INSERT INTO "mission_task_candidate_batches" ("id", "created_at", "updated_at", "repository_id", "status", "requested_goal_ids_json", "signal_snapshot_json", "selected_model_json", "raw_output_json", "error_message", "started_at", "completed_at") VALUES('08990b97-1495-488d-b5da-af9ba055f4f9',1783074694,1783074726,'984c8844-643e-4596-93a5-703a8d14a1e0','completed','["de3305e2-2269-4765-a117-5dd36de101e2"]','{"repository":{"id":"984c8844-643e-4596-93a5-703a8d14a1e0","name":"todolist","localPath":"/Users/y.noguchi/Code/todolist","branch":"main"},"activeGoals":[{"id":"de3305e2-2269-4765-a117-5dd36de101e2","title":"todo listを作る","goalText":"考えられる最も使いやすいtodolistを作る"}],"latestEvaluation":{"id":"a9ff9b87-ada3-43cb-bc45-88b80d8b8644","overallScore":72,"dimensions":[{"key":"conceptValue","score":78,"label":"コンセプト価値"},{"key":"architectureQuality","score":80,"label":"アーキテクチャ"},{"key":"extensibility","score":74,"label":"拡張性"},{"key":"uiUx","score":69,"label":"UI / UX"},{"key":"operability","score":76,"label":"運用性"},{"key":"security","score":71,"label":"セキュリティ"},{"key":"maintainability","score":79,"label":"保守性"},{"key":"marketCompetitiveness","score":66,"label":"市場競争力"}],"summary":"Hono + React + SQLite を同一 origin でまとめたテンプレートとしては、認証、保護ルート、共有 schema、検証ゲートまで揃っており、実運用の土台として成立している。BBS ルートや thread 系 UI も repo tree に見えるため、単なる starter を越えて複数ドメインを載せる余地がある一方、評価根拠は repo structure と README/LLM_CONTEXT に限られるため、実装の細部と実行時品質は過大評価しない。"},"latestQuality":{"coverage":null,"e2e":{"status":"failed","total":0,"passed":0,"failed":1,"skipped":0,"durationMs":null,"suites":[]}},"repositorySnapshot":{"packageName":"hono-standard","description":"Minimal Hono + React template with optional login and showcase screens.","readmeExcerpt":"# Hono Standard\n\n[![Bun](https://img.shields.io/badge/Bun-%23000000.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=bun&logoColor=white)](https://bun.sh/)\n[![Hono](https://img.shields.io/badge/Hono-%23E36022.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=hono&logoColor=white)](https://hono.dev/)\n[![React](https://img.shields.io/badge/React-%2320232a.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=react&logoColor=%2361DAFB)](https://react.dev/)\n[![SQLite](https://img.shields.io/badge/SQLite-003B57.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=sqlite&logoColor=white)](https://www.sqlite.org/)\n[![TypeScript](https://img.shields.io/badge/TypeScript-%23007ACC.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=typescript&logoColor=white)](https://www.typescriptlang.org/)\n[![MIT License](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-green.svg?style=for-the-badge)](LICENSE.md)\n\nHono backend と React + Vite frontend を同一 origin で動かす、local SQLite 対応の Web app template です。Drizzle のユーザー認証、httpOnly Cookie による access / refresh token、React Router ベースの画面、コンポーネント showcase を含みます。\n\n## 構成\n\n| Path | Role |\n| --- | --- |\n| `api/app/hono.ts` | Hono app composition。middleware、API route、静的配信、`AppType` を登録 |\n| `api/app/server.ts` | Bun server bootstrap |\n| `api/app/env.ts` | runtime env parser |\n| `api/config/appDefaults.ts` | 非シークレットの既定値 |\n| `api/db/index.ts` | DB runtime の public entry。variant はここから差し替える |\n| `api/db/sqlite.ts` | SQLite baseline の Drizzle runtime |\n| `api/db/schema.ts` | Drizzle SQLite schema |\n| `api/db/migrate.ts` | migration runner の public entry |\n| `api/db/migrate-sqlite.ts` | SQLite baseline の migration runner |\n| `api/routes/auth.route.ts` | `/api/auth/*` route |\n| `api/routes/health.route.ts` | `/api/health` route |\n| `api/routes/protected.route.ts` | `/api/protected/*` の server-side protected sample |\n| `api/modules/auth/` | password hash、JWT、cookie、auth service |\n| `api/middleware/auth.ts` | protected API middleware |\n| `web/src/` | React frontend |\n| `shared/schemas/` | frontend/backend で共有する Zod schema と API object type |\n| `drizzle/` | SQL migrations |\n| `scripts/verify.ts` | typecheck / lint / format / test / coverage / build の検証 pipeline |\n\n## 前提\n\n| Tool | 用途 |\n| --- | --- |\n| Bun | package manager、runtime、scripts |\n| SQLite | auth user / refresh token storage |\n\n## セットアップ\n\n```bash\nbun run bootstrap\nbun run auth:create-admin -- --email admin@example.com --name \"Admin User\"\nbun run dev\n```\n\n`bootstrap` は `.env` を用意し、dependency が未導入なら `bun install --frozen-lockfile` を実行し、SQLite database に migration を適用します。\n\n`auth:create-admin` は対話で password を読みます。自動化する場合は次のように標準入力から渡せます。\n\n```bash\nprintf ''%s\\n'' ''<password>'' | bun run auth:create-admin -- --email admin@example.com --name \"Admin User\" --password-stdin\n```\n\n開発サーバーは `http://localhost:5173` で起動します。Vite dev server が frontend を配信し、`/api/*` は Hono に渡されます。\n\n初回 clone 後に template の動作確認まで済ませる場合は、次を実行します。\n\n```bash\nbun run verify\nbun run verify:e2e\n```\n\n認証を使う app では `auth:create-admin` または `seed:dev` で admin を作成してから `/login` を確認します。認証を使わない app では、この README 後半の auth removal checklist に沿って auth route、DB table、login/protected screen、E2E scope をまとめて削ります。\n\n## 生成物と管理対象\n\nこの template では、source と docs は追跡し、local runtime や検証の生成物は追跡しません。\n\n| Path / Pattern | 扱い |\n| --- | --- |\n| `drizzle/*.sql` | Drizzle migration source。commit 対象 |\n| `.env.example` | local development の雛形。commit 対象 |\n| `.env*` | local secret / runtime env。`.env.example` 以外は commit しない |\n| `data/`, `*.db`, `*.sqlite`, `*.sqlite3` | local SQLite database。commit しない |\n| `coverage/`, `playwright-report/`, `test-results/` | verification output。commit しない |\n| `dist/`, `dist-web/`, `build/`, `*.tgz` | build / archive output。commit しない |\n\n## 環境変数\n\n非シークレットの既定値は `api/config/appDefaults.ts` にあります。`.env.example` は local development 向けの値です。\n\n| Variable | Required | Description | Default |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `NODE_ENV` | no | `development` / `test` / `production` | `development` |\n| `HOST` | no | HTTP bind host。container では `0.0.0.0` を指定 | `127.0.0.1` |\n| `PORT` | no | HTTP server port | `5173` |\n| `DATABASE_URL` | no | SQLite database ","sourceFiles":["LLM_CONTEXT.md","README.md","api/app/env.test.ts","api/app/env.ts","api/app/hono.test.ts","api/app/hono.ts","api/app/security-headers.ts","api/app/server.ts","api/cli/auth-create-admin.ts","api/cli/cli-contract.test.ts","api/cli/migrate.ts","api/config/appDefaults.ts","api/db/index.ts","api/db/migrate-sqlite.ts","api/db/migrate.ts","api/db/path.test.ts","api/db/path.ts","api/db/schema.ts","api/db/sqlite.ts","api/middleware/auth.test.ts","api/middleware/auth.ts","api/modules/auth/auth-cookies.test.ts","api/modules/auth/auth-cookies.ts","api/modules/auth/auth.service.test.ts","api/modules/auth/auth.service.ts","api/modules/auth/context.test.ts","api/modules/auth/context.ts","api/modules/auth/errors.test.ts","api/modules/auth/errors.ts","api/modules/auth/password.test.ts","api/modules/auth/password.ts","api/modules/auth/token.service.test.ts","api/modules/auth/token.service.ts","api/modules/auth/types.test.ts","api/modules/auth/types.ts","api/routes/auth.route.test.ts","api/routes/auth.route.ts","api/routes/bbs.route.test.ts","api/routes/bbs.route.ts","api/routes/health.route.test.ts","api/routes/health.route.ts","api/routes/protected.route.test.ts","api/routes/protected.route.ts","api/types/hono-context.d.ts","biome.json","docs/template-variant-management.md","drizzle.config.ts","drizzle/0001_auth.sql","drizzle/0002_bbs.sql","package.json","playwright.config.ts","scripts/bootstrap.test.ts","scripts/bootstrap.ts","scripts/e2e-server.ts","scripts/seed-dev.ts","scripts/verify.ts","shared/schemas/auth.schema.ts","shared/schemas/protected.schema.test.ts","shared/schemas/protected.schema.ts","tests/e2e/smoke.spec.ts","tsconfig.build.json","tsconfig.json","vite.config.ts","vitest.config.ts","web/src/App.tsx","web/src/api.test.ts","web/src/api.ts","web/src/auth-context.tsx","web/src/components/dev-error-panel.tsx","web/src/domains/auth/login-domain.tsx","web/src/main.tsx","web/src/router.tsx","web/src/routes/home-route.tsx","web/src/routes/login-route.tsx","web/src/routes/login-search.ts","web/src/routes/protected-route.tsx","web/src/routes/root-route.tsx","web/src/routes/route-access.test.ts","web/src/routes/route-access.ts","web/src/routes/showcase-route.tsx","web/src/routes/thread-detail-route.tsx","web/src/routes/thread-new-route.tsx","web/src/routes/threads-route.tsx","web/src/showcase-settings-context.tsx","web/src/showcase-table-search.ts","web/src/styles.css","web/src/views/home-view.tsx","web/src/views/login-view.tsx","web/src/views/protected-view.tsx","web/src/views/showcase-view.tsx","web/src/views/thread-detail-view.tsx","web/src/views/thread-new-view.tsx","web/src/views/threads-view.tsx"],"routeFiles":["api/routes/auth.route.test.ts","api/routes/auth.route.ts","api/routes/bbs.route.test.ts","api/routes/bbs.route.ts","api/routes/health.route.test.ts","api/routes/health.route.ts","api/routes/protected.route.test.ts","api/routes/protected.route.ts","web/src/routes/home-route.tsx","web/src/routes/login-route.tsx","web/src/routes/login-search.ts","web/src/routes/protected-route.tsx","web/src/routes/root-route.tsx","web/src/routes/route-access.test.ts","web/src/routes/route-access.ts","web/src/routes/showcase-route.tsx","web/src/routes/thread-detail-route.tsx","web/src/routes/thread-new-route.tsx","web/src/routes/threads-route.tsx","web/src/views/home-view.tsx","web/src/views/login-view.tsx","web/src/views/protected-view.tsx","web/src/views/showcase-view.tsx","web/src/views/thread-detail-view.tsx","web/src/views/thread-new-view.tsx","web/src/views/threads-view.tsx"],"migrationFiles":["drizzle/0001_auth.sql","drizzle/0002_bbs.sql"],"packageScripts":[{"name":"auth:create-admin","command":"bun run api/cli/auth-create-admin.ts"},{"name":"bootstrap","command":"bun scripts/bootstrap.ts"},{"name":"build","command":"bun run build:web"},{"name":"build:web","command":"vite build"},{"name":"db:generate","command":"drizzle-kit generate"},{"name":"db:migrate","command":"bun run api/cli/migrate.ts"},{"name":"db:migrate:drizzle","command":"drizzle-kit migrate"},{"name":"dev","command":"bunx --bun vite"},{"name":"dev:vite","command":"vite"},{"name":"format","command":"biome format --write api web shared scripts tests drizzle.config.ts playwright.config.ts vite.config.ts vitest.config.ts"},{"name":"format:check","command":"biome format api web shared scripts tests drizzle.config.ts playwright.config.ts vite.config.ts vitest.config.ts"},{"name":"lint","command":"biome lint api web shared scripts tests drizzle.config.ts playwright.config.ts vite.config.ts vitest.config.ts"},{"name":"seed:dev","command":"bun scripts/seed-dev.ts"},{"name":"start","command":"bun run api/app/server.ts"},{"name":"test","command":"vitest run"},{"name":"test:coverage","command":"vitest run --coverage"},{"name":"test:e2e","command":"playwright test"},{"name":"test:watch","command":"vitest"},{"name":"typecheck","command":"tsc --noEmit"},{"name":"verify","command":"bun scripts/verify.ts"},{"name":"verify:all","command":"bun run verify && bun run verify:e2e"},{"name":"verify:e2e","command":"bun run test:e2e"},{"name":"verify:strict","command":"bun run verify"}]},"qualityCapabilities":{"projectType":"typescript","commands":[{"kind":"unit","source":"package_json","command":"bun run ''test''","runnable":true},{"kind":"coverage","source":"package_json","command":"bun run ''test:coverage''","runnable":true},{"kind":"e2e","source":"package_json","command":"bun run ''test:e2e''","runnable":true},{"kind":"verify","source":"package_json","command":"bun run ''verify''","runnable":true}],"missingCapabilities":[]},"recentTokenSpendTasks":[{"taskId":"3c40e22b-fbe5-48a1-ba92-64f990e589fd","title":"BBSを作りたいです。計画してください。","totalTokens":8468677,"callCount":8}],"recentRuns":{"completed":1,"failed":0,"running":0}}','{"role":"mission_task_generation","providerId":"codex","providerEndpointId":"ep_2a9c67769830da1e","routeSource":"primary","modelOrDeployment":"gpt-5.4-mini","thinkingDepth":null}','{"schemaVersion":"nightworkers.mission-task-candidates/v1","candidates":[{"title":"todo list の本体機能を実装する","summary":"repositorySnapshot には todo 専用の実装が見当たらず、現状は Hono + React の template 色が強いので、まずは Mission Goal に直結する todo 本体を作る。タスク作成・完了切替・削除・一覧表示・入力導線を一貫した UX で実装し、既存の認証や showcase ではなく todo を主役にする。","rationale":"Goal が『考えられる最も使いやすいtodolistを作る』であり、現状の repo は minimal template かつ BBS/showcase 系の面が強い。最優先は todo プロダクト本体の実装で、改善系より先にユーザーが使える完成形を作る必要がある。","goalId":"de3305e2-2269-4765-a117-5dd36de101e2","evidence":[{"source":"project_evaluation","label":"repositorySnapshot.description","value":"Minimal Hono + React template with optional login and showcase screens."},{"source":"project_evaluation","label":"repositorySnapshot.readmeExcerpt","value":"Hono backend と React + Vite frontend を同一 origin で動かす template で、auth / showcase / protected screen を含む。"},{"source":"project_evaluation","label":"repositorySnapshot.routeFiles","value":"todo 専用 route/view は見当たらず、home/login/protected/showcase/thread/bbs が中心。"}],"evaluationContribution":32,"importancePercent":100,"confidencePercent":92,"tokenSize":"big","complexity":"complex","taskPrompt":"todo list プロダクトの本体を追加し、一覧・追加・完了切替・削除・空状態・入力導線を含む最小完成形を実装してください。既存の template / showcase / BBS 文脈よりも todo を主役にし、ユーザーがすぐ使える形に整えてください。","acceptanceCriteria":"todo の一覧表示、追加、完了/未完了切替、削除が一連の UI として動作すること。初回利用で迷わない導線と空状態があること。既存の auth/showcase/BBS より todo の体験が前面に出ていること。","verificationPlan":"対象 UI と API/状態管理の単体テストを追加し、既存 verify 相当のゲートで回帰がないことを確認する。必要なら e2e で todo の追加と完了切替を最低 1 本通す。"},{"title":"使いやすさを高める todo 操作フローを改善する","summary":"todo 本体の土台を前提に、入力・編集・完了操作・フィルタ・並び替えなどの日常操作を短い手数で完了できるように磨く。Goal が『最も使いやすい』なので、機能追加よりも操作コストの削減と視認性向上を優先する。","rationale":"ユーザー価値は単なる todo の存在ではなく、最小手数で継続利用できることにある。UI/UX スコアが相対的に低めなので、Goal に対する改善余地が大きい。","goalId":"de3305e2-2269-4765-a117-5dd36de101e2","evidence":[{"source":"project_evaluation","label":"latestEvaluation.uiUx","value":"69"},{"source":"project_evaluation","label":"latestEvaluation.summary","value":"実運用の土台は成立しているが、実装の細部と実行時品質は過大評価しない。"},{"source":"project_evaluation","label":"repositorySnapshot.packageName","value":"hono-standard"}],"evaluationContribution":18,"importancePercent":82,"confidencePercent":73,"tokenSize":"medium","complexity":"moderate","taskPrompt":"todo の日常操作を見直し、入力から完了までの手数を減らす改善を実装してください。キーボード操作、即時反映、空状態、フィルタ、編集導線など、使いやすさに直結する部分を優先してください。","acceptanceCriteria":"主要操作が少ないステップで完了できること。視認性と状態把握が改善されていること。UI の変更が機能回帰を起こしていないこと。","verificationPlan":"todo 主要フローの UI テストまたは e2e を追加し、フィルタや編集がある場合は状態遷移の単体テストも通す。"},{"title":"todo の検証基盤を Goal に合わせて整える","summary":"test / coverage / e2e capability は存在するが、latestQuality では e2e が failed になっているため、todo の完成度を支える検証経路を Goal に合わせて整備する。機能本体を妨げない範囲で、回帰検出の信頼性を上げる。","rationale":"qualityCapabilities には unit, coverage, e2e, verify が揃っている一方、最新品質では e2e failure が記録されている。todo 本体の実装を進めた後、その体験を守るための検証強化は Goal 直結の補助価値がある。","goalId":"de3305e2-2269-4765-a117-5dd36de101e2","evidence":[{"source":"project_evaluation","label":"latestQuality.e2e.status","value":"failed"},{"source":"project_evaluation","label":"qualityCapabilities.commands","value":"bun run test, bun run test:coverage, bun run test:e2e, bun run verify are runnable"},{"source":"project_evaluation","label":"repositorySnapshot.packageScripts","value":"test / test:coverage / test:e2e / verify が package.json にある"}],"evaluationContribution":10,"importancePercent":55,"confidencePercent":81,"tokenSize":"small","complexity":"simple","taskPrompt":"todo の主要フローを守る検証を整備してください。既存の unit / coverage / e2e / verify の実行経路を前提に、失敗している e2e を含めて回帰を検出できる状態にしてください。","acceptanceCriteria":"todo の主要フローをカバーする自動テストがあり、失敗している e2e が再現可能な形で解消または切り分けられていること。検証コマンドが repo の標準ゲートに乗っていること。","verificationPlan":"`bun run test`、`bun run test:coverage`、`bun run test:e2e`、`bun run verify` の少なくとも対象範囲を実行し、todo 関連の失敗が残っていないことを確認する。"}]}',NULL,1783074694,1783074726);
INSERT INTO "mission_task_candidate_batches" ("id", "created_at", "updated_at", "repository_id", "status", "requested_goal_ids_json", "signal_snapshot_json", "selected_model_json", "raw_output_json", "error_message", "started_at", "completed_at") VALUES('731b08fb-eab4-4771-bb54-154448932b93',1783083224,1783083258,'984c8844-643e-4596-93a5-703a8d14a1e0','completed','["de3305e2-2269-4765-a117-5dd36de101e2"]','{"repository":{"id":"984c8844-643e-4596-93a5-703a8d14a1e0","name":"todolist","localPath":"/Users/y.noguchi/Code/todolist","branch":"main"},"activeGoals":[{"id":"de3305e2-2269-4765-a117-5dd36de101e2","title":"todo listを作る","goalText":"考えられる最も使いやすいtodolistを作る"}],"latestEvaluation":{"id":"a9ff9b87-ada3-43cb-bc45-88b80d8b8644","overallScore":72,"dimensions":[{"key":"conceptValue","score":78,"label":"コンセプト価値"},{"key":"architectureQuality","score":80,"label":"アーキテクチャ"},{"key":"extensibility","score":74,"label":"拡張性"},{"key":"uiUx","score":69,"label":"UI / UX"},{"key":"operability","score":76,"label":"運用性"},{"key":"security","score":71,"label":"セキュリティ"},{"key":"maintainability","score":79,"label":"保守性"},{"key":"marketCompetitiveness","score":66,"label":"市場競争力"}],"summary":"Hono + React + SQLite を同一 origin でまとめたテンプレートとしては、認証、保護ルート、共有 schema、検証ゲートまで揃っており、実運用の土台として成立している。BBS ルートや thread 系 UI も repo tree に見えるため、単なる starter を越えて複数ドメインを載せる余地がある一方、評価根拠は repo structure と README/LLM_CONTEXT に限られるため、実装の細部と実行時品質は過大評価しない。"},"latestQuality":{"coverage":null,"e2e":{"status":"failed","total":0,"passed":0,"failed":1,"skipped":0,"durationMs":null,"suites":[]}},"repositorySnapshot":{"packageName":"hono-standard","description":"Minimal Hono + React template with optional login and showcase screens.","readmeExcerpt":"# Hono Standard\n\n[![Bun](https://img.shields.io/badge/Bun-%23000000.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=bun&logoColor=white)](https://bun.sh/)\n[![Hono](https://img.shields.io/badge/Hono-%23E36022.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=hono&logoColor=white)](https://hono.dev/)\n[![React](https://img.shields.io/badge/React-%2320232a.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=react&logoColor=%2361DAFB)](https://react.dev/)\n[![SQLite](https://img.shields.io/badge/SQLite-003B57.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=sqlite&logoColor=white)](https://www.sqlite.org/)\n[![TypeScript](https://img.shields.io/badge/TypeScript-%23007ACC.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=typescript&logoColor=white)](https://www.typescriptlang.org/)\n[![MIT License](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-green.svg?style=for-the-badge)](LICENSE.md)\n\nHono backend と React + Vite frontend を同一 origin で動かす、local SQLite 対応の Web app template です。Drizzle のユーザー認証、httpOnly Cookie による access / refresh token、React Router ベースの画面、コンポーネント showcase を含みます。\n\n## 構成\n\n| Path | Role |\n| --- | --- |\n| `api/app/hono.ts` | Hono app composition。middleware、API route、静的配信、`AppType` を登録 |\n| `api/app/server.ts` | Bun server bootstrap |\n| `api/app/env.ts` | runtime env parser |\n| `api/config/appDefaults.ts` | 非シークレットの既定値 |\n| `api/db/index.ts` | DB runtime の public entry。variant はここから差し替える |\n| `api/db/sqlite.ts` | SQLite baseline の Drizzle runtime |\n| `api/db/schema.ts` | Drizzle SQLite schema |\n| `api/db/migrate.ts` | migration runner の public entry |\n| `api/db/migrate-sqlite.ts` | SQLite baseline の migration runner |\n| `api/routes/auth.route.ts` | `/api/auth/*` route |\n| `api/routes/health.route.ts` | `/api/health` route |\n| `api/routes/protected.route.ts` | `/api/protected/*` の server-side protected sample |\n| `api/modules/auth/` | password hash、JWT、cookie、auth service |\n| `api/middleware/auth.ts` | protected API middleware |\n| `web/src/` | React frontend |\n| `shared/schemas/` | frontend/backend で共有する Zod schema と API object type |\n| `drizzle/` | SQL migrations |\n| `scripts/verify.ts` | typecheck / lint / format / test / coverage / build の検証 pipeline |\n\n## 前提\n\n| Tool | 用途 |\n| --- | --- |\n| Bun | package manager、runtime、scripts |\n| SQLite | auth user / refresh token storage |\n\n## セットアップ\n\n```bash\nbun run bootstrap\nbun run auth:create-admin -- --email admin@example.com --name \"Admin User\"\nbun run dev\n```\n\n`bootstrap` は `.env` を用意し、dependency が未導入なら `bun install --frozen-lockfile` を実行し、SQLite database に migration を適用します。\n\n`auth:create-admin` は対話で password を読みます。自動化する場合は次のように標準入力から渡せます。\n\n```bash\nprintf ''%s\\n'' ''<password>'' | bun run auth:create-admin -- --email admin@example.com --name \"Admin User\" --password-stdin\n```\n\n開発サーバーは `http://localhost:5173` で起動します。Vite dev server が frontend を配信し、`/api/*` は Hono に渡されます。\n\n初回 clone 後に template の動作確認まで済ませる場合は、次を実行します。\n\n```bash\nbun run verify\nbun run verify:e2e\n```\n\n認証を使う app では `auth:create-admin` または `seed:dev` で admin を作成してから `/login` を確認します。認証を使わない app では、この README 後半の auth removal checklist に沿って auth route、DB table、login/protected screen、E2E scope をまとめて削ります。\n\n## 生成物と管理対象\n\nこの template では、source と docs は追跡し、local runtime や検証の生成物は追跡しません。\n\n| Path / Pattern | 扱い |\n| --- | --- |\n| `drizzle/*.sql` | Drizzle migration source。commit 対象 |\n| `.env.example` | local development の雛形。commit 対象 |\n| `.env*` | local secret / runtime env。`.env.example` 以外は commit しない |\n| `data/`, `*.db`, `*.sqlite`, `*.sqlite3` | local SQLite database。commit しない |\n| `coverage/`, `playwright-report/`, `test-results/` | verification output。commit しない |\n| `dist/`, `dist-web/`, `build/`, `*.tgz` | build / archive output。commit しない |\n\n## 環境変数\n\n非シークレットの既定値は `api/config/appDefaults.ts` にあります。`.env.example` は local development 向けの値です。\n\n| Variable | Required | Description | Default |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `NODE_ENV` | no | `development` / `test` / `production` | `development` |\n| `HOST` | no | HTTP bind host。container では `0.0.0.0` を指定 | `127.0.0.1` |\n| `PORT` | no | HTTP server port | `5173` |\n| `DATABASE_URL` | no | SQLite database ","sourceFiles":["LLM_CONTEXT.md","README.md","api/app/env.test.ts","api/app/env.ts","api/app/hono.test.ts","api/app/hono.ts","api/app/security-headers.ts","api/app/server.ts","api/cli/auth-create-admin.ts","api/cli/cli-contract.test.ts","api/cli/migrate.ts","api/config/appDefaults.ts","api/db/index.ts","api/db/migrate-sqlite.ts","api/db/migrate.ts","api/db/path.test.ts","api/db/path.ts","api/db/schema.ts","api/db/sqlite.ts","api/middleware/auth.test.ts","api/middleware/auth.ts","api/modules/auth/auth-cookies.test.ts","api/modules/auth/auth-cookies.ts","api/modules/auth/auth.service.test.ts","api/modules/auth/auth.service.ts","api/modules/auth/context.test.ts","api/modules/auth/context.ts","api/modules/auth/errors.test.ts","api/modules/auth/errors.ts","api/modules/auth/password.test.ts","api/modules/auth/password.ts","api/modules/auth/token.service.test.ts","api/modules/auth/token.service.ts","api/modules/auth/types.test.ts","api/modules/auth/types.ts","api/routes/auth.route.test.ts","api/routes/auth.route.ts","api/routes/bbs.route.test.ts","api/routes/bbs.route.ts","api/routes/health.route.test.ts","api/routes/health.route.ts","api/routes/protected.route.test.ts","api/routes/protected.route.ts","api/types/hono-context.d.ts","biome.json","docs/template-variant-management.md","drizzle.config.ts","drizzle/0001_auth.sql","drizzle/0002_bbs.sql","package.json","playwright.config.ts","scripts/bootstrap.test.ts","scripts/bootstrap.ts","scripts/e2e-server.ts","scripts/seed-dev.ts","scripts/verify.ts","shared/schemas/auth.schema.ts","shared/schemas/protected.schema.test.ts","shared/schemas/protected.schema.ts","tests/e2e/smoke.spec.ts","tsconfig.build.json","tsconfig.json","vite.config.ts","vitest.config.ts","web/src/App.tsx","web/src/api.test.ts","web/src/api.ts","web/src/auth-context.tsx","web/src/components/dev-error-panel.tsx","web/src/domains/auth/login-domain.tsx","web/src/main.tsx","web/src/router.tsx","web/src/routes/home-route.tsx","web/src/routes/login-route.tsx","web/src/routes/login-search.ts","web/src/routes/protected-route.tsx","web/src/routes/root-route.tsx","web/src/routes/route-access.test.ts","web/src/routes/route-access.ts","web/src/routes/showcase-route.tsx","web/src/routes/thread-detail-route.tsx","web/src/routes/thread-new-route.tsx","web/src/routes/threads-route.tsx","web/src/showcase-settings-context.tsx","web/src/showcase-table-search.ts","web/src/styles.css","web/src/views/home-view.tsx","web/src/views/login-view.tsx","web/src/views/protected-view.tsx","web/src/views/showcase-view.tsx","web/src/views/thread-detail-view.tsx","web/src/views/thread-new-view.tsx","web/src/views/threads-view.tsx"],"routeFiles":["api/routes/auth.route.test.ts","api/routes/auth.route.ts","api/routes/bbs.route.test.ts","api/routes/bbs.route.ts","api/routes/health.route.test.ts","api/routes/health.route.ts","api/routes/protected.route.test.ts","api/routes/protected.route.ts","web/src/routes/home-route.tsx","web/src/routes/login-route.tsx","web/src/routes/login-search.ts","web/src/routes/protected-route.tsx","web/src/routes/root-route.tsx","web/src/routes/route-access.test.ts","web/src/routes/route-access.ts","web/src/routes/showcase-route.tsx","web/src/routes/thread-detail-route.tsx","web/src/routes/thread-new-route.tsx","web/src/routes/threads-route.tsx","web/src/views/home-view.tsx","web/src/views/login-view.tsx","web/src/views/protected-view.tsx","web/src/views/showcase-view.tsx","web/src/views/thread-detail-view.tsx","web/src/views/thread-new-view.tsx","web/src/views/threads-view.tsx"],"migrationFiles":["drizzle/0001_auth.sql","drizzle/0002_bbs.sql"],"packageScripts":[{"name":"auth:create-admin","command":"bun run api/cli/auth-create-admin.ts"},{"name":"bootstrap","command":"bun scripts/bootstrap.ts"},{"name":"build","command":"bun run build:web"},{"name":"build:web","command":"vite build"},{"name":"db:generate","command":"drizzle-kit generate"},{"name":"db:migrate","command":"bun run api/cli/migrate.ts"},{"name":"db:migrate:drizzle","command":"drizzle-kit migrate"},{"name":"dev","command":"bunx --bun vite"},{"name":"dev:vite","command":"vite"},{"name":"format","command":"biome format --write api web shared scripts tests drizzle.config.ts playwright.config.ts vite.config.ts vitest.config.ts"},{"name":"format:check","command":"biome format api web shared scripts tests drizzle.config.ts playwright.config.ts vite.config.ts vitest.config.ts"},{"name":"lint","command":"biome lint api web shared scripts tests drizzle.config.ts playwright.config.ts vite.config.ts vitest.config.ts"},{"name":"seed:dev","command":"bun scripts/seed-dev.ts"},{"name":"start","command":"bun run api/app/server.ts"},{"name":"test","command":"vitest run"},{"name":"test:coverage","command":"vitest run --coverage"},{"name":"test:e2e","command":"playwright test"},{"name":"test:watch","command":"vitest"},{"name":"typecheck","command":"tsc --noEmit"},{"name":"verify","command":"bun scripts/verify.ts"},{"name":"verify:all","command":"bun run verify && bun run verify:e2e"},{"name":"verify:e2e","command":"bun run test:e2e"},{"name":"verify:strict","command":"bun run verify"}]},"qualityCapabilities":{"projectType":"typescript","commands":[{"kind":"unit","source":"package_json","command":"bun run ''test''","runnable":true},{"kind":"coverage","source":"package_json","command":"bun run ''test:coverage''","runnable":true},{"kind":"e2e","source":"package_json","command":"bun run ''test:e2e''","runnable":true},{"kind":"verify","source":"package_json","command":"bun run ''verify''","runnable":true}],"missingCapabilities":[]},"recentTokenSpendTasks":[{"taskId":"3c40e22b-fbe5-48a1-ba92-64f990e589fd","title":"BBSを作りたいです。計画してください。","totalTokens":8468677,"callCount":8}],"recentRuns":{"completed":1,"failed":0,"running":0}}','{"role":"mission_task_generation","providerId":"codex","providerEndpointId":"ep_2a9c67769830da1e","routeSource":"primary","modelOrDeployment":"gpt-5.4-mini","thinkingDepth":null}','{"schemaVersion":"nightworkers.mission-task-candidates/v1","candidates":[{"title":"使いやすいtodo本体の追加・編集・完了・削除を実装する","summary":"Todo一覧、追加、編集、完了切り替え、削除を一通り実装し、Goal の中心価値である「最も使いやすいtodolist」の土台を作る。","rationale":"repositorySnapshot は minimal template であり、Mission Goal の対象プロダクト本体はまだ十分に具体化されていない。既存候補にも検証や改善はあるが、Goal 達成に最も直結するのはまず todo の主要操作を完成させること。","goalId":"de3305e2-2269-4765-a117-5dd36de101e2","evidence":[{"source":"mission_goal","label":"goalText","value":"考えられる最も使いやすいtodolistを作る"},{"source":"project_evaluation","label":"repositorySnapshot.description","value":"Minimal Hono + React template with optional login and showcase screens."},{"source":"project_evaluation","label":"repositorySnapshot.summary","value":"テンプレート寄りで、todo 本体の操作体験はまだ Goal に合わせて作り込む余地が大きい。"}],"evaluationContribution":32,"importancePercent":100,"confidencePercent":91,"tokenSize":"big","complexity":"complex","taskPrompt":"todo の基本機能を実装する。具体的には、ユーザーが todo を追加・編集・完了切り替え・削除でき、一覧で状態が分かる UI と状態管理を作る。既存の template 機能よりも todo の操作体験を優先し、Goal に直結する本体機能として仕上げる。","acceptanceCriteria":"todo を追加・編集・完了切り替え・削除できる。空状態と通常状態の双方で UI が破綻しない。主要操作が画面上で完結し、Goal の中心機能として使える。","verificationPlan":"主要画面の手動確認に加え、追加・編集・完了・削除の unit test か component test を整備する。既存の verify / test / e2e のうち、影響範囲に応じて少なくとも該当するテストを通す。"},{"title":"使いやすさを高める todo 入力・検索・フィルタ体験を整える","summary":"Todo の入力導線、検索、未完了/完了フィルタ、並び順などを整え、日常利用で迷いにくい操作体験にする。","rationale":"主要機能が揃った前提では、使いやすさの差は入力導線と絞り込みのしやすさで大きく出る。Goal が「最も使いやすい」なので、操作の摩擦を下げる改善は直接的な価値になる。","goalId":"de3305e2-2269-4765-a117-5dd36de101e2","evidence":[{"source":"mission_goal","label":"goalText","value":"考えられる最も使いやすいtodolistを作る"},{"source":"project_evaluation","label":"latestEvaluation.uiUx","value":"69"},{"source":"project_evaluation","label":"repositorySnapshot.summary","value":"template としては成立しているが、todo の使いやすさはまだ伸ばせる。"}],"evaluationContribution":18,"importancePercent":78,"confidencePercent":84,"tokenSize":"medium","complexity":"moderate","taskPrompt":"todo の入力・検索・フィルタ・並び順を改善する。ユーザーが迷わず追加でき、必要な todo をすぐ絞り込める UI にする。主要アクションの手数を減らし、日常利用での快適さを上げる。","acceptanceCriteria":"todo の追加導線が簡潔で、検索かフィルタで目的の項目にすぐ到達できる。未完了と完了を見分けやすい。並び順や表示状態が一貫している。","verificationPlan":"UI の主要フローを手動確認し、検索・フィルタ・並び順のロジックに unit test を追加する。必要なら画面レベルの回帰テストも追加する。"},{"title":"todo の状態保存と永続化を実装する","summary":"ブラウザ再読込や再訪問後も todo が残るように永続化を実装し、実用性を高める。","rationale":"使いやすい todo は、単なる画面上の操作だけでなく、状態が失われないことが前提になる。Goal の達成に直結し、ユーザー体験の基礎になるため優先度が高い。","goalId":"de3305e2-2269-4765-a117-5dd36de101e2","evidence":[{"source":"mission_goal","label":"goalText","value":"考えられる最も使いやすいtodolistを作る"},{"source":"project_evaluation","label":"latestEvaluation.marketCompetitiveness","value":"66"},{"source":"project_evaluation","label":"repositorySnapshot.summary","value":"実運用の土台はあるが、日常利用の実用性を上げる余地がある。"}],"evaluationContribution":20,"importancePercent":88,"confidencePercent":79,"tokenSize":"medium","complexity":"moderate","taskPrompt":"todo の状態を永続化する。再読込や再訪問後も todo が保持されるようにし、アプリを日常的に使える状態にする。必要なら保存失敗時の扱いも含めて実装する。","acceptanceCriteria":"todo がページ再読込後も保持される。追加・編集・完了切り替え・削除の結果が保存される。保存失敗時に破綻しない。","verificationPlan":"永続化の単体テストと、再読み込み後に状態が復元されることの e2e または統合テストを追加する。"},{"title":"todo の初回利用体験と空状態ガイドを磨く","summary":"初回訪問時の空状態、案内、サンプル、エラー表示を整え、すぐ使い始められる体験にする。","rationale":"Goal が「最も使いやすい」ため、初回利用の分かりやすさは重要。既存の機能群を前提に、迷わず使い始められる導線を作ることは評価へも直接効く。","goalId":"de3305e2-2269-4765-a117-5dd36de101e2","evidence":[{"source":"mission_goal","label":"goalText","value":"考えられる最も使いやすいtodolistを作る"},{"source":"project_evaluation","label":"latestEvaluation.uiUx","value":"69"},{"source":"quality","label":"latestQuality.e2e","value":"failed: 1"}],"evaluationContribution":12,"importancePercent":64,"confidencePercent":73,"tokenSize":"small","complexity":"simple","taskPrompt":"初回利用時の空状態、案内文、サンプル表示、失敗時メッセージを整える。ユーザーが何をすればよいか一目で分かり、すぐに最初の todo を作れる体験にする。","acceptanceCriteria":"空状態で次の行動が分かる。初回利用時に迷わない。エラーや未入力時の表示が自然で、利用を止めない。","verificationPlan":"空状態とエラー表示の UI テストを追加し、主要ブラウザ幅で表示崩れがないか確認する。"}]}',NULL,1783083224,1783083258);
INSERT INTO "mission_task_candidate_batches" ("id", "created_at", "updated_at", "repository_id", "status", "requested_goal_ids_json", "signal_snapshot_json", "selected_model_json", "raw_output_json", "error_message", "started_at", "completed_at") VALUES('16fab0bc-dba3-449c-9858-f0c07f705e26',1783178789,1783178837,'984c8844-643e-4596-93a5-703a8d14a1e0','completed','["de3305e2-2269-4765-a117-5dd36de101e2"]','{"repository":{"id":"984c8844-643e-4596-93a5-703a8d14a1e0","name":"todolist","localPath":"/Users/y.noguchi/Code/todolist","branch":"main"},"activeGoals":[{"id":"de3305e2-2269-4765-a117-5dd36de101e2","title":"todo listを作る","goalText":"考えられる最も使いやすいtodolistを作る","interpretation":{"scope":"unknown","intent":"unknown","source":"unknown","confidencePercent":0,"reason":null}}],"latestEvaluation":{"id":"a9ff9b87-ada3-43cb-bc45-88b80d8b8644","overallScore":72,"dimensions":[{"key":"conceptValue","score":78,"label":"コンセプト価値"},{"key":"architectureQuality","score":80,"label":"アーキテクチャ"},{"key":"extensibility","score":74,"label":"拡張性"},{"key":"uiUx","score":69,"label":"UI / UX"},{"key":"operability","score":76,"label":"運用性"},{"key":"security","score":71,"label":"セキュリティ"},{"key":"maintainability","score":79,"label":"保守性"},{"key":"marketCompetitiveness","score":66,"label":"市場競争力"}],"summary":"Hono + React + SQLite を同一 origin でまとめたテンプレートとしては、認証、保護ルート、共有 schema、検証ゲートまで揃っており、実運用の土台として成立している。BBS ルートや thread 系 UI も repo tree に見えるため、単なる starter を越えて複数ドメインを載せる余地がある一方、評価根拠は repo structure と README/LLM_CONTEXT に限られるため、実装の細部と実行時品質は過大評価しない。"},"latestQuality":{"coverage":null,"e2e":{"status":"passed","total":2,"passed":2,"failed":0,"skipped":0,"durationMs":1170,"suites":[{"title":"smoke.spec.ts","status":"passed","tests":2,"durationMs":1170,"lastFailure":null}]}},"repositorySnapshot":{"packageName":"hono-standard","description":"Minimal Hono + React template with optional login and showcase screens.","readmeExcerpt":"# Hono Standard\n\n[![Bun](https://img.shields.io/badge/Bun-%23000000.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=bun&logoColor=white)](https://bun.sh/)\n[![Hono](https://img.shields.io/badge/Hono-%23E36022.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=hono&logoColor=white)](https://hono.dev/)\n[![React](https://img.shields.io/badge/React-%2320232a.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=react&logoColor=%2361DAFB)](https://react.dev/)\n[![SQLite](https://img.shields.io/badge/SQLite-003B57.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=sqlite&logoColor=white)](https://www.sqlite.org/)\n[![TypeScript](https://img.shields.io/badge/TypeScript-%23007ACC.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=typescript&logoColor=white)](https://www.typescriptlang.org/)\n[![MIT License](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-green.svg?style=for-the-badge)](LICENSE.md)\n\nHono backend と React + Vite frontend を同一 origin で動かす、local SQLite 対応の Web app template です。Drizzle のユーザー認証、httpOnly Cookie による access / refresh token、React Router ベースの画面、コンポーネント showcase を含みます。\n\n## 構成\n\n| Path | Role |\n| --- | --- |\n| `api/app/hono.ts` | Hono app composition。middleware、API route、静的配信、`AppType` を登録 |\n| `api/app/server.ts` | Bun server bootstrap |\n| `api/app/env.ts` | runtime env parser |\n| `api/config/appDefaults.ts` | 非シークレットの既定値 |\n| `api/db/index.ts` | DB runtime の public entry。variant はここから差し替える |\n| `api/db/sqlite.ts` | SQLite baseline の Drizzle runtime |\n| `api/db/schema.ts` | Drizzle SQLite schema |\n| `api/db/migrate.ts` | migration runner の public entry |\n| `api/db/migrate-sqlite.ts` | SQLite baseline の migration runner |\n| `api/routes/auth.route.ts` | `/api/auth/*` route |\n| `api/routes/health.route.ts` | `/api/health` route |\n| `api/routes/protected.route.ts` | `/api/protected/*` の server-side protected sample |\n| `api/modules/auth/` | password hash、JWT、cookie、auth service |\n| `api/middleware/auth.ts` | protected API middleware |\n| `web/src/` | React frontend |\n| `shared/schemas/` | frontend/backend で共有する Zod schema と API object type |\n| `drizzle/` | SQL migrations |\n| `scripts/verify.ts` | typecheck / lint / format / test / coverage / build の検証 pipeline |\n\n## 前提\n\n| Tool | 用途 |\n| --- | --- |\n| Bun | package manager、runtime、scripts |\n| SQLite | auth user / refresh token storage |\n\n## セットアップ\n\n```bash\nbun run bootstrap\nbun run auth:create-admin -- --email admin@example.com --name \"Admin User\"\nbun run dev\n```\n\n`bootstrap` は `.env` を用意し、dependency が未導入なら `bun install --frozen-lockfile` を実行し、SQLite database に migration を適用します。\n\n`auth:create-admin` は対話で password を読みます。自動化する場合は次のように標準入力から渡せます。\n\n```bash\nprintf ''%s\\n'' ''<password>'' | bun run auth:create-admin -- --email admin@example.com --name \"Admin User\" --password-stdin\n```\n\n開発サーバーは `http://localhost:5173` で起動します。Vite dev server が frontend を配信し、`/api/*` は Hono に渡されます。\n\n初回 clone 後に template の動作確認まで済ませる場合は、次を実行します。\n\n```bash\nbun run verify\nbun run verify:e2e\n```\n\n認証を使う app では `auth:create-admin` または `seed:dev` で admin を作成してから `/login` を確認します。認証を使わない app では、この README 後半の auth removal checklist に沿って auth route、DB table、login/protected screen、E2E scope をまとめて削ります。\n\n## 生成物と管理対象\n\nこの template では、source と docs は追跡し、local runtime や検証の生成物は追跡しません。\n\n| Path / Pattern | 扱い |\n| --- | --- |\n| `drizzle/*.sql` | Drizzle migration source。commit 対象 |\n| `.env.example` | local development の雛形。commit 対象 |\n| `.env*` | local secret / runtime env。`.env.example` 以外は commit しない |\n| `data/`, `*.db`, `*.sqlite`, `*.sqlite3` | local SQLite database。commit しない |\n| `coverage/`, `playwright-report/`, `test-results/` | verification output。commit しない |\n| `dist/`, `dist-web/`, `build/`, `*.tgz` | build / archive output。commit しない |\n\n## 環境変数\n\n非シークレットの既定値は `api/config/appDefaults.ts` にあります。`.env.example` は local development 向けの値です。\n\n| Variable | Required | Description | Default |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `NODE_ENV` | no | `development` / `test` / `production` | `development` |\n| `HOST` | no | HTTP bind host。container では `0.0.0.0` を指定 | `127.0.0.1` |\n| `PORT` | no | HTTP server port | `5173` |\n| `DATABASE_URL` | no | SQLite database ","sourceFiles":["LLM_CONTEXT.md","README.md","api/app/env.test.ts","api/app/env.ts","api/app/hono.test.ts","api/app/hono.ts","api/app/security-headers.ts","api/app/server.ts","api/cli/auth-create-admin.ts","api/cli/cli-contract.test.ts","api/cli/migrate.ts","api/config/appDefaults.ts","api/db/index.ts","api/db/migrate-sqlite.ts","api/db/migrate.ts","api/db/path.test.ts","api/db/path.ts","api/db/schema.ts","api/db/sqlite.ts","api/middleware/auth.test.ts","api/middleware/auth.ts","api/modules/auth/auth-cookies.test.ts","api/modules/auth/auth-cookies.ts","api/modules/auth/auth.service.test.ts","api/modules/auth/auth.service.ts","api/modules/auth/context.test.ts","api/modules/auth/context.ts","api/modules/auth/errors.test.ts","api/modules/auth/errors.ts","api/modules/auth/password.test.ts","api/modules/auth/password.ts","api/modules/auth/token.service.test.ts","api/modules/auth/token.service.ts","api/modules/auth/types.test.ts","api/modules/auth/types.ts","api/routes/auth.route.test.ts","api/routes/auth.route.ts","api/routes/bbs.route.test.ts","api/routes/bbs.route.ts","api/routes/health.route.test.ts","api/routes/health.route.ts","api/routes/protected.route.test.ts","api/routes/protected.route.ts","api/types/hono-context.d.ts","biome.json","docs/template-variant-management.md","drizzle.config.ts","drizzle/0001_auth.sql","drizzle/0002_bbs.sql","package.json","playwright.config.ts","scripts/bootstrap.test.ts","scripts/bootstrap.ts","scripts/e2e-server.ts","scripts/seed-dev.ts","scripts/verify.ts","shared/schemas/auth.schema.ts","shared/schemas/protected.schema.test.ts","shared/schemas/protected.schema.ts","tests/e2e/smoke.spec.ts","tsconfig.build.json","tsconfig.json","vite.config.ts","vitest.config.ts","web/src/App.tsx","web/src/api.test.ts","web/src/api.ts","web/src/auth-context.tsx","web/src/components/dev-error-panel.tsx","web/src/domains/auth/login-domain.tsx","web/src/main.tsx","web/src/router.tsx","web/src/routes/home-route.tsx","web/src/routes/login-route.tsx","web/src/routes/login-search.ts","web/src/routes/protected-route.tsx","web/src/routes/root-route.tsx","web/src/routes/route-access.test.ts","web/src/routes/route-access.ts","web/src/routes/showcase-route.tsx","web/src/routes/thread-detail-route.tsx","web/src/routes/thread-new-route.tsx","web/src/routes/threads-route.tsx","web/src/showcase-settings-context.tsx","web/src/showcase-table-search.ts","web/src/styles.css","web/src/views/home-view.tsx","web/src/views/login-view.tsx","web/src/views/protected-view.tsx","web/src/views/showcase-view.tsx","web/src/views/thread-detail-view.tsx","web/src/views/thread-new-view.tsx","web/src/views/threads-view.tsx"],"routeFiles":["api/routes/auth.route.test.ts","api/routes/auth.route.ts","api/routes/bbs.route.test.ts","api/routes/bbs.route.ts","api/routes/health.route.test.ts","api/routes/health.route.ts","api/routes/protected.route.test.ts","api/routes/protected.route.ts","web/src/routes/home-route.tsx","web/src/routes/login-route.tsx","web/src/routes/login-search.ts","web/src/routes/protected-route.tsx","web/src/routes/root-route.tsx","web/src/routes/route-access.test.ts","web/src/routes/route-access.ts","web/src/routes/showcase-route.tsx","web/src/routes/thread-detail-route.tsx","web/src/routes/thread-new-route.tsx","web/src/routes/threads-route.tsx","web/src/views/home-view.tsx","web/src/views/login-view.tsx","web/src/views/protected-view.tsx","web/src/views/showcase-view.tsx","web/src/views/thread-detail-view.tsx","web/src/views/thread-new-view.tsx","web/src/views/threads-view.tsx"],"migrationFiles":["drizzle/0001_auth.sql","drizzle/0002_bbs.sql"],"sourceExcerpts":[{"path":"README.md","excerpt":"# Hono Standard\n[![Bun](https://img.shields.io/badge/Bun-%23000000.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=bun&logoColor=white)](https://bun.sh/)\n[![Hono](https://img.shields.io/badge/Hono-%23E36022.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=hono&logoColor=white)](https://hono.dev/)\n[![React](https://img.shields.io/badge/React-%2320232a.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=react&logoColor=%2361DAFB)](https://react.dev/)\n[![SQLite](https://img.shields.io/badge/SQLite-003B57.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=sqlite&logoColor=white)](https://www.sqlite.org/)\n[![TypeScript](https://img.shields.io/badge/TypeScript-%23007ACC.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=typescript&logoColor=white)](https://www.typescriptlang.org/)\n[![MIT License](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-green.svg?style=for-the-badge)](LICENSE.md)\nHono backend と React + Vite frontend を同一 origin で動かす、local SQLite 対応の Web app template です。Drizzle のユーザー認証、httpOnly Cookie による access / refresh token、React Router ベースの画面、コンポーネント showcase を含みます。\n## 構成\n| Path | Role |\n| --- | --- |\n| `api/app/hono.ts` | Hono app composition。middleware、API route、静的配信、`AppType` を登録 |\n| `api/app/server.ts` | Bun server bootstrap |\n| `api/app/env.ts` | runtime env parser |\n| `api/config/appDefaults.ts` | 非シークレットの既定値 |\n| `api/db/index.ts` | DB runtime の public entry。variant はここから差し替える |\n| `api/db/sqlite.ts` | SQLite baseline の Drizzle runtime |\n| `api/db/schema.ts` | Drizzle SQLite schema |\n| `api/db/migrate.ts` | migration runner の public entry |\n| `api/db/migrate-sqlite.ts` | SQLite baseline の migration runner |\n| `api/routes/auth.route.ts` | `/api/auth/*` route |\n| `api/routes/health.route.ts` | `/api/health` route |\n| `api/routes/protected.route.ts` | `/api/protected/*` の server-side protected sample |\n| `api/modules/auth/` | password hash、JWT、cookie、auth service |\n| `api/mi"},{"path":"api/app/env.test.ts","excerpt":"import { describe, expect, it } from \"vitest\";\nimport { APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS } from \"../config/appDefaults\";\nimport { readAppEnv } from \"./env\";\ndescribe(\"readAppEnv\", () => {\n\tit(\"uses minimal app defaults\", () => {\n\t\tconst env = readAppEnv({});\n\t\texpect(env.nodeEnv).toBe(\"development\");\n\t\texpect(env.host).toBe(APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS.host);\n\t\texpect(env.port).toBe(APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS.port);\n\t\texpect(env.databaseUrl).toBe(APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS.databaseUrl);\n\t\texpect(env.appUrl).toBe(APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS.appUrl);\n\t\texpect(env.corsOrigins).toEqual(APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS.corsOrigins);\n\t\texpect(env.cookieSameSite).toBe(APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS.cookieSameSite);\n\t});\n\tit(\"accepts database and auth runtime overrides\", () => {\n\t\tconst env = readAppEnv({\n\t\t\tHOST: \"0.0.0.0\",\n\t\t\tPORT: \"5174\",\n\t\t\tDATABASE_URL: \"tmp/test.sqlite\",\n\t\t\tJWT_SECRET: \"x\".repeat(32),\n\t\t\tAPP_URL: \"https://showcase.example.com\",\n\t\t\tCORS_ORIGINS: \"https://showcase.example.com,http://localhost:5173\",\n\t\t\tAUTH_COOKIE_SECURE: \"true\",\n\t\t\tAUTH_COOKIE_SAME_SITE: \"none\",\n\t\t\tSECURITY_HEADERS_MODE: \"https\",\n\t\t});\n\t\texpect(env.host).toBe(\"0.0.0.0\");\n\t\texpect(env.port).toBe(5174);\n\t\texpect(env.databaseUrl).toBe(\"tmp/test.sqlite\");\n\t\texpect(env.jwtSecret).toBe(\"x\".repeat(32));\n\t\texpect(env.appUrl).toBe(\"https://showcase.example.com\");\n\t\texpect(env.corsOrigins).toEqual([\n\t\t\t\"https://showcase.example.com\",\n\t\t\t\"http://localhost:5173\",\n\t\t]);\n\t\texpect(env.secureCookie).toBe(true);\n\t\texpect(env.cookieSameSite).toBe(\"none\");\n\t\texpect(env.securityHeadersMode).toBe(\"https\");\n\t});\n\tit(\"falls back to the SQLite default when a dev shell provides a connection URL\", () => {\n\t\tconst env = readAppEnv({\n\t\t\tDATABASE_URL: \"postgres://postgres:postgres@127.0.0.1:5432/app\",\n\t\t});\n\t\texpect(env.databaseUrl).toBe(APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS.databaseUrl);\n\t});\n\tit(\"rej"},{"path":"api/app/env.ts","excerpt":"import { z } from \"zod\";\nimport { APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS } from \"../config/appDefaults\";\nimport { isDatabaseConnectionUrl } from \"../db/path\";\nconst optionalTrimmedString = z.preprocess((value) => {\n\tif (typeof value !== \"string\") return value;\n\tconst trimmed = value.trim();\n\treturn trimmed.length > 0 ? trimmed : undefined;\n}, z.string().trim().optional());\nconst optionalUrl = z.preprocess((value) => {\n\tif (typeof value !== \"string\") return value;\n\tconst trimmed = value.trim();\n\treturn trimmed.length > 0 ? trimmed : undefined;\n}, z.string().url().optional());\nconst optionalBoolean = z.preprocess((value) => {\n\tif (typeof value === \"boolean\") return value;\n\tif (typeof value !== \"string\") return value;\n\tconst normalized = value.trim().toLowerCase();\n\tif (!normalized) return undefined;\n\tif ([\"1\", \"true\", \"yes\", \"on\"].includes(normalized)) return true;\n\tif ([\"0\", \"false\", \"no\", \"off\"].includes(normalized)) return false;\n\treturn value;\n}, z.boolean().optional());\nconst optionalPort = z.preprocess((value) => {\n\tif (typeof value === \"number\") return value;\n\tif (typeof value !== \"string\") return value;\n\tconst trimmed = value.trim();\n\treturn trimmed.length > 0 ? Number(trimmed) : undefined;\n}, z.number().int().min(1).max(65535).optional());\nconst optionalCookieSameSite = z.preprocess((value) => {\n\tif (typeof value !== \"string\") return value;\n\tconst normalized = value.trim().toLowerCase();\n\treturn normalized.length > 0 ? normalized : undefined;\n}, z.enum([\"lax\", \"strict\", \"none\"]).optional());\nconst optionalSecurityHeadersMode = z.preprocess(\n\t(value) => {\n\t\tif (typeof value !== \"string\") return value;\n\t\tconst normalized = value.trim().toLowerCase();\n\t\treturn normalized.length > 0 ? normalized : undefined;\n\t},\n\tz.enum([\"auto\", \"http\", \"https\"]).default(\"auto\"),\n);\nconst EnvSchema = z"},{"path":"api/app/hono.test.ts","excerpt":"import { describe, expect, it, vi, beforeEach } from \"vitest\";\nimport fs from \"node:fs/promises\";\nimport { HttpError } from \"../modules/auth/errors\";\nimport { HTTPException } from \"hono/http-exception\";\n// Mock environment and DB connection before importing app\nvi.mock(\"../db\", () => ({\n\tcreateDbRuntime: vi.fn().mockReturnValue({\n\t\tdb: {\n\t\t\tquery: {\n\t\t\t\tusers: {\n\t\t\t\t\tfindFirst: vi.fn(),\n\t\t\t\t},\n\t\t\t},\n\t\t},\n\t\tclose: vi.fn(),\n\t\tconnection: {\n\t\t\tclient: {\n\t\t\t\tclose: vi.fn(),\n\t\t\t},\n\t\t\townsConnection: false,\n\t\t},\n\t}),\n}));\nvi.mock(\"./env\", () => ({\n\treadAppEnv: vi.fn().mockReturnValue({\n\t\tnodeEnv: \"test\",\n\t\thost: \"127.0.0.1\",\n\t\tport: 5173,\n\t\tdatabaseUrl: \"mock.db\",\n\t\tjwtSecret: \"x\".repeat(32),\n\t\tjwtAccessExpiresIn: \"15m\",\n\t\tjwtRefreshExpiresIn: \"7d\",\n\t\tappUrl: \"http://localhost:5173\",\n\t\tcorsOrigins: [\"http://localhost:5173\"],\n\t\ttrustProxy: true,\n\t\tsecureCookie: false,\n\t\tcookieSameSite: \"lax\",\n\t\tsecurityHeadersMode: \"auto\",\n\t}),\n}));\n// Mock Bun global variable before importing hono/bun dependent code\n(globalThis as any).Bun = {\n\tfile: (path: string) => ({\n\t\texists: () => Promise.resolve(true),\n\t}),\n};\n// Dynamically import app so globalThis.Bun is defined first\nconst { default: app } = await import(\"./hono\");\n// Add test routes before any request is processed (Hono routers lock after first request)\napp.post(\"/api/test-http-error\", () => {\n\tthrow new HttpError(400, \"Bad Parameters\");\n});\napp.post(\"/api/test-hono-http-exception\", () => {\n\tthrow new HTTPException(403, { message: \"Access Forbidden\" });\n});\napp.post(\"/api/test-generic-error\", () => {\n\tthrow new Error(\"Something blew up\");\n});\ndescribe(\"hono app entry\", () => {\n\tbeforeEach(() => {\n\t\tvi.restoreAllMocks();\n\t});\n\tit(\"should return 200 for /api/health\", async () => {\n\t\tconst res = await app.request(\"/api/health\");\n\t\texp"},{"path":"api/app/hono.ts","excerpt":"import fs from \"node:fs/promises\";\nimport path from \"node:path\";\nimport { serveStatic } from \"hono/bun\";\nimport { csrf } from \"hono/csrf\";\nimport { Hono } from \"hono\";\nimport { cors } from \"hono/cors\";\nimport { logger } from \"hono/logger\";\nimport { HTTPException } from \"hono/http-exception\";\nimport { secureHeaders } from \"hono/secure-headers\";\nimport type { DbRuntime } from \"../db\";\nimport { createDbRuntime } from \"../db\";\nimport { requireAuth } from \"../middleware/auth\";\nimport { AuthService } from \"../modules/auth/auth.service\";\nimport { HttpError } from \"../modules/auth/errors\";\nimport { createBbsRoute } from \"../routes/bbs.route\";\nimport { createAuthRoute } from \"../routes/auth.route\";\nimport { createHealthRoute } from \"../routes/health.route\";\nimport { createProtectedRoute } from \"../routes/protected.route\";\nimport { readAppEnv, type AppEnv } from \"./env\";\nimport { appContentSecurityPolicy } from \"./security-headers\";\nexport type AppDeps = {\n\tenv: AppEnv;\n\tdbRuntime: DbRuntime;\n\tauthService: AuthService;\n};\ndeclare global {\n\tvar __honoStandardRuntime__: Promise<AppDeps> | undefined;\n}\nexport async function createDefaultAppDeps(): Promise<AppDeps> {\n\tconst env = readAppEnv();\n\tconst dbRuntime = createDbRuntime(env);\n\tconst authService = new AuthService(dbRuntime.db, env);\n\treturn { env, dbRuntime, authService };\n}\nexport async function getAppRuntime(): Promise<AppDeps> {\n\tif (!globalThis.__honoStandardRuntime__) {\n\t\tglobalThis.__honoStandardRuntime__ = createDefaultAppDeps().catch(\n\t\t\t(error) => {\n\t\t\t\tglobalThis.__honoStandardRuntime__ = undefined;\n\t\t\t\tthrow error;\n\t\t\t},\n\t\t);\n\t}\n\treturn globalThis.__honoStandardRuntime__;\n}\nconst distWebRoot = path.resolve(process.cwd(), \"dist-web\");\nconst distWebIndex = path.resolve(distWebRoot, \"index.html\");\nexport function creat"},{"path":"api/app/security-headers.ts","excerpt":"type CspDirectives = Record<string, string[]>;\nexport const appContentSecurityPolicy: CspDirectives = {\n\tdefaultSrc: [\"''self''\"],\n\tbaseUri: [\"''self''\"],\n\tconnectSrc: [\"''self''\"],\n\tfontSrc: [\"''self''\", \"data:\"],\n\tformAction: [\"''self''\"],\n\tframeAncestors: [\"''self''\"],\n\timgSrc: [\"''self''\", \"data:\", \"blob:\"],\n\tmanifestSrc: [\"''self''\"],\n\tobjectSrc: [\"''none''\"],\n\tscriptSrc: [\"''self''\"],\n\tstyleSrc: [\"''self''\", \"''unsafe-inline''\"],\n\tworkerSrc: [\"''self''\", \"blob:\"],\n};\nexport const viteDevContentSecurityPolicy: CspDirectives = {\n\t...appContentSecurityPolicy,\n\tconnectSrc: [\n\t\t\"''self''\",\n\t\t\"ws:\",\n\t\t\"http://localhost:5173\",\n\t\t\"http://127.0.0.1:5173\",\n\t],\n\tscriptSrc: [\"''self''\", \"''unsafe-inline''\", \"''unsafe-eval''\"],\n};\nconst toKebabCase = (value: string): string =>\n\tvalue.replace(/[A-Z]+(?![a-z])|[A-Z]/g, (match, offset) =>\n\t\toffset ? `-${match.toLowerCase()}` : match.toLowerCase(),\n\t);\nexport function serializeContentSecurityPolicy(policy: CspDirectives): string {\n\treturn Object.entries(policy)\n\t\t.map(\n\t\t\t([directive, values]) => `${toKebabCase(directive)} ${values.join(\" \")}`,\n\t\t)\n\t\t.join(\"; \");\n}"},{"path":"api/app/server.ts","excerpt":"import app, { getAppRuntime } from \"./hono\";\nimport { readAppEnv } from \"./env\";\nconst env = readAppEnv();\nconst server = Bun.serve({\n\tfetch: app.fetch,\n\thostname: env.host,\n\tport: env.port,\n});\nconsole.log(\n\t`Hono Standard server listening on http://${env.host}:${server.port}`,\n);\nconst shutdown = async (signal: string) => {\n\tconsole.log(`\\nReceived ${signal}. Shutting down gracefully...`);\n\tserver.stop(true);\n\ttry {\n\t\tconst runtime = await getAppRuntime();\n\t\tconsole.log(\"Closing database connection...\");\n\t\truntime.dbRuntime.close();\n\t\tconsole.log(\"Shutdown complete.\");\n\t\tprocess.exit(0);\n\t} catch (error) {\n\t\tconsole.error(\"Error during shutdown:\", error);\n\t\tprocess.exit(1);\n\t}\n};\nprocess.on(\"SIGINT\", () => shutdown(\"SIGINT\"));\nprocess.on(\"SIGTERM\", () => shutdown(\"SIGTERM\"));"},{"path":"api/routes/auth.route.test.ts","excerpt":"import { Hono } from \"hono\";\nimport { describe, expect, it, vi, beforeEach } from \"vitest\";\nimport { createAuthRoute } from \"./auth.route\";\nimport { requireAuth } from \"../middleware/auth\";\nimport type { AppEnv } from \"../app/env\";\nimport type { AuthService } from \"../modules/auth/auth.service\";\nimport { HttpError } from \"../modules/auth/errors\";\nimport {\n\tACCESS_TOKEN_COOKIE_NAME,\n\tREFRESH_TOKEN_COOKIE_NAME,\n} from \"../modules/auth/auth-cookies\";\ndescribe(\"auth route\", () => {\n\tlet app: Hono;\n\tlet mockAuthService: any;\n\tlet mockEnv: AppEnv;\n\tconst testUser = {\n\t\tid: \"a1a1a1a1-a1a1-41a1-a1a1-a1a1a1a1a1a1\",\n\t\temail: \"test@example.com\",\n\t\tdisplayName: \"Test User\",\n\t\trole: \"member\" as const,\n\t\tisActive: true,\n\t};\n\tbeforeEach(() => {\n\t\tmockEnv = {\n\t\t\tjwtSecret: \"x\".repeat(32),\n\t\t\tjwtAccessExpiresIn: \"15m\",\n\t\t\tjwtRefreshExpiresIn: \"7d\",\n\t\t\tsecureCookie: true,\n\t\t\tcookieSameSite: \"lax\",\n\t\t} as unknown as AppEnv;\n\t\tmockAuthService = {\n\t\t\tlogin: vi.fn(),\n\t\t\trefresh: vi.fn(),\n\t\t\tlogout: vi.fn(),\n\t\t\tfindUserById: vi.fn(),\n\t\t};\n\t\tapp = new Hono();\n\t\t// Set error handler to prevent throwing unhandled exceptions in tests\n\t\tapp.onError((err, c) => {\n\t\t\tconst status = (err as HttpError).status || 500;\n\t\t\treturn c.json({ message: err.message }, status as any);\n\t\t});\n\t\tapp.use(\n\t\t\t\"/auth/me\",\n\t\t\trequireAuth({\n\t\t\t\tenv: mockEnv,\n\t\t\t\tauthService: mockAuthService as unknown as AuthService,\n\t\t\t}),\n\t\t);\n\t\tapp.route(\n\t\t\t\"/auth\",\n\t\t\tcreateAuthRoute({\n\t\t\t\tauthService: mockAuthService as unknown as AuthService,\n\t\t\t\tenv: mockEnv,\n\t\t\t}),\n\t\t);\n\t});\n\tdescribe(\"POST /login\", () => {\n\t\tit(\"should login user with valid credentials and set cookies\", async () => {\n\t\t\tmockAuthService.login.mockResolvedValue({\n\t\t\t\taccessToken: \"access-token-123\",\n\t\t\t\trefreshToken: \"refresh-token-456\",\n\t\t\t\tuser: {\n\t\t\t\t\tid: te"},{"path":"api/routes/auth.route.ts","excerpt":"import { zValidator } from \"@hono/zod-validator\";\nimport { Hono } from \"hono\";\nimport { getCookie } from \"hono/cookie\";\nimport { loginSchema } from \"../../shared/schemas/auth.schema\";\nimport type { AppEnv } from \"../app/env\";\nimport type { AuthService } from \"../modules/auth/auth.service\";\nimport {\n\tREFRESH_TOKEN_COOKIE_NAME,\n\tclearAuthCookies,\n\tsetAuthCookies,\n} from \"../modules/auth/auth-cookies\";\nimport { getAuthContextUser } from \"../modules/auth/context\";\nimport { HttpError } from \"../modules/auth/errors\";\ntype AuthRouteDeps = {\n\tauthService: AuthService;\n\tenv: AppEnv;\n};\nexport function createAuthRoute(deps: AuthRouteDeps) {\n\treturn new Hono()\n\t\t.post(\"/login\", zValidator(\"json\", loginSchema), async (c) => {\n\t\t\tconst body = c.req.valid(\"json\");\n\t\t\tconst result = await deps.authService.login({\n\t\t\t\temail: body.email,\n\t\t\t\tpassword: body.password,\n\t\t\t});\n\t\t\tsetAuthCookies(c, deps.env, result);\n\t\t\treturn c.json({ user: result.user });\n\t\t})\n\t\t.post(\"/refresh\", async (c) => {\n\t\t\tconst refreshToken = getCookie(c, REFRESH_TOKEN_COOKIE_NAME);\n\t\t\tif (!refreshToken) {\n\t\t\t\tthrow new HttpError(401, \"Unauthorized\");\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\tconst result = await deps.authService.refresh(refreshToken);\n\t\t\tsetAuthCookies(c, deps.env, result);\n\t\t\treturn c.json({ user: result.user });\n\t\t})\n\t\t.post(\"/logout\", async (c) => {\n\t\t\tconst refreshToken = getCookie(c, REFRESH_TOKEN_COOKIE_NAME);\n\t\t\tawait deps.authService.logout(refreshToken);\n\t\t\tclearAuthCookies(c);\n\t\t\treturn c.json({ ok: true });\n\t\t})\n\t\t.get(\"/me\", async (c) => {\n\t\t\tconst authUser = getAuthContextUser(c);\n\t\t\tconst user = await deps.authService.findUserById(authUser.userId);\n\t\t\tif (!user?.isActive) {\n\t\t\t\tthrow new HttpError(401, \"Unauthorized\");\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\treturn c.json({\n\t\t\t\tuser: {\n\t\t\t\t\tid: user.id,\n\t\t\t\t\temail: user.email,\n\t\t\t\t\tdisplayName: us"},{"path":"api/routes/bbs.route.test.ts","excerpt":"import { Hono } from \"hono\";\nimport { HttpError } from \"../modules/auth/errors\";\nimport { afterEach, describe, expect, it, vi } from \"vitest\";\nimport { createBbsRoute } from \"./bbs.route\";\nimport { posts, threads } from \"../db/schema\";\ntype ThreadRow = {\n\tid: number;\n\ttitle: string;\n\tcreatedAt: Date;\n\tupdatedAt: Date;\n\tlastPostAt: Date;\n\treplyCount: number;\n};\ntype PostRow = {\n\tid: number;\n\tthreadId: number;\n\tparentPostId: number | null;\n\tauthorName: string;\n\tbody: string;\n\tcreatedAt: Date;\n\tupdatedAt: Date;\n};\nfunction createFakeDb(options?: {\n\tfailThreadInsert?: boolean;\n\tfailParentLookup?: boolean;\n}) {\n\tconst state = {\n\t\tthreadId: 0,\n\t\tpostId: 0,\n\t\tthreads: [] as ThreadRow[],\n\t\tposts: [] as PostRow[],\n\t};\n\tconst select = (selection?: Record<string, unknown>) => ({\n\t\tfrom(table: unknown) {\n\t\t\tif (table === threads) {\n\t\t\t\tconst build = (predicate?: unknown) => ({\n\t\t\t\t\tget: async () =>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tstate.threads.find((thread) =>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tmatchThreadPredicate(thread, predicate),\n\t\t\t\t\t\t) ?? null,\n\t\t\t\t\tall: async () =>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t[...state.threads]\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t.sort((a, b) => b.lastPostAt.getTime() - a.lastPostAt.getTime())\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t.map((thread) => ({\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tid: thread.id,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\ttitle: thread.title,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tcreatedAt: thread.createdAt,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tupdatedAt: thread.updatedAt,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tlastPostAt: thread.lastPostAt,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\treplyCount: thread.replyCount,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t})),\n\t\t\t\t});\n\t\t\t\treturn {\n\t\t\t\t\twhere: (predicate?: unknown) => build(predicate),\n\t\t\t\t\torderBy: () => build(),\n\t\t\t\t};\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\tconst build = (predicate?: unknown) => {\n\t\t\t\tconst rows = state.posts.filter((post) =>\n\t\t\t\t\tmatchPostPredicate(post, predicate, options?.failParentLookup),\n\t\t\t\t);\n\t\t\t\tconst query = {\n\t\t\t\t\tget: async () => rows[0] ?? null,\n\t\t\t\t\tall: async () =>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t[...rows].sort((a, b) => a.createdAt.getTime() - b.createdAt.getTi"},{"path":"api/routes/bbs.route.ts","excerpt":"import { zValidator } from \"@hono/zod-validator\";\nimport { and, asc, desc, eq } from \"drizzle-orm\";\nimport { Hono } from \"hono\";\nimport { z } from \"zod\";\nimport type { AppDatabase } from \"../db\";\nimport { posts, threads } from \"../db/schema\";\nimport { HttpError } from \"../modules/auth/errors\";\ntype BbsRouteDeps = {\n\tdb: AppDatabase;\n};\nconst threadCreateSchema = z.object({\n\ttitle: z.string().trim().min(1).max(120),\n\tbody: z.string().trim().min(1).max(4000),\n\tauthorName: z.string().trim().min(1).max(80).optional(),\n});\nconst replyCreateSchema = z.object({\n\tbody: z.string().trim().min(1).max(4000),\n\tauthorName: z.string().trim().min(1).max(80).optional(),\n\tparentPostId: z.number().int().positive().optional(),\n});\nasync function getThreadOrThrow(db: AppDatabase, id: number) {\n\tconst row = await db.select().from(threads).where(eq(threads.id, id)).get();\n\tif (!row) throw new HttpError(404, \"Thread not found\");\n\treturn row;\n}\nexport function createBbsRoute(deps: BbsRouteDeps) {\n\treturn new Hono()\n\t\t.get(\"/threads\", async (c) => {\n\t\t\tconst items = await deps.db\n\t\t\t\t.select({\n\t\t\t\t\tid: threads.id,\n\t\t\t\t\ttitle: threads.title,\n\t\t\t\t\tcreatedAt: threads.createdAt,\n\t\t\t\t\tupdatedAt: threads.updatedAt,\n\t\t\t\t\tlastPostAt: threads.lastPostAt,\n\t\t\t\t\treplyCount: threads.replyCount,\n\t\t\t\t})\n\t\t\t\t.from(threads)\n\t\t\t\t.orderBy(desc(threads.lastPostAt), desc(threads.createdAt))\n\t\t\t\t.all();\n\t\t\treturn c.json({ threads: items });\n\t\t})\n\t\t.get(\"/threads/:id\", async (c) => {\n\t\t\tconst id = Number(c.req.param(\"id\"));\n\t\t\tif (!Number.isInteger(id)) throw new HttpError(400, \"Invalid thread id\");\n\t\t\tconst thread = await getThreadOrThrow(deps.db, id);\n\t\t\tconst items = await deps.db\n\t\t\t\t.select({\n\t\t\t\t\tid: posts.id,\n\t\t\t\t\tthreadId: posts.threadId,\n\t\t\t\t\tparentPostId: posts.parentPostId,\n\t\t\t\t\tauthorName: posts.authorName"},{"path":"api/routes/health.route.test.ts","excerpt":"import { Hono } from \"hono\";\nimport { describe, expect, it } from \"vitest\";\nimport { createHealthRoute } from \"./health.route\";\ndescribe(\"health route\", () => {\n\tit(\"should return ok status\", async () => {\n\t\tconst app = new Hono().route(\"/health\", createHealthRoute());\n\t\tconst res = await app.request(\"/health\");\n\t\texpect(res.status).toBe(200);\n\t\tconst body = await res.json();\n\t\texpect(body).toEqual({\n\t\t\tstatus: \"ok\",\n\t\t\tservice: \"hono-standard\",\n\t\t});\n\t});\n});"},{"path":"api/routes/health.route.ts","excerpt":"import { Hono } from \"hono\";\nexport function createHealthRoute() {\n\treturn new Hono().get(\"/\", (c) => {\n\t\treturn c.json({ status: \"ok\", service: \"hono-standard\" });\n\t});\n}"},{"path":"api/routes/protected.route.test.ts","excerpt":"import { Hono } from \"hono\";\nimport { describe, expect, it } from \"vitest\";\nimport { createProtectedRoute } from \"./protected.route\";\ndescribe(\"protected route\", () => {\n\tit(\"returns the authenticated profile from context\", async () => {\n\t\tconst app = new Hono();\n\t\tapp.use(\"/protected/*\", async (c, next) => {\n\t\t\tc.set(\"authUser\", {\n\t\t\t\tuserId: \"a1a1a1a1-a1a1-41a1-a1a1-a1a1a1a1a1a1\",\n\t\t\t\temail: \"test@example.com\",\n\t\t\t\trole: \"member\",\n\t\t\t});\n\t\t\tawait next();\n\t\t});\n\t\tapp.route(\"/protected\", createProtectedRoute());\n\t\tconst res = await app.request(\"/protected/profile\");\n\t\tconst body = await res.json();\n\t\texpect(res.status).toBe(200);\n\t\texpect(body.profile).toEqual({\n\t\t\temail: \"test@example.com\",\n\t\t\trole: \"member\",\n\t\t});\n\t});\n});"},{"path":"api/routes/protected.route.ts","excerpt":"import { Hono } from \"hono\";\nimport type { ProtectedProfileResponse } from \"../../shared/schemas/protected.schema\";\nimport { getAuthContextUser } from \"../modules/auth/context\";\nexport function createProtectedRoute() {\n\treturn new Hono().get(\"/profile\", (c) => {\n\t\tconst authUser = getAuthContextUser(c);\n\t\tconst response = {\n\t\t\tprofile: {\n\t\t\t\temail: authUser.email,\n\t\t\t\trole: authUser.role,\n\t\t\t},\n\t\t} satisfies ProtectedProfileResponse;\n\t\treturn c.json(response);\n\t});\n}"},{"path":"web/src/App.tsx","excerpt":"import { QueryClient, QueryClientProvider } from \"@tanstack/react-query\";\nimport { RouterProvider } from \"@tanstack/react-router\";\nimport { router } from \"./router\";\nimport { ShowcaseSettingsProvider } from \"./showcase-settings-context\";\nconst queryClient = new QueryClient({\n\tdefaultOptions: {\n\t\tqueries: {\n\t\t\tretry: false,\n\t\t},\n\t},\n});\nexport function App() {\n\treturn (\n\t\t<QueryClientProvider client={queryClient}>\n\t\t\t<ShowcaseSettingsProvider>\n\t\t\t\t<RouterProvider router={router} />\n\t\t\t</ShowcaseSettingsProvider>\n\t\t</QueryClientProvider>\n\t);\n}"}],"llmContextFiles":[{"path":"LLM_CONTEXT.md","excerpt":"# LLM Context: Hono Standard\n\nこの文書は、`hono-standard` を clone した直後に作業入口を決めるための圧縮コンテキストです。現行 branch は local SQLite auth/showcase template です。RAG、pgvector、agentic search、wiki ingestion は含みません。\n\n## Repository Snapshot\n\n- Bun + Hono backend と React + Vite frontend を同一 origin で動かす template。\n- DB は local SQLite。Drizzle schema は `api/db/schema.ts`、migration は `drizzle/`。\n- Backend app composition は `api/app/hono.ts`、server bootstrap は `api/app/server.ts`。\n- DB runtime の public entry は `api/db/index.ts`。SQLite baseline は `api/db/sqlite.ts`、migration runner は `api/db/migrate.ts` から `api/db/migrate-sqlite.ts` を呼ぶ。\n- Frontend entry は `web/src/App.tsx`、router は `web/src/router.tsx`、API client は `web/src/api.ts`。\n- Auth 実装は `api/modules/auth/`、route は `api/routes/auth.route.ts`、login UI は `web/src/domains/auth/login-domain.tsx`。\n- Shared API schema/object は `shared/schemas/`。Backend は `zValidator`、frontend は `hono/client` + `AppType` で同じ契約を参照する。\n- Home と Showcase は未ログインでも表示する。ログイン状態がある場合だけ header に user chip と logout button を表示する。\n- Protected sample は `/protected` と `/api/protected/profile`。frontend guard と server-side `requireAuth` の両方を示す。\n- Package manager / runtime は Bun。dev server は `bunx --bun vite` で起動する。\n- Quality gates は `bun run verify` と `bun run verify:e2e`。CI も同じ入口を使う。\n- `main` は SQLite baseline。Turso / PostgreSQL / pgvector は `variant/*` branch で driver、schema、migration、docs、smoke setup を差し替える。\n\n## Top-Level Map\n\n| Path | Role |\n| --- | --- |\n| `api/app/hono.ts` | Hono middleware、API route、static fallback、`AppType` export |\n| `api/app/server.ts` | Bun server bootstrap |\n| `api/app/env.ts` | environment parsing and defaults |\n| `api/config/appDefaults.ts` | non-secret app defaults |\n| `api/db/index.ts` | DB runtime public entry and variant boundary |\n| `api/db/sqlite.ts` | SQLite baseline Drizzle runtime |\n| `api/db/migrate.ts` | migration runner public entry |\n| `api/db/migrate-sqlite.ts` | SQLite baseline migration runner |\n| `api/db/schema.ts` | SQLite baseline Drizzle schema |\n| `api/routes/auth.route.ts` | `/api/auth/*` route module |\n| `api/routes/health.route.ts` | health route |\n| `api/routes/protected.route.ts` | server-side protected API sample |\n| `api/modules/auth/` | Auth service、JWT、cookies、password hashing |\n| `api/middleware/auth.ts` | access-token auth middleware |\n| `shared/schemas/` | Zod schema and public API object types shared by api and web |\n| `web/src/App.tsx` | React Query and Router providers |\n| `web/src/router.tsx` | TanStack Router tree |\n| `web/src/api.ts` | browser API client and auth refresh handling |\n| `web/src/auth-context.tsx` | frontend auth state |\n| `web/src/routes/` | route definitions |\n| `web/src/views/` | Home/Login/Showcase views |\n| `web/src/showcase-*` | showcase state and URL search helpers |\n| `drizzle/` | SQL migrations |\n| `scripts/verify.ts` | verification pipeline |\n| `scripts/e2e-server.ts` | Playwright smoke server with isolated SQLite DB |\n| `tests/e2e/` | Playwright smoke tests |\n| `.github/workflows/verify.yml` | CI verification |\n| `Dockerfile`, `docker-compose.yml` | Optional SQLite baseline container runtime |\n\n## Task Routing\n\n| Task | Start here | Usually also read | Defer unless touched |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Change auth API | `api/routes/auth.route.ts`, `api/modules/auth/`, `api/middleware/auth.ts`, `shared/schemas/auth.schema.ts` | `web/src/api.ts`, `web/src/auth-context.tsx` | showcase UI |\n| Change protected sample | `api/routes/protected.route.ts`, `web/src/views/protected-view.tsx`, `web/src/routes/protected-route.tsx` | `api/middleware/auth.ts`, `shared/schemas/protected.schema.ts`, `web/src/api.ts` | showcase UI |\n| Change login UI | `web/src/views/login-view.tsx`, `web/src/domains/auth/login-domain.tsx` | `web/src/auth-context.tsx`, `web/src/api.ts` | DB schema |\n| Change app shell/routing | `web/src/routes/root-route.tsx`, `web/src/router.tsx` | `web/src/App.tsx`, affected view | auth service internals |\n| Change showcase UI | `web/src/views/showcase-view.tsx`, `web/src/showcase-settings-context.tsx`, `web/src/showcase-table-search.ts` | `web/src/styles.css` | backend auth |\n| Change env/config | `api/app/env.ts`, `api/config/appDefaults.ts`, `.env.example` | `drizzle.config.ts`, Docker/Compose if bind host or port changes | frontend views |\n| Change DB runtime/variant boundary | `api/db/index.ts`, `api/db/sqlite.ts`, `api/db/migrate.ts`, `api/db/migrate-sqlite.ts` | `api/cli/migrate.ts`, `api/cli/auth-create-admin.ts`, `docs/template-variant-management.md` | showcase UI |\n| Change DB schema/migration | `api/db/schema.ts`, `drizzle/`, `api/db/migrate*.ts` | `api/modules/auth/auth.service.ts`, `api/modules/auth/token.service.ts` | showcase UI |\n| Change build/dev tooling | `package.json`, `vite.config.ts`, `vitest.config.ts`, `playwright.config.ts`, `scripts/verify.ts` | `.github/workflows/verify.yml`, failing config-specific output | feature code |\n| Change docs | `README.md`, `LLM_CONTEXT.md`, `docs/` | `.gitignore` when generated output changes | feature code |\n\n## Styling / CSS Architecture\n\nUI 変更では、この節を styling 判断の入口にする。まず全 CSS を広く探索せず、以下の entrypoint と pattern source で説明できるか確認する。\n\n- Global style entrypoint: `web/src/styles.css`。Tailwind v4 の `@import \"tailwindcss\"`、`@theme` token、`@layer base`、`@layer components` をこの1ファイルに集約している。\n- CSS load path: `web/src/main.tsx` が `./styles.css` を import する。Tailwind plugin は `vite.config.ts` の `@tailwindcss/vite`。\n- Design tokens / theme values: `web/src/styles.css` の `@theme` が global token の source of truth。`--color-*` と `--radius-*` を Tailwind utility / `@apply` から使う。\n- Showcase theme values: `web/src/showcase-settings-context.tsx` が `--showcase-*` custom properties を生成し、`web/src/styles.css` の `.showcase-shell` と `:root[data-showcase-page-theme]` rules がそれを消費する。\n- Shared UI components and common patterns: `web/src/styles.css` の `.topbar`, `.menu-*`, `.auth-*`, `.home-*`, `.center-shell`, `.signed-in-panel`, `.showcase-*`, `.demo-*`, `.table-*` class families。\n- Page a"}],"recentCommitDiffs":[],"packageScripts":[{"name":"auth:create-admin","command":"bun run api/cli/auth-create-admin.ts"},{"name":"bootstrap","command":"bun scripts/bootstrap.ts"},{"name":"build","command":"bun run build:web"},{"name":"build:web","command":"vite build"},{"name":"db:generate","command":"drizzle-kit generate"},{"name":"db:migrate","command":"bun run api/cli/migrate.ts"},{"name":"db:migrate:drizzle","command":"drizzle-kit migrate"},{"name":"dev","command":"bunx --bun vite"},{"name":"dev:vite","command":"vite"},{"name":"format","command":"biome format --write api web shared scripts tests drizzle.config.ts playwright.config.ts vite.config.ts vitest.config.ts"},{"name":"format:check","command":"biome format api web shared scripts tests drizzle.config.ts playwright.config.ts vite.config.ts vitest.config.ts"},{"name":"lint","command":"biome lint api web shared scripts tests drizzle.config.ts playwright.config.ts vite.config.ts vitest.config.ts"},{"name":"seed:dev","command":"bun scripts/seed-dev.ts"},{"name":"start","command":"bun run api/app/server.ts"},{"name":"test","command":"vitest run"},{"name":"test:coverage","command":"vitest run --coverage"},{"name":"test:e2e","command":"playwright test"},{"name":"test:watch","command":"vitest"},{"name":"typecheck","command":"tsc --noEmit"},{"name":"verify","command":"bun scripts/verify.ts"},{"name":"verify:all","command":"bun run verify && bun run verify:e2e"},{"name":"verify:e2e","command":"bun run test:e2e"},{"name":"verify:strict","command":"bun run verify"}],"moduleOntology":null},"qualityCapabilities":{"projectType":"typescript","commands":[{"kind":"unit","source":"package_json","command":"bun run ''test''","runnable":true},{"kind":"coverage","source":"package_json","command":"bun run ''test:coverage''","runnable":true},{"kind":"e2e","source":"package_json","command":"bun run ''test:e2e''","runnable":true},{"kind":"verify","source":"package_json","command":"bun run ''verify''","runnable":true}],"missingCapabilities":[]},"recentTokenSpendTasks":[{"taskId":"3c40e22b-fbe5-48a1-ba92-64f990e589fd","title":"BBSを作りたいです。計画してください。","totalTokens":8468677,"callCount":8}],"recentRuns":{"completed":1,"failed":0,"running":0}}','{"role":"mission_task_generation","providerId":"codex","providerEndpointId":"ep_2a9c67769830da1e","routeSource":"primary","modelOrDeployment":"gpt-5.4-mini","thinkingDepth":null}','{"schemaVersion":"nightworkers.mission-task-candidates/v1","candidates":[{"title":"todolist 機能の初期実装計画を作成する","summary":"todolist Goal に対して、未実装の本体機能を実装前提で整理し、UI・データモデル・永続化・完了状態・編集削除・検証方針を Plan Mode で確定するための入口を作る。","rationale":"repositorySnapshot.llmContextFiles と README から、この repo は Hono + React + SQLite の template であり、現時点の中心実装は auth/showcase/BBS で、todolist 本体は見当たらない。したがって Goal 達成に直接つながる最初の作業は、実装そのものではなく、todolist の初期実装計画を固めることになる。UI 詳細、データモデル、保存方式、完了状態、編集削除、検証方式は未確定要素として Plan Mode で定義すべきで、個別実装候補として分割しない。","goalId":"de3305e2-2269-4765-a117-5dd36de101e2","candidateKind":"feature_entrypoint","moduleRouting":{"primaryModule":null,"secondaryModules":["web/src","api/routes","api/db","shared/schemas"],"confidencePercent":32,"reason":"moduleOntology が無く、todolist 専用の実装モジュールは snapshot 上で未確認。template の現状からは frontend 画面、API ルート、SQLite schema、共有 schema が候補だが、初期計画段階では実装先を断定しない。"},"constraintGoalIds":[],"planModeOpenQuestions":["todolist の基本 UI は単一ページの追加フォーム中心にするか、一覧・詳細・フィルタを分けるか","タスクのデータモデルに必要な属性は何か: title, memo, priority, dueDate, labels, order, completedAt などの採否","永続化は既存 SQLite をそのまま使うか、共有 schema と API を前提にするか","完了状態は単純な boolean か、完了日時や取り消し履歴まで持つか","編集・削除・並び替え・一括完了/一括削除のどこまでを初期範囲に含めるか","検証は unit / e2e / smoke のどれを初期ゴールにするか"],"evidence":[{"source":"mission_goal","label":"goalText","value":"考えられる最も使いやすいtodolistを作る"},{"source":"project_evaluation","label":"overallScore","value":"72"},{"source":"project_evaluation","label":"summary","value":"Hono + React + SQLite を同一 origin でまとめたテンプレートとしては、認証、保護ルート、共有 schema、検証ゲートまで揃っている一方、BBS ルートや thread 系 UI が見えるため、todolist 本体はまだ載っていないと読める"},{"source":"quality","label":"e2e","value":"passed 2/2"},{"source":"llm_usage","label":"repositorySnapshot","value":"Minimal Hono + React template with optional login and showcase screens. README and llmContextFiles describe auth/showcase/BBS, not todolist."}],"evaluationContribution":78,"importancePercent":100,"confidencePercent":94,"tokenSize":"medium","complexity":"moderate","taskPrompt":"todolist Goal を実装する前提で、まず初期実装計画を作成してください。現時点の repo は Hono + React + SQLite の template で、auth / showcase / BBS は見える一方、todolist 本体は未実装に見えます。したがって、まずは実装ではなく Plan Mode で以下を確定する方針で進めてください。\n\n- どの画面を最初の利用入口にするか\n- タスクのデータモデルに何を含めるか\n- SQLite / API / shared schema をどう分けるか\n- 完了状態をどう表現するか\n- 編集・削除・並び替え・一括操作を初期範囲に含めるか\n- どの検証で最小完成とするか\n\n未確認の細部を勝手に固定しないでください。ユーザーが選べる仕様要素は Questionaire / Plan Mode の論点として残し、最終的に実装へ進めるための具体的な設計案、期待成果、検証方針までまとめてください。既存の auth/showcase/BBS 実装と衝突しない導線を前提に、todolist をこの template 上で自然に載せる初期計画を作ってください。","acceptanceCriteria":"todolist 本体の実装計画が、UI / データモデル / 永続化 / 完了状態 / 編集削除 / 検証の論点に分解されており、未確定要素は Plan Mode の質問として保持されていること。既存の auth/showcase/BBS を前提に、Goal 達成へ直接つながる初期方針が明示されていること。","verificationPlan":"Plan Mode の出力に、実装入口、データ保存方式、完了状態、編集削除、検証方針がすべて含まれているかを確認する。併せて、todolist 以外の周辺改善や template 一般論に逸れていないかを確認する。"}]}',NULL,1783178789,1783178837);
INSERT INTO "mission_task_candidate_batches" ("id", "created_at", "updated_at", "repository_id", "status", "requested_goal_ids_json", "signal_snapshot_json", "selected_model_json", "raw_output_json", "error_message", "started_at", "completed_at") VALUES('39a21902-6385-4ff2-afd5-a89583aef2c1',1783214215,1783214260,'984c8844-643e-4596-93a5-703a8d14a1e0','completed','["de3305e2-2269-4765-a117-5dd36de101e2"]','{"repository":{"id":"984c8844-643e-4596-93a5-703a8d14a1e0","name":"todolist","localPath":"/Users/y.noguchi/Code/todolist","branch":"main"},"activeGoals":[{"id":"de3305e2-2269-4765-a117-5dd36de101e2","title":"todo listを作る","goalText":"考えられる最も使いやすいtodolistを作る","interpretation":{"scope":"unknown","intent":"unknown","source":"unknown","confidencePercent":0,"reason":null}}],"latestEvaluation":{"id":"a9ff9b87-ada3-43cb-bc45-88b80d8b8644","overallScore":72,"dimensions":[{"key":"conceptValue","score":78,"label":"コンセプト価値"},{"key":"architectureQuality","score":80,"label":"アーキテクチャ"},{"key":"extensibility","score":74,"label":"拡張性"},{"key":"uiUx","score":69,"label":"UI / UX"},{"key":"operability","score":76,"label":"運用性"},{"key":"security","score":71,"label":"セキュリティ"},{"key":"maintainability","score":79,"label":"保守性"},{"key":"marketCompetitiveness","score":66,"label":"市場競争力"}],"summary":"Hono + React + SQLite を同一 origin でまとめたテンプレートとしては、認証、保護ルート、共有 schema、検証ゲートまで揃っており、実運用の土台として成立している。BBS ルートや thread 系 UI も repo tree に見えるため、単なる starter を越えて複数ドメインを載せる余地がある一方、評価根拠は repo structure と README/LLM_CONTEXT に限られるため、実装の細部と実行時品質は過大評価しない。"},"latestQuality":{"coverage":null,"e2e":{"status":"passed","total":2,"passed":2,"failed":0,"skipped":0,"durationMs":1170,"suites":[{"title":"smoke.spec.ts","status":"passed","tests":2,"durationMs":1170,"lastFailure":null}]}},"repositorySnapshot":{"packageName":"hono-standard","description":"Minimal Hono + React template with optional login and showcase screens.","readmeExcerpt":"# Hono Standard\n\n[![Bun](https://img.shields.io/badge/Bun-%23000000.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=bun&logoColor=white)](https://bun.sh/)\n[![Hono](https://img.shields.io/badge/Hono-%23E36022.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=hono&logoColor=white)](https://hono.dev/)\n[![React](https://img.shields.io/badge/React-%2320232a.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=react&logoColor=%2361DAFB)](https://react.dev/)\n[![SQLite](https://img.shields.io/badge/SQLite-003B57.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=sqlite&logoColor=white)](https://www.sqlite.org/)\n[![TypeScript](https://img.shields.io/badge/TypeScript-%23007ACC.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=typescript&logoColor=white)](https://www.typescriptlang.org/)\n[![MIT License](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-green.svg?style=for-the-badge)](LICENSE.md)\n\nHono backend と React + Vite frontend を同一 origin で動かす、local SQLite 対応の Web app template です。Drizzle のユーザー認証、httpOnly Cookie による access / refresh token、React Router ベースの画面、コンポーネント showcase を含みます。\n\n## 構成\n\n| Path | Role |\n| --- | --- |\n| `api/app/hono.ts` | Hono app composition。middleware、API route、静的配信、`AppType` を登録 |\n| `api/app/server.ts` | Bun server bootstrap |\n| `api/app/env.ts` | runtime env parser |\n| `api/config/appDefaults.ts` | 非シークレットの既定値 |\n| `api/db/index.ts` | DB runtime の public entry。variant はここから差し替える |\n| `api/db/sqlite.ts` | SQLite baseline の Drizzle runtime |\n| `api/db/schema.ts` | Drizzle SQLite schema |\n| `api/db/migrate.ts` | migration runner の public entry |\n| `api/db/migrate-sqlite.ts` | SQLite baseline の migration runner |\n| `api/routes/auth.route.ts` | `/api/auth/*` route |\n| `api/routes/health.route.ts` | `/api/health` route |\n| `api/routes/protected.route.ts` | `/api/protected/*` の server-side protected sample |\n| `api/modules/auth/` | password hash、JWT、cookie、auth service |\n| `api/middleware/auth.ts` | protected API middleware |\n| `web/src/` | React frontend |\n| `shared/schemas/` | frontend/backend で共有する Zod schema と API object type |\n| `drizzle/` | SQL migrations |\n| `scripts/verify.ts` | typecheck / lint / format / test / coverage / build の検証 pipeline |\n\n## 前提\n\n| Tool | 用途 |\n| --- | --- |\n| Bun | package manager、runtime、scripts |\n| SQLite | auth user / refresh token storage |\n\n## セットアップ\n\n```bash\nbun run bootstrap\nbun run auth:create-admin -- --email admin@example.com --name \"Admin User\"\nbun run dev\n```\n\n`bootstrap` は `.env` を用意し、dependency が未導入なら `bun install --frozen-lockfile` を実行し、SQLite database に migration を適用します。\n\n`auth:create-admin` は対話で password を読みます。自動化する場合は次のように標準入力から渡せます。\n\n```bash\nprintf ''%s\\n'' ''<password>'' | bun run auth:create-admin -- --email admin@example.com --name \"Admin User\" --password-stdin\n```\n\n開発サーバーは `http://localhost:5173` で起動します。Vite dev server が frontend を配信し、`/api/*` は Hono に渡されます。\n\n初回 clone 後に template の動作確認まで済ませる場合は、次を実行します。\n\n```bash\nbun run verify\nbun run verify:e2e\n```\n\n認証を使う app では `auth:create-admin` または `seed:dev` で admin を作成してから `/login` を確認します。認証を使わない app では、この README 後半の auth removal checklist に沿って auth route、DB table、login/protected screen、E2E scope をまとめて削ります。\n\n## 生成物と管理対象\n\nこの template では、source と docs は追跡し、local runtime や検証の生成物は追跡しません。\n\n| Path / Pattern | 扱い |\n| --- | --- |\n| `drizzle/*.sql` | Drizzle migration source。commit 対象 |\n| `.env.example` | local development の雛形。commit 対象 |\n| `.env*` | local secret / runtime env。`.env.example` 以外は commit しない |\n| `data/`, `*.db`, `*.sqlite`, `*.sqlite3` | local SQLite database。commit しない |\n| `coverage/`, `playwright-report/`, `test-results/` | verification output。commit しない |\n| `dist/`, `dist-web/`, `build/`, `*.tgz` | build / archive output。commit しない |\n\n## 環境変数\n\n非シークレットの既定値は `api/config/appDefaults.ts` にあります。`.env.example` は local development 向けの値です。\n\n| Variable | Required | Description | Default |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `NODE_ENV` | no | `development` / `test` / `production` | `development` |\n| `HOST` | no | HTTP bind host。container では `0.0.0.0` を指定 | `127.0.0.1` |\n| `PORT` | no | HTTP server port | `5173` |\n| `DATABASE_URL` | no | SQLite database ","sourceFiles":["LLM_CONTEXT.md","README.md","api/app/env.test.ts","api/app/env.ts","api/app/hono.test.ts","api/app/hono.ts","api/app/security-headers.ts","api/app/server.ts","api/cli/auth-create-admin.ts","api/cli/cli-contract.test.ts","api/cli/migrate.ts","api/config/appDefaults.ts","api/db/index.ts","api/db/migrate-sqlite.ts","api/db/migrate.ts","api/db/path.test.ts","api/db/path.ts","api/db/schema.ts","api/db/sqlite.ts","api/middleware/auth.test.ts","api/middleware/auth.ts","api/modules/auth/auth-cookies.test.ts","api/modules/auth/auth-cookies.ts","api/modules/auth/auth.service.test.ts","api/modules/auth/auth.service.ts","api/modules/auth/context.test.ts","api/modules/auth/context.ts","api/modules/auth/errors.test.ts","api/modules/auth/errors.ts","api/modules/auth/password.test.ts","api/modules/auth/password.ts","api/modules/auth/token.service.test.ts","api/modules/auth/token.service.ts","api/modules/auth/types.test.ts","api/modules/auth/types.ts","api/routes/auth.route.test.ts","api/routes/auth.route.ts","api/routes/bbs.route.test.ts","api/routes/bbs.route.ts","api/routes/health.route.test.ts","api/routes/health.route.ts","api/routes/protected.route.test.ts","api/routes/protected.route.ts","api/types/hono-context.d.ts","biome.json","docs/template-variant-management.md","drizzle.config.ts","drizzle/0001_auth.sql","drizzle/0002_bbs.sql","package.json","playwright.config.ts","scripts/bootstrap.test.ts","scripts/bootstrap.ts","scripts/e2e-server.ts","scripts/seed-dev.ts","scripts/verify.ts","shared/schemas/auth.schema.ts","shared/schemas/protected.schema.test.ts","shared/schemas/protected.schema.ts","tests/e2e/smoke.spec.ts","tsconfig.build.json","tsconfig.json","vite.config.ts","vitest.config.ts","web/src/App.tsx","web/src/api.test.ts","web/src/api.ts","web/src/auth-context.tsx","web/src/components/dev-error-panel.tsx","web/src/domains/auth/login-domain.tsx","web/src/main.tsx","web/src/router.tsx","web/src/routes/home-route.tsx","web/src/routes/login-route.tsx","web/src/routes/login-search.ts","web/src/routes/protected-route.tsx","web/src/routes/root-route.tsx","web/src/routes/route-access.test.ts","web/src/routes/route-access.ts","web/src/routes/showcase-route.tsx","web/src/routes/thread-detail-route.tsx","web/src/routes/thread-new-route.tsx","web/src/routes/threads-route.tsx","web/src/showcase-settings-context.tsx","web/src/showcase-table-search.ts","web/src/styles.css","web/src/views/home-view.tsx","web/src/views/login-view.tsx","web/src/views/protected-view.tsx","web/src/views/showcase-view.tsx","web/src/views/thread-detail-view.tsx","web/src/views/thread-new-view.tsx","web/src/views/threads-view.tsx"],"routeFiles":["api/routes/auth.route.test.ts","api/routes/auth.route.ts","api/routes/bbs.route.test.ts","api/routes/bbs.route.ts","api/routes/health.route.test.ts","api/routes/health.route.ts","api/routes/protected.route.test.ts","api/routes/protected.route.ts","web/src/routes/home-route.tsx","web/src/routes/login-route.tsx","web/src/routes/login-search.ts","web/src/routes/protected-route.tsx","web/src/routes/root-route.tsx","web/src/routes/route-access.test.ts","web/src/routes/route-access.ts","web/src/routes/showcase-route.tsx","web/src/routes/thread-detail-route.tsx","web/src/routes/thread-new-route.tsx","web/src/routes/threads-route.tsx","web/src/views/home-view.tsx","web/src/views/login-view.tsx","web/src/views/protected-view.tsx","web/src/views/showcase-view.tsx","web/src/views/thread-detail-view.tsx","web/src/views/thread-new-view.tsx","web/src/views/threads-view.tsx"],"migrationFiles":["drizzle/0001_auth.sql","drizzle/0002_bbs.sql"],"sourceExcerpts":[{"path":"README.md","excerpt":"# Hono Standard\n[![Bun](https://img.shields.io/badge/Bun-%23000000.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=bun&logoColor=white)](https://bun.sh/)\n[![Hono](https://img.shields.io/badge/Hono-%23E36022.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=hono&logoColor=white)](https://hono.dev/)\n[![React](https://img.shields.io/badge/React-%2320232a.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=react&logoColor=%2361DAFB)](https://react.dev/)\n[![SQLite](https://img.shields.io/badge/SQLite-003B57.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=sqlite&logoColor=white)](https://www.sqlite.org/)\n[![TypeScript](https://img.shields.io/badge/TypeScript-%23007ACC.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=typescript&logoColor=white)](https://www.typescriptlang.org/)\n[![MIT License](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-green.svg?style=for-the-badge)](LICENSE.md)\nHono backend と React + Vite frontend を同一 origin で動かす、local SQLite 対応の Web app template です。Drizzle のユーザー認証、httpOnly Cookie による access / refresh token、React Router ベースの画面、コンポーネント showcase を含みます。\n## 構成\n| Path | Role |\n| --- | --- |\n| `api/app/hono.ts` | Hono app composition。middleware、API route、静的配信、`AppType` を登録 |\n| `api/app/server.ts` | Bun server bootstrap |\n| `api/app/env.ts` | runtime env parser |\n| `api/config/appDefaults.ts` | 非シークレットの既定値 |\n| `api/db/index.ts` | DB runtime の public entry。variant はここから差し替える |\n| `api/db/sqlite.ts` | SQLite baseline の Drizzle runtime |\n| `api/db/schema.ts` | Drizzle SQLite schema |\n| `api/db/migrate.ts` | migration runner の public entry |\n| `api/db/migrate-sqlite.ts` | SQLite baseline の migration runner |\n| `api/routes/auth.route.ts` | `/api/auth/*` route |\n| `api/routes/health.route.ts` | `/api/health` route |\n| `api/routes/protected.route.ts` | `/api/protected/*` の server-side protected sample |\n| `api/modules/auth/` | password hash、JWT、cookie、auth service |\n| `api/mi"},{"path":"api/app/env.test.ts","excerpt":"import { describe, expect, it } from \"vitest\";\nimport { APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS } from \"../config/appDefaults\";\nimport { readAppEnv } from \"./env\";\ndescribe(\"readAppEnv\", () => {\n\tit(\"uses minimal app defaults\", () => {\n\t\tconst env = readAppEnv({});\n\t\texpect(env.nodeEnv).toBe(\"development\");\n\t\texpect(env.host).toBe(APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS.host);\n\t\texpect(env.port).toBe(APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS.port);\n\t\texpect(env.databaseUrl).toBe(APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS.databaseUrl);\n\t\texpect(env.appUrl).toBe(APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS.appUrl);\n\t\texpect(env.corsOrigins).toEqual(APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS.corsOrigins);\n\t\texpect(env.cookieSameSite).toBe(APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS.cookieSameSite);\n\t});\n\tit(\"accepts database and auth runtime overrides\", () => {\n\t\tconst env = readAppEnv({\n\t\t\tHOST: \"0.0.0.0\",\n\t\t\tPORT: \"5174\",\n\t\t\tDATABASE_URL: \"tmp/test.sqlite\",\n\t\t\tJWT_SECRET: \"x\".repeat(32),\n\t\t\tAPP_URL: \"https://showcase.example.com\",\n\t\t\tCORS_ORIGINS: \"https://showcase.example.com,http://localhost:5173\",\n\t\t\tAUTH_COOKIE_SECURE: \"true\",\n\t\t\tAUTH_COOKIE_SAME_SITE: \"none\",\n\t\t\tSECURITY_HEADERS_MODE: \"https\",\n\t\t});\n\t\texpect(env.host).toBe(\"0.0.0.0\");\n\t\texpect(env.port).toBe(5174);\n\t\texpect(env.databaseUrl).toBe(\"tmp/test.sqlite\");\n\t\texpect(env.jwtSecret).toBe(\"x\".repeat(32));\n\t\texpect(env.appUrl).toBe(\"https://showcase.example.com\");\n\t\texpect(env.corsOrigins).toEqual([\n\t\t\t\"https://showcase.example.com\",\n\t\t\t\"http://localhost:5173\",\n\t\t]);\n\t\texpect(env.secureCookie).toBe(true);\n\t\texpect(env.cookieSameSite).toBe(\"none\");\n\t\texpect(env.securityHeadersMode).toBe(\"https\");\n\t});\n\tit(\"falls back to the SQLite default when a dev shell provides a connection URL\", () => {\n\t\tconst env = readAppEnv({\n\t\t\tDATABASE_URL: \"postgres://postgres:postgres@127.0.0.1:5432/app\",\n\t\t});\n\t\texpect(env.databaseUrl).toBe(APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS.databaseUrl);\n\t});\n\tit(\"rej"},{"path":"api/app/env.ts","excerpt":"import { z } from \"zod\";\nimport { APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS } from \"../config/appDefaults\";\nimport { isDatabaseConnectionUrl } from \"../db/path\";\nconst optionalTrimmedString = z.preprocess((value) => {\n\tif (typeof value !== \"string\") return value;\n\tconst trimmed = value.trim();\n\treturn trimmed.length > 0 ? trimmed : undefined;\n}, z.string().trim().optional());\nconst optionalUrl = z.preprocess((value) => {\n\tif (typeof value !== \"string\") return value;\n\tconst trimmed = value.trim();\n\treturn trimmed.length > 0 ? trimmed : undefined;\n}, z.string().url().optional());\nconst optionalBoolean = z.preprocess((value) => {\n\tif (typeof value === \"boolean\") return value;\n\tif (typeof value !== \"string\") return value;\n\tconst normalized = value.trim().toLowerCase();\n\tif (!normalized) return undefined;\n\tif ([\"1\", \"true\", \"yes\", \"on\"].includes(normalized)) return true;\n\tif ([\"0\", \"false\", \"no\", \"off\"].includes(normalized)) return false;\n\treturn value;\n}, z.boolean().optional());\nconst optionalPort = z.preprocess((value) => {\n\tif (typeof value === \"number\") return value;\n\tif (typeof value !== \"string\") return value;\n\tconst trimmed = value.trim();\n\treturn trimmed.length > 0 ? Number(trimmed) : undefined;\n}, z.number().int().min(1).max(65535).optional());\nconst optionalCookieSameSite = z.preprocess((value) => {\n\tif (typeof value !== \"string\") return value;\n\tconst normalized = value.trim().toLowerCase();\n\treturn normalized.length > 0 ? normalized : undefined;\n}, z.enum([\"lax\", \"strict\", \"none\"]).optional());\nconst optionalSecurityHeadersMode = z.preprocess(\n\t(value) => {\n\t\tif (typeof value !== \"string\") return value;\n\t\tconst normalized = value.trim().toLowerCase();\n\t\treturn normalized.length > 0 ? normalized : undefined;\n\t},\n\tz.enum([\"auto\", \"http\", \"https\"]).default(\"auto\"),\n);\nconst EnvSchema = z"},{"path":"api/app/hono.test.ts","excerpt":"import { describe, expect, it, vi, beforeEach } from \"vitest\";\nimport fs from \"node:fs/promises\";\nimport { HttpError } from \"../modules/auth/errors\";\nimport { HTTPException } from \"hono/http-exception\";\n// Mock environment and DB connection before importing app\nvi.mock(\"../db\", () => ({\n\tcreateDbRuntime: vi.fn().mockReturnValue({\n\t\tdb: {\n\t\t\tquery: {\n\t\t\t\tusers: {\n\t\t\t\t\tfindFirst: vi.fn(),\n\t\t\t\t},\n\t\t\t},\n\t\t},\n\t\tclose: vi.fn(),\n\t\tconnection: {\n\t\t\tclient: {\n\t\t\t\tclose: vi.fn(),\n\t\t\t},\n\t\t\townsConnection: false,\n\t\t},\n\t}),\n}));\nvi.mock(\"./env\", () => ({\n\treadAppEnv: vi.fn().mockReturnValue({\n\t\tnodeEnv: \"test\",\n\t\thost: \"127.0.0.1\",\n\t\tport: 5173,\n\t\tdatabaseUrl: \"mock.db\",\n\t\tjwtSecret: \"x\".repeat(32),\n\t\tjwtAccessExpiresIn: \"15m\",\n\t\tjwtRefreshExpiresIn: \"7d\",\n\t\tappUrl: \"http://localhost:5173\",\n\t\tcorsOrigins: [\"http://localhost:5173\"],\n\t\ttrustProxy: true,\n\t\tsecureCookie: false,\n\t\tcookieSameSite: \"lax\",\n\t\tsecurityHeadersMode: \"auto\",\n\t}),\n}));\n// Mock Bun global variable before importing hono/bun dependent code\n(globalThis as any).Bun = {\n\tfile: (path: string) => ({\n\t\texists: () => Promise.resolve(true),\n\t}),\n};\n// Dynamically import app so globalThis.Bun is defined first\nconst { default: app } = await import(\"./hono\");\n// Add test routes before any request is processed (Hono routers lock after first request)\napp.post(\"/api/test-http-error\", () => {\n\tthrow new HttpError(400, \"Bad Parameters\");\n});\napp.post(\"/api/test-hono-http-exception\", () => {\n\tthrow new HTTPException(403, { message: \"Access Forbidden\" });\n});\napp.post(\"/api/test-generic-error\", () => {\n\tthrow new Error(\"Something blew up\");\n});\ndescribe(\"hono app entry\", () => {\n\tbeforeEach(() => {\n\t\tvi.restoreAllMocks();\n\t});\n\tit(\"should return 200 for /api/health\", async () => {\n\t\tconst res = await app.request(\"/api/health\");\n\t\texp"},{"path":"api/app/hono.ts","excerpt":"import fs from \"node:fs/promises\";\nimport path from \"node:path\";\nimport { serveStatic } from \"hono/bun\";\nimport { csrf } from \"hono/csrf\";\nimport { Hono } from \"hono\";\nimport { cors } from \"hono/cors\";\nimport { logger } from \"hono/logger\";\nimport { HTTPException } from \"hono/http-exception\";\nimport { secureHeaders } from \"hono/secure-headers\";\nimport type { DbRuntime } from \"../db\";\nimport { createDbRuntime } from \"../db\";\nimport { requireAuth } from \"../middleware/auth\";\nimport { AuthService } from \"../modules/auth/auth.service\";\nimport { HttpError } from \"../modules/auth/errors\";\nimport { createBbsRoute } from \"../routes/bbs.route\";\nimport { createAuthRoute } from \"../routes/auth.route\";\nimport { createHealthRoute } from \"../routes/health.route\";\nimport { createProtectedRoute } from \"../routes/protected.route\";\nimport { readAppEnv, type AppEnv } from \"./env\";\nimport { appContentSecurityPolicy } from \"./security-headers\";\nexport type AppDeps = {\n\tenv: AppEnv;\n\tdbRuntime: DbRuntime;\n\tauthService: AuthService;\n};\ndeclare global {\n\tvar __honoStandardRuntime__: Promise<AppDeps> | undefined;\n}\nexport async function createDefaultAppDeps(): Promise<AppDeps> {\n\tconst env = readAppEnv();\n\tconst dbRuntime = createDbRuntime(env);\n\tconst authService = new AuthService(dbRuntime.db, env);\n\treturn { env, dbRuntime, authService };\n}\nexport async function getAppRuntime(): Promise<AppDeps> {\n\tif (!globalThis.__honoStandardRuntime__) {\n\t\tglobalThis.__honoStandardRuntime__ = createDefaultAppDeps().catch(\n\t\t\t(error) => {\n\t\t\t\tglobalThis.__honoStandardRuntime__ = undefined;\n\t\t\t\tthrow error;\n\t\t\t},\n\t\t);\n\t}\n\treturn globalThis.__honoStandardRuntime__;\n}\nconst distWebRoot = path.resolve(process.cwd(), \"dist-web\");\nconst distWebIndex = path.resolve(distWebRoot, \"index.html\");\nexport function creat"},{"path":"api/app/security-headers.ts","excerpt":"type CspDirectives = Record<string, string[]>;\nexport const appContentSecurityPolicy: CspDirectives = {\n\tdefaultSrc: [\"''self''\"],\n\tbaseUri: [\"''self''\"],\n\tconnectSrc: [\"''self''\"],\n\tfontSrc: [\"''self''\", \"data:\"],\n\tformAction: [\"''self''\"],\n\tframeAncestors: [\"''self''\"],\n\timgSrc: [\"''self''\", \"data:\", \"blob:\"],\n\tmanifestSrc: [\"''self''\"],\n\tobjectSrc: [\"''none''\"],\n\tscriptSrc: [\"''self''\"],\n\tstyleSrc: [\"''self''\", \"''unsafe-inline''\"],\n\tworkerSrc: [\"''self''\", \"blob:\"],\n};\nexport const viteDevContentSecurityPolicy: CspDirectives = {\n\t...appContentSecurityPolicy,\n\tconnectSrc: [\n\t\t\"''self''\",\n\t\t\"ws:\",\n\t\t\"http://localhost:5173\",\n\t\t\"http://127.0.0.1:5173\",\n\t],\n\tscriptSrc: [\"''self''\", \"''unsafe-inline''\", \"''unsafe-eval''\"],\n};\nconst toKebabCase = (value: string): string =>\n\tvalue.replace(/[A-Z]+(?![a-z])|[A-Z]/g, (match, offset) =>\n\t\toffset ? `-${match.toLowerCase()}` : match.toLowerCase(),\n\t);\nexport function serializeContentSecurityPolicy(policy: CspDirectives): string {\n\treturn Object.entries(policy)\n\t\t.map(\n\t\t\t([directive, values]) => `${toKebabCase(directive)} ${values.join(\" \")}`,\n\t\t)\n\t\t.join(\"; \");\n}"},{"path":"api/app/server.ts","excerpt":"import app, { getAppRuntime } from \"./hono\";\nimport { readAppEnv } from \"./env\";\nconst env = readAppEnv();\nconst server = Bun.serve({\n\tfetch: app.fetch,\n\thostname: env.host,\n\tport: env.port,\n});\nconsole.log(\n\t`Hono Standard server listening on http://${env.host}:${server.port}`,\n);\nconst shutdown = async (signal: string) => {\n\tconsole.log(`\\nReceived ${signal}. Shutting down gracefully...`);\n\tserver.stop(true);\n\ttry {\n\t\tconst runtime = await getAppRuntime();\n\t\tconsole.log(\"Closing database connection...\");\n\t\truntime.dbRuntime.close();\n\t\tconsole.log(\"Shutdown complete.\");\n\t\tprocess.exit(0);\n\t} catch (error) {\n\t\tconsole.error(\"Error during shutdown:\", error);\n\t\tprocess.exit(1);\n\t}\n};\nprocess.on(\"SIGINT\", () => shutdown(\"SIGINT\"));\nprocess.on(\"SIGTERM\", () => shutdown(\"SIGTERM\"));"},{"path":"api/routes/auth.route.test.ts","excerpt":"import { Hono } from \"hono\";\nimport { describe, expect, it, vi, beforeEach } from \"vitest\";\nimport { createAuthRoute } from \"./auth.route\";\nimport { requireAuth } from \"../middleware/auth\";\nimport type { AppEnv } from \"../app/env\";\nimport type { AuthService } from \"../modules/auth/auth.service\";\nimport { HttpError } from \"../modules/auth/errors\";\nimport {\n\tACCESS_TOKEN_COOKIE_NAME,\n\tREFRESH_TOKEN_COOKIE_NAME,\n} from \"../modules/auth/auth-cookies\";\ndescribe(\"auth route\", () => {\n\tlet app: Hono;\n\tlet mockAuthService: any;\n\tlet mockEnv: AppEnv;\n\tconst testUser = {\n\t\tid: \"a1a1a1a1-a1a1-41a1-a1a1-a1a1a1a1a1a1\",\n\t\temail: \"test@example.com\",\n\t\tdisplayName: \"Test User\",\n\t\trole: \"member\" as const,\n\t\tisActive: true,\n\t};\n\tbeforeEach(() => {\n\t\tmockEnv = {\n\t\t\tjwtSecret: \"x\".repeat(32),\n\t\t\tjwtAccessExpiresIn: \"15m\",\n\t\t\tjwtRefreshExpiresIn: \"7d\",\n\t\t\tsecureCookie: true,\n\t\t\tcookieSameSite: \"lax\",\n\t\t} as unknown as AppEnv;\n\t\tmockAuthService = {\n\t\t\tlogin: vi.fn(),\n\t\t\trefresh: vi.fn(),\n\t\t\tlogout: vi.fn(),\n\t\t\tfindUserById: vi.fn(),\n\t\t};\n\t\tapp = new Hono();\n\t\t// Set error handler to prevent throwing unhandled exceptions in tests\n\t\tapp.onError((err, c) => {\n\t\t\tconst status = (err as HttpError).status || 500;\n\t\t\treturn c.json({ message: err.message }, status as any);\n\t\t});\n\t\tapp.use(\n\t\t\t\"/auth/me\",\n\t\t\trequireAuth({\n\t\t\t\tenv: mockEnv,\n\t\t\t\tauthService: mockAuthService as unknown as AuthService,\n\t\t\t}),\n\t\t);\n\t\tapp.route(\n\t\t\t\"/auth\",\n\t\t\tcreateAuthRoute({\n\t\t\t\tauthService: mockAuthService as unknown as AuthService,\n\t\t\t\tenv: mockEnv,\n\t\t\t}),\n\t\t);\n\t});\n\tdescribe(\"POST /login\", () => {\n\t\tit(\"should login user with valid credentials and set cookies\", async () => {\n\t\t\tmockAuthService.login.mockResolvedValue({\n\t\t\t\taccessToken: \"access-token-123\",\n\t\t\t\trefreshToken: \"refresh-token-456\",\n\t\t\t\tuser: {\n\t\t\t\t\tid: te"},{"path":"api/routes/auth.route.ts","excerpt":"import { zValidator } from \"@hono/zod-validator\";\nimport { Hono } from \"hono\";\nimport { getCookie } from \"hono/cookie\";\nimport { loginSchema } from \"../../shared/schemas/auth.schema\";\nimport type { AppEnv } from \"../app/env\";\nimport type { AuthService } from \"../modules/auth/auth.service\";\nimport {\n\tREFRESH_TOKEN_COOKIE_NAME,\n\tclearAuthCookies,\n\tsetAuthCookies,\n} from \"../modules/auth/auth-cookies\";\nimport { getAuthContextUser } from \"../modules/auth/context\";\nimport { HttpError } from \"../modules/auth/errors\";\ntype AuthRouteDeps = {\n\tauthService: AuthService;\n\tenv: AppEnv;\n};\nexport function createAuthRoute(deps: AuthRouteDeps) {\n\treturn new Hono()\n\t\t.post(\"/login\", zValidator(\"json\", loginSchema), async (c) => {\n\t\t\tconst body = c.req.valid(\"json\");\n\t\t\tconst result = await deps.authService.login({\n\t\t\t\temail: body.email,\n\t\t\t\tpassword: body.password,\n\t\t\t});\n\t\t\tsetAuthCookies(c, deps.env, result);\n\t\t\treturn c.json({ user: result.user });\n\t\t})\n\t\t.post(\"/refresh\", async (c) => {\n\t\t\tconst refreshToken = getCookie(c, REFRESH_TOKEN_COOKIE_NAME);\n\t\t\tif (!refreshToken) {\n\t\t\t\tthrow new HttpError(401, \"Unauthorized\");\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\tconst result = await deps.authService.refresh(refreshToken);\n\t\t\tsetAuthCookies(c, deps.env, result);\n\t\t\treturn c.json({ user: result.user });\n\t\t})\n\t\t.post(\"/logout\", async (c) => {\n\t\t\tconst refreshToken = getCookie(c, REFRESH_TOKEN_COOKIE_NAME);\n\t\t\tawait deps.authService.logout(refreshToken);\n\t\t\tclearAuthCookies(c);\n\t\t\treturn c.json({ ok: true });\n\t\t})\n\t\t.get(\"/me\", async (c) => {\n\t\t\tconst authUser = getAuthContextUser(c);\n\t\t\tconst user = await deps.authService.findUserById(authUser.userId);\n\t\t\tif (!user?.isActive) {\n\t\t\t\tthrow new HttpError(401, \"Unauthorized\");\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\treturn c.json({\n\t\t\t\tuser: {\n\t\t\t\t\tid: user.id,\n\t\t\t\t\temail: user.email,\n\t\t\t\t\tdisplayName: us"},{"path":"api/routes/bbs.route.test.ts","excerpt":"import { Hono } from \"hono\";\nimport { HttpError } from \"../modules/auth/errors\";\nimport { afterEach, describe, expect, it, vi } from \"vitest\";\nimport { createBbsRoute } from \"./bbs.route\";\nimport { posts, threads } from \"../db/schema\";\ntype ThreadRow = {\n\tid: number;\n\ttitle: string;\n\tcreatedAt: Date;\n\tupdatedAt: Date;\n\tlastPostAt: Date;\n\treplyCount: number;\n};\ntype PostRow = {\n\tid: number;\n\tthreadId: number;\n\tparentPostId: number | null;\n\tauthorName: string;\n\tbody: string;\n\tcreatedAt: Date;\n\tupdatedAt: Date;\n};\nfunction createFakeDb(options?: {\n\tfailThreadInsert?: boolean;\n\tfailParentLookup?: boolean;\n}) {\n\tconst state = {\n\t\tthreadId: 0,\n\t\tpostId: 0,\n\t\tthreads: [] as ThreadRow[],\n\t\tposts: [] as PostRow[],\n\t};\n\tconst select = (selection?: Record<string, unknown>) => ({\n\t\tfrom(table: unknown) {\n\t\t\tif (table === threads) {\n\t\t\t\tconst build = (predicate?: unknown) => ({\n\t\t\t\t\tget: async () =>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tstate.threads.find((thread) =>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tmatchThreadPredicate(thread, predicate),\n\t\t\t\t\t\t) ?? null,\n\t\t\t\t\tall: async () =>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t[...state.threads]\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t.sort((a, b) => b.lastPostAt.getTime() - a.lastPostAt.getTime())\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t.map((thread) => ({\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tid: thread.id,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\ttitle: thread.title,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tcreatedAt: thread.createdAt,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tupdatedAt: thread.updatedAt,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tlastPostAt: thread.lastPostAt,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\treplyCount: thread.replyCount,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t})),\n\t\t\t\t});\n\t\t\t\treturn {\n\t\t\t\t\twhere: (predicate?: unknown) => build(predicate),\n\t\t\t\t\torderBy: () => build(),\n\t\t\t\t};\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\tconst build = (predicate?: unknown) => {\n\t\t\t\tconst rows = state.posts.filter((post) =>\n\t\t\t\t\tmatchPostPredicate(post, predicate, options?.failParentLookup),\n\t\t\t\t);\n\t\t\t\tconst query = {\n\t\t\t\t\tget: async () => rows[0] ?? null,\n\t\t\t\t\tall: async () =>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t[...rows].sort((a, b) => a.createdAt.getTime() - b.createdAt.getTi"},{"path":"api/routes/bbs.route.ts","excerpt":"import { zValidator } from \"@hono/zod-validator\";\nimport { and, asc, desc, eq } from \"drizzle-orm\";\nimport { Hono } from \"hono\";\nimport { z } from \"zod\";\nimport type { AppDatabase } from \"../db\";\nimport { posts, threads } from \"../db/schema\";\nimport { HttpError } from \"../modules/auth/errors\";\ntype BbsRouteDeps = {\n\tdb: AppDatabase;\n};\nconst threadCreateSchema = z.object({\n\ttitle: z.string().trim().min(1).max(120),\n\tbody: z.string().trim().min(1).max(4000),\n\tauthorName: z.string().trim().min(1).max(80).optional(),\n});\nconst replyCreateSchema = z.object({\n\tbody: z.string().trim().min(1).max(4000),\n\tauthorName: z.string().trim().min(1).max(80).optional(),\n\tparentPostId: z.number().int().positive().optional(),\n});\nasync function getThreadOrThrow(db: AppDatabase, id: number) {\n\tconst row = await db.select().from(threads).where(eq(threads.id, id)).get();\n\tif (!row) throw new HttpError(404, \"Thread not found\");\n\treturn row;\n}\nexport function createBbsRoute(deps: BbsRouteDeps) {\n\treturn new Hono()\n\t\t.get(\"/threads\", async (c) => {\n\t\t\tconst items = await deps.db\n\t\t\t\t.select({\n\t\t\t\t\tid: threads.id,\n\t\t\t\t\ttitle: threads.title,\n\t\t\t\t\tcreatedAt: threads.createdAt,\n\t\t\t\t\tupdatedAt: threads.updatedAt,\n\t\t\t\t\tlastPostAt: threads.lastPostAt,\n\t\t\t\t\treplyCount: threads.replyCount,\n\t\t\t\t})\n\t\t\t\t.from(threads)\n\t\t\t\t.orderBy(desc(threads.lastPostAt), desc(threads.createdAt))\n\t\t\t\t.all();\n\t\t\treturn c.json({ threads: items });\n\t\t})\n\t\t.get(\"/threads/:id\", async (c) => {\n\t\t\tconst id = Number(c.req.param(\"id\"));\n\t\t\tif (!Number.isInteger(id)) throw new HttpError(400, \"Invalid thread id\");\n\t\t\tconst thread = await getThreadOrThrow(deps.db, id);\n\t\t\tconst items = await deps.db\n\t\t\t\t.select({\n\t\t\t\t\tid: posts.id,\n\t\t\t\t\tthreadId: posts.threadId,\n\t\t\t\t\tparentPostId: posts.parentPostId,\n\t\t\t\t\tauthorName: posts.authorName"},{"path":"api/routes/health.route.test.ts","excerpt":"import { Hono } from \"hono\";\nimport { describe, expect, it } from \"vitest\";\nimport { createHealthRoute } from \"./health.route\";\ndescribe(\"health route\", () => {\n\tit(\"should return ok status\", async () => {\n\t\tconst app = new Hono().route(\"/health\", createHealthRoute());\n\t\tconst res = await app.request(\"/health\");\n\t\texpect(res.status).toBe(200);\n\t\tconst body = await res.json();\n\t\texpect(body).toEqual({\n\t\t\tstatus: \"ok\",\n\t\t\tservice: \"hono-standard\",\n\t\t});\n\t});\n});"},{"path":"api/routes/health.route.ts","excerpt":"import { Hono } from \"hono\";\nexport function createHealthRoute() {\n\treturn new Hono().get(\"/\", (c) => {\n\t\treturn c.json({ status: \"ok\", service: \"hono-standard\" });\n\t});\n}"},{"path":"api/routes/protected.route.test.ts","excerpt":"import { Hono } from \"hono\";\nimport { describe, expect, it } from \"vitest\";\nimport { createProtectedRoute } from \"./protected.route\";\ndescribe(\"protected route\", () => {\n\tit(\"returns the authenticated profile from context\", async () => {\n\t\tconst app = new Hono();\n\t\tapp.use(\"/protected/*\", async (c, next) => {\n\t\t\tc.set(\"authUser\", {\n\t\t\t\tuserId: \"a1a1a1a1-a1a1-41a1-a1a1-a1a1a1a1a1a1\",\n\t\t\t\temail: \"test@example.com\",\n\t\t\t\trole: \"member\",\n\t\t\t});\n\t\t\tawait next();\n\t\t});\n\t\tapp.route(\"/protected\", createProtectedRoute());\n\t\tconst res = await app.request(\"/protected/profile\");\n\t\tconst body = await res.json();\n\t\texpect(res.status).toBe(200);\n\t\texpect(body.profile).toEqual({\n\t\t\temail: \"test@example.com\",\n\t\t\trole: \"member\",\n\t\t});\n\t});\n});"},{"path":"api/routes/protected.route.ts","excerpt":"import { Hono } from \"hono\";\nimport type { ProtectedProfileResponse } from \"../../shared/schemas/protected.schema\";\nimport { getAuthContextUser } from \"../modules/auth/context\";\nexport function createProtectedRoute() {\n\treturn new Hono().get(\"/profile\", (c) => {\n\t\tconst authUser = getAuthContextUser(c);\n\t\tconst response = {\n\t\t\tprofile: {\n\t\t\t\temail: authUser.email,\n\t\t\t\trole: authUser.role,\n\t\t\t},\n\t\t} satisfies ProtectedProfileResponse;\n\t\treturn c.json(response);\n\t});\n}"},{"path":"web/src/App.tsx","excerpt":"import { QueryClient, QueryClientProvider } from \"@tanstack/react-query\";\nimport { RouterProvider } from \"@tanstack/react-router\";\nimport { router } from \"./router\";\nimport { ShowcaseSettingsProvider } from \"./showcase-settings-context\";\nconst queryClient = new QueryClient({\n\tdefaultOptions: {\n\t\tqueries: {\n\t\t\tretry: false,\n\t\t},\n\t},\n});\nexport function App() {\n\treturn (\n\t\t<QueryClientProvider client={queryClient}>\n\t\t\t<ShowcaseSettingsProvider>\n\t\t\t\t<RouterProvider router={router} />\n\t\t\t</ShowcaseSettingsProvider>\n\t\t</QueryClientProvider>\n\t);\n}"}],"llmContextFiles":[{"path":"LLM_CONTEXT.md","excerpt":"# LLM Context: Hono Standard\n\nこの文書は、`hono-standard` を clone した直後に作業入口を決めるための圧縮コンテキストです。現行 branch は local SQLite auth/showcase template です。RAG、pgvector、agentic search、wiki ingestion は含みません。\n\n## Repository Snapshot\n\n- Bun + Hono backend と React + Vite frontend を同一 origin で動かす template。\n- DB は local SQLite。Drizzle schema は `api/db/schema.ts`、migration は `drizzle/`。\n- Backend app composition は `api/app/hono.ts`、server bootstrap は `api/app/server.ts`。\n- DB runtime の public entry は `api/db/index.ts`。SQLite baseline は `api/db/sqlite.ts`、migration runner は `api/db/migrate.ts` から `api/db/migrate-sqlite.ts` を呼ぶ。\n- Frontend entry は `web/src/App.tsx`、router は `web/src/router.tsx`、API client は `web/src/api.ts`。\n- Auth 実装は `api/modules/auth/`、route は `api/routes/auth.route.ts`、login UI は `web/src/domains/auth/login-domain.tsx`。\n- Shared API schema/object は `shared/schemas/`。Backend は `zValidator`、frontend は `hono/client` + `AppType` で同じ契約を参照する。\n- Home と Showcase は未ログインでも表示する。ログイン状態がある場合だけ header に user chip と logout button を表示する。\n- Protected sample は `/protected` と `/api/protected/profile`。frontend guard と server-side `requireAuth` の両方を示す。\n- Package manager / runtime は Bun。dev server は `bunx --bun vite` で起動する。\n- Quality gates は `bun run verify` と `bun run verify:e2e`。CI も同じ入口を使う。\n- `main` は SQLite baseline。Turso / PostgreSQL / pgvector は `variant/*` branch で driver、schema、migration、docs、smoke setup を差し替える。\n\n## Top-Level Map\n\n| Path | Role |\n| --- | --- |\n| `api/app/hono.ts` | Hono middleware、API route、static fallback、`AppType` export |\n| `api/app/server.ts` | Bun server bootstrap |\n| `api/app/env.ts` | environment parsing and defaults |\n| `api/config/appDefaults.ts` | non-secret app defaults |\n| `api/db/index.ts` | DB runtime public entry and variant boundary |\n| `api/db/sqlite.ts` | SQLite baseline Drizzle runtime |\n| `api/db/migrate.ts` | migration runner public entry |\n| `api/db/migrate-sqlite.ts` | SQLite baseline migration runner |\n| `api/db/schema.ts` | SQLite baseline Drizzle schema |\n| `api/routes/auth.route.ts` | `/api/auth/*` route module |\n| `api/routes/health.route.ts` | health route |\n| `api/routes/protected.route.ts` | server-side protected API sample |\n| `api/modules/auth/` | Auth service、JWT、cookies、password hashing |\n| `api/middleware/auth.ts` | access-token auth middleware |\n| `shared/schemas/` | Zod schema and public API object types shared by api and web |\n| `web/src/App.tsx` | React Query and Router providers |\n| `web/src/router.tsx` | TanStack Router tree |\n| `web/src/api.ts` | browser API client and auth refresh handling |\n| `web/src/auth-context.tsx` | frontend auth state |\n| `web/src/routes/` | route definitions |\n| `web/src/views/` | Home/Login/Showcase views |\n| `web/src/showcase-*` | showcase state and URL search helpers |\n| `drizzle/` | SQL migrations |\n| `scripts/verify.ts` | verification pipeline |\n| `scripts/e2e-server.ts` | Playwright smoke server with isolated SQLite DB |\n| `tests/e2e/` | Playwright smoke tests |\n| `.github/workflows/verify.yml` | CI verification |\n| `Dockerfile`, `docker-compose.yml` | Optional SQLite baseline container runtime |\n\n## Task Routing\n\n| Task | Start here | Usually also read | Defer unless touched |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Change auth API | `api/routes/auth.route.ts`, `api/modules/auth/`, `api/middleware/auth.ts`, `shared/schemas/auth.schema.ts` | `web/src/api.ts`, `web/src/auth-context.tsx` | showcase UI |\n| Change protected sample | `api/routes/protected.route.ts`, `web/src/views/protected-view.tsx`, `web/src/routes/protected-route.tsx` | `api/middleware/auth.ts`, `shared/schemas/protected.schema.ts`, `web/src/api.ts` | showcase UI |\n| Change login UI | `web/src/views/login-view.tsx`, `web/src/domains/auth/login-domain.tsx` | `web/src/auth-context.tsx`, `web/src/api.ts` | DB schema |\n| Change app shell/routing | `web/src/routes/root-route.tsx`, `web/src/router.tsx` | `web/src/App.tsx`, affected view | auth service internals |\n| Change showcase UI | `web/src/views/showcase-view.tsx`, `web/src/showcase-settings-context.tsx`, `web/src/showcase-table-search.ts` | `web/src/styles.css` | backend auth |\n| Change env/config | `api/app/env.ts`, `api/config/appDefaults.ts`, `.env.example` | `drizzle.config.ts`, Docker/Compose if bind host or port changes | frontend views |\n| Change DB runtime/variant boundary | `api/db/index.ts`, `api/db/sqlite.ts`, `api/db/migrate.ts`, `api/db/migrate-sqlite.ts` | `api/cli/migrate.ts`, `api/cli/auth-create-admin.ts`, `docs/template-variant-management.md` | showcase UI |\n| Change DB schema/migration | `api/db/schema.ts`, `drizzle/`, `api/db/migrate*.ts` | `api/modules/auth/auth.service.ts`, `api/modules/auth/token.service.ts` | showcase UI |\n| Change build/dev tooling | `package.json`, `vite.config.ts`, `vitest.config.ts`, `playwright.config.ts`, `scripts/verify.ts` | `.github/workflows/verify.yml`, failing config-specific output | feature code |\n| Change docs | `README.md`, `LLM_CONTEXT.md`, `docs/` | `.gitignore` when generated output changes | feature code |\n\n## Styling / CSS Architecture\n\nUI 変更では、この節を styling 判断の入口にする。まず全 CSS を広く探索せず、以下の entrypoint と pattern source で説明できるか確認する。\n\n- Global style entrypoint: `web/src/styles.css`。Tailwind v4 の `@import \"tailwindcss\"`、`@theme` token、`@layer base`、`@layer components` をこの1ファイルに集約している。\n- CSS load path: `web/src/main.tsx` が `./styles.css` を import する。Tailwind plugin は `vite.config.ts` の `@tailwindcss/vite`。\n- Design tokens / theme values: `web/src/styles.css` の `@theme` が global token の source of truth。`--color-*` と `--radius-*` を Tailwind utility / `@apply` から使う。\n- Showcase theme values: `web/src/showcase-settings-context.tsx` が `--showcase-*` custom properties を生成し、`web/src/styles.css` の `.showcase-shell` と `:root[data-showcase-page-theme]` rules がそれを消費する。\n- Shared UI components and common patterns: `web/src/styles.css` の `.topbar`, `.menu-*`, `.auth-*`, `.home-*`, `.center-shell`, `.signed-in-panel`, `.showcase-*`, `.demo-*`, `.table-*` class families。\n- Page a"}],"recentCommitDiffs":[],"packageScripts":[{"name":"auth:create-admin","command":"bun run api/cli/auth-create-admin.ts"},{"name":"bootstrap","command":"bun scripts/bootstrap.ts"},{"name":"build","command":"bun run build:web"},{"name":"build:web","command":"vite build"},{"name":"db:generate","command":"drizzle-kit generate"},{"name":"db:migrate","command":"bun run api/cli/migrate.ts"},{"name":"db:migrate:drizzle","command":"drizzle-kit migrate"},{"name":"dev","command":"bunx --bun vite"},{"name":"dev:vite","command":"vite"},{"name":"format","command":"biome format --write api web shared scripts tests drizzle.config.ts playwright.config.ts vite.config.ts vitest.config.ts"},{"name":"format:check","command":"biome format api web shared scripts tests drizzle.config.ts playwright.config.ts vite.config.ts vitest.config.ts"},{"name":"lint","command":"biome lint api web shared scripts tests drizzle.config.ts playwright.config.ts vite.config.ts vitest.config.ts"},{"name":"seed:dev","command":"bun scripts/seed-dev.ts"},{"name":"start","command":"bun run api/app/server.ts"},{"name":"test","command":"vitest run"},{"name":"test:coverage","command":"vitest run --coverage"},{"name":"test:e2e","command":"playwright test"},{"name":"test:watch","command":"vitest"},{"name":"typecheck","command":"tsc --noEmit"},{"name":"verify","command":"bun scripts/verify.ts"},{"name":"verify:all","command":"bun run verify && bun run verify:e2e"},{"name":"verify:e2e","command":"bun run test:e2e"},{"name":"verify:strict","command":"bun run verify"}],"moduleOntology":null},"qualityCapabilities":{"projectType":"typescript","commands":[{"kind":"unit","source":"package_json","command":"bun run ''test''","runnable":true},{"kind":"coverage","source":"package_json","command":"bun run ''test:coverage''","runnable":true},{"kind":"e2e","source":"package_json","command":"bun run ''test:e2e''","runnable":true},{"kind":"verify","source":"package_json","command":"bun run ''verify''","runnable":true}],"missingCapabilities":[]},"recentTokenSpendTasks":[{"taskId":"3c40e22b-fbe5-48a1-ba92-64f990e589fd","title":"BBSを作りたいです。計画してください。","totalTokens":8468677,"callCount":8}],"recentRuns":{"completed":1,"failed":0,"running":0}}','{"role":"mission_task_generation","providerId":"codex","providerEndpointId":"ep_2a9c67769830da1e","routeSource":"primary","modelOrDeployment":"gpt-5.4-mini","thinkingDepth":null}','{"schemaVersion":"nightworkers.mission-task-candidates/v1","candidates":[{"title":"todo list 機能の初期実装計画を作成する","summary":"todolist を本体として立ち上げるため、UI・データモデル・保存方式・完了状態・編集削除・検証方針を Plan Mode で確定する入口を作る。","rationale":"repositorySnapshot は `Hono Standard` テンプレートで、現状の中心実装は認証・showcase・BBS に見える。`todo list` 本体は llmContextFiles / sourceFiles 上で確認できないため、まずは機能の初期実装計画を作る候補が Mission Goal への最短経路になる。","goalId":"de3305e2-2269-4765-a117-5dd36de101e2","candidateKind":"feature_entrypoint","moduleRouting":{"primaryModule":null,"secondaryModules":["web/src","api/routes","api/db","shared/schemas"],"confidencePercent":18,"reason":"moduleOntology が未提供で、todolist 本体の配置がまだ不明。現時点では UI・API・永続化の境界を Plan Mode で決める入口として扱うのが妥当。"},"constraintGoalIds":[],"planModeOpenQuestions":["todo を管理する UI は単一画面のリスト型にするか、詳細ペインやサブビューを持たせるか","タスクのデータモデルに含める項目を何にするか（例: title, note, due date, priority, tags など）","永続化方式をどうするか（SQLite 直結、既存 DB への追加、ローカル永続のみ など）","完了状態を単純な boolean にするか、アーカイブや進捗段階を持たせるか","編集・削除・並び替え・フィルタのどこまでを初期範囲に入れるか","検証方針を unit / integration / e2e のどこまで求めるか"],"evidence":[{"source":"mission_goal","label":"goal","value":"考えられる最も使いやすいtodolistを作る"},{"source":"project_evaluation","label":"overallScore","value":"72"},{"source":"project_evaluation","label":"uiUx","value":"69"},{"source":"project_evaluation","label":"marketCompetitiveness","value":"66"},{"source":"quality","label":"e2e","value":"passed 2/2"},{"source":"llm_usage","label":"repositorySnapshot","value":"Minimal Hono + React template with optional login and showcase screens."},{"source":"llm_usage","label":"llmContextFiles","value":"現行 branch は local SQLite auth/showcase template。todolist 本体は記載されていない。"}],"evaluationContribution":34,"importancePercent":99,"confidencePercent":92,"tokenSize":"medium","complexity":"moderate","taskPrompt":"todolist の本体実装に入る前提で、初期実装計画を作成してください。現状のリポジトリは Hono + React + SQLite のテンプレートで、認証・showcase・BBS の既存実装が見えますが、todolist 本体はまだ確認できません。まずは Plan Mode で、どの画面を入口にするか、タスクのデータモデルに何を含めるか、どの保存方式を採るか、完了状態をどう表現するか、編集・削除・並び替え・フィルタを初期範囲に含めるか、検証を unit / integration / e2e のどこまで求めるかを整理してください。ユーザーが選べる仕様要素は固定せず、候補として比較できる形で残してください。期待成果は、todolist 機能の実装方針が明確になり、そのまま次の実装タスクに分解できることです。検証方針は、既存の `bun run verify` と `bun run verify:e2e` の土台を崩さず、必要なら追加テスト方針を定義することです。","acceptanceCriteria":"todolist 本体の実装方針が Plan Mode で定義され、UI・データモデル・保存方式・完了状態・編集削除・検証方針の未確定要素が洗い出されていること。既存のテンプレート実装に対して、何を残し何を新規作成するかの境界が明確であること。","verificationPlan":"Plan で確定した仕様を基に、実装候補を UI / API / schema / persistence / tests に分解できる状態まで持っていく。次段では、確定した画面遷移とデータモデルに沿って最小の実装を入れ、既存の `bun run verify` と `bun run verify:e2e` が通るかで確認する。"}]}',NULL,1783214215,1783214260);
INSERT INTO "mission_task_candidate_batches" ("id", "created_at", "updated_at", "repository_id", "status", "requested_goal_ids_json", "signal_snapshot_json", "selected_model_json", "raw_output_json", "error_message", "started_at", "completed_at") VALUES('0af658c1-3059-432f-a933-148e0f0c255c',1783214601,1783214617,'984c8844-643e-4596-93a5-703a8d14a1e0','failed','["de3305e2-2269-4765-a117-5dd36de101e2"]','{"repository":{"id":"984c8844-643e-4596-93a5-703a8d14a1e0","name":"todolist","localPath":"/Users/y.noguchi/Code/todolist","branch":"main"},"activeGoals":[{"id":"de3305e2-2269-4765-a117-5dd36de101e2","title":"todo listを作る","goalText":"考えられる最も使いやすいtodolistを作る","interpretation":{"scope":"unknown","intent":"unknown","source":"unknown","confidencePercent":0,"reason":null}}],"latestEvaluation":{"id":"a9ff9b87-ada3-43cb-bc45-88b80d8b8644","overallScore":72,"dimensions":[{"key":"conceptValue","score":78,"label":"コンセプト価値"},{"key":"architectureQuality","score":80,"label":"アーキテクチャ"},{"key":"extensibility","score":74,"label":"拡張性"},{"key":"uiUx","score":69,"label":"UI / UX"},{"key":"operability","score":76,"label":"運用性"},{"key":"security","score":71,"label":"セキュリティ"},{"key":"maintainability","score":79,"label":"保守性"},{"key":"marketCompetitiveness","score":66,"label":"市場競争力"}],"summary":"Hono + React + SQLite を同一 origin でまとめたテンプレートとしては、認証、保護ルート、共有 schema、検証ゲートまで揃っており、実運用の土台として成立している。BBS ルートや thread 系 UI も repo tree に見えるため、単なる starter を越えて複数ドメインを載せる余地がある一方、評価根拠は repo structure と README/LLM_CONTEXT に限られるため、実装の細部と実行時品質は過大評価しない。"},"latestQuality":{"coverage":null,"e2e":{"status":"passed","total":2,"passed":2,"failed":0,"skipped":0,"durationMs":1170,"suites":[{"title":"smoke.spec.ts","status":"passed","tests":2,"durationMs":1170,"lastFailure":null}]}},"repositorySnapshot":{"packageName":"hono-standard","description":"Minimal Hono + React template with optional login and showcase screens.","readmeExcerpt":"# Hono Standard\n\n[![Bun](https://img.shields.io/badge/Bun-%23000000.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=bun&logoColor=white)](https://bun.sh/)\n[![Hono](https://img.shields.io/badge/Hono-%23E36022.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=hono&logoColor=white)](https://hono.dev/)\n[![React](https://img.shields.io/badge/React-%2320232a.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=react&logoColor=%2361DAFB)](https://react.dev/)\n[![SQLite](https://img.shields.io/badge/SQLite-003B57.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=sqlite&logoColor=white)](https://www.sqlite.org/)\n[![TypeScript](https://img.shields.io/badge/TypeScript-%23007ACC.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=typescript&logoColor=white)](https://www.typescriptlang.org/)\n[![MIT License](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-green.svg?style=for-the-badge)](LICENSE.md)\n\nHono backend と React + Vite frontend を同一 origin で動かす、local SQLite 対応の Web app template です。Drizzle のユーザー認証、httpOnly Cookie による access / refresh token、React Router ベースの画面、コンポーネント showcase を含みます。\n\n## 構成\n\n| Path | Role |\n| --- | --- |\n| `api/app/hono.ts` | Hono app composition。middleware、API route、静的配信、`AppType` を登録 |\n| `api/app/server.ts` | Bun server bootstrap |\n| `api/app/env.ts` | runtime env parser |\n| `api/config/appDefaults.ts` | 非シークレットの既定値 |\n| `api/db/index.ts` | DB runtime の public entry。variant はここから差し替える |\n| `api/db/sqlite.ts` | SQLite baseline の Drizzle runtime |\n| `api/db/schema.ts` | Drizzle SQLite schema |\n| `api/db/migrate.ts` | migration runner の public entry |\n| `api/db/migrate-sqlite.ts` | SQLite baseline の migration runner |\n| `api/routes/auth.route.ts` | `/api/auth/*` route |\n| `api/routes/health.route.ts` | `/api/health` route |\n| `api/routes/protected.route.ts` | `/api/protected/*` の server-side protected sample |\n| `api/modules/auth/` | password hash、JWT、cookie、auth service |\n| `api/middleware/auth.ts` | protected API middleware |\n| `web/src/` | React frontend |\n| `shared/schemas/` | frontend/backend で共有する Zod schema と API object type |\n| `drizzle/` | SQL migrations |\n| `scripts/verify.ts` | typecheck / lint / format / test / coverage / build の検証 pipeline |\n\n## 前提\n\n| Tool | 用途 |\n| --- | --- |\n| Bun | package manager、runtime、scripts |\n| SQLite | auth user / refresh token storage |\n\n## セットアップ\n\n```bash\nbun run bootstrap\nbun run auth:create-admin -- --email admin@example.com --name \"Admin User\"\nbun run dev\n```\n\n`bootstrap` は `.env` を用意し、dependency が未導入なら `bun install --frozen-lockfile` を実行し、SQLite database に migration を適用します。\n\n`auth:create-admin` は対話で password を読みます。自動化する場合は次のように標準入力から渡せます。\n\n```bash\nprintf ''%s\\n'' ''<password>'' | bun run auth:create-admin -- --email admin@example.com --name \"Admin User\" --password-stdin\n```\n\n開発サーバーは `http://localhost:5173` で起動します。Vite dev server が frontend を配信し、`/api/*` は Hono に渡されます。\n\n初回 clone 後に template の動作確認まで済ませる場合は、次を実行します。\n\n```bash\nbun run verify\nbun run verify:e2e\n```\n\n認証を使う app では `auth:create-admin` または `seed:dev` で admin を作成してから `/login` を確認します。認証を使わない app では、この README 後半の auth removal checklist に沿って auth route、DB table、login/protected screen、E2E scope をまとめて削ります。\n\n## 生成物と管理対象\n\nこの template では、source と docs は追跡し、local runtime や検証の生成物は追跡しません。\n\n| Path / Pattern | 扱い |\n| --- | --- |\n| `drizzle/*.sql` | Drizzle migration source。commit 対象 |\n| `.env.example` | local development の雛形。commit 対象 |\n| `.env*` | local secret / runtime env。`.env.example` 以外は commit しない |\n| `data/`, `*.db`, `*.sqlite`, `*.sqlite3` | local SQLite database。commit しない |\n| `coverage/`, `playwright-report/`, `test-results/` | verification output。commit しない |\n| `dist/`, `dist-web/`, `build/`, `*.tgz` | build / archive output。commit しない |\n\n## 環境変数\n\n非シークレットの既定値は `api/config/appDefaults.ts` にあります。`.env.example` は local development 向けの値です。\n\n| Variable | Required | Description | Default |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `NODE_ENV` | no | `development` / `test` / `production` | `development` |\n| `HOST` | no | HTTP bind host。container では `0.0.0.0` を指定 | `127.0.0.1` |\n| `PORT` | no | HTTP server port | `5173` |\n| `DATABASE_URL` | no | SQLite database ","sourceFiles":["LLM_CONTEXT.md","README.md","api/app/env.test.ts","api/app/env.ts","api/app/hono.test.ts","api/app/hono.ts","api/app/security-headers.ts","api/app/server.ts","api/cli/auth-create-admin.ts","api/cli/cli-contract.test.ts","api/cli/migrate.ts","api/config/appDefaults.ts","api/db/index.ts","api/db/migrate-sqlite.ts","api/db/migrate.ts","api/db/path.test.ts","api/db/path.ts","api/db/schema.ts","api/db/sqlite.ts","api/middleware/auth.test.ts","api/middleware/auth.ts","api/modules/auth/auth-cookies.test.ts","api/modules/auth/auth-cookies.ts","api/modules/auth/auth.service.test.ts","api/modules/auth/auth.service.ts","api/modules/auth/context.test.ts","api/modules/auth/context.ts","api/modules/auth/errors.test.ts","api/modules/auth/errors.ts","api/modules/auth/password.test.ts","api/modules/auth/password.ts","api/modules/auth/token.service.test.ts","api/modules/auth/token.service.ts","api/modules/auth/types.test.ts","api/modules/auth/types.ts","api/routes/auth.route.test.ts","api/routes/auth.route.ts","api/routes/bbs.route.test.ts","api/routes/bbs.route.ts","api/routes/health.route.test.ts","api/routes/health.route.ts","api/routes/protected.route.test.ts","api/routes/protected.route.ts","api/types/hono-context.d.ts","biome.json","docs/template-variant-management.md","drizzle.config.ts","drizzle/0001_auth.sql","drizzle/0002_bbs.sql","package.json","playwright.config.ts","scripts/bootstrap.test.ts","scripts/bootstrap.ts","scripts/e2e-server.ts","scripts/seed-dev.ts","scripts/verify.ts","shared/schemas/auth.schema.ts","shared/schemas/protected.schema.test.ts","shared/schemas/protected.schema.ts","tests/e2e/smoke.spec.ts","tsconfig.build.json","tsconfig.json","vite.config.ts","vitest.config.ts","web/src/App.tsx","web/src/api.test.ts","web/src/api.ts","web/src/auth-context.tsx","web/src/components/dev-error-panel.tsx","web/src/domains/auth/login-domain.tsx","web/src/main.tsx","web/src/router.tsx","web/src/routes/home-route.tsx","web/src/routes/login-route.tsx","web/src/routes/login-search.ts","web/src/routes/protected-route.tsx","web/src/routes/root-route.tsx","web/src/routes/route-access.test.ts","web/src/routes/route-access.ts","web/src/routes/showcase-route.tsx","web/src/routes/thread-detail-route.tsx","web/src/routes/thread-new-route.tsx","web/src/routes/threads-route.tsx","web/src/showcase-settings-context.tsx","web/src/showcase-table-search.ts","web/src/styles.css","web/src/views/home-view.tsx","web/src/views/login-view.tsx","web/src/views/protected-view.tsx","web/src/views/showcase-view.tsx","web/src/views/thread-detail-view.tsx","web/src/views/thread-new-view.tsx","web/src/views/threads-view.tsx"],"routeFiles":["api/routes/auth.route.test.ts","api/routes/auth.route.ts","api/routes/bbs.route.test.ts","api/routes/bbs.route.ts","api/routes/health.route.test.ts","api/routes/health.route.ts","api/routes/protected.route.test.ts","api/routes/protected.route.ts","web/src/routes/home-route.tsx","web/src/routes/login-route.tsx","web/src/routes/login-search.ts","web/src/routes/protected-route.tsx","web/src/routes/root-route.tsx","web/src/routes/route-access.test.ts","web/src/routes/route-access.ts","web/src/routes/showcase-route.tsx","web/src/routes/thread-detail-route.tsx","web/src/routes/thread-new-route.tsx","web/src/routes/threads-route.tsx","web/src/views/home-view.tsx","web/src/views/login-view.tsx","web/src/views/protected-view.tsx","web/src/views/showcase-view.tsx","web/src/views/thread-detail-view.tsx","web/src/views/thread-new-view.tsx","web/src/views/threads-view.tsx"],"migrationFiles":["drizzle/0001_auth.sql","drizzle/0002_bbs.sql"],"sourceExcerpts":[{"path":"README.md","excerpt":"# Hono Standard\n[![Bun](https://img.shields.io/badge/Bun-%23000000.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=bun&logoColor=white)](https://bun.sh/)\n[![Hono](https://img.shields.io/badge/Hono-%23E36022.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=hono&logoColor=white)](https://hono.dev/)\n[![React](https://img.shields.io/badge/React-%2320232a.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=react&logoColor=%2361DAFB)](https://react.dev/)\n[![SQLite](https://img.shields.io/badge/SQLite-003B57.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=sqlite&logoColor=white)](https://www.sqlite.org/)\n[![TypeScript](https://img.shields.io/badge/TypeScript-%23007ACC.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=typescript&logoColor=white)](https://www.typescriptlang.org/)\n[![MIT License](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-green.svg?style=for-the-badge)](LICENSE.md)\nHono backend と React + Vite frontend を同一 origin で動かす、local SQLite 対応の Web app template です。Drizzle のユーザー認証、httpOnly Cookie による access / refresh token、React Router ベースの画面、コンポーネント showcase を含みます。\n## 構成\n| Path | Role |\n| --- | --- |\n| `api/app/hono.ts` | Hono app composition。middleware、API route、静的配信、`AppType` を登録 |\n| `api/app/server.ts` | Bun server bootstrap |\n| `api/app/env.ts` | runtime env parser |\n| `api/config/appDefaults.ts` | 非シークレットの既定値 |\n| `api/db/index.ts` | DB runtime の public entry。variant はここから差し替える |\n| `api/db/sqlite.ts` | SQLite baseline の Drizzle runtime |\n| `api/db/schema.ts` | Drizzle SQLite schema |\n| `api/db/migrate.ts` | migration runner の public entry |\n| `api/db/migrate-sqlite.ts` | SQLite baseline の migration runner |\n| `api/routes/auth.route.ts` | `/api/auth/*` route |\n| `api/routes/health.route.ts` | `/api/health` route |\n| `api/routes/protected.route.ts` | `/api/protected/*` の server-side protected sample |\n| `api/modules/auth/` | password hash、JWT、cookie、auth service |\n| `api/mi"},{"path":"api/app/env.test.ts","excerpt":"import { describe, expect, it } from \"vitest\";\nimport { APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS } from \"../config/appDefaults\";\nimport { readAppEnv } from \"./env\";\ndescribe(\"readAppEnv\", () => {\n\tit(\"uses minimal app defaults\", () => {\n\t\tconst env = readAppEnv({});\n\t\texpect(env.nodeEnv).toBe(\"development\");\n\t\texpect(env.host).toBe(APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS.host);\n\t\texpect(env.port).toBe(APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS.port);\n\t\texpect(env.databaseUrl).toBe(APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS.databaseUrl);\n\t\texpect(env.appUrl).toBe(APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS.appUrl);\n\t\texpect(env.corsOrigins).toEqual(APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS.corsOrigins);\n\t\texpect(env.cookieSameSite).toBe(APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS.cookieSameSite);\n\t});\n\tit(\"accepts database and auth runtime overrides\", () => {\n\t\tconst env = readAppEnv({\n\t\t\tHOST: \"0.0.0.0\",\n\t\t\tPORT: \"5174\",\n\t\t\tDATABASE_URL: \"tmp/test.sqlite\",\n\t\t\tJWT_SECRET: \"x\".repeat(32),\n\t\t\tAPP_URL: \"https://showcase.example.com\",\n\t\t\tCORS_ORIGINS: \"https://showcase.example.com,http://localhost:5173\",\n\t\t\tAUTH_COOKIE_SECURE: \"true\",\n\t\t\tAUTH_COOKIE_SAME_SITE: \"none\",\n\t\t\tSECURITY_HEADERS_MODE: \"https\",\n\t\t});\n\t\texpect(env.host).toBe(\"0.0.0.0\");\n\t\texpect(env.port).toBe(5174);\n\t\texpect(env.databaseUrl).toBe(\"tmp/test.sqlite\");\n\t\texpect(env.jwtSecret).toBe(\"x\".repeat(32));\n\t\texpect(env.appUrl).toBe(\"https://showcase.example.com\");\n\t\texpect(env.corsOrigins).toEqual([\n\t\t\t\"https://showcase.example.com\",\n\t\t\t\"http://localhost:5173\",\n\t\t]);\n\t\texpect(env.secureCookie).toBe(true);\n\t\texpect(env.cookieSameSite).toBe(\"none\");\n\t\texpect(env.securityHeadersMode).toBe(\"https\");\n\t});\n\tit(\"falls back to the SQLite default when a dev shell provides a connection URL\", () => {\n\t\tconst env = readAppEnv({\n\t\t\tDATABASE_URL: \"postgres://postgres:postgres@127.0.0.1:5432/app\",\n\t\t});\n\t\texpect(env.databaseUrl).toBe(APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS.databaseUrl);\n\t});\n\tit(\"rej"},{"path":"api/app/env.ts","excerpt":"import { z } from \"zod\";\nimport { APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS } from \"../config/appDefaults\";\nimport { isDatabaseConnectionUrl } from \"../db/path\";\nconst optionalTrimmedString = z.preprocess((value) => {\n\tif (typeof value !== \"string\") return value;\n\tconst trimmed = value.trim();\n\treturn trimmed.length > 0 ? trimmed : undefined;\n}, z.string().trim().optional());\nconst optionalUrl = z.preprocess((value) => {\n\tif (typeof value !== \"string\") return value;\n\tconst trimmed = value.trim();\n\treturn trimmed.length > 0 ? trimmed : undefined;\n}, z.string().url().optional());\nconst optionalBoolean = z.preprocess((value) => {\n\tif (typeof value === \"boolean\") return value;\n\tif (typeof value !== \"string\") return value;\n\tconst normalized = value.trim().toLowerCase();\n\tif (!normalized) return undefined;\n\tif ([\"1\", \"true\", \"yes\", \"on\"].includes(normalized)) return true;\n\tif ([\"0\", \"false\", \"no\", \"off\"].includes(normalized)) return false;\n\treturn value;\n}, z.boolean().optional());\nconst optionalPort = z.preprocess((value) => {\n\tif (typeof value === \"number\") return value;\n\tif (typeof value !== \"string\") return value;\n\tconst trimmed = value.trim();\n\treturn trimmed.length > 0 ? Number(trimmed) : undefined;\n}, z.number().int().min(1).max(65535).optional());\nconst optionalCookieSameSite = z.preprocess((value) => {\n\tif (typeof value !== \"string\") return value;\n\tconst normalized = value.trim().toLowerCase();\n\treturn normalized.length > 0 ? normalized : undefined;\n}, z.enum([\"lax\", \"strict\", \"none\"]).optional());\nconst optionalSecurityHeadersMode = z.preprocess(\n\t(value) => {\n\t\tif (typeof value !== \"string\") return value;\n\t\tconst normalized = value.trim().toLowerCase();\n\t\treturn normalized.length > 0 ? normalized : undefined;\n\t},\n\tz.enum([\"auto\", \"http\", \"https\"]).default(\"auto\"),\n);\nconst EnvSchema = z"},{"path":"api/app/hono.test.ts","excerpt":"import { describe, expect, it, vi, beforeEach } from \"vitest\";\nimport fs from \"node:fs/promises\";\nimport { HttpError } from \"../modules/auth/errors\";\nimport { HTTPException } from \"hono/http-exception\";\n// Mock environment and DB connection before importing app\nvi.mock(\"../db\", () => ({\n\tcreateDbRuntime: vi.fn().mockReturnValue({\n\t\tdb: {\n\t\t\tquery: {\n\t\t\t\tusers: {\n\t\t\t\t\tfindFirst: vi.fn(),\n\t\t\t\t},\n\t\t\t},\n\t\t},\n\t\tclose: vi.fn(),\n\t\tconnection: {\n\t\t\tclient: {\n\t\t\t\tclose: vi.fn(),\n\t\t\t},\n\t\t\townsConnection: false,\n\t\t},\n\t}),\n}));\nvi.mock(\"./env\", () => ({\n\treadAppEnv: vi.fn().mockReturnValue({\n\t\tnodeEnv: \"test\",\n\t\thost: \"127.0.0.1\",\n\t\tport: 5173,\n\t\tdatabaseUrl: \"mock.db\",\n\t\tjwtSecret: \"x\".repeat(32),\n\t\tjwtAccessExpiresIn: \"15m\",\n\t\tjwtRefreshExpiresIn: \"7d\",\n\t\tappUrl: \"http://localhost:5173\",\n\t\tcorsOrigins: [\"http://localhost:5173\"],\n\t\ttrustProxy: true,\n\t\tsecureCookie: false,\n\t\tcookieSameSite: \"lax\",\n\t\tsecurityHeadersMode: \"auto\",\n\t}),\n}));\n// Mock Bun global variable before importing hono/bun dependent code\n(globalThis as any).Bun = {\n\tfile: (path: string) => ({\n\t\texists: () => Promise.resolve(true),\n\t}),\n};\n// Dynamically import app so globalThis.Bun is defined first\nconst { default: app } = await import(\"./hono\");\n// Add test routes before any request is processed (Hono routers lock after first request)\napp.post(\"/api/test-http-error\", () => {\n\tthrow new HttpError(400, \"Bad Parameters\");\n});\napp.post(\"/api/test-hono-http-exception\", () => {\n\tthrow new HTTPException(403, { message: \"Access Forbidden\" });\n});\napp.post(\"/api/test-generic-error\", () => {\n\tthrow new Error(\"Something blew up\");\n});\ndescribe(\"hono app entry\", () => {\n\tbeforeEach(() => {\n\t\tvi.restoreAllMocks();\n\t});\n\tit(\"should return 200 for /api/health\", async () => {\n\t\tconst res = await app.request(\"/api/health\");\n\t\texp"},{"path":"api/app/hono.ts","excerpt":"import fs from \"node:fs/promises\";\nimport path from \"node:path\";\nimport { serveStatic } from \"hono/bun\";\nimport { csrf } from \"hono/csrf\";\nimport { Hono } from \"hono\";\nimport { cors } from \"hono/cors\";\nimport { logger } from \"hono/logger\";\nimport { HTTPException } from \"hono/http-exception\";\nimport { secureHeaders } from \"hono/secure-headers\";\nimport type { DbRuntime } from \"../db\";\nimport { createDbRuntime } from \"../db\";\nimport { requireAuth } from \"../middleware/auth\";\nimport { AuthService } from \"../modules/auth/auth.service\";\nimport { HttpError } from \"../modules/auth/errors\";\nimport { createBbsRoute } from \"../routes/bbs.route\";\nimport { createAuthRoute } from \"../routes/auth.route\";\nimport { createHealthRoute } from \"../routes/health.route\";\nimport { createProtectedRoute } from \"../routes/protected.route\";\nimport { readAppEnv, type AppEnv } from \"./env\";\nimport { appContentSecurityPolicy } from \"./security-headers\";\nexport type AppDeps = {\n\tenv: AppEnv;\n\tdbRuntime: DbRuntime;\n\tauthService: AuthService;\n};\ndeclare global {\n\tvar __honoStandardRuntime__: Promise<AppDeps> | undefined;\n}\nexport async function createDefaultAppDeps(): Promise<AppDeps> {\n\tconst env = readAppEnv();\n\tconst dbRuntime = createDbRuntime(env);\n\tconst authService = new AuthService(dbRuntime.db, env);\n\treturn { env, dbRuntime, authService };\n}\nexport async function getAppRuntime(): Promise<AppDeps> {\n\tif (!globalThis.__honoStandardRuntime__) {\n\t\tglobalThis.__honoStandardRuntime__ = createDefaultAppDeps().catch(\n\t\t\t(error) => {\n\t\t\t\tglobalThis.__honoStandardRuntime__ = undefined;\n\t\t\t\tthrow error;\n\t\t\t},\n\t\t);\n\t}\n\treturn globalThis.__honoStandardRuntime__;\n}\nconst distWebRoot = path.resolve(process.cwd(), \"dist-web\");\nconst distWebIndex = path.resolve(distWebRoot, \"index.html\");\nexport function creat"},{"path":"api/app/security-headers.ts","excerpt":"type CspDirectives = Record<string, string[]>;\nexport const appContentSecurityPolicy: CspDirectives = {\n\tdefaultSrc: [\"''self''\"],\n\tbaseUri: [\"''self''\"],\n\tconnectSrc: [\"''self''\"],\n\tfontSrc: [\"''self''\", \"data:\"],\n\tformAction: [\"''self''\"],\n\tframeAncestors: [\"''self''\"],\n\timgSrc: [\"''self''\", \"data:\", \"blob:\"],\n\tmanifestSrc: [\"''self''\"],\n\tobjectSrc: [\"''none''\"],\n\tscriptSrc: [\"''self''\"],\n\tstyleSrc: [\"''self''\", \"''unsafe-inline''\"],\n\tworkerSrc: [\"''self''\", \"blob:\"],\n};\nexport const viteDevContentSecurityPolicy: CspDirectives = {\n\t...appContentSecurityPolicy,\n\tconnectSrc: [\n\t\t\"''self''\",\n\t\t\"ws:\",\n\t\t\"http://localhost:5173\",\n\t\t\"http://127.0.0.1:5173\",\n\t],\n\tscriptSrc: [\"''self''\", \"''unsafe-inline''\", \"''unsafe-eval''\"],\n};\nconst toKebabCase = (value: string): string =>\n\tvalue.replace(/[A-Z]+(?![a-z])|[A-Z]/g, (match, offset) =>\n\t\toffset ? `-${match.toLowerCase()}` : match.toLowerCase(),\n\t);\nexport function serializeContentSecurityPolicy(policy: CspDirectives): string {\n\treturn Object.entries(policy)\n\t\t.map(\n\t\t\t([directive, values]) => `${toKebabCase(directive)} ${values.join(\" \")}`,\n\t\t)\n\t\t.join(\"; \");\n}"},{"path":"api/app/server.ts","excerpt":"import app, { getAppRuntime } from \"./hono\";\nimport { readAppEnv } from \"./env\";\nconst env = readAppEnv();\nconst server = Bun.serve({\n\tfetch: app.fetch,\n\thostname: env.host,\n\tport: env.port,\n});\nconsole.log(\n\t`Hono Standard server listening on http://${env.host}:${server.port}`,\n);\nconst shutdown = async (signal: string) => {\n\tconsole.log(`\\nReceived ${signal}. Shutting down gracefully...`);\n\tserver.stop(true);\n\ttry {\n\t\tconst runtime = await getAppRuntime();\n\t\tconsole.log(\"Closing database connection...\");\n\t\truntime.dbRuntime.close();\n\t\tconsole.log(\"Shutdown complete.\");\n\t\tprocess.exit(0);\n\t} catch (error) {\n\t\tconsole.error(\"Error during shutdown:\", error);\n\t\tprocess.exit(1);\n\t}\n};\nprocess.on(\"SIGINT\", () => shutdown(\"SIGINT\"));\nprocess.on(\"SIGTERM\", () => shutdown(\"SIGTERM\"));"},{"path":"api/routes/auth.route.test.ts","excerpt":"import { Hono } from \"hono\";\nimport { describe, expect, it, vi, beforeEach } from \"vitest\";\nimport { createAuthRoute } from \"./auth.route\";\nimport { requireAuth } from \"../middleware/auth\";\nimport type { AppEnv } from \"../app/env\";\nimport type { AuthService } from \"../modules/auth/auth.service\";\nimport { HttpError } from \"../modules/auth/errors\";\nimport {\n\tACCESS_TOKEN_COOKIE_NAME,\n\tREFRESH_TOKEN_COOKIE_NAME,\n} from \"../modules/auth/auth-cookies\";\ndescribe(\"auth route\", () => {\n\tlet app: Hono;\n\tlet mockAuthService: any;\n\tlet mockEnv: AppEnv;\n\tconst testUser = {\n\t\tid: \"a1a1a1a1-a1a1-41a1-a1a1-a1a1a1a1a1a1\",\n\t\temail: \"test@example.com\",\n\t\tdisplayName: \"Test User\",\n\t\trole: \"member\" as const,\n\t\tisActive: true,\n\t};\n\tbeforeEach(() => {\n\t\tmockEnv = {\n\t\t\tjwtSecret: \"x\".repeat(32),\n\t\t\tjwtAccessExpiresIn: \"15m\",\n\t\t\tjwtRefreshExpiresIn: \"7d\",\n\t\t\tsecureCookie: true,\n\t\t\tcookieSameSite: \"lax\",\n\t\t} as unknown as AppEnv;\n\t\tmockAuthService = {\n\t\t\tlogin: vi.fn(),\n\t\t\trefresh: vi.fn(),\n\t\t\tlogout: vi.fn(),\n\t\t\tfindUserById: vi.fn(),\n\t\t};\n\t\tapp = new Hono();\n\t\t// Set error handler to prevent throwing unhandled exceptions in tests\n\t\tapp.onError((err, c) => {\n\t\t\tconst status = (err as HttpError).status || 500;\n\t\t\treturn c.json({ message: err.message }, status as any);\n\t\t});\n\t\tapp.use(\n\t\t\t\"/auth/me\",\n\t\t\trequireAuth({\n\t\t\t\tenv: mockEnv,\n\t\t\t\tauthService: mockAuthService as unknown as AuthService,\n\t\t\t}),\n\t\t);\n\t\tapp.route(\n\t\t\t\"/auth\",\n\t\t\tcreateAuthRoute({\n\t\t\t\tauthService: mockAuthService as unknown as AuthService,\n\t\t\t\tenv: mockEnv,\n\t\t\t}),\n\t\t);\n\t});\n\tdescribe(\"POST /login\", () => {\n\t\tit(\"should login user with valid credentials and set cookies\", async () => {\n\t\t\tmockAuthService.login.mockResolvedValue({\n\t\t\t\taccessToken: \"access-token-123\",\n\t\t\t\trefreshToken: \"refresh-token-456\",\n\t\t\t\tuser: {\n\t\t\t\t\tid: te"},{"path":"api/routes/auth.route.ts","excerpt":"import { zValidator } from \"@hono/zod-validator\";\nimport { Hono } from \"hono\";\nimport { getCookie } from \"hono/cookie\";\nimport { loginSchema } from \"../../shared/schemas/auth.schema\";\nimport type { AppEnv } from \"../app/env\";\nimport type { AuthService } from \"../modules/auth/auth.service\";\nimport {\n\tREFRESH_TOKEN_COOKIE_NAME,\n\tclearAuthCookies,\n\tsetAuthCookies,\n} from \"../modules/auth/auth-cookies\";\nimport { getAuthContextUser } from \"../modules/auth/context\";\nimport { HttpError } from \"../modules/auth/errors\";\ntype AuthRouteDeps = {\n\tauthService: AuthService;\n\tenv: AppEnv;\n};\nexport function createAuthRoute(deps: AuthRouteDeps) {\n\treturn new Hono()\n\t\t.post(\"/login\", zValidator(\"json\", loginSchema), async (c) => {\n\t\t\tconst body = c.req.valid(\"json\");\n\t\t\tconst result = await deps.authService.login({\n\t\t\t\temail: body.email,\n\t\t\t\tpassword: body.password,\n\t\t\t});\n\t\t\tsetAuthCookies(c, deps.env, result);\n\t\t\treturn c.json({ user: result.user });\n\t\t})\n\t\t.post(\"/refresh\", async (c) => {\n\t\t\tconst refreshToken = getCookie(c, REFRESH_TOKEN_COOKIE_NAME);\n\t\t\tif (!refreshToken) {\n\t\t\t\tthrow new HttpError(401, \"Unauthorized\");\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\tconst result = await deps.authService.refresh(refreshToken);\n\t\t\tsetAuthCookies(c, deps.env, result);\n\t\t\treturn c.json({ user: result.user });\n\t\t})\n\t\t.post(\"/logout\", async (c) => {\n\t\t\tconst refreshToken = getCookie(c, REFRESH_TOKEN_COOKIE_NAME);\n\t\t\tawait deps.authService.logout(refreshToken);\n\t\t\tclearAuthCookies(c);\n\t\t\treturn c.json({ ok: true });\n\t\t})\n\t\t.get(\"/me\", async (c) => {\n\t\t\tconst authUser = getAuthContextUser(c);\n\t\t\tconst user = await deps.authService.findUserById(authUser.userId);\n\t\t\tif (!user?.isActive) {\n\t\t\t\tthrow new HttpError(401, \"Unauthorized\");\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\treturn c.json({\n\t\t\t\tuser: {\n\t\t\t\t\tid: user.id,\n\t\t\t\t\temail: user.email,\n\t\t\t\t\tdisplayName: us"},{"path":"api/routes/bbs.route.test.ts","excerpt":"import { Hono } from \"hono\";\nimport { HttpError } from \"../modules/auth/errors\";\nimport { afterEach, describe, expect, it, vi } from \"vitest\";\nimport { createBbsRoute } from \"./bbs.route\";\nimport { posts, threads } from \"../db/schema\";\ntype ThreadRow = {\n\tid: number;\n\ttitle: string;\n\tcreatedAt: Date;\n\tupdatedAt: Date;\n\tlastPostAt: Date;\n\treplyCount: number;\n};\ntype PostRow = {\n\tid: number;\n\tthreadId: number;\n\tparentPostId: number | null;\n\tauthorName: string;\n\tbody: string;\n\tcreatedAt: Date;\n\tupdatedAt: Date;\n};\nfunction createFakeDb(options?: {\n\tfailThreadInsert?: boolean;\n\tfailParentLookup?: boolean;\n}) {\n\tconst state = {\n\t\tthreadId: 0,\n\t\tpostId: 0,\n\t\tthreads: [] as ThreadRow[],\n\t\tposts: [] as PostRow[],\n\t};\n\tconst select = (selection?: Record<string, unknown>) => ({\n\t\tfrom(table: unknown) {\n\t\t\tif (table === threads) {\n\t\t\t\tconst build = (predicate?: unknown) => ({\n\t\t\t\t\tget: async () =>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tstate.threads.find((thread) =>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tmatchThreadPredicate(thread, predicate),\n\t\t\t\t\t\t) ?? null,\n\t\t\t\t\tall: async () =>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t[...state.threads]\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t.sort((a, b) => b.lastPostAt.getTime() - a.lastPostAt.getTime())\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t.map((thread) => ({\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tid: thread.id,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\ttitle: thread.title,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tcreatedAt: thread.createdAt,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tupdatedAt: thread.updatedAt,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tlastPostAt: thread.lastPostAt,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\treplyCount: thread.replyCount,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t})),\n\t\t\t\t});\n\t\t\t\treturn {\n\t\t\t\t\twhere: (predicate?: unknown) => build(predicate),\n\t\t\t\t\torderBy: () => build(),\n\t\t\t\t};\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\tconst build = (predicate?: unknown) => {\n\t\t\t\tconst rows = state.posts.filter((post) =>\n\t\t\t\t\tmatchPostPredicate(post, predicate, options?.failParentLookup),\n\t\t\t\t);\n\t\t\t\tconst query = {\n\t\t\t\t\tget: async () => rows[0] ?? null,\n\t\t\t\t\tall: async () =>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t[...rows].sort((a, b) => a.createdAt.getTime() - b.createdAt.getTi"},{"path":"api/routes/bbs.route.ts","excerpt":"import { zValidator } from \"@hono/zod-validator\";\nimport { and, asc, desc, eq } from \"drizzle-orm\";\nimport { Hono } from \"hono\";\nimport { z } from \"zod\";\nimport type { AppDatabase } from \"../db\";\nimport { posts, threads } from \"../db/schema\";\nimport { HttpError } from \"../modules/auth/errors\";\ntype BbsRouteDeps = {\n\tdb: AppDatabase;\n};\nconst threadCreateSchema = z.object({\n\ttitle: z.string().trim().min(1).max(120),\n\tbody: z.string().trim().min(1).max(4000),\n\tauthorName: z.string().trim().min(1).max(80).optional(),\n});\nconst replyCreateSchema = z.object({\n\tbody: z.string().trim().min(1).max(4000),\n\tauthorName: z.string().trim().min(1).max(80).optional(),\n\tparentPostId: z.number().int().positive().optional(),\n});\nasync function getThreadOrThrow(db: AppDatabase, id: number) {\n\tconst row = await db.select().from(threads).where(eq(threads.id, id)).get();\n\tif (!row) throw new HttpError(404, \"Thread not found\");\n\treturn row;\n}\nexport function createBbsRoute(deps: BbsRouteDeps) {\n\treturn new Hono()\n\t\t.get(\"/threads\", async (c) => {\n\t\t\tconst items = await deps.db\n\t\t\t\t.select({\n\t\t\t\t\tid: threads.id,\n\t\t\t\t\ttitle: threads.title,\n\t\t\t\t\tcreatedAt: threads.createdAt,\n\t\t\t\t\tupdatedAt: threads.updatedAt,\n\t\t\t\t\tlastPostAt: threads.lastPostAt,\n\t\t\t\t\treplyCount: threads.replyCount,\n\t\t\t\t})\n\t\t\t\t.from(threads)\n\t\t\t\t.orderBy(desc(threads.lastPostAt), desc(threads.createdAt))\n\t\t\t\t.all();\n\t\t\treturn c.json({ threads: items });\n\t\t})\n\t\t.get(\"/threads/:id\", async (c) => {\n\t\t\tconst id = Number(c.req.param(\"id\"));\n\t\t\tif (!Number.isInteger(id)) throw new HttpError(400, \"Invalid thread id\");\n\t\t\tconst thread = await getThreadOrThrow(deps.db, id);\n\t\t\tconst items = await deps.db\n\t\t\t\t.select({\n\t\t\t\t\tid: posts.id,\n\t\t\t\t\tthreadId: posts.threadId,\n\t\t\t\t\tparentPostId: posts.parentPostId,\n\t\t\t\t\tauthorName: posts.authorName"},{"path":"api/routes/health.route.test.ts","excerpt":"import { Hono } from \"hono\";\nimport { describe, expect, it } from \"vitest\";\nimport { createHealthRoute } from \"./health.route\";\ndescribe(\"health route\", () => {\n\tit(\"should return ok status\", async () => {\n\t\tconst app = new Hono().route(\"/health\", createHealthRoute());\n\t\tconst res = await app.request(\"/health\");\n\t\texpect(res.status).toBe(200);\n\t\tconst body = await res.json();\n\t\texpect(body).toEqual({\n\t\t\tstatus: \"ok\",\n\t\t\tservice: \"hono-standard\",\n\t\t});\n\t});\n});"},{"path":"api/routes/health.route.ts","excerpt":"import { Hono } from \"hono\";\nexport function createHealthRoute() {\n\treturn new Hono().get(\"/\", (c) => {\n\t\treturn c.json({ status: \"ok\", service: \"hono-standard\" });\n\t});\n}"},{"path":"api/routes/protected.route.test.ts","excerpt":"import { Hono } from \"hono\";\nimport { describe, expect, it } from \"vitest\";\nimport { createProtectedRoute } from \"./protected.route\";\ndescribe(\"protected route\", () => {\n\tit(\"returns the authenticated profile from context\", async () => {\n\t\tconst app = new Hono();\n\t\tapp.use(\"/protected/*\", async (c, next) => {\n\t\t\tc.set(\"authUser\", {\n\t\t\t\tuserId: \"a1a1a1a1-a1a1-41a1-a1a1-a1a1a1a1a1a1\",\n\t\t\t\temail: \"test@example.com\",\n\t\t\t\trole: \"member\",\n\t\t\t});\n\t\t\tawait next();\n\t\t});\n\t\tapp.route(\"/protected\", createProtectedRoute());\n\t\tconst res = await app.request(\"/protected/profile\");\n\t\tconst body = await res.json();\n\t\texpect(res.status).toBe(200);\n\t\texpect(body.profile).toEqual({\n\t\t\temail: \"test@example.com\",\n\t\t\trole: \"member\",\n\t\t});\n\t});\n});"},{"path":"api/routes/protected.route.ts","excerpt":"import { Hono } from \"hono\";\nimport type { ProtectedProfileResponse } from \"../../shared/schemas/protected.schema\";\nimport { getAuthContextUser } from \"../modules/auth/context\";\nexport function createProtectedRoute() {\n\treturn new Hono().get(\"/profile\", (c) => {\n\t\tconst authUser = getAuthContextUser(c);\n\t\tconst response = {\n\t\t\tprofile: {\n\t\t\t\temail: authUser.email,\n\t\t\t\trole: authUser.role,\n\t\t\t},\n\t\t} satisfies ProtectedProfileResponse;\n\t\treturn c.json(response);\n\t});\n}"},{"path":"web/src/App.tsx","excerpt":"import { QueryClient, QueryClientProvider } from \"@tanstack/react-query\";\nimport { RouterProvider } from \"@tanstack/react-router\";\nimport { router } from \"./router\";\nimport { ShowcaseSettingsProvider } from \"./showcase-settings-context\";\nconst queryClient = new QueryClient({\n\tdefaultOptions: {\n\t\tqueries: {\n\t\t\tretry: false,\n\t\t},\n\t},\n});\nexport function App() {\n\treturn (\n\t\t<QueryClientProvider client={queryClient}>\n\t\t\t<ShowcaseSettingsProvider>\n\t\t\t\t<RouterProvider router={router} />\n\t\t\t</ShowcaseSettingsProvider>\n\t\t</QueryClientProvider>\n\t);\n}"}],"llmContextFiles":[{"path":"LLM_CONTEXT.md","excerpt":"# LLM Context: Hono Standard\n\nこの文書は、`hono-standard` を clone した直後に作業入口を決めるための圧縮コンテキストです。現行 branch は local SQLite auth/showcase template です。RAG、pgvector、agentic search、wiki ingestion は含みません。\n\n## Repository Snapshot\n\n- Bun + Hono backend と React + Vite frontend を同一 origin で動かす template。\n- DB は local SQLite。Drizzle schema は `api/db/schema.ts`、migration は `drizzle/`。\n- Backend app composition は `api/app/hono.ts`、server bootstrap は `api/app/server.ts`。\n- DB runtime の public entry は `api/db/index.ts`。SQLite baseline は `api/db/sqlite.ts`、migration runner は `api/db/migrate.ts` から `api/db/migrate-sqlite.ts` を呼ぶ。\n- Frontend entry は `web/src/App.tsx`、router は `web/src/router.tsx`、API client は `web/src/api.ts`。\n- Auth 実装は `api/modules/auth/`、route は `api/routes/auth.route.ts`、login UI は `web/src/domains/auth/login-domain.tsx`。\n- Shared API schema/object は `shared/schemas/`。Backend は `zValidator`、frontend は `hono/client` + `AppType` で同じ契約を参照する。\n- Home と Showcase は未ログインでも表示する。ログイン状態がある場合だけ header に user chip と logout button を表示する。\n- Protected sample は `/protected` と `/api/protected/profile`。frontend guard と server-side `requireAuth` の両方を示す。\n- Package manager / runtime は Bun。dev server は `bunx --bun vite` で起動する。\n- Quality gates は `bun run verify` と `bun run verify:e2e`。CI も同じ入口を使う。\n- `main` は SQLite baseline。Turso / PostgreSQL / pgvector は `variant/*` branch で driver、schema、migration、docs、smoke setup を差し替える。\n\n## Top-Level Map\n\n| Path | Role |\n| --- | --- |\n| `api/app/hono.ts` | Hono middleware、API route、static fallback、`AppType` export |\n| `api/app/server.ts` | Bun server bootstrap |\n| `api/app/env.ts` | environment parsing and defaults |\n| `api/config/appDefaults.ts` | non-secret app defaults |\n| `api/db/index.ts` | DB runtime public entry and variant boundary |\n| `api/db/sqlite.ts` | SQLite baseline Drizzle runtime |\n| `api/db/migrate.ts` | migration runner public entry |\n| `api/db/migrate-sqlite.ts` | SQLite baseline migration runner |\n| `api/db/schema.ts` | SQLite baseline Drizzle schema |\n| `api/routes/auth.route.ts` | `/api/auth/*` route module |\n| `api/routes/health.route.ts` | health route |\n| `api/routes/protected.route.ts` | server-side protected API sample |\n| `api/modules/auth/` | Auth service、JWT、cookies、password hashing |\n| `api/middleware/auth.ts` | access-token auth middleware |\n| `shared/schemas/` | Zod schema and public API object types shared by api and web |\n| `web/src/App.tsx` | React Query and Router providers |\n| `web/src/router.tsx` | TanStack Router tree |\n| `web/src/api.ts` | browser API client and auth refresh handling |\n| `web/src/auth-context.tsx` | frontend auth state |\n| `web/src/routes/` | route definitions |\n| `web/src/views/` | Home/Login/Showcase views |\n| `web/src/showcase-*` | showcase state and URL search helpers |\n| `drizzle/` | SQL migrations |\n| `scripts/verify.ts` | verification pipeline |\n| `scripts/e2e-server.ts` | Playwright smoke server with isolated SQLite DB |\n| `tests/e2e/` | Playwright smoke tests |\n| `.github/workflows/verify.yml` | CI verification |\n| `Dockerfile`, `docker-compose.yml` | Optional SQLite baseline container runtime |\n\n## Task Routing\n\n| Task | Start here | Usually also read | Defer unless touched |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Change auth API | `api/routes/auth.route.ts`, `api/modules/auth/`, `api/middleware/auth.ts`, `shared/schemas/auth.schema.ts` | `web/src/api.ts`, `web/src/auth-context.tsx` | showcase UI |\n| Change protected sample | `api/routes/protected.route.ts`, `web/src/views/protected-view.tsx`, `web/src/routes/protected-route.tsx` | `api/middleware/auth.ts`, `shared/schemas/protected.schema.ts`, `web/src/api.ts` | showcase UI |\n| Change login UI | `web/src/views/login-view.tsx`, `web/src/domains/auth/login-domain.tsx` | `web/src/auth-context.tsx`, `web/src/api.ts` | DB schema |\n| Change app shell/routing | `web/src/routes/root-route.tsx`, `web/src/router.tsx` | `web/src/App.tsx`, affected view | auth service internals |\n| Change showcase UI | `web/src/views/showcase-view.tsx`, `web/src/showcase-settings-context.tsx`, `web/src/showcase-table-search.ts` | `web/src/styles.css` | backend auth |\n| Change env/config | `api/app/env.ts`, `api/config/appDefaults.ts`, `.env.example` | `drizzle.config.ts`, Docker/Compose if bind host or port changes | frontend views |\n| Change DB runtime/variant boundary | `api/db/index.ts`, `api/db/sqlite.ts`, `api/db/migrate.ts`, `api/db/migrate-sqlite.ts` | `api/cli/migrate.ts`, `api/cli/auth-create-admin.ts`, `docs/template-variant-management.md` | showcase UI |\n| Change DB schema/migration | `api/db/schema.ts`, `drizzle/`, `api/db/migrate*.ts` | `api/modules/auth/auth.service.ts`, `api/modules/auth/token.service.ts` | showcase UI |\n| Change build/dev tooling | `package.json`, `vite.config.ts`, `vitest.config.ts`, `playwright.config.ts`, `scripts/verify.ts` | `.github/workflows/verify.yml`, failing config-specific output | feature code |\n| Change docs | `README.md`, `LLM_CONTEXT.md`, `docs/` | `.gitignore` when generated output changes | feature code |\n\n## Styling / CSS Architecture\n\nUI 変更では、この節を styling 判断の入口にする。まず全 CSS を広く探索せず、以下の entrypoint と pattern source で説明できるか確認する。\n\n- Global style entrypoint: `web/src/styles.css`。Tailwind v4 の `@import \"tailwindcss\"`、`@theme` token、`@layer base`、`@layer components` をこの1ファイルに集約している。\n- CSS load path: `web/src/main.tsx` が `./styles.css` を import する。Tailwind plugin は `vite.config.ts` の `@tailwindcss/vite`。\n- Design tokens / theme values: `web/src/styles.css` の `@theme` が global token の source of truth。`--color-*` と `--radius-*` を Tailwind utility / `@apply` から使う。\n- Showcase theme values: `web/src/showcase-settings-context.tsx` が `--showcase-*` custom properties を生成し、`web/src/styles.css` の `.showcase-shell` と `:root[data-showcase-page-theme]` rules がそれを消費する。\n- Shared UI components and common patterns: `web/src/styles.css` の `.topbar`, `.menu-*`, `.auth-*`, `.home-*`, `.center-shell`, `.signed-in-panel`, `.showcase-*`, `.demo-*`, `.table-*` class families。\n- Page a"}],"recentCommitDiffs":[],"packageScripts":[{"name":"auth:create-admin","command":"bun run api/cli/auth-create-admin.ts"},{"name":"bootstrap","command":"bun scripts/bootstrap.ts"},{"name":"build","command":"bun run build:web"},{"name":"build:web","command":"vite build"},{"name":"db:generate","command":"drizzle-kit generate"},{"name":"db:migrate","command":"bun run api/cli/migrate.ts"},{"name":"db:migrate:drizzle","command":"drizzle-kit migrate"},{"name":"dev","command":"bunx --bun vite"},{"name":"dev:vite","command":"vite"},{"name":"format","command":"biome format --write api web shared scripts tests drizzle.config.ts playwright.config.ts vite.config.ts vitest.config.ts"},{"name":"format:check","command":"biome format api web shared scripts tests drizzle.config.ts playwright.config.ts vite.config.ts vitest.config.ts"},{"name":"lint","command":"biome lint api web shared scripts tests drizzle.config.ts playwright.config.ts vite.config.ts vitest.config.ts"},{"name":"seed:dev","command":"bun scripts/seed-dev.ts"},{"name":"start","command":"bun run api/app/server.ts"},{"name":"test","command":"vitest run"},{"name":"test:coverage","command":"vitest run --coverage"},{"name":"test:e2e","command":"playwright test"},{"name":"test:watch","command":"vitest"},{"name":"typecheck","command":"tsc --noEmit"},{"name":"verify","command":"bun scripts/verify.ts"},{"name":"verify:all","command":"bun run verify && bun run verify:e2e"},{"name":"verify:e2e","command":"bun run test:e2e"},{"name":"verify:strict","command":"bun run verify"}],"moduleOntology":null},"qualityCapabilities":{"projectType":"typescript","commands":[{"kind":"unit","source":"package_json","command":"bun run ''test''","runnable":true},{"kind":"coverage","source":"package_json","command":"bun run ''test:coverage''","runnable":true},{"kind":"e2e","source":"package_json","command":"bun run ''test:e2e''","runnable":true},{"kind":"verify","source":"package_json","command":"bun run ''verify''","runnable":true}],"missingCapabilities":[]},"recentTokenSpendTasks":[{"taskId":"3c40e22b-fbe5-48a1-ba92-64f990e589fd","title":"BBSを作りたいです。計画してください。","totalTokens":8468677,"callCount":8}],"recentRuns":{"completed":1,"failed":0,"running":0}}','{"role":"mission_task_generation","providerId":"codex","providerEndpointId":"ep_2a9c67769830da1e","routeSource":"primary","modelOrDeployment":"gpt-5.4-mini","thinkingDepth":null}',NULL,unistr('Codex Exec exited with code 1: Reading prompt from stdin...\u000a'),1783214601,1783214617);
INSERT INTO "mission_task_candidate_batches" ("id", "created_at", "updated_at", "repository_id", "status", "requested_goal_ids_json", "signal_snapshot_json", "selected_model_json", "raw_output_json", "error_message", "started_at", "completed_at") VALUES('fa63c2a7-178d-4987-8712-512c70768e38',1783214645,1783214678,'984c8844-643e-4596-93a5-703a8d14a1e0','completed','["de3305e2-2269-4765-a117-5dd36de101e2"]','{"repository":{"id":"984c8844-643e-4596-93a5-703a8d14a1e0","name":"todolist","localPath":"/Users/y.noguchi/Code/todolist","branch":"main"},"activeGoals":[{"id":"de3305e2-2269-4765-a117-5dd36de101e2","title":"todo listを作る","goalText":"考えられる最も使いやすいtodolistを作る","interpretation":{"scope":"unknown","intent":"unknown","source":"unknown","confidencePercent":0,"reason":null}}],"latestEvaluation":{"id":"a9ff9b87-ada3-43cb-bc45-88b80d8b8644","overallScore":72,"dimensions":[{"key":"conceptValue","score":78,"label":"コンセプト価値"},{"key":"architectureQuality","score":80,"label":"アーキテクチャ"},{"key":"extensibility","score":74,"label":"拡張性"},{"key":"uiUx","score":69,"label":"UI / UX"},{"key":"operability","score":76,"label":"運用性"},{"key":"security","score":71,"label":"セキュリティ"},{"key":"maintainability","score":79,"label":"保守性"},{"key":"marketCompetitiveness","score":66,"label":"市場競争力"}],"summary":"Hono + React + SQLite を同一 origin でまとめたテンプレートとしては、認証、保護ルート、共有 schema、検証ゲートまで揃っており、実運用の土台として成立している。BBS ルートや thread 系 UI も repo tree に見えるため、単なる starter を越えて複数ドメインを載せる余地がある一方、評価根拠は repo structure と README/LLM_CONTEXT に限られるため、実装の細部と実行時品質は過大評価しない。"},"latestQuality":{"coverage":null,"e2e":{"status":"passed","total":2,"passed":2,"failed":0,"skipped":0,"durationMs":1170,"suites":[{"title":"smoke.spec.ts","status":"passed","tests":2,"durationMs":1170,"lastFailure":null}]}},"repositorySnapshot":{"packageName":"hono-standard","description":"Minimal Hono + React template with optional login and showcase screens.","readmeExcerpt":"# Hono Standard\n\n[![Bun](https://img.shields.io/badge/Bun-%23000000.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=bun&logoColor=white)](https://bun.sh/)\n[![Hono](https://img.shields.io/badge/Hono-%23E36022.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=hono&logoColor=white)](https://hono.dev/)\n[![React](https://img.shields.io/badge/React-%2320232a.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=react&logoColor=%2361DAFB)](https://react.dev/)\n[![SQLite](https://img.shields.io/badge/SQLite-003B57.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=sqlite&logoColor=white)](https://www.sqlite.org/)\n[![TypeScript](https://img.shields.io/badge/TypeScript-%23007ACC.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=typescript&logoColor=white)](https://www.typescriptlang.org/)\n[![MIT License](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-green.svg?style=for-the-badge)](LICENSE.md)\n\nHono backend と React + Vite frontend を同一 origin で動かす、local SQLite 対応の Web app template です。Drizzle のユーザー認証、httpOnly Cookie による access / refresh token、React Router ベースの画面、コンポーネント showcase を含みます。\n\n## 構成\n\n| Path | Role |\n| --- | --- |\n| `api/app/hono.ts` | Hono app composition。middleware、API route、静的配信、`AppType` を登録 |\n| `api/app/server.ts` | Bun server bootstrap |\n| `api/app/env.ts` | runtime env parser |\n| `api/config/appDefaults.ts` | 非シークレットの既定値 |\n| `api/db/index.ts` | DB runtime の public entry。variant はここから差し替える |\n| `api/db/sqlite.ts` | SQLite baseline の Drizzle runtime |\n| `api/db/schema.ts` | Drizzle SQLite schema |\n| `api/db/migrate.ts` | migration runner の public entry |\n| `api/db/migrate-sqlite.ts` | SQLite baseline の migration runner |\n| `api/routes/auth.route.ts` | `/api/auth/*` route |\n| `api/routes/health.route.ts` | `/api/health` route |\n| `api/routes/protected.route.ts` | `/api/protected/*` の server-side protected sample |\n| `api/modules/auth/` | password hash、JWT、cookie、auth service |\n| `api/middleware/auth.ts` | protected API middleware |\n| `web/src/` | React frontend |\n| `shared/schemas/` | frontend/backend で共有する Zod schema と API object type |\n| `drizzle/` | SQL migrations |\n| `scripts/verify.ts` | typecheck / lint / format / test / coverage / build の検証 pipeline |\n\n## 前提\n\n| Tool | 用途 |\n| --- | --- |\n| Bun | package manager、runtime、scripts |\n| SQLite | auth user / refresh token storage |\n\n## セットアップ\n\n```bash\nbun run bootstrap\nbun run auth:create-admin -- --email admin@example.com --name \"Admin User\"\nbun run dev\n```\n\n`bootstrap` は `.env` を用意し、dependency が未導入なら `bun install --frozen-lockfile` を実行し、SQLite database に migration を適用します。\n\n`auth:create-admin` は対話で password を読みます。自動化する場合は次のように標準入力から渡せます。\n\n```bash\nprintf ''%s\\n'' ''<password>'' | bun run auth:create-admin -- --email admin@example.com --name \"Admin User\" --password-stdin\n```\n\n開発サーバーは `http://localhost:5173` で起動します。Vite dev server が frontend を配信し、`/api/*` は Hono に渡されます。\n\n初回 clone 後に template の動作確認まで済ませる場合は、次を実行します。\n\n```bash\nbun run verify\nbun run verify:e2e\n```\n\n認証を使う app では `auth:create-admin` または `seed:dev` で admin を作成してから `/login` を確認します。認証を使わない app では、この README 後半の auth removal checklist に沿って auth route、DB table、login/protected screen、E2E scope をまとめて削ります。\n\n## 生成物と管理対象\n\nこの template では、source と docs は追跡し、local runtime や検証の生成物は追跡しません。\n\n| Path / Pattern | 扱い |\n| --- | --- |\n| `drizzle/*.sql` | Drizzle migration source。commit 対象 |\n| `.env.example` | local development の雛形。commit 対象 |\n| `.env*` | local secret / runtime env。`.env.example` 以外は commit しない |\n| `data/`, `*.db`, `*.sqlite`, `*.sqlite3` | local SQLite database。commit しない |\n| `coverage/`, `playwright-report/`, `test-results/` | verification output。commit しない |\n| `dist/`, `dist-web/`, `build/`, `*.tgz` | build / archive output。commit しない |\n\n## 環境変数\n\n非シークレットの既定値は `api/config/appDefaults.ts` にあります。`.env.example` は local development 向けの値です。\n\n| Variable | Required | Description | Default |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `NODE_ENV` | no | `development` / `test` / `production` | `development` |\n| `HOST` | no | HTTP bind host。container では `0.0.0.0` を指定 | `127.0.0.1` |\n| `PORT` | no | HTTP server port | `5173` |\n| `DATABASE_URL` | no | SQLite database ","sourceFiles":["LLM_CONTEXT.md","README.md","api/app/env.test.ts","api/app/env.ts","api/app/hono.test.ts","api/app/hono.ts","api/app/security-headers.ts","api/app/server.ts","api/cli/auth-create-admin.ts","api/cli/cli-contract.test.ts","api/cli/migrate.ts","api/config/appDefaults.ts","api/db/index.ts","api/db/migrate-sqlite.ts","api/db/migrate.ts","api/db/path.test.ts","api/db/path.ts","api/db/schema.ts","api/db/sqlite.ts","api/middleware/auth.test.ts","api/middleware/auth.ts","api/modules/auth/auth-cookies.test.ts","api/modules/auth/auth-cookies.ts","api/modules/auth/auth.service.test.ts","api/modules/auth/auth.service.ts","api/modules/auth/context.test.ts","api/modules/auth/context.ts","api/modules/auth/errors.test.ts","api/modules/auth/errors.ts","api/modules/auth/password.test.ts","api/modules/auth/password.ts","api/modules/auth/token.service.test.ts","api/modules/auth/token.service.ts","api/modules/auth/types.test.ts","api/modules/auth/types.ts","api/routes/auth.route.test.ts","api/routes/auth.route.ts","api/routes/bbs.route.test.ts","api/routes/bbs.route.ts","api/routes/health.route.test.ts","api/routes/health.route.ts","api/routes/protected.route.test.ts","api/routes/protected.route.ts","api/types/hono-context.d.ts","biome.json","docs/template-variant-management.md","drizzle.config.ts","drizzle/0001_auth.sql","drizzle/0002_bbs.sql","package.json","playwright.config.ts","scripts/bootstrap.test.ts","scripts/bootstrap.ts","scripts/e2e-server.ts","scripts/seed-dev.ts","scripts/verify.ts","shared/schemas/auth.schema.ts","shared/schemas/protected.schema.test.ts","shared/schemas/protected.schema.ts","tests/e2e/smoke.spec.ts","tsconfig.build.json","tsconfig.json","vite.config.ts","vitest.config.ts","web/src/App.tsx","web/src/api.test.ts","web/src/api.ts","web/src/auth-context.tsx","web/src/components/dev-error-panel.tsx","web/src/domains/auth/login-domain.tsx","web/src/main.tsx","web/src/router.tsx","web/src/routes/home-route.tsx","web/src/routes/login-route.tsx","web/src/routes/login-search.ts","web/src/routes/protected-route.tsx","web/src/routes/root-route.tsx","web/src/routes/route-access.test.ts","web/src/routes/route-access.ts","web/src/routes/showcase-route.tsx","web/src/routes/thread-detail-route.tsx","web/src/routes/thread-new-route.tsx","web/src/routes/threads-route.tsx","web/src/showcase-settings-context.tsx","web/src/showcase-table-search.ts","web/src/styles.css","web/src/views/home-view.tsx","web/src/views/login-view.tsx","web/src/views/protected-view.tsx","web/src/views/showcase-view.tsx","web/src/views/thread-detail-view.tsx","web/src/views/thread-new-view.tsx","web/src/views/threads-view.tsx"],"routeFiles":["api/routes/auth.route.test.ts","api/routes/auth.route.ts","api/routes/bbs.route.test.ts","api/routes/bbs.route.ts","api/routes/health.route.test.ts","api/routes/health.route.ts","api/routes/protected.route.test.ts","api/routes/protected.route.ts","web/src/routes/home-route.tsx","web/src/routes/login-route.tsx","web/src/routes/login-search.ts","web/src/routes/protected-route.tsx","web/src/routes/root-route.tsx","web/src/routes/route-access.test.ts","web/src/routes/route-access.ts","web/src/routes/showcase-route.tsx","web/src/routes/thread-detail-route.tsx","web/src/routes/thread-new-route.tsx","web/src/routes/threads-route.tsx","web/src/views/home-view.tsx","web/src/views/login-view.tsx","web/src/views/protected-view.tsx","web/src/views/showcase-view.tsx","web/src/views/thread-detail-view.tsx","web/src/views/thread-new-view.tsx","web/src/views/threads-view.tsx"],"migrationFiles":["drizzle/0001_auth.sql","drizzle/0002_bbs.sql"],"sourceExcerpts":[{"path":"README.md","excerpt":"# Hono Standard\n[![Bun](https://img.shields.io/badge/Bun-%23000000.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=bun&logoColor=white)](https://bun.sh/)\n[![Hono](https://img.shields.io/badge/Hono-%23E36022.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=hono&logoColor=white)](https://hono.dev/)\n[![React](https://img.shields.io/badge/React-%2320232a.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=react&logoColor=%2361DAFB)](https://react.dev/)\n[![SQLite](https://img.shields.io/badge/SQLite-003B57.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=sqlite&logoColor=white)](https://www.sqlite.org/)\n[![TypeScript](https://img.shields.io/badge/TypeScript-%23007ACC.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=typescript&logoColor=white)](https://www.typescriptlang.org/)\n[![MIT License](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-green.svg?style=for-the-badge)](LICENSE.md)\nHono backend と React + Vite frontend を同一 origin で動かす、local SQLite 対応の Web app template です。Drizzle のユーザー認証、httpOnly Cookie による access / refresh token、React Router ベースの画面、コンポーネント showcase を含みます。\n## 構成\n| Path | Role |\n| --- | --- |\n| `api/app/hono.ts` | Hono app composition。middleware、API route、静的配信、`AppType` を登録 |\n| `api/app/server.ts` | Bun server bootstrap |\n| `api/app/env.ts` | runtime env parser |\n| `api/config/appDefaults.ts` | 非シークレットの既定値 |\n| `api/db/index.ts` | DB runtime の public entry。variant はここから差し替える |\n| `api/db/sqlite.ts` | SQLite baseline の Drizzle runtime |\n| `api/db/schema.ts` | Drizzle SQLite schema |\n| `api/db/migrate.ts` | migration runner の public entry |\n| `api/db/migrate-sqlite.ts` | SQLite baseline の migration runner |\n| `api/routes/auth.route.ts` | `/api/auth/*` route |\n| `api/routes/health.route.ts` | `/api/health` route |\n| `api/routes/protected.route.ts` | `/api/protected/*` の server-side protected sample |\n| `api/modules/auth/` | password hash、JWT、cookie、auth service |\n| `api/mi"},{"path":"api/app/env.test.ts","excerpt":"import { describe, expect, it } from \"vitest\";\nimport { APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS } from \"../config/appDefaults\";\nimport { readAppEnv } from \"./env\";\ndescribe(\"readAppEnv\", () => {\n\tit(\"uses minimal app defaults\", () => {\n\t\tconst env = readAppEnv({});\n\t\texpect(env.nodeEnv).toBe(\"development\");\n\t\texpect(env.host).toBe(APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS.host);\n\t\texpect(env.port).toBe(APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS.port);\n\t\texpect(env.databaseUrl).toBe(APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS.databaseUrl);\n\t\texpect(env.appUrl).toBe(APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS.appUrl);\n\t\texpect(env.corsOrigins).toEqual(APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS.corsOrigins);\n\t\texpect(env.cookieSameSite).toBe(APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS.cookieSameSite);\n\t});\n\tit(\"accepts database and auth runtime overrides\", () => {\n\t\tconst env = readAppEnv({\n\t\t\tHOST: \"0.0.0.0\",\n\t\t\tPORT: \"5174\",\n\t\t\tDATABASE_URL: \"tmp/test.sqlite\",\n\t\t\tJWT_SECRET: \"x\".repeat(32),\n\t\t\tAPP_URL: \"https://showcase.example.com\",\n\t\t\tCORS_ORIGINS: \"https://showcase.example.com,http://localhost:5173\",\n\t\t\tAUTH_COOKIE_SECURE: \"true\",\n\t\t\tAUTH_COOKIE_SAME_SITE: \"none\",\n\t\t\tSECURITY_HEADERS_MODE: \"https\",\n\t\t});\n\t\texpect(env.host).toBe(\"0.0.0.0\");\n\t\texpect(env.port).toBe(5174);\n\t\texpect(env.databaseUrl).toBe(\"tmp/test.sqlite\");\n\t\texpect(env.jwtSecret).toBe(\"x\".repeat(32));\n\t\texpect(env.appUrl).toBe(\"https://showcase.example.com\");\n\t\texpect(env.corsOrigins).toEqual([\n\t\t\t\"https://showcase.example.com\",\n\t\t\t\"http://localhost:5173\",\n\t\t]);\n\t\texpect(env.secureCookie).toBe(true);\n\t\texpect(env.cookieSameSite).toBe(\"none\");\n\t\texpect(env.securityHeadersMode).toBe(\"https\");\n\t});\n\tit(\"falls back to the SQLite default when a dev shell provides a connection URL\", () => {\n\t\tconst env = readAppEnv({\n\t\t\tDATABASE_URL: \"postgres://postgres:postgres@127.0.0.1:5432/app\",\n\t\t});\n\t\texpect(env.databaseUrl).toBe(APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS.databaseUrl);\n\t});\n\tit(\"rej"},{"path":"api/app/env.ts","excerpt":"import { z } from \"zod\";\nimport { APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS } from \"../config/appDefaults\";\nimport { isDatabaseConnectionUrl } from \"../db/path\";\nconst optionalTrimmedString = z.preprocess((value) => {\n\tif (typeof value !== \"string\") return value;\n\tconst trimmed = value.trim();\n\treturn trimmed.length > 0 ? trimmed : undefined;\n}, z.string().trim().optional());\nconst optionalUrl = z.preprocess((value) => {\n\tif (typeof value !== \"string\") return value;\n\tconst trimmed = value.trim();\n\treturn trimmed.length > 0 ? trimmed : undefined;\n}, z.string().url().optional());\nconst optionalBoolean = z.preprocess((value) => {\n\tif (typeof value === \"boolean\") return value;\n\tif (typeof value !== \"string\") return value;\n\tconst normalized = value.trim().toLowerCase();\n\tif (!normalized) return undefined;\n\tif ([\"1\", \"true\", \"yes\", \"on\"].includes(normalized)) return true;\n\tif ([\"0\", \"false\", \"no\", \"off\"].includes(normalized)) return false;\n\treturn value;\n}, z.boolean().optional());\nconst optionalPort = z.preprocess((value) => {\n\tif (typeof value === \"number\") return value;\n\tif (typeof value !== \"string\") return value;\n\tconst trimmed = value.trim();\n\treturn trimmed.length > 0 ? Number(trimmed) : undefined;\n}, z.number().int().min(1).max(65535).optional());\nconst optionalCookieSameSite = z.preprocess((value) => {\n\tif (typeof value !== \"string\") return value;\n\tconst normalized = value.trim().toLowerCase();\n\treturn normalized.length > 0 ? normalized : undefined;\n}, z.enum([\"lax\", \"strict\", \"none\"]).optional());\nconst optionalSecurityHeadersMode = z.preprocess(\n\t(value) => {\n\t\tif (typeof value !== \"string\") return value;\n\t\tconst normalized = value.trim().toLowerCase();\n\t\treturn normalized.length > 0 ? normalized : undefined;\n\t},\n\tz.enum([\"auto\", \"http\", \"https\"]).default(\"auto\"),\n);\nconst EnvSchema = z"},{"path":"api/app/hono.test.ts","excerpt":"import { describe, expect, it, vi, beforeEach } from \"vitest\";\nimport fs from \"node:fs/promises\";\nimport { HttpError } from \"../modules/auth/errors\";\nimport { HTTPException } from \"hono/http-exception\";\n// Mock environment and DB connection before importing app\nvi.mock(\"../db\", () => ({\n\tcreateDbRuntime: vi.fn().mockReturnValue({\n\t\tdb: {\n\t\t\tquery: {\n\t\t\t\tusers: {\n\t\t\t\t\tfindFirst: vi.fn(),\n\t\t\t\t},\n\t\t\t},\n\t\t},\n\t\tclose: vi.fn(),\n\t\tconnection: {\n\t\t\tclient: {\n\t\t\t\tclose: vi.fn(),\n\t\t\t},\n\t\t\townsConnection: false,\n\t\t},\n\t}),\n}));\nvi.mock(\"./env\", () => ({\n\treadAppEnv: vi.fn().mockReturnValue({\n\t\tnodeEnv: \"test\",\n\t\thost: \"127.0.0.1\",\n\t\tport: 5173,\n\t\tdatabaseUrl: \"mock.db\",\n\t\tjwtSecret: \"x\".repeat(32),\n\t\tjwtAccessExpiresIn: \"15m\",\n\t\tjwtRefreshExpiresIn: \"7d\",\n\t\tappUrl: \"http://localhost:5173\",\n\t\tcorsOrigins: [\"http://localhost:5173\"],\n\t\ttrustProxy: true,\n\t\tsecureCookie: false,\n\t\tcookieSameSite: \"lax\",\n\t\tsecurityHeadersMode: \"auto\",\n\t}),\n}));\n// Mock Bun global variable before importing hono/bun dependent code\n(globalThis as any).Bun = {\n\tfile: (path: string) => ({\n\t\texists: () => Promise.resolve(true),\n\t}),\n};\n// Dynamically import app so globalThis.Bun is defined first\nconst { default: app } = await import(\"./hono\");\n// Add test routes before any request is processed (Hono routers lock after first request)\napp.post(\"/api/test-http-error\", () => {\n\tthrow new HttpError(400, \"Bad Parameters\");\n});\napp.post(\"/api/test-hono-http-exception\", () => {\n\tthrow new HTTPException(403, { message: \"Access Forbidden\" });\n});\napp.post(\"/api/test-generic-error\", () => {\n\tthrow new Error(\"Something blew up\");\n});\ndescribe(\"hono app entry\", () => {\n\tbeforeEach(() => {\n\t\tvi.restoreAllMocks();\n\t});\n\tit(\"should return 200 for /api/health\", async () => {\n\t\tconst res = await app.request(\"/api/health\");\n\t\texp"},{"path":"api/app/hono.ts","excerpt":"import fs from \"node:fs/promises\";\nimport path from \"node:path\";\nimport { serveStatic } from \"hono/bun\";\nimport { csrf } from \"hono/csrf\";\nimport { Hono } from \"hono\";\nimport { cors } from \"hono/cors\";\nimport { logger } from \"hono/logger\";\nimport { HTTPException } from \"hono/http-exception\";\nimport { secureHeaders } from \"hono/secure-headers\";\nimport type { DbRuntime } from \"../db\";\nimport { createDbRuntime } from \"../db\";\nimport { requireAuth } from \"../middleware/auth\";\nimport { AuthService } from \"../modules/auth/auth.service\";\nimport { HttpError } from \"../modules/auth/errors\";\nimport { createBbsRoute } from \"../routes/bbs.route\";\nimport { createAuthRoute } from \"../routes/auth.route\";\nimport { createHealthRoute } from \"../routes/health.route\";\nimport { createProtectedRoute } from \"../routes/protected.route\";\nimport { readAppEnv, type AppEnv } from \"./env\";\nimport { appContentSecurityPolicy } from \"./security-headers\";\nexport type AppDeps = {\n\tenv: AppEnv;\n\tdbRuntime: DbRuntime;\n\tauthService: AuthService;\n};\ndeclare global {\n\tvar __honoStandardRuntime__: Promise<AppDeps> | undefined;\n}\nexport async function createDefaultAppDeps(): Promise<AppDeps> {\n\tconst env = readAppEnv();\n\tconst dbRuntime = createDbRuntime(env);\n\tconst authService = new AuthService(dbRuntime.db, env);\n\treturn { env, dbRuntime, authService };\n}\nexport async function getAppRuntime(): Promise<AppDeps> {\n\tif (!globalThis.__honoStandardRuntime__) {\n\t\tglobalThis.__honoStandardRuntime__ = createDefaultAppDeps().catch(\n\t\t\t(error) => {\n\t\t\t\tglobalThis.__honoStandardRuntime__ = undefined;\n\t\t\t\tthrow error;\n\t\t\t},\n\t\t);\n\t}\n\treturn globalThis.__honoStandardRuntime__;\n}\nconst distWebRoot = path.resolve(process.cwd(), \"dist-web\");\nconst distWebIndex = path.resolve(distWebRoot, \"index.html\");\nexport function creat"},{"path":"api/app/security-headers.ts","excerpt":"type CspDirectives = Record<string, string[]>;\nexport const appContentSecurityPolicy: CspDirectives = {\n\tdefaultSrc: [\"''self''\"],\n\tbaseUri: [\"''self''\"],\n\tconnectSrc: [\"''self''\"],\n\tfontSrc: [\"''self''\", \"data:\"],\n\tformAction: [\"''self''\"],\n\tframeAncestors: [\"''self''\"],\n\timgSrc: [\"''self''\", \"data:\", \"blob:\"],\n\tmanifestSrc: [\"''self''\"],\n\tobjectSrc: [\"''none''\"],\n\tscriptSrc: [\"''self''\"],\n\tstyleSrc: [\"''self''\", \"''unsafe-inline''\"],\n\tworkerSrc: [\"''self''\", \"blob:\"],\n};\nexport const viteDevContentSecurityPolicy: CspDirectives = {\n\t...appContentSecurityPolicy,\n\tconnectSrc: [\n\t\t\"''self''\",\n\t\t\"ws:\",\n\t\t\"http://localhost:5173\",\n\t\t\"http://127.0.0.1:5173\",\n\t],\n\tscriptSrc: [\"''self''\", \"''unsafe-inline''\", \"''unsafe-eval''\"],\n};\nconst toKebabCase = (value: string): string =>\n\tvalue.replace(/[A-Z]+(?![a-z])|[A-Z]/g, (match, offset) =>\n\t\toffset ? `-${match.toLowerCase()}` : match.toLowerCase(),\n\t);\nexport function serializeContentSecurityPolicy(policy: CspDirectives): string {\n\treturn Object.entries(policy)\n\t\t.map(\n\t\t\t([directive, values]) => `${toKebabCase(directive)} ${values.join(\" \")}`,\n\t\t)\n\t\t.join(\"; \");\n}"},{"path":"api/app/server.ts","excerpt":"import app, { getAppRuntime } from \"./hono\";\nimport { readAppEnv } from \"./env\";\nconst env = readAppEnv();\nconst server = Bun.serve({\n\tfetch: app.fetch,\n\thostname: env.host,\n\tport: env.port,\n});\nconsole.log(\n\t`Hono Standard server listening on http://${env.host}:${server.port}`,\n);\nconst shutdown = async (signal: string) => {\n\tconsole.log(`\\nReceived ${signal}. Shutting down gracefully...`);\n\tserver.stop(true);\n\ttry {\n\t\tconst runtime = await getAppRuntime();\n\t\tconsole.log(\"Closing database connection...\");\n\t\truntime.dbRuntime.close();\n\t\tconsole.log(\"Shutdown complete.\");\n\t\tprocess.exit(0);\n\t} catch (error) {\n\t\tconsole.error(\"Error during shutdown:\", error);\n\t\tprocess.exit(1);\n\t}\n};\nprocess.on(\"SIGINT\", () => shutdown(\"SIGINT\"));\nprocess.on(\"SIGTERM\", () => shutdown(\"SIGTERM\"));"},{"path":"api/routes/auth.route.test.ts","excerpt":"import { Hono } from \"hono\";\nimport { describe, expect, it, vi, beforeEach } from \"vitest\";\nimport { createAuthRoute } from \"./auth.route\";\nimport { requireAuth } from \"../middleware/auth\";\nimport type { AppEnv } from \"../app/env\";\nimport type { AuthService } from \"../modules/auth/auth.service\";\nimport { HttpError } from \"../modules/auth/errors\";\nimport {\n\tACCESS_TOKEN_COOKIE_NAME,\n\tREFRESH_TOKEN_COOKIE_NAME,\n} from \"../modules/auth/auth-cookies\";\ndescribe(\"auth route\", () => {\n\tlet app: Hono;\n\tlet mockAuthService: any;\n\tlet mockEnv: AppEnv;\n\tconst testUser = {\n\t\tid: \"a1a1a1a1-a1a1-41a1-a1a1-a1a1a1a1a1a1\",\n\t\temail: \"test@example.com\",\n\t\tdisplayName: \"Test User\",\n\t\trole: \"member\" as const,\n\t\tisActive: true,\n\t};\n\tbeforeEach(() => {\n\t\tmockEnv = {\n\t\t\tjwtSecret: \"x\".repeat(32),\n\t\t\tjwtAccessExpiresIn: \"15m\",\n\t\t\tjwtRefreshExpiresIn: \"7d\",\n\t\t\tsecureCookie: true,\n\t\t\tcookieSameSite: \"lax\",\n\t\t} as unknown as AppEnv;\n\t\tmockAuthService = {\n\t\t\tlogin: vi.fn(),\n\t\t\trefresh: vi.fn(),\n\t\t\tlogout: vi.fn(),\n\t\t\tfindUserById: vi.fn(),\n\t\t};\n\t\tapp = new Hono();\n\t\t// Set error handler to prevent throwing unhandled exceptions in tests\n\t\tapp.onError((err, c) => {\n\t\t\tconst status = (err as HttpError).status || 500;\n\t\t\treturn c.json({ message: err.message }, status as any);\n\t\t});\n\t\tapp.use(\n\t\t\t\"/auth/me\",\n\t\t\trequireAuth({\n\t\t\t\tenv: mockEnv,\n\t\t\t\tauthService: mockAuthService as unknown as AuthService,\n\t\t\t}),\n\t\t);\n\t\tapp.route(\n\t\t\t\"/auth\",\n\t\t\tcreateAuthRoute({\n\t\t\t\tauthService: mockAuthService as unknown as AuthService,\n\t\t\t\tenv: mockEnv,\n\t\t\t}),\n\t\t);\n\t});\n\tdescribe(\"POST /login\", () => {\n\t\tit(\"should login user with valid credentials and set cookies\", async () => {\n\t\t\tmockAuthService.login.mockResolvedValue({\n\t\t\t\taccessToken: \"access-token-123\",\n\t\t\t\trefreshToken: \"refresh-token-456\",\n\t\t\t\tuser: {\n\t\t\t\t\tid: te"},{"path":"api/routes/auth.route.ts","excerpt":"import { zValidator } from \"@hono/zod-validator\";\nimport { Hono } from \"hono\";\nimport { getCookie } from \"hono/cookie\";\nimport { loginSchema } from \"../../shared/schemas/auth.schema\";\nimport type { AppEnv } from \"../app/env\";\nimport type { AuthService } from \"../modules/auth/auth.service\";\nimport {\n\tREFRESH_TOKEN_COOKIE_NAME,\n\tclearAuthCookies,\n\tsetAuthCookies,\n} from \"../modules/auth/auth-cookies\";\nimport { getAuthContextUser } from \"../modules/auth/context\";\nimport { HttpError } from \"../modules/auth/errors\";\ntype AuthRouteDeps = {\n\tauthService: AuthService;\n\tenv: AppEnv;\n};\nexport function createAuthRoute(deps: AuthRouteDeps) {\n\treturn new Hono()\n\t\t.post(\"/login\", zValidator(\"json\", loginSchema), async (c) => {\n\t\t\tconst body = c.req.valid(\"json\");\n\t\t\tconst result = await deps.authService.login({\n\t\t\t\temail: body.email,\n\t\t\t\tpassword: body.password,\n\t\t\t});\n\t\t\tsetAuthCookies(c, deps.env, result);\n\t\t\treturn c.json({ user: result.user });\n\t\t})\n\t\t.post(\"/refresh\", async (c) => {\n\t\t\tconst refreshToken = getCookie(c, REFRESH_TOKEN_COOKIE_NAME);\n\t\t\tif (!refreshToken) {\n\t\t\t\tthrow new HttpError(401, \"Unauthorized\");\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\tconst result = await deps.authService.refresh(refreshToken);\n\t\t\tsetAuthCookies(c, deps.env, result);\n\t\t\treturn c.json({ user: result.user });\n\t\t})\n\t\t.post(\"/logout\", async (c) => {\n\t\t\tconst refreshToken = getCookie(c, REFRESH_TOKEN_COOKIE_NAME);\n\t\t\tawait deps.authService.logout(refreshToken);\n\t\t\tclearAuthCookies(c);\n\t\t\treturn c.json({ ok: true });\n\t\t})\n\t\t.get(\"/me\", async (c) => {\n\t\t\tconst authUser = getAuthContextUser(c);\n\t\t\tconst user = await deps.authService.findUserById(authUser.userId);\n\t\t\tif (!user?.isActive) {\n\t\t\t\tthrow new HttpError(401, \"Unauthorized\");\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\treturn c.json({\n\t\t\t\tuser: {\n\t\t\t\t\tid: user.id,\n\t\t\t\t\temail: user.email,\n\t\t\t\t\tdisplayName: us"},{"path":"api/routes/bbs.route.test.ts","excerpt":"import { Hono } from \"hono\";\nimport { HttpError } from \"../modules/auth/errors\";\nimport { afterEach, describe, expect, it, vi } from \"vitest\";\nimport { createBbsRoute } from \"./bbs.route\";\nimport { posts, threads } from \"../db/schema\";\ntype ThreadRow = {\n\tid: number;\n\ttitle: string;\n\tcreatedAt: Date;\n\tupdatedAt: Date;\n\tlastPostAt: Date;\n\treplyCount: number;\n};\ntype PostRow = {\n\tid: number;\n\tthreadId: number;\n\tparentPostId: number | null;\n\tauthorName: string;\n\tbody: string;\n\tcreatedAt: Date;\n\tupdatedAt: Date;\n};\nfunction createFakeDb(options?: {\n\tfailThreadInsert?: boolean;\n\tfailParentLookup?: boolean;\n}) {\n\tconst state = {\n\t\tthreadId: 0,\n\t\tpostId: 0,\n\t\tthreads: [] as ThreadRow[],\n\t\tposts: [] as PostRow[],\n\t};\n\tconst select = (selection?: Record<string, unknown>) => ({\n\t\tfrom(table: unknown) {\n\t\t\tif (table === threads) {\n\t\t\t\tconst build = (predicate?: unknown) => ({\n\t\t\t\t\tget: async () =>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tstate.threads.find((thread) =>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tmatchThreadPredicate(thread, predicate),\n\t\t\t\t\t\t) ?? null,\n\t\t\t\t\tall: async () =>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t[...state.threads]\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t.sort((a, b) => b.lastPostAt.getTime() - a.lastPostAt.getTime())\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t.map((thread) => ({\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tid: thread.id,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\ttitle: thread.title,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tcreatedAt: thread.createdAt,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tupdatedAt: thread.updatedAt,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tlastPostAt: thread.lastPostAt,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\treplyCount: thread.replyCount,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t})),\n\t\t\t\t});\n\t\t\t\treturn {\n\t\t\t\t\twhere: (predicate?: unknown) => build(predicate),\n\t\t\t\t\torderBy: () => build(),\n\t\t\t\t};\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\tconst build = (predicate?: unknown) => {\n\t\t\t\tconst rows = state.posts.filter((post) =>\n\t\t\t\t\tmatchPostPredicate(post, predicate, options?.failParentLookup),\n\t\t\t\t);\n\t\t\t\tconst query = {\n\t\t\t\t\tget: async () => rows[0] ?? null,\n\t\t\t\t\tall: async () =>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t[...rows].sort((a, b) => a.createdAt.getTime() - b.createdAt.getTi"},{"path":"api/routes/bbs.route.ts","excerpt":"import { zValidator } from \"@hono/zod-validator\";\nimport { and, asc, desc, eq } from \"drizzle-orm\";\nimport { Hono } from \"hono\";\nimport { z } from \"zod\";\nimport type { AppDatabase } from \"../db\";\nimport { posts, threads } from \"../db/schema\";\nimport { HttpError } from \"../modules/auth/errors\";\ntype BbsRouteDeps = {\n\tdb: AppDatabase;\n};\nconst threadCreateSchema = z.object({\n\ttitle: z.string().trim().min(1).max(120),\n\tbody: z.string().trim().min(1).max(4000),\n\tauthorName: z.string().trim().min(1).max(80).optional(),\n});\nconst replyCreateSchema = z.object({\n\tbody: z.string().trim().min(1).max(4000),\n\tauthorName: z.string().trim().min(1).max(80).optional(),\n\tparentPostId: z.number().int().positive().optional(),\n});\nasync function getThreadOrThrow(db: AppDatabase, id: number) {\n\tconst row = await db.select().from(threads).where(eq(threads.id, id)).get();\n\tif (!row) throw new HttpError(404, \"Thread not found\");\n\treturn row;\n}\nexport function createBbsRoute(deps: BbsRouteDeps) {\n\treturn new Hono()\n\t\t.get(\"/threads\", async (c) => {\n\t\t\tconst items = await deps.db\n\t\t\t\t.select({\n\t\t\t\t\tid: threads.id,\n\t\t\t\t\ttitle: threads.title,\n\t\t\t\t\tcreatedAt: threads.createdAt,\n\t\t\t\t\tupdatedAt: threads.updatedAt,\n\t\t\t\t\tlastPostAt: threads.lastPostAt,\n\t\t\t\t\treplyCount: threads.replyCount,\n\t\t\t\t})\n\t\t\t\t.from(threads)\n\t\t\t\t.orderBy(desc(threads.lastPostAt), desc(threads.createdAt))\n\t\t\t\t.all();\n\t\t\treturn c.json({ threads: items });\n\t\t})\n\t\t.get(\"/threads/:id\", async (c) => {\n\t\t\tconst id = Number(c.req.param(\"id\"));\n\t\t\tif (!Number.isInteger(id)) throw new HttpError(400, \"Invalid thread id\");\n\t\t\tconst thread = await getThreadOrThrow(deps.db, id);\n\t\t\tconst items = await deps.db\n\t\t\t\t.select({\n\t\t\t\t\tid: posts.id,\n\t\t\t\t\tthreadId: posts.threadId,\n\t\t\t\t\tparentPostId: posts.parentPostId,\n\t\t\t\t\tauthorName: posts.authorName"},{"path":"api/routes/health.route.test.ts","excerpt":"import { Hono } from \"hono\";\nimport { describe, expect, it } from \"vitest\";\nimport { createHealthRoute } from \"./health.route\";\ndescribe(\"health route\", () => {\n\tit(\"should return ok status\", async () => {\n\t\tconst app = new Hono().route(\"/health\", createHealthRoute());\n\t\tconst res = await app.request(\"/health\");\n\t\texpect(res.status).toBe(200);\n\t\tconst body = await res.json();\n\t\texpect(body).toEqual({\n\t\t\tstatus: \"ok\",\n\t\t\tservice: \"hono-standard\",\n\t\t});\n\t});\n});"},{"path":"api/routes/health.route.ts","excerpt":"import { Hono } from \"hono\";\nexport function createHealthRoute() {\n\treturn new Hono().get(\"/\", (c) => {\n\t\treturn c.json({ status: \"ok\", service: \"hono-standard\" });\n\t});\n}"},{"path":"api/routes/protected.route.test.ts","excerpt":"import { Hono } from \"hono\";\nimport { describe, expect, it } from \"vitest\";\nimport { createProtectedRoute } from \"./protected.route\";\ndescribe(\"protected route\", () => {\n\tit(\"returns the authenticated profile from context\", async () => {\n\t\tconst app = new Hono();\n\t\tapp.use(\"/protected/*\", async (c, next) => {\n\t\t\tc.set(\"authUser\", {\n\t\t\t\tuserId: \"a1a1a1a1-a1a1-41a1-a1a1-a1a1a1a1a1a1\",\n\t\t\t\temail: \"test@example.com\",\n\t\t\t\trole: \"member\",\n\t\t\t});\n\t\t\tawait next();\n\t\t});\n\t\tapp.route(\"/protected\", createProtectedRoute());\n\t\tconst res = await app.request(\"/protected/profile\");\n\t\tconst body = await res.json();\n\t\texpect(res.status).toBe(200);\n\t\texpect(body.profile).toEqual({\n\t\t\temail: \"test@example.com\",\n\t\t\trole: \"member\",\n\t\t});\n\t});\n});"},{"path":"api/routes/protected.route.ts","excerpt":"import { Hono } from \"hono\";\nimport type { ProtectedProfileResponse } from \"../../shared/schemas/protected.schema\";\nimport { getAuthContextUser } from \"../modules/auth/context\";\nexport function createProtectedRoute() {\n\treturn new Hono().get(\"/profile\", (c) => {\n\t\tconst authUser = getAuthContextUser(c);\n\t\tconst response = {\n\t\t\tprofile: {\n\t\t\t\temail: authUser.email,\n\t\t\t\trole: authUser.role,\n\t\t\t},\n\t\t} satisfies ProtectedProfileResponse;\n\t\treturn c.json(response);\n\t});\n}"},{"path":"web/src/App.tsx","excerpt":"import { QueryClient, QueryClientProvider } from \"@tanstack/react-query\";\nimport { RouterProvider } from \"@tanstack/react-router\";\nimport { router } from \"./router\";\nimport { ShowcaseSettingsProvider } from \"./showcase-settings-context\";\nconst queryClient = new QueryClient({\n\tdefaultOptions: {\n\t\tqueries: {\n\t\t\tretry: false,\n\t\t},\n\t},\n});\nexport function App() {\n\treturn (\n\t\t<QueryClientProvider client={queryClient}>\n\t\t\t<ShowcaseSettingsProvider>\n\t\t\t\t<RouterProvider router={router} />\n\t\t\t</ShowcaseSettingsProvider>\n\t\t</QueryClientProvider>\n\t);\n}"}],"llmContextFiles":[{"path":"LLM_CONTEXT.md","excerpt":"# LLM Context: Hono Standard\n\nこの文書は、`hono-standard` を clone した直後に作業入口を決めるための圧縮コンテキストです。現行 branch は local SQLite auth/showcase template です。RAG、pgvector、agentic search、wiki ingestion は含みません。\n\n## Repository Snapshot\n\n- Bun + Hono backend と React + Vite frontend を同一 origin で動かす template。\n- DB は local SQLite。Drizzle schema は `api/db/schema.ts`、migration は `drizzle/`。\n- Backend app composition は `api/app/hono.ts`、server bootstrap は `api/app/server.ts`。\n- DB runtime の public entry は `api/db/index.ts`。SQLite baseline は `api/db/sqlite.ts`、migration runner は `api/db/migrate.ts` から `api/db/migrate-sqlite.ts` を呼ぶ。\n- Frontend entry は `web/src/App.tsx`、router は `web/src/router.tsx`、API client は `web/src/api.ts`。\n- Auth 実装は `api/modules/auth/`、route は `api/routes/auth.route.ts`、login UI は `web/src/domains/auth/login-domain.tsx`。\n- Shared API schema/object は `shared/schemas/`。Backend は `zValidator`、frontend は `hono/client` + `AppType` で同じ契約を参照する。\n- Home と Showcase は未ログインでも表示する。ログイン状態がある場合だけ header に user chip と logout button を表示する。\n- Protected sample は `/protected` と `/api/protected/profile`。frontend guard と server-side `requireAuth` の両方を示す。\n- Package manager / runtime は Bun。dev server は `bunx --bun vite` で起動する。\n- Quality gates は `bun run verify` と `bun run verify:e2e`。CI も同じ入口を使う。\n- `main` は SQLite baseline。Turso / PostgreSQL / pgvector は `variant/*` branch で driver、schema、migration、docs、smoke setup を差し替える。\n\n## Top-Level Map\n\n| Path | Role |\n| --- | --- |\n| `api/app/hono.ts` | Hono middleware、API route、static fallback、`AppType` export |\n| `api/app/server.ts` | Bun server bootstrap |\n| `api/app/env.ts` | environment parsing and defaults |\n| `api/config/appDefaults.ts` | non-secret app defaults |\n| `api/db/index.ts` | DB runtime public entry and variant boundary |\n| `api/db/sqlite.ts` | SQLite baseline Drizzle runtime |\n| `api/db/migrate.ts` | migration runner public entry |\n| `api/db/migrate-sqlite.ts` | SQLite baseline migration runner |\n| `api/db/schema.ts` | SQLite baseline Drizzle schema |\n| `api/routes/auth.route.ts` | `/api/auth/*` route module |\n| `api/routes/health.route.ts` | health route |\n| `api/routes/protected.route.ts` | server-side protected API sample |\n| `api/modules/auth/` | Auth service、JWT、cookies、password hashing |\n| `api/middleware/auth.ts` | access-token auth middleware |\n| `shared/schemas/` | Zod schema and public API object types shared by api and web |\n| `web/src/App.tsx` | React Query and Router providers |\n| `web/src/router.tsx` | TanStack Router tree |\n| `web/src/api.ts` | browser API client and auth refresh handling |\n| `web/src/auth-context.tsx` | frontend auth state |\n| `web/src/routes/` | route definitions |\n| `web/src/views/` | Home/Login/Showcase views |\n| `web/src/showcase-*` | showcase state and URL search helpers |\n| `drizzle/` | SQL migrations |\n| `scripts/verify.ts` | verification pipeline |\n| `scripts/e2e-server.ts` | Playwright smoke server with isolated SQLite DB |\n| `tests/e2e/` | Playwright smoke tests |\n| `.github/workflows/verify.yml` | CI verification |\n| `Dockerfile`, `docker-compose.yml` | Optional SQLite baseline container runtime |\n\n## Task Routing\n\n| Task | Start here | Usually also read | Defer unless touched |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Change auth API | `api/routes/auth.route.ts`, `api/modules/auth/`, `api/middleware/auth.ts`, `shared/schemas/auth.schema.ts` | `web/src/api.ts`, `web/src/auth-context.tsx` | showcase UI |\n| Change protected sample | `api/routes/protected.route.ts`, `web/src/views/protected-view.tsx`, `web/src/routes/protected-route.tsx` | `api/middleware/auth.ts`, `shared/schemas/protected.schema.ts`, `web/src/api.ts` | showcase UI |\n| Change login UI | `web/src/views/login-view.tsx`, `web/src/domains/auth/login-domain.tsx` | `web/src/auth-context.tsx`, `web/src/api.ts` | DB schema |\n| Change app shell/routing | `web/src/routes/root-route.tsx`, `web/src/router.tsx` | `web/src/App.tsx`, affected view | auth service internals |\n| Change showcase UI | `web/src/views/showcase-view.tsx`, `web/src/showcase-settings-context.tsx`, `web/src/showcase-table-search.ts` | `web/src/styles.css` | backend auth |\n| Change env/config | `api/app/env.ts`, `api/config/appDefaults.ts`, `.env.example` | `drizzle.config.ts`, Docker/Compose if bind host or port changes | frontend views |\n| Change DB runtime/variant boundary | `api/db/index.ts`, `api/db/sqlite.ts`, `api/db/migrate.ts`, `api/db/migrate-sqlite.ts` | `api/cli/migrate.ts`, `api/cli/auth-create-admin.ts`, `docs/template-variant-management.md` | showcase UI |\n| Change DB schema/migration | `api/db/schema.ts`, `drizzle/`, `api/db/migrate*.ts` | `api/modules/auth/auth.service.ts`, `api/modules/auth/token.service.ts` | showcase UI |\n| Change build/dev tooling | `package.json`, `vite.config.ts`, `vitest.config.ts`, `playwright.config.ts`, `scripts/verify.ts` | `.github/workflows/verify.yml`, failing config-specific output | feature code |\n| Change docs | `README.md`, `LLM_CONTEXT.md`, `docs/` | `.gitignore` when generated output changes | feature code |\n\n## Styling / CSS Architecture\n\nUI 変更では、この節を styling 判断の入口にする。まず全 CSS を広く探索せず、以下の entrypoint と pattern source で説明できるか確認する。\n\n- Global style entrypoint: `web/src/styles.css`。Tailwind v4 の `@import \"tailwindcss\"`、`@theme` token、`@layer base`、`@layer components` をこの1ファイルに集約している。\n- CSS load path: `web/src/main.tsx` が `./styles.css` を import する。Tailwind plugin は `vite.config.ts` の `@tailwindcss/vite`。\n- Design tokens / theme values: `web/src/styles.css` の `@theme` が global token の source of truth。`--color-*` と `--radius-*` を Tailwind utility / `@apply` から使う。\n- Showcase theme values: `web/src/showcase-settings-context.tsx` が `--showcase-*` custom properties を生成し、`web/src/styles.css` の `.showcase-shell` と `:root[data-showcase-page-theme]` rules がそれを消費する。\n- Shared UI components and common patterns: `web/src/styles.css` の `.topbar`, `.menu-*`, `.auth-*`, `.home-*`, `.center-shell`, `.signed-in-panel`, `.showcase-*`, `.demo-*`, `.table-*` class families。\n- Page a"}],"recentCommitDiffs":[],"packageScripts":[{"name":"auth:create-admin","command":"bun run api/cli/auth-create-admin.ts"},{"name":"bootstrap","command":"bun scripts/bootstrap.ts"},{"name":"build","command":"bun run build:web"},{"name":"build:web","command":"vite build"},{"name":"db:generate","command":"drizzle-kit generate"},{"name":"db:migrate","command":"bun run api/cli/migrate.ts"},{"name":"db:migrate:drizzle","command":"drizzle-kit migrate"},{"name":"dev","command":"bunx --bun vite"},{"name":"dev:vite","command":"vite"},{"name":"format","command":"biome format --write api web shared scripts tests drizzle.config.ts playwright.config.ts vite.config.ts vitest.config.ts"},{"name":"format:check","command":"biome format api web shared scripts tests drizzle.config.ts playwright.config.ts vite.config.ts vitest.config.ts"},{"name":"lint","command":"biome lint api web shared scripts tests drizzle.config.ts playwright.config.ts vite.config.ts vitest.config.ts"},{"name":"seed:dev","command":"bun scripts/seed-dev.ts"},{"name":"start","command":"bun run api/app/server.ts"},{"name":"test","command":"vitest run"},{"name":"test:coverage","command":"vitest run --coverage"},{"name":"test:e2e","command":"playwright test"},{"name":"test:watch","command":"vitest"},{"name":"typecheck","command":"tsc --noEmit"},{"name":"verify","command":"bun scripts/verify.ts"},{"name":"verify:all","command":"bun run verify && bun run verify:e2e"},{"name":"verify:e2e","command":"bun run test:e2e"},{"name":"verify:strict","command":"bun run verify"}],"moduleOntology":null},"qualityCapabilities":{"projectType":"typescript","commands":[{"kind":"unit","source":"package_json","command":"bun run ''test''","runnable":true},{"kind":"coverage","source":"package_json","command":"bun run ''test:coverage''","runnable":true},{"kind":"e2e","source":"package_json","command":"bun run ''test:e2e''","runnable":true},{"kind":"verify","source":"package_json","command":"bun run ''verify''","runnable":true}],"missingCapabilities":[]},"recentTokenSpendTasks":[{"taskId":"3c40e22b-fbe5-48a1-ba92-64f990e589fd","title":"BBSを作りたいです。計画してください。","totalTokens":8468677,"callCount":8}],"recentRuns":{"completed":1,"failed":0,"running":0}}','{"role":"mission_task_generation","providerId":"codex","providerEndpointId":"ep_2a9c67769830da1e","routeSource":"primary","modelOrDeployment":"gpt-5.4-mini","thinkingDepth":null}','{"schemaVersion":"nightworkers.mission-task-candidates/v1","candidates":[{"title":"todo list 機能の初期実装計画を作成する","summary":"Hono + React + SQLite のテンプレート上に、使いやすい todo list の本体機能をどう載せるかを Plan Mode で確定する入口候補です。UI、保存方式、完了状態、編集削除、検証方針は未確定要素として整理します。","rationale":"repositorySnapshot は minimal Hono + React template であり、現時点の sourceFiles / llmContextFiles には auth / protected / showcase / bbs はあるものの todo list 本体は見当たりません。したがって Goal 本体の初期実装を直接進める前に、機能境界と実装方針を決める入口が最優先です。","goalId":"de3305e2-2269-4765-a117-5dd36de101e2","candidateKind":"feature_entrypoint","moduleRouting":{"primaryModule":null,"secondaryModules":["web/src","api/routes","api/db","shared/schemas"],"confidencePercent":24,"reason":"moduleOntology がなく、todo domain の既存実装も見当たらないため未判定です。テンプレート上では frontend route / backend route / schema / shared contract の横断が想定されます。"},"constraintGoalIds":[],"planModeOpenQuestions":["todo list の画面構成をどうするか。単一画面で完結させるか、一覧・詳細・編集を分けるか。","todo item に持たせるデータ項目をどうするか。例: title, memo, due date, priority, tags, status, order。","保存方式をどうするか。SQLite のどのテーブルで管理するか、既存 auth / bbs と分離するか、共有するか。","完了状態をどう表現するか。単純な done / undone か、アーカイブや削除と分けるか。","編集・削除・並べ替えをどこまで Plan の対象に含めるか。","検証方針をどうするか。unit, integration, e2e のどれを必須にするか。"],"evidence":[{"source":"mission_goal","label":"goalText","value":"考えられる最も使いやすいtodolistを作る"},{"source":"project_evaluation","label":"overallScore","value":"72"},{"source":"project_evaluation","label":"uiUx","value":"69"},{"source":"project_evaluation","label":"conceptValue","value":"78"},{"source":"quality","label":"e2e","value":"passed 2/2"},{"source":"llm_usage","label":"repositorySnapshot.description","value":"Minimal Hono + React template with optional login and showcase screens."},{"source":"llm_usage","label":"llmContextFiles","value":"auth / protected / showcase / bbs はあるが todo list 本体の実装は示されていない"}],"evaluationContribution":18,"importancePercent":98,"confidencePercent":87,"tokenSize":"medium","complexity":"moderate","taskPrompt":"todo list 機能の初期実装計画を作成してください。現状の repository は Hono + React + SQLite のテンプレートで、auth / protected / showcase / bbs はありますが、todo list 本体は見当たりません。まず Plan Mode で、どの画面を持つか、どの data model にするか、SQLite にどう保存するか、完了状態をどう扱うか、編集・削除・並べ替えをどう扱うか、検証方針をどうするかを決める前提で進めてください。\\n\\n既知の前提: 同一 origin の Web app template、backend は Hono、frontend は React + Vite、DB は local SQLite、shared schema は `shared/schemas/`、検証入口は `bun run verify` と `bun run verify:e2e` です。\\n\\n未確定の仕様は固定しないでください。UI の粒度、todo の項目、完了/未完了以外の状態、保存の粒度、削除の扱い、タブやフィルタの有無、E2E の対象範囲は Plan Mode で定義してください。\\n\\n期待成果は、todo list の初期実装に必要な UI / API / schema / migration / route / validation の実装方針が明確になり、以後の実装タスクに分解できることです。最終的には既存のテンプレート構成と整合する設計にしてください。","acceptanceCriteria":"todo list 機能をこの repo に載せるための初期実装計画が、既存テンプレート構成を前提に整理されていること。UI、データモデル、保存方式、完了状態、編集削除、検証方針について未確定項目が明示され、勝手に固定されていないこと。","verificationPlan":"Plan Mode で確定した後に、必要な route / schema / UI / migration / test の実装タスクへ分解し、`bun run verify` と `bun run verify:e2e` を通す前提で進めてください。"}]}',NULL,1783214645,1783214678);
INSERT INTO "mission_task_candidate_batches" ("id", "created_at", "updated_at", "repository_id", "status", "requested_goal_ids_json", "signal_snapshot_json", "selected_model_json", "raw_output_json", "error_message", "started_at", "completed_at") VALUES('7dcd54d2-ae1f-45f0-9a7e-92a6ed67e69a',1783215352,1783215394,'984c8844-643e-4596-93a5-703a8d14a1e0','completed','["de3305e2-2269-4765-a117-5dd36de101e2"]','{"repository":{"id":"984c8844-643e-4596-93a5-703a8d14a1e0","name":"todolist","localPath":"/Users/y.noguchi/Code/todolist","branch":"main"},"activeGoals":[{"id":"de3305e2-2269-4765-a117-5dd36de101e2","title":"todo listを作る","goalText":"考えられる最も使いやすいtodolistを作る","interpretation":{"scope":"unknown","intent":"unknown","source":"unknown","confidencePercent":0,"reason":null}}],"latestEvaluation":{"id":"a9ff9b87-ada3-43cb-bc45-88b80d8b8644","overallScore":72,"dimensions":[{"key":"conceptValue","score":78,"label":"コンセプト価値"},{"key":"architectureQuality","score":80,"label":"アーキテクチャ"},{"key":"extensibility","score":74,"label":"拡張性"},{"key":"uiUx","score":69,"label":"UI / UX"},{"key":"operability","score":76,"label":"運用性"},{"key":"security","score":71,"label":"セキュリティ"},{"key":"maintainability","score":79,"label":"保守性"},{"key":"marketCompetitiveness","score":66,"label":"市場競争力"}],"summary":"Hono + React + SQLite を同一 origin でまとめたテンプレートとしては、認証、保護ルート、共有 schema、検証ゲートまで揃っており、実運用の土台として成立している。BBS ルートや thread 系 UI も repo tree に見えるため、単なる starter を越えて複数ドメインを載せる余地がある一方、評価根拠は repo structure と README/LLM_CONTEXT に限られるため、実装の細部と実行時品質は過大評価しない。"},"latestQuality":{"coverage":null,"e2e":{"status":"passed","total":2,"passed":2,"failed":0,"skipped":0,"durationMs":1170,"suites":[{"title":"smoke.spec.ts","status":"passed","tests":2,"durationMs":1170,"lastFailure":null}]}},"repositorySnapshot":{"packageName":"hono-standard","description":"Minimal Hono + React template with optional login and showcase screens.","readmeExcerpt":"# Hono Standard\n\n[![Bun](https://img.shields.io/badge/Bun-%23000000.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=bun&logoColor=white)](https://bun.sh/)\n[![Hono](https://img.shields.io/badge/Hono-%23E36022.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=hono&logoColor=white)](https://hono.dev/)\n[![React](https://img.shields.io/badge/React-%2320232a.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=react&logoColor=%2361DAFB)](https://react.dev/)\n[![SQLite](https://img.shields.io/badge/SQLite-003B57.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=sqlite&logoColor=white)](https://www.sqlite.org/)\n[![TypeScript](https://img.shields.io/badge/TypeScript-%23007ACC.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=typescript&logoColor=white)](https://www.typescriptlang.org/)\n[![MIT License](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-green.svg?style=for-the-badge)](LICENSE.md)\n\nHono backend と React + Vite frontend を同一 origin で動かす、local SQLite 対応の Web app template です。Drizzle のユーザー認証、httpOnly Cookie による access / refresh token、React Router ベースの画面、コンポーネント showcase を含みます。\n\n## 構成\n\n| Path | Role |\n| --- | --- |\n| `api/app/hono.ts` | Hono app composition。middleware、API route、静的配信、`AppType` を登録 |\n| `api/app/server.ts` | Bun server bootstrap |\n| `api/app/env.ts` | runtime env parser |\n| `api/config/appDefaults.ts` | 非シークレットの既定値 |\n| `api/db/index.ts` | DB runtime の public entry。variant はここから差し替える |\n| `api/db/sqlite.ts` | SQLite baseline の Drizzle runtime |\n| `api/db/schema.ts` | Drizzle SQLite schema |\n| `api/db/migrate.ts` | migration runner の public entry |\n| `api/db/migrate-sqlite.ts` | SQLite baseline の migration runner |\n| `api/routes/auth.route.ts` | `/api/auth/*` route |\n| `api/routes/health.route.ts` | `/api/health` route |\n| `api/routes/protected.route.ts` | `/api/protected/*` の server-side protected sample |\n| `api/modules/auth/` | password hash、JWT、cookie、auth service |\n| `api/middleware/auth.ts` | protected API middleware |\n| `web/src/` | React frontend |\n| `shared/schemas/` | frontend/backend で共有する Zod schema と API object type |\n| `drizzle/` | SQL migrations |\n| `scripts/verify.ts` | typecheck / lint / format / test / coverage / build の検証 pipeline |\n\n## 前提\n\n| Tool | 用途 |\n| --- | --- |\n| Bun | package manager、runtime、scripts |\n| SQLite | auth user / refresh token storage |\n\n## セットアップ\n\n```bash\nbun run bootstrap\nbun run auth:create-admin -- --email admin@example.com --name \"Admin User\"\nbun run dev\n```\n\n`bootstrap` は `.env` を用意し、dependency が未導入なら `bun install --frozen-lockfile` を実行し、SQLite database に migration を適用します。\n\n`auth:create-admin` は対話で password を読みます。自動化する場合は次のように標準入力から渡せます。\n\n```bash\nprintf ''%s\\n'' ''<password>'' | bun run auth:create-admin -- --email admin@example.com --name \"Admin User\" --password-stdin\n```\n\n開発サーバーは `http://localhost:5173` で起動します。Vite dev server が frontend を配信し、`/api/*` は Hono に渡されます。\n\n初回 clone 後に template の動作確認まで済ませる場合は、次を実行します。\n\n```bash\nbun run verify\nbun run verify:e2e\n```\n\n認証を使う app では `auth:create-admin` または `seed:dev` で admin を作成してから `/login` を確認します。認証を使わない app では、この README 後半の auth removal checklist に沿って auth route、DB table、login/protected screen、E2E scope をまとめて削ります。\n\n## 生成物と管理対象\n\nこの template では、source と docs は追跡し、local runtime や検証の生成物は追跡しません。\n\n| Path / Pattern | 扱い |\n| --- | --- |\n| `drizzle/*.sql` | Drizzle migration source。commit 対象 |\n| `.env.example` | local development の雛形。commit 対象 |\n| `.env*` | local secret / runtime env。`.env.example` 以外は commit しない |\n| `data/`, `*.db`, `*.sqlite`, `*.sqlite3` | local SQLite database。commit しない |\n| `coverage/`, `playwright-report/`, `test-results/` | verification output。commit しない |\n| `dist/`, `dist-web/`, `build/`, `*.tgz` | build / archive output。commit しない |\n\n## 環境変数\n\n非シークレットの既定値は `api/config/appDefaults.ts` にあります。`.env.example` は local development 向けの値です。\n\n| Variable | Required | Description | Default |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `NODE_ENV` | no | `development` / `test` / `production` | `development` |\n| `HOST` | no | HTTP bind host。container では `0.0.0.0` を指定 | `127.0.0.1` |\n| `PORT` | no | HTTP server port | `5173` |\n| `DATABASE_URL` | no | SQLite database ","sourceFiles":["LLM_CONTEXT.md","README.md","api/app/env.test.ts","api/app/env.ts","api/app/hono.test.ts","api/app/hono.ts","api/app/security-headers.ts","api/app/server.ts","api/cli/auth-create-admin.ts","api/cli/cli-contract.test.ts","api/cli/migrate.ts","api/config/appDefaults.ts","api/db/index.ts","api/db/migrate-sqlite.ts","api/db/migrate.ts","api/db/path.test.ts","api/db/path.ts","api/db/schema.ts","api/db/sqlite.ts","api/middleware/auth.test.ts","api/middleware/auth.ts","api/modules/auth/auth-cookies.test.ts","api/modules/auth/auth-cookies.ts","api/modules/auth/auth.service.test.ts","api/modules/auth/auth.service.ts","api/modules/auth/context.test.ts","api/modules/auth/context.ts","api/modules/auth/errors.test.ts","api/modules/auth/errors.ts","api/modules/auth/password.test.ts","api/modules/auth/password.ts","api/modules/auth/token.service.test.ts","api/modules/auth/token.service.ts","api/modules/auth/types.test.ts","api/modules/auth/types.ts","api/routes/auth.route.test.ts","api/routes/auth.route.ts","api/routes/bbs.route.test.ts","api/routes/bbs.route.ts","api/routes/health.route.test.ts","api/routes/health.route.ts","api/routes/protected.route.test.ts","api/routes/protected.route.ts","api/types/hono-context.d.ts","biome.json","docs/template-variant-management.md","drizzle.config.ts","drizzle/0001_auth.sql","drizzle/0002_bbs.sql","package.json","playwright.config.ts","scripts/bootstrap.test.ts","scripts/bootstrap.ts","scripts/e2e-server.ts","scripts/seed-dev.ts","scripts/verify.ts","shared/schemas/auth.schema.ts","shared/schemas/protected.schema.test.ts","shared/schemas/protected.schema.ts","tests/e2e/smoke.spec.ts","tsconfig.build.json","tsconfig.json","vite.config.ts","vitest.config.ts","web/src/App.tsx","web/src/api.test.ts","web/src/api.ts","web/src/auth-context.tsx","web/src/components/dev-error-panel.tsx","web/src/domains/auth/login-domain.tsx","web/src/main.tsx","web/src/router.tsx","web/src/routes/home-route.tsx","web/src/routes/login-route.tsx","web/src/routes/login-search.ts","web/src/routes/protected-route.tsx","web/src/routes/root-route.tsx","web/src/routes/route-access.test.ts","web/src/routes/route-access.ts","web/src/routes/showcase-route.tsx","web/src/routes/thread-detail-route.tsx","web/src/routes/thread-new-route.tsx","web/src/routes/threads-route.tsx","web/src/showcase-settings-context.tsx","web/src/showcase-table-search.ts","web/src/styles.css","web/src/views/home-view.tsx","web/src/views/login-view.tsx","web/src/views/protected-view.tsx","web/src/views/showcase-view.tsx","web/src/views/thread-detail-view.tsx","web/src/views/thread-new-view.tsx","web/src/views/threads-view.tsx"],"routeFiles":["api/routes/auth.route.test.ts","api/routes/auth.route.ts","api/routes/bbs.route.test.ts","api/routes/bbs.route.ts","api/routes/health.route.test.ts","api/routes/health.route.ts","api/routes/protected.route.test.ts","api/routes/protected.route.ts","web/src/routes/home-route.tsx","web/src/routes/login-route.tsx","web/src/routes/login-search.ts","web/src/routes/protected-route.tsx","web/src/routes/root-route.tsx","web/src/routes/route-access.test.ts","web/src/routes/route-access.ts","web/src/routes/showcase-route.tsx","web/src/routes/thread-detail-route.tsx","web/src/routes/thread-new-route.tsx","web/src/routes/threads-route.tsx","web/src/views/home-view.tsx","web/src/views/login-view.tsx","web/src/views/protected-view.tsx","web/src/views/showcase-view.tsx","web/src/views/thread-detail-view.tsx","web/src/views/thread-new-view.tsx","web/src/views/threads-view.tsx"],"migrationFiles":["drizzle/0001_auth.sql","drizzle/0002_bbs.sql"],"sourceExcerpts":[{"path":"README.md","excerpt":"# Hono Standard\n[![Bun](https://img.shields.io/badge/Bun-%23000000.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=bun&logoColor=white)](https://bun.sh/)\n[![Hono](https://img.shields.io/badge/Hono-%23E36022.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=hono&logoColor=white)](https://hono.dev/)\n[![React](https://img.shields.io/badge/React-%2320232a.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=react&logoColor=%2361DAFB)](https://react.dev/)\n[![SQLite](https://img.shields.io/badge/SQLite-003B57.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=sqlite&logoColor=white)](https://www.sqlite.org/)\n[![TypeScript](https://img.shields.io/badge/TypeScript-%23007ACC.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=typescript&logoColor=white)](https://www.typescriptlang.org/)\n[![MIT License](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-green.svg?style=for-the-badge)](LICENSE.md)\nHono backend と React + Vite frontend を同一 origin で動かす、local SQLite 対応の Web app template です。Drizzle のユーザー認証、httpOnly Cookie による access / refresh token、React Router ベースの画面、コンポーネント showcase を含みます。\n## 構成\n| Path | Role |\n| --- | --- |\n| `api/app/hono.ts` | Hono app composition。middleware、API route、静的配信、`AppType` を登録 |\n| `api/app/server.ts` | Bun server bootstrap |\n| `api/app/env.ts` | runtime env parser |\n| `api/config/appDefaults.ts` | 非シークレットの既定値 |\n| `api/db/index.ts` | DB runtime の public entry。variant はここから差し替える |\n| `api/db/sqlite.ts` | SQLite baseline の Drizzle runtime |\n| `api/db/schema.ts` | Drizzle SQLite schema |\n| `api/db/migrate.ts` | migration runner の public entry |\n| `api/db/migrate-sqlite.ts` | SQLite baseline の migration runner |\n| `api/routes/auth.route.ts` | `/api/auth/*` route |\n| `api/routes/health.route.ts` | `/api/health` route |\n| `api/routes/protected.route.ts` | `/api/protected/*` の server-side protected sample |\n| `api/modules/auth/` | password hash、JWT、cookie、auth service |\n| `api/mi"},{"path":"api/app/env.test.ts","excerpt":"import { describe, expect, it } from \"vitest\";\nimport { APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS } from \"../config/appDefaults\";\nimport { readAppEnv } from \"./env\";\ndescribe(\"readAppEnv\", () => {\n\tit(\"uses minimal app defaults\", () => {\n\t\tconst env = readAppEnv({});\n\t\texpect(env.nodeEnv).toBe(\"development\");\n\t\texpect(env.host).toBe(APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS.host);\n\t\texpect(env.port).toBe(APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS.port);\n\t\texpect(env.databaseUrl).toBe(APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS.databaseUrl);\n\t\texpect(env.appUrl).toBe(APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS.appUrl);\n\t\texpect(env.corsOrigins).toEqual(APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS.corsOrigins);\n\t\texpect(env.cookieSameSite).toBe(APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS.cookieSameSite);\n\t});\n\tit(\"accepts database and auth runtime overrides\", () => {\n\t\tconst env = readAppEnv({\n\t\t\tHOST: \"0.0.0.0\",\n\t\t\tPORT: \"5174\",\n\t\t\tDATABASE_URL: \"tmp/test.sqlite\",\n\t\t\tJWT_SECRET: \"x\".repeat(32),\n\t\t\tAPP_URL: \"https://showcase.example.com\",\n\t\t\tCORS_ORIGINS: \"https://showcase.example.com,http://localhost:5173\",\n\t\t\tAUTH_COOKIE_SECURE: \"true\",\n\t\t\tAUTH_COOKIE_SAME_SITE: \"none\",\n\t\t\tSECURITY_HEADERS_MODE: \"https\",\n\t\t});\n\t\texpect(env.host).toBe(\"0.0.0.0\");\n\t\texpect(env.port).toBe(5174);\n\t\texpect(env.databaseUrl).toBe(\"tmp/test.sqlite\");\n\t\texpect(env.jwtSecret).toBe(\"x\".repeat(32));\n\t\texpect(env.appUrl).toBe(\"https://showcase.example.com\");\n\t\texpect(env.corsOrigins).toEqual([\n\t\t\t\"https://showcase.example.com\",\n\t\t\t\"http://localhost:5173\",\n\t\t]);\n\t\texpect(env.secureCookie).toBe(true);\n\t\texpect(env.cookieSameSite).toBe(\"none\");\n\t\texpect(env.securityHeadersMode).toBe(\"https\");\n\t});\n\tit(\"falls back to the SQLite default when a dev shell provides a connection URL\", () => {\n\t\tconst env = readAppEnv({\n\t\t\tDATABASE_URL: \"postgres://postgres:postgres@127.0.0.1:5432/app\",\n\t\t});\n\t\texpect(env.databaseUrl).toBe(APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS.databaseUrl);\n\t});\n\tit(\"rej"},{"path":"api/app/env.ts","excerpt":"import { z } from \"zod\";\nimport { APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS } from \"../config/appDefaults\";\nimport { isDatabaseConnectionUrl } from \"../db/path\";\nconst optionalTrimmedString = z.preprocess((value) => {\n\tif (typeof value !== \"string\") return value;\n\tconst trimmed = value.trim();\n\treturn trimmed.length > 0 ? trimmed : undefined;\n}, z.string().trim().optional());\nconst optionalUrl = z.preprocess((value) => {\n\tif (typeof value !== \"string\") return value;\n\tconst trimmed = value.trim();\n\treturn trimmed.length > 0 ? trimmed : undefined;\n}, z.string().url().optional());\nconst optionalBoolean = z.preprocess((value) => {\n\tif (typeof value === \"boolean\") return value;\n\tif (typeof value !== \"string\") return value;\n\tconst normalized = value.trim().toLowerCase();\n\tif (!normalized) return undefined;\n\tif ([\"1\", \"true\", \"yes\", \"on\"].includes(normalized)) return true;\n\tif ([\"0\", \"false\", \"no\", \"off\"].includes(normalized)) return false;\n\treturn value;\n}, z.boolean().optional());\nconst optionalPort = z.preprocess((value) => {\n\tif (typeof value === \"number\") return value;\n\tif (typeof value !== \"string\") return value;\n\tconst trimmed = value.trim();\n\treturn trimmed.length > 0 ? Number(trimmed) : undefined;\n}, z.number().int().min(1).max(65535).optional());\nconst optionalCookieSameSite = z.preprocess((value) => {\n\tif (typeof value !== \"string\") return value;\n\tconst normalized = value.trim().toLowerCase();\n\treturn normalized.length > 0 ? normalized : undefined;\n}, z.enum([\"lax\", \"strict\", \"none\"]).optional());\nconst optionalSecurityHeadersMode = z.preprocess(\n\t(value) => {\n\t\tif (typeof value !== \"string\") return value;\n\t\tconst normalized = value.trim().toLowerCase();\n\t\treturn normalized.length > 0 ? normalized : undefined;\n\t},\n\tz.enum([\"auto\", \"http\", \"https\"]).default(\"auto\"),\n);\nconst EnvSchema = z"},{"path":"api/app/hono.test.ts","excerpt":"import { describe, expect, it, vi, beforeEach } from \"vitest\";\nimport fs from \"node:fs/promises\";\nimport { HttpError } from \"../modules/auth/errors\";\nimport { HTTPException } from \"hono/http-exception\";\n// Mock environment and DB connection before importing app\nvi.mock(\"../db\", () => ({\n\tcreateDbRuntime: vi.fn().mockReturnValue({\n\t\tdb: {\n\t\t\tquery: {\n\t\t\t\tusers: {\n\t\t\t\t\tfindFirst: vi.fn(),\n\t\t\t\t},\n\t\t\t},\n\t\t},\n\t\tclose: vi.fn(),\n\t\tconnection: {\n\t\t\tclient: {\n\t\t\t\tclose: vi.fn(),\n\t\t\t},\n\t\t\townsConnection: false,\n\t\t},\n\t}),\n}));\nvi.mock(\"./env\", () => ({\n\treadAppEnv: vi.fn().mockReturnValue({\n\t\tnodeEnv: \"test\",\n\t\thost: \"127.0.0.1\",\n\t\tport: 5173,\n\t\tdatabaseUrl: \"mock.db\",\n\t\tjwtSecret: \"x\".repeat(32),\n\t\tjwtAccessExpiresIn: \"15m\",\n\t\tjwtRefreshExpiresIn: \"7d\",\n\t\tappUrl: \"http://localhost:5173\",\n\t\tcorsOrigins: [\"http://localhost:5173\"],\n\t\ttrustProxy: true,\n\t\tsecureCookie: false,\n\t\tcookieSameSite: \"lax\",\n\t\tsecurityHeadersMode: \"auto\",\n\t}),\n}));\n// Mock Bun global variable before importing hono/bun dependent code\n(globalThis as any).Bun = {\n\tfile: (path: string) => ({\n\t\texists: () => Promise.resolve(true),\n\t}),\n};\n// Dynamically import app so globalThis.Bun is defined first\nconst { default: app } = await import(\"./hono\");\n// Add test routes before any request is processed (Hono routers lock after first request)\napp.post(\"/api/test-http-error\", () => {\n\tthrow new HttpError(400, \"Bad Parameters\");\n});\napp.post(\"/api/test-hono-http-exception\", () => {\n\tthrow new HTTPException(403, { message: \"Access Forbidden\" });\n});\napp.post(\"/api/test-generic-error\", () => {\n\tthrow new Error(\"Something blew up\");\n});\ndescribe(\"hono app entry\", () => {\n\tbeforeEach(() => {\n\t\tvi.restoreAllMocks();\n\t});\n\tit(\"should return 200 for /api/health\", async () => {\n\t\tconst res = await app.request(\"/api/health\");\n\t\texp"},{"path":"api/app/hono.ts","excerpt":"import fs from \"node:fs/promises\";\nimport path from \"node:path\";\nimport { serveStatic } from \"hono/bun\";\nimport { csrf } from \"hono/csrf\";\nimport { Hono } from \"hono\";\nimport { cors } from \"hono/cors\";\nimport { logger } from \"hono/logger\";\nimport { HTTPException } from \"hono/http-exception\";\nimport { secureHeaders } from \"hono/secure-headers\";\nimport type { DbRuntime } from \"../db\";\nimport { createDbRuntime } from \"../db\";\nimport { requireAuth } from \"../middleware/auth\";\nimport { AuthService } from \"../modules/auth/auth.service\";\nimport { HttpError } from \"../modules/auth/errors\";\nimport { createBbsRoute } from \"../routes/bbs.route\";\nimport { createAuthRoute } from \"../routes/auth.route\";\nimport { createHealthRoute } from \"../routes/health.route\";\nimport { createProtectedRoute } from \"../routes/protected.route\";\nimport { readAppEnv, type AppEnv } from \"./env\";\nimport { appContentSecurityPolicy } from \"./security-headers\";\nexport type AppDeps = {\n\tenv: AppEnv;\n\tdbRuntime: DbRuntime;\n\tauthService: AuthService;\n};\ndeclare global {\n\tvar __honoStandardRuntime__: Promise<AppDeps> | undefined;\n}\nexport async function createDefaultAppDeps(): Promise<AppDeps> {\n\tconst env = readAppEnv();\n\tconst dbRuntime = createDbRuntime(env);\n\tconst authService = new AuthService(dbRuntime.db, env);\n\treturn { env, dbRuntime, authService };\n}\nexport async function getAppRuntime(): Promise<AppDeps> {\n\tif (!globalThis.__honoStandardRuntime__) {\n\t\tglobalThis.__honoStandardRuntime__ = createDefaultAppDeps().catch(\n\t\t\t(error) => {\n\t\t\t\tglobalThis.__honoStandardRuntime__ = undefined;\n\t\t\t\tthrow error;\n\t\t\t},\n\t\t);\n\t}\n\treturn globalThis.__honoStandardRuntime__;\n}\nconst distWebRoot = path.resolve(process.cwd(), \"dist-web\");\nconst distWebIndex = path.resolve(distWebRoot, \"index.html\");\nexport function creat"},{"path":"api/app/security-headers.ts","excerpt":"type CspDirectives = Record<string, string[]>;\nexport const appContentSecurityPolicy: CspDirectives = {\n\tdefaultSrc: [\"''self''\"],\n\tbaseUri: [\"''self''\"],\n\tconnectSrc: [\"''self''\"],\n\tfontSrc: [\"''self''\", \"data:\"],\n\tformAction: [\"''self''\"],\n\tframeAncestors: [\"''self''\"],\n\timgSrc: [\"''self''\", \"data:\", \"blob:\"],\n\tmanifestSrc: [\"''self''\"],\n\tobjectSrc: [\"''none''\"],\n\tscriptSrc: [\"''self''\"],\n\tstyleSrc: [\"''self''\", \"''unsafe-inline''\"],\n\tworkerSrc: [\"''self''\", \"blob:\"],\n};\nexport const viteDevContentSecurityPolicy: CspDirectives = {\n\t...appContentSecurityPolicy,\n\tconnectSrc: [\n\t\t\"''self''\",\n\t\t\"ws:\",\n\t\t\"http://localhost:5173\",\n\t\t\"http://127.0.0.1:5173\",\n\t],\n\tscriptSrc: [\"''self''\", \"''unsafe-inline''\", \"''unsafe-eval''\"],\n};\nconst toKebabCase = (value: string): string =>\n\tvalue.replace(/[A-Z]+(?![a-z])|[A-Z]/g, (match, offset) =>\n\t\toffset ? `-${match.toLowerCase()}` : match.toLowerCase(),\n\t);\nexport function serializeContentSecurityPolicy(policy: CspDirectives): string {\n\treturn Object.entries(policy)\n\t\t.map(\n\t\t\t([directive, values]) => `${toKebabCase(directive)} ${values.join(\" \")}`,\n\t\t)\n\t\t.join(\"; \");\n}"},{"path":"api/app/server.ts","excerpt":"import app, { getAppRuntime } from \"./hono\";\nimport { readAppEnv } from \"./env\";\nconst env = readAppEnv();\nconst server = Bun.serve({\n\tfetch: app.fetch,\n\thostname: env.host,\n\tport: env.port,\n});\nconsole.log(\n\t`Hono Standard server listening on http://${env.host}:${server.port}`,\n);\nconst shutdown = async (signal: string) => {\n\tconsole.log(`\\nReceived ${signal}. Shutting down gracefully...`);\n\tserver.stop(true);\n\ttry {\n\t\tconst runtime = await getAppRuntime();\n\t\tconsole.log(\"Closing database connection...\");\n\t\truntime.dbRuntime.close();\n\t\tconsole.log(\"Shutdown complete.\");\n\t\tprocess.exit(0);\n\t} catch (error) {\n\t\tconsole.error(\"Error during shutdown:\", error);\n\t\tprocess.exit(1);\n\t}\n};\nprocess.on(\"SIGINT\", () => shutdown(\"SIGINT\"));\nprocess.on(\"SIGTERM\", () => shutdown(\"SIGTERM\"));"},{"path":"api/routes/auth.route.test.ts","excerpt":"import { Hono } from \"hono\";\nimport { describe, expect, it, vi, beforeEach } from \"vitest\";\nimport { createAuthRoute } from \"./auth.route\";\nimport { requireAuth } from \"../middleware/auth\";\nimport type { AppEnv } from \"../app/env\";\nimport type { AuthService } from \"../modules/auth/auth.service\";\nimport { HttpError } from \"../modules/auth/errors\";\nimport {\n\tACCESS_TOKEN_COOKIE_NAME,\n\tREFRESH_TOKEN_COOKIE_NAME,\n} from \"../modules/auth/auth-cookies\";\ndescribe(\"auth route\", () => {\n\tlet app: Hono;\n\tlet mockAuthService: any;\n\tlet mockEnv: AppEnv;\n\tconst testUser = {\n\t\tid: \"a1a1a1a1-a1a1-41a1-a1a1-a1a1a1a1a1a1\",\n\t\temail: \"test@example.com\",\n\t\tdisplayName: \"Test User\",\n\t\trole: \"member\" as const,\n\t\tisActive: true,\n\t};\n\tbeforeEach(() => {\n\t\tmockEnv = {\n\t\t\tjwtSecret: \"x\".repeat(32),\n\t\t\tjwtAccessExpiresIn: \"15m\",\n\t\t\tjwtRefreshExpiresIn: \"7d\",\n\t\t\tsecureCookie: true,\n\t\t\tcookieSameSite: \"lax\",\n\t\t} as unknown as AppEnv;\n\t\tmockAuthService = {\n\t\t\tlogin: vi.fn(),\n\t\t\trefresh: vi.fn(),\n\t\t\tlogout: vi.fn(),\n\t\t\tfindUserById: vi.fn(),\n\t\t};\n\t\tapp = new Hono();\n\t\t// Set error handler to prevent throwing unhandled exceptions in tests\n\t\tapp.onError((err, c) => {\n\t\t\tconst status = (err as HttpError).status || 500;\n\t\t\treturn c.json({ message: err.message }, status as any);\n\t\t});\n\t\tapp.use(\n\t\t\t\"/auth/me\",\n\t\t\trequireAuth({\n\t\t\t\tenv: mockEnv,\n\t\t\t\tauthService: mockAuthService as unknown as AuthService,\n\t\t\t}),\n\t\t);\n\t\tapp.route(\n\t\t\t\"/auth\",\n\t\t\tcreateAuthRoute({\n\t\t\t\tauthService: mockAuthService as unknown as AuthService,\n\t\t\t\tenv: mockEnv,\n\t\t\t}),\n\t\t);\n\t});\n\tdescribe(\"POST /login\", () => {\n\t\tit(\"should login user with valid credentials and set cookies\", async () => {\n\t\t\tmockAuthService.login.mockResolvedValue({\n\t\t\t\taccessToken: \"access-token-123\",\n\t\t\t\trefreshToken: \"refresh-token-456\",\n\t\t\t\tuser: {\n\t\t\t\t\tid: te"},{"path":"api/routes/auth.route.ts","excerpt":"import { zValidator } from \"@hono/zod-validator\";\nimport { Hono } from \"hono\";\nimport { getCookie } from \"hono/cookie\";\nimport { loginSchema } from \"../../shared/schemas/auth.schema\";\nimport type { AppEnv } from \"../app/env\";\nimport type { AuthService } from \"../modules/auth/auth.service\";\nimport {\n\tREFRESH_TOKEN_COOKIE_NAME,\n\tclearAuthCookies,\n\tsetAuthCookies,\n} from \"../modules/auth/auth-cookies\";\nimport { getAuthContextUser } from \"../modules/auth/context\";\nimport { HttpError } from \"../modules/auth/errors\";\ntype AuthRouteDeps = {\n\tauthService: AuthService;\n\tenv: AppEnv;\n};\nexport function createAuthRoute(deps: AuthRouteDeps) {\n\treturn new Hono()\n\t\t.post(\"/login\", zValidator(\"json\", loginSchema), async (c) => {\n\t\t\tconst body = c.req.valid(\"json\");\n\t\t\tconst result = await deps.authService.login({\n\t\t\t\temail: body.email,\n\t\t\t\tpassword: body.password,\n\t\t\t});\n\t\t\tsetAuthCookies(c, deps.env, result);\n\t\t\treturn c.json({ user: result.user });\n\t\t})\n\t\t.post(\"/refresh\", async (c) => {\n\t\t\tconst refreshToken = getCookie(c, REFRESH_TOKEN_COOKIE_NAME);\n\t\t\tif (!refreshToken) {\n\t\t\t\tthrow new HttpError(401, \"Unauthorized\");\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\tconst result = await deps.authService.refresh(refreshToken);\n\t\t\tsetAuthCookies(c, deps.env, result);\n\t\t\treturn c.json({ user: result.user });\n\t\t})\n\t\t.post(\"/logout\", async (c) => {\n\t\t\tconst refreshToken = getCookie(c, REFRESH_TOKEN_COOKIE_NAME);\n\t\t\tawait deps.authService.logout(refreshToken);\n\t\t\tclearAuthCookies(c);\n\t\t\treturn c.json({ ok: true });\n\t\t})\n\t\t.get(\"/me\", async (c) => {\n\t\t\tconst authUser = getAuthContextUser(c);\n\t\t\tconst user = await deps.authService.findUserById(authUser.userId);\n\t\t\tif (!user?.isActive) {\n\t\t\t\tthrow new HttpError(401, \"Unauthorized\");\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\treturn c.json({\n\t\t\t\tuser: {\n\t\t\t\t\tid: user.id,\n\t\t\t\t\temail: user.email,\n\t\t\t\t\tdisplayName: us"},{"path":"api/routes/bbs.route.test.ts","excerpt":"import { Hono } from \"hono\";\nimport { HttpError } from \"../modules/auth/errors\";\nimport { afterEach, describe, expect, it, vi } from \"vitest\";\nimport { createBbsRoute } from \"./bbs.route\";\nimport { posts, threads } from \"../db/schema\";\ntype ThreadRow = {\n\tid: number;\n\ttitle: string;\n\tcreatedAt: Date;\n\tupdatedAt: Date;\n\tlastPostAt: Date;\n\treplyCount: number;\n};\ntype PostRow = {\n\tid: number;\n\tthreadId: number;\n\tparentPostId: number | null;\n\tauthorName: string;\n\tbody: string;\n\tcreatedAt: Date;\n\tupdatedAt: Date;\n};\nfunction createFakeDb(options?: {\n\tfailThreadInsert?: boolean;\n\tfailParentLookup?: boolean;\n}) {\n\tconst state = {\n\t\tthreadId: 0,\n\t\tpostId: 0,\n\t\tthreads: [] as ThreadRow[],\n\t\tposts: [] as PostRow[],\n\t};\n\tconst select = (selection?: Record<string, unknown>) => ({\n\t\tfrom(table: unknown) {\n\t\t\tif (table === threads) {\n\t\t\t\tconst build = (predicate?: unknown) => ({\n\t\t\t\t\tget: async () =>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tstate.threads.find((thread) =>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tmatchThreadPredicate(thread, predicate),\n\t\t\t\t\t\t) ?? null,\n\t\t\t\t\tall: async () =>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t[...state.threads]\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t.sort((a, b) => b.lastPostAt.getTime() - a.lastPostAt.getTime())\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t.map((thread) => ({\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tid: thread.id,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\ttitle: thread.title,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tcreatedAt: thread.createdAt,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tupdatedAt: thread.updatedAt,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tlastPostAt: thread.lastPostAt,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\treplyCount: thread.replyCount,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t})),\n\t\t\t\t});\n\t\t\t\treturn {\n\t\t\t\t\twhere: (predicate?: unknown) => build(predicate),\n\t\t\t\t\torderBy: () => build(),\n\t\t\t\t};\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\tconst build = (predicate?: unknown) => {\n\t\t\t\tconst rows = state.posts.filter((post) =>\n\t\t\t\t\tmatchPostPredicate(post, predicate, options?.failParentLookup),\n\t\t\t\t);\n\t\t\t\tconst query = {\n\t\t\t\t\tget: async () => rows[0] ?? null,\n\t\t\t\t\tall: async () =>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t[...rows].sort((a, b) => a.createdAt.getTime() - b.createdAt.getTi"},{"path":"api/routes/bbs.route.ts","excerpt":"import { zValidator } from \"@hono/zod-validator\";\nimport { and, asc, desc, eq } from \"drizzle-orm\";\nimport { Hono } from \"hono\";\nimport { z } from \"zod\";\nimport type { AppDatabase } from \"../db\";\nimport { posts, threads } from \"../db/schema\";\nimport { HttpError } from \"../modules/auth/errors\";\ntype BbsRouteDeps = {\n\tdb: AppDatabase;\n};\nconst threadCreateSchema = z.object({\n\ttitle: z.string().trim().min(1).max(120),\n\tbody: z.string().trim().min(1).max(4000),\n\tauthorName: z.string().trim().min(1).max(80).optional(),\n});\nconst replyCreateSchema = z.object({\n\tbody: z.string().trim().min(1).max(4000),\n\tauthorName: z.string().trim().min(1).max(80).optional(),\n\tparentPostId: z.number().int().positive().optional(),\n});\nasync function getThreadOrThrow(db: AppDatabase, id: number) {\n\tconst row = await db.select().from(threads).where(eq(threads.id, id)).get();\n\tif (!row) throw new HttpError(404, \"Thread not found\");\n\treturn row;\n}\nexport function createBbsRoute(deps: BbsRouteDeps) {\n\treturn new Hono()\n\t\t.get(\"/threads\", async (c) => {\n\t\t\tconst items = await deps.db\n\t\t\t\t.select({\n\t\t\t\t\tid: threads.id,\n\t\t\t\t\ttitle: threads.title,\n\t\t\t\t\tcreatedAt: threads.createdAt,\n\t\t\t\t\tupdatedAt: threads.updatedAt,\n\t\t\t\t\tlastPostAt: threads.lastPostAt,\n\t\t\t\t\treplyCount: threads.replyCount,\n\t\t\t\t})\n\t\t\t\t.from(threads)\n\t\t\t\t.orderBy(desc(threads.lastPostAt), desc(threads.createdAt))\n\t\t\t\t.all();\n\t\t\treturn c.json({ threads: items });\n\t\t})\n\t\t.get(\"/threads/:id\", async (c) => {\n\t\t\tconst id = Number(c.req.param(\"id\"));\n\t\t\tif (!Number.isInteger(id)) throw new HttpError(400, \"Invalid thread id\");\n\t\t\tconst thread = await getThreadOrThrow(deps.db, id);\n\t\t\tconst items = await deps.db\n\t\t\t\t.select({\n\t\t\t\t\tid: posts.id,\n\t\t\t\t\tthreadId: posts.threadId,\n\t\t\t\t\tparentPostId: posts.parentPostId,\n\t\t\t\t\tauthorName: posts.authorName"},{"path":"api/routes/health.route.test.ts","excerpt":"import { Hono } from \"hono\";\nimport { describe, expect, it } from \"vitest\";\nimport { createHealthRoute } from \"./health.route\";\ndescribe(\"health route\", () => {\n\tit(\"should return ok status\", async () => {\n\t\tconst app = new Hono().route(\"/health\", createHealthRoute());\n\t\tconst res = await app.request(\"/health\");\n\t\texpect(res.status).toBe(200);\n\t\tconst body = await res.json();\n\t\texpect(body).toEqual({\n\t\t\tstatus: \"ok\",\n\t\t\tservice: \"hono-standard\",\n\t\t});\n\t});\n});"},{"path":"api/routes/health.route.ts","excerpt":"import { Hono } from \"hono\";\nexport function createHealthRoute() {\n\treturn new Hono().get(\"/\", (c) => {\n\t\treturn c.json({ status: \"ok\", service: \"hono-standard\" });\n\t});\n}"},{"path":"api/routes/protected.route.test.ts","excerpt":"import { Hono } from \"hono\";\nimport { describe, expect, it } from \"vitest\";\nimport { createProtectedRoute } from \"./protected.route\";\ndescribe(\"protected route\", () => {\n\tit(\"returns the authenticated profile from context\", async () => {\n\t\tconst app = new Hono();\n\t\tapp.use(\"/protected/*\", async (c, next) => {\n\t\t\tc.set(\"authUser\", {\n\t\t\t\tuserId: \"a1a1a1a1-a1a1-41a1-a1a1-a1a1a1a1a1a1\",\n\t\t\t\temail: \"test@example.com\",\n\t\t\t\trole: \"member\",\n\t\t\t});\n\t\t\tawait next();\n\t\t});\n\t\tapp.route(\"/protected\", createProtectedRoute());\n\t\tconst res = await app.request(\"/protected/profile\");\n\t\tconst body = await res.json();\n\t\texpect(res.status).toBe(200);\n\t\texpect(body.profile).toEqual({\n\t\t\temail: \"test@example.com\",\n\t\t\trole: \"member\",\n\t\t});\n\t});\n});"},{"path":"api/routes/protected.route.ts","excerpt":"import { Hono } from \"hono\";\nimport type { ProtectedProfileResponse } from \"../../shared/schemas/protected.schema\";\nimport { getAuthContextUser } from \"../modules/auth/context\";\nexport function createProtectedRoute() {\n\treturn new Hono().get(\"/profile\", (c) => {\n\t\tconst authUser = getAuthContextUser(c);\n\t\tconst response = {\n\t\t\tprofile: {\n\t\t\t\temail: authUser.email,\n\t\t\t\trole: authUser.role,\n\t\t\t},\n\t\t} satisfies ProtectedProfileResponse;\n\t\treturn c.json(response);\n\t});\n}"},{"path":"web/src/App.tsx","excerpt":"import { QueryClient, QueryClientProvider } from \"@tanstack/react-query\";\nimport { RouterProvider } from \"@tanstack/react-router\";\nimport { router } from \"./router\";\nimport { ShowcaseSettingsProvider } from \"./showcase-settings-context\";\nconst queryClient = new QueryClient({\n\tdefaultOptions: {\n\t\tqueries: {\n\t\t\tretry: false,\n\t\t},\n\t},\n});\nexport function App() {\n\treturn (\n\t\t<QueryClientProvider client={queryClient}>\n\t\t\t<ShowcaseSettingsProvider>\n\t\t\t\t<RouterProvider router={router} />\n\t\t\t</ShowcaseSettingsProvider>\n\t\t</QueryClientProvider>\n\t);\n}"}],"llmContextFiles":[{"path":"LLM_CONTEXT.md","excerpt":"# LLM Context: Hono Standard\n\nこの文書は、`hono-standard` を clone した直後に作業入口を決めるための圧縮コンテキストです。現行 branch は local SQLite auth/showcase template です。RAG、pgvector、agentic search、wiki ingestion は含みません。\n\n## Repository Snapshot\n\n- Bun + Hono backend と React + Vite frontend を同一 origin で動かす template。\n- DB は local SQLite。Drizzle schema は `api/db/schema.ts`、migration は `drizzle/`。\n- Backend app composition は `api/app/hono.ts`、server bootstrap は `api/app/server.ts`。\n- DB runtime の public entry は `api/db/index.ts`。SQLite baseline は `api/db/sqlite.ts`、migration runner は `api/db/migrate.ts` から `api/db/migrate-sqlite.ts` を呼ぶ。\n- Frontend entry は `web/src/App.tsx`、router は `web/src/router.tsx`、API client は `web/src/api.ts`。\n- Auth 実装は `api/modules/auth/`、route は `api/routes/auth.route.ts`、login UI は `web/src/domains/auth/login-domain.tsx`。\n- Shared API schema/object は `shared/schemas/`。Backend は `zValidator`、frontend は `hono/client` + `AppType` で同じ契約を参照する。\n- Home と Showcase は未ログインでも表示する。ログイン状態がある場合だけ header に user chip と logout button を表示する。\n- Protected sample は `/protected` と `/api/protected/profile`。frontend guard と server-side `requireAuth` の両方を示す。\n- Package manager / runtime は Bun。dev server は `bunx --bun vite` で起動する。\n- Quality gates は `bun run verify` と `bun run verify:e2e`。CI も同じ入口を使う。\n- `main` は SQLite baseline。Turso / PostgreSQL / pgvector は `variant/*` branch で driver、schema、migration、docs、smoke setup を差し替える。\n\n## Top-Level Map\n\n| Path | Role |\n| --- | --- |\n| `api/app/hono.ts` | Hono middleware、API route、static fallback、`AppType` export |\n| `api/app/server.ts` | Bun server bootstrap |\n| `api/app/env.ts` | environment parsing and defaults |\n| `api/config/appDefaults.ts` | non-secret app defaults |\n| `api/db/index.ts` | DB runtime public entry and variant boundary |\n| `api/db/sqlite.ts` | SQLite baseline Drizzle runtime |\n| `api/db/migrate.ts` | migration runner public entry |\n| `api/db/migrate-sqlite.ts` | SQLite baseline migration runner |\n| `api/db/schema.ts` | SQLite baseline Drizzle schema |\n| `api/routes/auth.route.ts` | `/api/auth/*` route module |\n| `api/routes/health.route.ts` | health route |\n| `api/routes/protected.route.ts` | server-side protected API sample |\n| `api/modules/auth/` | Auth service、JWT、cookies、password hashing |\n| `api/middleware/auth.ts` | access-token auth middleware |\n| `shared/schemas/` | Zod schema and public API object types shared by api and web |\n| `web/src/App.tsx` | React Query and Router providers |\n| `web/src/router.tsx` | TanStack Router tree |\n| `web/src/api.ts` | browser API client and auth refresh handling |\n| `web/src/auth-context.tsx` | frontend auth state |\n| `web/src/routes/` | route definitions |\n| `web/src/views/` | Home/Login/Showcase views |\n| `web/src/showcase-*` | showcase state and URL search helpers |\n| `drizzle/` | SQL migrations |\n| `scripts/verify.ts` | verification pipeline |\n| `scripts/e2e-server.ts` | Playwright smoke server with isolated SQLite DB |\n| `tests/e2e/` | Playwright smoke tests |\n| `.github/workflows/verify.yml` | CI verification |\n| `Dockerfile`, `docker-compose.yml` | Optional SQLite baseline container runtime |\n\n## Task Routing\n\n| Task | Start here | Usually also read | Defer unless touched |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Change auth API | `api/routes/auth.route.ts`, `api/modules/auth/`, `api/middleware/auth.ts`, `shared/schemas/auth.schema.ts` | `web/src/api.ts`, `web/src/auth-context.tsx` | showcase UI |\n| Change protected sample | `api/routes/protected.route.ts`, `web/src/views/protected-view.tsx`, `web/src/routes/protected-route.tsx` | `api/middleware/auth.ts`, `shared/schemas/protected.schema.ts`, `web/src/api.ts` | showcase UI |\n| Change login UI | `web/src/views/login-view.tsx`, `web/src/domains/auth/login-domain.tsx` | `web/src/auth-context.tsx`, `web/src/api.ts` | DB schema |\n| Change app shell/routing | `web/src/routes/root-route.tsx`, `web/src/router.tsx` | `web/src/App.tsx`, affected view | auth service internals |\n| Change showcase UI | `web/src/views/showcase-view.tsx`, `web/src/showcase-settings-context.tsx`, `web/src/showcase-table-search.ts` | `web/src/styles.css` | backend auth |\n| Change env/config | `api/app/env.ts`, `api/config/appDefaults.ts`, `.env.example` | `drizzle.config.ts`, Docker/Compose if bind host or port changes | frontend views |\n| Change DB runtime/variant boundary | `api/db/index.ts`, `api/db/sqlite.ts`, `api/db/migrate.ts`, `api/db/migrate-sqlite.ts` | `api/cli/migrate.ts`, `api/cli/auth-create-admin.ts`, `docs/template-variant-management.md` | showcase UI |\n| Change DB schema/migration | `api/db/schema.ts`, `drizzle/`, `api/db/migrate*.ts` | `api/modules/auth/auth.service.ts`, `api/modules/auth/token.service.ts` | showcase UI |\n| Change build/dev tooling | `package.json`, `vite.config.ts`, `vitest.config.ts`, `playwright.config.ts`, `scripts/verify.ts` | `.github/workflows/verify.yml`, failing config-specific output | feature code |\n| Change docs | `README.md`, `LLM_CONTEXT.md`, `docs/` | `.gitignore` when generated output changes | feature code |\n\n## Styling / CSS Architecture\n\nUI 変更では、この節を styling 判断の入口にする。まず全 CSS を広く探索せず、以下の entrypoint と pattern source で説明できるか確認する。\n\n- Global style entrypoint: `web/src/styles.css`。Tailwind v4 の `@import \"tailwindcss\"`、`@theme` token、`@layer base`、`@layer components` をこの1ファイルに集約している。\n- CSS load path: `web/src/main.tsx` が `./styles.css` を import する。Tailwind plugin は `vite.config.ts` の `@tailwindcss/vite`。\n- Design tokens / theme values: `web/src/styles.css` の `@theme` が global token の source of truth。`--color-*` と `--radius-*` を Tailwind utility / `@apply` から使う。\n- Showcase theme values: `web/src/showcase-settings-context.tsx` が `--showcase-*` custom properties を生成し、`web/src/styles.css` の `.showcase-shell` と `:root[data-showcase-page-theme]` rules がそれを消費する。\n- Shared UI components and common patterns: `web/src/styles.css` の `.topbar`, `.menu-*`, `.auth-*`, `.home-*`, `.center-shell`, `.signed-in-panel`, `.showcase-*`, `.demo-*`, `.table-*` class families。\n- Page a"}],"recentCommitDiffs":[],"packageScripts":[{"name":"auth:create-admin","command":"bun run api/cli/auth-create-admin.ts"},{"name":"bootstrap","command":"bun scripts/bootstrap.ts"},{"name":"build","command":"bun run build:web"},{"name":"build:web","command":"vite build"},{"name":"db:generate","command":"drizzle-kit generate"},{"name":"db:migrate","command":"bun run api/cli/migrate.ts"},{"name":"db:migrate:drizzle","command":"drizzle-kit migrate"},{"name":"dev","command":"bunx --bun vite"},{"name":"dev:vite","command":"vite"},{"name":"format","command":"biome format --write api web shared scripts tests drizzle.config.ts playwright.config.ts vite.config.ts vitest.config.ts"},{"name":"format:check","command":"biome format api web shared scripts tests drizzle.config.ts playwright.config.ts vite.config.ts vitest.config.ts"},{"name":"lint","command":"biome lint api web shared scripts tests drizzle.config.ts playwright.config.ts vite.config.ts vitest.config.ts"},{"name":"seed:dev","command":"bun scripts/seed-dev.ts"},{"name":"start","command":"bun run api/app/server.ts"},{"name":"test","command":"vitest run"},{"name":"test:coverage","command":"vitest run --coverage"},{"name":"test:e2e","command":"playwright test"},{"name":"test:watch","command":"vitest"},{"name":"typecheck","command":"tsc --noEmit"},{"name":"verify","command":"bun scripts/verify.ts"},{"name":"verify:all","command":"bun run verify && bun run verify:e2e"},{"name":"verify:e2e","command":"bun run test:e2e"},{"name":"verify:strict","command":"bun run verify"}],"moduleOntology":null},"qualityCapabilities":{"projectType":"typescript","commands":[{"kind":"unit","source":"package_json","command":"bun run ''test''","runnable":true},{"kind":"coverage","source":"package_json","command":"bun run ''test:coverage''","runnable":true},{"kind":"e2e","source":"package_json","command":"bun run ''test:e2e''","runnable":true},{"kind":"verify","source":"package_json","command":"bun run ''verify''","runnable":true}],"missingCapabilities":[]},"recentTokenSpendTasks":[{"taskId":"3c40e22b-fbe5-48a1-ba92-64f990e589fd","title":"BBSを作りたいです。計画してください。","totalTokens":8468677,"callCount":8}],"recentRuns":{"completed":1,"failed":0,"running":0}}','{"role":"mission_task_generation","providerId":"codex","providerEndpointId":"ep_2a9c67769830da1e","routeSource":"primary","modelOrDeployment":"gpt-5.4-mini","thinkingDepth":null}','{"schemaVersion":"nightworkers.mission-task-candidates/v1","candidates":[{"title":"todo list機能の初期実装計画を作成する","summary":"todo list プロダクト本体を作るための Plan Mode 入口を作成し、UI・データモデル・保存方式・完了状態・編集削除・検証方針を確定する。","rationale":"repositorySnapshot は Hono + React + SQLite の template で、現時点では todo list 本体は確認できない。したがって最初の候補は直接実装ではなく、機能の初期実装計画を作る入口にして、未確定仕様を Plan Mode で回収するのが適切。","goalId":"de3305e2-2269-4765-a117-5dd36de101e2","candidateKind":"feature_entrypoint","moduleRouting":{"primaryModule":null,"secondaryModules":["web/src","api/routes","api/db","shared/schemas"],"confidencePercent":22,"reason":"moduleOntology がなく、todo list 専用モジュールも未確認のため未判定。現状の repositorySnapshot からは frontend, api, shared schema, SQLite が実装候補の受け皿として見える。"},"constraintGoalIds":[],"planModeOpenQuestions":["todo list の主要 UI をどこまで含めるか: 単一画面の入力中心か、一覧・詳細・フィルタ・並び替えまで含めるか","タスクのデータモデルをどうするか: title, note, due, priority, tags, status などの採用可否","保存方式をどうするか: ローカル永続化のみか、SQLite/API を使うか、将来同期を見据えるか","完了状態の表現をどうするか: チェックボックスのみか、アーカイブや削除済みも含めるか","編集・削除の操作体験をどうするか: インライン編集、モーダル、スワイプ、取り消し導線など","検証方針をどうするか: unit / e2e / schema どこまでを必須にするか"],"evidence":[{"source":"mission_goal","label":"goalText","value":"考えられる最も使いやすいtodolistを作る"},{"source":"project_evaluation","label":"latestEvaluation.summary","value":"Hono + React + SQLite を同一 origin でまとめた template としては実運用の土台として成立しているが、評価根拠は repo structure と README/LLM_CONTEXT に限られる。"},{"source":"project_evaluation","label":"repositorySnapshot.description","value":"Minimal Hono + React template with optional login and showcase screens."},{"source":"project_evaluation","label":"llmContextFiles","value":"LLM_CONTEXT.md は local SQLite auth/showcase template を示し、todo list 本体は見当たらない。"}],"evaluationContribution":44,"importancePercent":98,"confidencePercent":87,"tokenSize":"medium","complexity":"moderate","taskPrompt":"todo list プロダクト本体の初期実装計画を作成してください。現状の repository は Hono + React + SQLite の template で、auth/showcase や BBS 系の既存要素は見える一方、todo list 本体は未確認です。まず Plan Mode で、どの画面を最初の完成形にするか、タスクのデータモデル、保存方式、完了状態の扱い、編集・削除の操作、検証方針を決めてください。ユーザーが定義できる未確定要素は固定せず、候補として比較できる形で整理してください。期待成果は、実装に入る前に UI 仕様、データ構造、永続化、完了条件、検証手段が一貫した plan を作ることです。検証方針は、選んだ構成に応じて unit / e2e / schema のどこを必須にするかまで含めてください。","acceptanceCriteria":"todo list 本体の初期実装へ進むために必要な Plan Mode の論点が整理され、UI・データモデル・保存方式・完了状態・編集削除・検証方針の未確定点が明示されていること。既存の task と重複せず、template 由来の既存機能ではなく Mission Goal 直結の計画になっていること。","verificationPlan":"repositorySnapshot と llmContextFiles を前提に、本体機能の未実装を確認したうえで、Plan Mode で決めるべき論点が漏れなく taskPrompt と planModeOpenQuestions に入っているかを確認する。既存 Task / existingUncreatedCandidates と重複しないことを再確認し、必要なら次段で実装候補へ分割する。"}]}',NULL,1783215352,1783215394);
INSERT INTO "mission_task_candidate_batches" ("id", "created_at", "updated_at", "repository_id", "status", "requested_goal_ids_json", "signal_snapshot_json", "selected_model_json", "raw_output_json", "error_message", "started_at", "completed_at") VALUES('ebba0874-88ee-4d07-8db0-1de7890bd1d2',1783215958,1783216010,'984c8844-643e-4596-93a5-703a8d14a1e0','completed','["de3305e2-2269-4765-a117-5dd36de101e2"]','{"repository":{"id":"984c8844-643e-4596-93a5-703a8d14a1e0","name":"todolist","localPath":"/Users/y.noguchi/Code/todolist","branch":"main"},"activeGoals":[{"id":"de3305e2-2269-4765-a117-5dd36de101e2","title":"todo listを作る","goalText":"考えられる最も使いやすいtodolistを作る","interpretation":{"scope":"unknown","intent":"unknown","source":"unknown","confidencePercent":0,"reason":null}}],"latestEvaluation":{"id":"a9ff9b87-ada3-43cb-bc45-88b80d8b8644","overallScore":72,"dimensions":[{"key":"conceptValue","score":78,"label":"コンセプト価値"},{"key":"architectureQuality","score":80,"label":"アーキテクチャ"},{"key":"extensibility","score":74,"label":"拡張性"},{"key":"uiUx","score":69,"label":"UI / UX"},{"key":"operability","score":76,"label":"運用性"},{"key":"security","score":71,"label":"セキュリティ"},{"key":"maintainability","score":79,"label":"保守性"},{"key":"marketCompetitiveness","score":66,"label":"市場競争力"}],"summary":"Hono + React + SQLite を同一 origin でまとめたテンプレートとしては、認証、保護ルート、共有 schema、検証ゲートまで揃っており、実運用の土台として成立している。BBS ルートや thread 系 UI も repo tree に見えるため、単なる starter を越えて複数ドメインを載せる余地がある一方、評価根拠は repo structure と README/LLM_CONTEXT に限られるため、実装の細部と実行時品質は過大評価しない。"},"latestQuality":{"coverage":null,"e2e":{"status":"passed","total":2,"passed":2,"failed":0,"skipped":0,"durationMs":1170,"suites":[{"title":"smoke.spec.ts","status":"passed","tests":2,"durationMs":1170,"lastFailure":null}]}},"repositorySnapshot":{"packageName":"hono-standard","description":"Minimal Hono + React template with optional login and showcase screens.","readmeExcerpt":"# Hono Standard\n\n[![Bun](https://img.shields.io/badge/Bun-%23000000.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=bun&logoColor=white)](https://bun.sh/)\n[![Hono](https://img.shields.io/badge/Hono-%23E36022.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=hono&logoColor=white)](https://hono.dev/)\n[![React](https://img.shields.io/badge/React-%2320232a.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=react&logoColor=%2361DAFB)](https://react.dev/)\n[![SQLite](https://img.shields.io/badge/SQLite-003B57.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=sqlite&logoColor=white)](https://www.sqlite.org/)\n[![TypeScript](https://img.shields.io/badge/TypeScript-%23007ACC.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=typescript&logoColor=white)](https://www.typescriptlang.org/)\n[![MIT License](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-green.svg?style=for-the-badge)](LICENSE.md)\n\nHono backend と React + Vite frontend を同一 origin で動かす、local SQLite 対応の Web app template です。Drizzle のユーザー認証、httpOnly Cookie による access / refresh token、React Router ベースの画面、コンポーネント showcase を含みます。\n\n## 構成\n\n| Path | Role |\n| --- | --- |\n| `api/app/hono.ts` | Hono app composition。middleware、API route、静的配信、`AppType` を登録 |\n| `api/app/server.ts` | Bun server bootstrap |\n| `api/app/env.ts` | runtime env parser |\n| `api/config/appDefaults.ts` | 非シークレットの既定値 |\n| `api/db/index.ts` | DB runtime の public entry。variant はここから差し替える |\n| `api/db/sqlite.ts` | SQLite baseline の Drizzle runtime |\n| `api/db/schema.ts` | Drizzle SQLite schema |\n| `api/db/migrate.ts` | migration runner の public entry |\n| `api/db/migrate-sqlite.ts` | SQLite baseline の migration runner |\n| `api/routes/auth.route.ts` | `/api/auth/*` route |\n| `api/routes/health.route.ts` | `/api/health` route |\n| `api/routes/protected.route.ts` | `/api/protected/*` の server-side protected sample |\n| `api/modules/auth/` | password hash、JWT、cookie、auth service |\n| `api/middleware/auth.ts` | protected API middleware |\n| `web/src/` | React frontend |\n| `shared/schemas/` | frontend/backend で共有する Zod schema と API object type |\n| `drizzle/` | SQL migrations |\n| `scripts/verify.ts` | typecheck / lint / format / test / coverage / build の検証 pipeline |\n\n## 前提\n\n| Tool | 用途 |\n| --- | --- |\n| Bun | package manager、runtime、scripts |\n| SQLite | auth user / refresh token storage |\n\n## セットアップ\n\n```bash\nbun run bootstrap\nbun run auth:create-admin -- --email admin@example.com --name \"Admin User\"\nbun run dev\n```\n\n`bootstrap` は `.env` を用意し、dependency が未導入なら `bun install --frozen-lockfile` を実行し、SQLite database に migration を適用します。\n\n`auth:create-admin` は対話で password を読みます。自動化する場合は次のように標準入力から渡せます。\n\n```bash\nprintf ''%s\\n'' ''<password>'' | bun run auth:create-admin -- --email admin@example.com --name \"Admin User\" --password-stdin\n```\n\n開発サーバーは `http://localhost:5173` で起動します。Vite dev server が frontend を配信し、`/api/*` は Hono に渡されます。\n\n初回 clone 後に template の動作確認まで済ませる場合は、次を実行します。\n\n```bash\nbun run verify\nbun run verify:e2e\n```\n\n認証を使う app では `auth:create-admin` または `seed:dev` で admin を作成してから `/login` を確認します。認証を使わない app では、この README 後半の auth removal checklist に沿って auth route、DB table、login/protected screen、E2E scope をまとめて削ります。\n\n## 生成物と管理対象\n\nこの template では、source と docs は追跡し、local runtime や検証の生成物は追跡しません。\n\n| Path / Pattern | 扱い |\n| --- | --- |\n| `drizzle/*.sql` | Drizzle migration source。commit 対象 |\n| `.env.example` | local development の雛形。commit 対象 |\n| `.env*` | local secret / runtime env。`.env.example` 以外は commit しない |\n| `data/`, `*.db`, `*.sqlite`, `*.sqlite3` | local SQLite database。commit しない |\n| `coverage/`, `playwright-report/`, `test-results/` | verification output。commit しない |\n| `dist/`, `dist-web/`, `build/`, `*.tgz` | build / archive output。commit しない |\n\n## 環境変数\n\n非シークレットの既定値は `api/config/appDefaults.ts` にあります。`.env.example` は local development 向けの値です。\n\n| Variable | Required | Description | Default |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `NODE_ENV` | no | `development` / `test` / `production` | `development` |\n| `HOST` | no | HTTP bind host。container では `0.0.0.0` を指定 | `127.0.0.1` |\n| `PORT` | no | HTTP server port | `5173` |\n| `DATABASE_URL` | no | SQLite database ","sourceFiles":["LLM_CONTEXT.md","README.md","api/app/env.test.ts","api/app/env.ts","api/app/hono.test.ts","api/app/hono.ts","api/app/security-headers.ts","api/app/server.ts","api/cli/auth-create-admin.ts","api/cli/cli-contract.test.ts","api/cli/migrate.ts","api/config/appDefaults.ts","api/db/index.ts","api/db/migrate-sqlite.ts","api/db/migrate.ts","api/db/path.test.ts","api/db/path.ts","api/db/schema.ts","api/db/sqlite.ts","api/middleware/auth.test.ts","api/middleware/auth.ts","api/modules/auth/auth-cookies.test.ts","api/modules/auth/auth-cookies.ts","api/modules/auth/auth.service.test.ts","api/modules/auth/auth.service.ts","api/modules/auth/context.test.ts","api/modules/auth/context.ts","api/modules/auth/errors.test.ts","api/modules/auth/errors.ts","api/modules/auth/password.test.ts","api/modules/auth/password.ts","api/modules/auth/token.service.test.ts","api/modules/auth/token.service.ts","api/modules/auth/types.test.ts","api/modules/auth/types.ts","api/routes/auth.route.test.ts","api/routes/auth.route.ts","api/routes/bbs.route.test.ts","api/routes/bbs.route.ts","api/routes/health.route.test.ts","api/routes/health.route.ts","api/routes/protected.route.test.ts","api/routes/protected.route.ts","api/types/hono-context.d.ts","biome.json","docs/template-variant-management.md","drizzle.config.ts","drizzle/0001_auth.sql","drizzle/0002_bbs.sql","package.json","playwright.config.ts","scripts/bootstrap.test.ts","scripts/bootstrap.ts","scripts/e2e-server.ts","scripts/seed-dev.ts","scripts/verify.ts","shared/schemas/auth.schema.ts","shared/schemas/protected.schema.test.ts","shared/schemas/protected.schema.ts","tests/e2e/smoke.spec.ts","tsconfig.build.json","tsconfig.json","vite.config.ts","vitest.config.ts","web/src/App.tsx","web/src/api.test.ts","web/src/api.ts","web/src/auth-context.tsx","web/src/components/dev-error-panel.tsx","web/src/domains/auth/login-domain.tsx","web/src/main.tsx","web/src/router.tsx","web/src/routes/home-route.tsx","web/src/routes/login-route.tsx","web/src/routes/login-search.ts","web/src/routes/protected-route.tsx","web/src/routes/root-route.tsx","web/src/routes/route-access.test.ts","web/src/routes/route-access.ts","web/src/routes/showcase-route.tsx","web/src/routes/thread-detail-route.tsx","web/src/routes/thread-new-route.tsx","web/src/routes/threads-route.tsx","web/src/showcase-settings-context.tsx","web/src/showcase-table-search.ts","web/src/styles.css","web/src/views/home-view.tsx","web/src/views/login-view.tsx","web/src/views/protected-view.tsx","web/src/views/showcase-view.tsx","web/src/views/thread-detail-view.tsx","web/src/views/thread-new-view.tsx","web/src/views/threads-view.tsx"],"routeFiles":["api/routes/auth.route.test.ts","api/routes/auth.route.ts","api/routes/bbs.route.test.ts","api/routes/bbs.route.ts","api/routes/health.route.test.ts","api/routes/health.route.ts","api/routes/protected.route.test.ts","api/routes/protected.route.ts","web/src/routes/home-route.tsx","web/src/routes/login-route.tsx","web/src/routes/login-search.ts","web/src/routes/protected-route.tsx","web/src/routes/root-route.tsx","web/src/routes/route-access.test.ts","web/src/routes/route-access.ts","web/src/routes/showcase-route.tsx","web/src/routes/thread-detail-route.tsx","web/src/routes/thread-new-route.tsx","web/src/routes/threads-route.tsx","web/src/views/home-view.tsx","web/src/views/login-view.tsx","web/src/views/protected-view.tsx","web/src/views/showcase-view.tsx","web/src/views/thread-detail-view.tsx","web/src/views/thread-new-view.tsx","web/src/views/threads-view.tsx"],"migrationFiles":["drizzle/0001_auth.sql","drizzle/0002_bbs.sql"],"sourceExcerpts":[{"path":"README.md","excerpt":"# Hono Standard\n[![Bun](https://img.shields.io/badge/Bun-%23000000.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=bun&logoColor=white)](https://bun.sh/)\n[![Hono](https://img.shields.io/badge/Hono-%23E36022.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=hono&logoColor=white)](https://hono.dev/)\n[![React](https://img.shields.io/badge/React-%2320232a.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=react&logoColor=%2361DAFB)](https://react.dev/)\n[![SQLite](https://img.shields.io/badge/SQLite-003B57.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=sqlite&logoColor=white)](https://www.sqlite.org/)\n[![TypeScript](https://img.shields.io/badge/TypeScript-%23007ACC.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=typescript&logoColor=white)](https://www.typescriptlang.org/)\n[![MIT License](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-green.svg?style=for-the-badge)](LICENSE.md)\nHono backend と React + Vite frontend を同一 origin で動かす、local SQLite 対応の Web app template です。Drizzle のユーザー認証、httpOnly Cookie による access / refresh token、React Router ベースの画面、コンポーネント showcase を含みます。\n## 構成\n| Path | Role |\n| --- | --- |\n| `api/app/hono.ts` | Hono app composition。middleware、API route、静的配信、`AppType` を登録 |\n| `api/app/server.ts` | Bun server bootstrap |\n| `api/app/env.ts` | runtime env parser |\n| `api/config/appDefaults.ts` | 非シークレットの既定値 |\n| `api/db/index.ts` | DB runtime の public entry。variant はここから差し替える |\n| `api/db/sqlite.ts` | SQLite baseline の Drizzle runtime |\n| `api/db/schema.ts` | Drizzle SQLite schema |\n| `api/db/migrate.ts` | migration runner の public entry |\n| `api/db/migrate-sqlite.ts` | SQLite baseline の migration runner |\n| `api/routes/auth.route.ts` | `/api/auth/*` route |\n| `api/routes/health.route.ts` | `/api/health` route |\n| `api/routes/protected.route.ts` | `/api/protected/*` の server-side protected sample |\n| `api/modules/auth/` | password hash、JWT、cookie、auth service |\n| `api/mi"},{"path":"api/app/env.test.ts","excerpt":"import { describe, expect, it } from \"vitest\";\nimport { APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS } from \"../config/appDefaults\";\nimport { readAppEnv } from \"./env\";\ndescribe(\"readAppEnv\", () => {\n\tit(\"uses minimal app defaults\", () => {\n\t\tconst env = readAppEnv({});\n\t\texpect(env.nodeEnv).toBe(\"development\");\n\t\texpect(env.host).toBe(APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS.host);\n\t\texpect(env.port).toBe(APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS.port);\n\t\texpect(env.databaseUrl).toBe(APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS.databaseUrl);\n\t\texpect(env.appUrl).toBe(APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS.appUrl);\n\t\texpect(env.corsOrigins).toEqual(APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS.corsOrigins);\n\t\texpect(env.cookieSameSite).toBe(APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS.cookieSameSite);\n\t});\n\tit(\"accepts database and auth runtime overrides\", () => {\n\t\tconst env = readAppEnv({\n\t\t\tHOST: \"0.0.0.0\",\n\t\t\tPORT: \"5174\",\n\t\t\tDATABASE_URL: \"tmp/test.sqlite\",\n\t\t\tJWT_SECRET: \"x\".repeat(32),\n\t\t\tAPP_URL: \"https://showcase.example.com\",\n\t\t\tCORS_ORIGINS: \"https://showcase.example.com,http://localhost:5173\",\n\t\t\tAUTH_COOKIE_SECURE: \"true\",\n\t\t\tAUTH_COOKIE_SAME_SITE: \"none\",\n\t\t\tSECURITY_HEADERS_MODE: \"https\",\n\t\t});\n\t\texpect(env.host).toBe(\"0.0.0.0\");\n\t\texpect(env.port).toBe(5174);\n\t\texpect(env.databaseUrl).toBe(\"tmp/test.sqlite\");\n\t\texpect(env.jwtSecret).toBe(\"x\".repeat(32));\n\t\texpect(env.appUrl).toBe(\"https://showcase.example.com\");\n\t\texpect(env.corsOrigins).toEqual([\n\t\t\t\"https://showcase.example.com\",\n\t\t\t\"http://localhost:5173\",\n\t\t]);\n\t\texpect(env.secureCookie).toBe(true);\n\t\texpect(env.cookieSameSite).toBe(\"none\");\n\t\texpect(env.securityHeadersMode).toBe(\"https\");\n\t});\n\tit(\"falls back to the SQLite default when a dev shell provides a connection URL\", () => {\n\t\tconst env = readAppEnv({\n\t\t\tDATABASE_URL: \"postgres://postgres:postgres@127.0.0.1:5432/app\",\n\t\t});\n\t\texpect(env.databaseUrl).toBe(APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS.databaseUrl);\n\t});\n\tit(\"rej"},{"path":"api/app/env.ts","excerpt":"import { z } from \"zod\";\nimport { APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS } from \"../config/appDefaults\";\nimport { isDatabaseConnectionUrl } from \"../db/path\";\nconst optionalTrimmedString = z.preprocess((value) => {\n\tif (typeof value !== \"string\") return value;\n\tconst trimmed = value.trim();\n\treturn trimmed.length > 0 ? trimmed : undefined;\n}, z.string().trim().optional());\nconst optionalUrl = z.preprocess((value) => {\n\tif (typeof value !== \"string\") return value;\n\tconst trimmed = value.trim();\n\treturn trimmed.length > 0 ? trimmed : undefined;\n}, z.string().url().optional());\nconst optionalBoolean = z.preprocess((value) => {\n\tif (typeof value === \"boolean\") return value;\n\tif (typeof value !== \"string\") return value;\n\tconst normalized = value.trim().toLowerCase();\n\tif (!normalized) return undefined;\n\tif ([\"1\", \"true\", \"yes\", \"on\"].includes(normalized)) return true;\n\tif ([\"0\", \"false\", \"no\", \"off\"].includes(normalized)) return false;\n\treturn value;\n}, z.boolean().optional());\nconst optionalPort = z.preprocess((value) => {\n\tif (typeof value === \"number\") return value;\n\tif (typeof value !== \"string\") return value;\n\tconst trimmed = value.trim();\n\treturn trimmed.length > 0 ? Number(trimmed) : undefined;\n}, z.number().int().min(1).max(65535).optional());\nconst optionalCookieSameSite = z.preprocess((value) => {\n\tif (typeof value !== \"string\") return value;\n\tconst normalized = value.trim().toLowerCase();\n\treturn normalized.length > 0 ? normalized : undefined;\n}, z.enum([\"lax\", \"strict\", \"none\"]).optional());\nconst optionalSecurityHeadersMode = z.preprocess(\n\t(value) => {\n\t\tif (typeof value !== \"string\") return value;\n\t\tconst normalized = value.trim().toLowerCase();\n\t\treturn normalized.length > 0 ? normalized : undefined;\n\t},\n\tz.enum([\"auto\", \"http\", \"https\"]).default(\"auto\"),\n);\nconst EnvSchema = z"},{"path":"api/app/hono.test.ts","excerpt":"import { describe, expect, it, vi, beforeEach } from \"vitest\";\nimport fs from \"node:fs/promises\";\nimport { HttpError } from \"../modules/auth/errors\";\nimport { HTTPException } from \"hono/http-exception\";\n// Mock environment and DB connection before importing app\nvi.mock(\"../db\", () => ({\n\tcreateDbRuntime: vi.fn().mockReturnValue({\n\t\tdb: {\n\t\t\tquery: {\n\t\t\t\tusers: {\n\t\t\t\t\tfindFirst: vi.fn(),\n\t\t\t\t},\n\t\t\t},\n\t\t},\n\t\tclose: vi.fn(),\n\t\tconnection: {\n\t\t\tclient: {\n\t\t\t\tclose: vi.fn(),\n\t\t\t},\n\t\t\townsConnection: false,\n\t\t},\n\t}),\n}));\nvi.mock(\"./env\", () => ({\n\treadAppEnv: vi.fn().mockReturnValue({\n\t\tnodeEnv: \"test\",\n\t\thost: \"127.0.0.1\",\n\t\tport: 5173,\n\t\tdatabaseUrl: \"mock.db\",\n\t\tjwtSecret: \"x\".repeat(32),\n\t\tjwtAccessExpiresIn: \"15m\",\n\t\tjwtRefreshExpiresIn: \"7d\",\n\t\tappUrl: \"http://localhost:5173\",\n\t\tcorsOrigins: [\"http://localhost:5173\"],\n\t\ttrustProxy: true,\n\t\tsecureCookie: false,\n\t\tcookieSameSite: \"lax\",\n\t\tsecurityHeadersMode: \"auto\",\n\t}),\n}));\n// Mock Bun global variable before importing hono/bun dependent code\n(globalThis as any).Bun = {\n\tfile: (path: string) => ({\n\t\texists: () => Promise.resolve(true),\n\t}),\n};\n// Dynamically import app so globalThis.Bun is defined first\nconst { default: app } = await import(\"./hono\");\n// Add test routes before any request is processed (Hono routers lock after first request)\napp.post(\"/api/test-http-error\", () => {\n\tthrow new HttpError(400, \"Bad Parameters\");\n});\napp.post(\"/api/test-hono-http-exception\", () => {\n\tthrow new HTTPException(403, { message: \"Access Forbidden\" });\n});\napp.post(\"/api/test-generic-error\", () => {\n\tthrow new Error(\"Something blew up\");\n});\ndescribe(\"hono app entry\", () => {\n\tbeforeEach(() => {\n\t\tvi.restoreAllMocks();\n\t});\n\tit(\"should return 200 for /api/health\", async () => {\n\t\tconst res = await app.request(\"/api/health\");\n\t\texp"},{"path":"api/app/hono.ts","excerpt":"import fs from \"node:fs/promises\";\nimport path from \"node:path\";\nimport { serveStatic } from \"hono/bun\";\nimport { csrf } from \"hono/csrf\";\nimport { Hono } from \"hono\";\nimport { cors } from \"hono/cors\";\nimport { logger } from \"hono/logger\";\nimport { HTTPException } from \"hono/http-exception\";\nimport { secureHeaders } from \"hono/secure-headers\";\nimport type { DbRuntime } from \"../db\";\nimport { createDbRuntime } from \"../db\";\nimport { requireAuth } from \"../middleware/auth\";\nimport { AuthService } from \"../modules/auth/auth.service\";\nimport { HttpError } from \"../modules/auth/errors\";\nimport { createBbsRoute } from \"../routes/bbs.route\";\nimport { createAuthRoute } from \"../routes/auth.route\";\nimport { createHealthRoute } from \"../routes/health.route\";\nimport { createProtectedRoute } from \"../routes/protected.route\";\nimport { readAppEnv, type AppEnv } from \"./env\";\nimport { appContentSecurityPolicy } from \"./security-headers\";\nexport type AppDeps = {\n\tenv: AppEnv;\n\tdbRuntime: DbRuntime;\n\tauthService: AuthService;\n};\ndeclare global {\n\tvar __honoStandardRuntime__: Promise<AppDeps> | undefined;\n}\nexport async function createDefaultAppDeps(): Promise<AppDeps> {\n\tconst env = readAppEnv();\n\tconst dbRuntime = createDbRuntime(env);\n\tconst authService = new AuthService(dbRuntime.db, env);\n\treturn { env, dbRuntime, authService };\n}\nexport async function getAppRuntime(): Promise<AppDeps> {\n\tif (!globalThis.__honoStandardRuntime__) {\n\t\tglobalThis.__honoStandardRuntime__ = createDefaultAppDeps().catch(\n\t\t\t(error) => {\n\t\t\t\tglobalThis.__honoStandardRuntime__ = undefined;\n\t\t\t\tthrow error;\n\t\t\t},\n\t\t);\n\t}\n\treturn globalThis.__honoStandardRuntime__;\n}\nconst distWebRoot = path.resolve(process.cwd(), \"dist-web\");\nconst distWebIndex = path.resolve(distWebRoot, \"index.html\");\nexport function creat"},{"path":"api/app/security-headers.ts","excerpt":"type CspDirectives = Record<string, string[]>;\nexport const appContentSecurityPolicy: CspDirectives = {\n\tdefaultSrc: [\"''self''\"],\n\tbaseUri: [\"''self''\"],\n\tconnectSrc: [\"''self''\"],\n\tfontSrc: [\"''self''\", \"data:\"],\n\tformAction: [\"''self''\"],\n\tframeAncestors: [\"''self''\"],\n\timgSrc: [\"''self''\", \"data:\", \"blob:\"],\n\tmanifestSrc: [\"''self''\"],\n\tobjectSrc: [\"''none''\"],\n\tscriptSrc: [\"''self''\"],\n\tstyleSrc: [\"''self''\", \"''unsafe-inline''\"],\n\tworkerSrc: [\"''self''\", \"blob:\"],\n};\nexport const viteDevContentSecurityPolicy: CspDirectives = {\n\t...appContentSecurityPolicy,\n\tconnectSrc: [\n\t\t\"''self''\",\n\t\t\"ws:\",\n\t\t\"http://localhost:5173\",\n\t\t\"http://127.0.0.1:5173\",\n\t],\n\tscriptSrc: [\"''self''\", \"''unsafe-inline''\", \"''unsafe-eval''\"],\n};\nconst toKebabCase = (value: string): string =>\n\tvalue.replace(/[A-Z]+(?![a-z])|[A-Z]/g, (match, offset) =>\n\t\toffset ? `-${match.toLowerCase()}` : match.toLowerCase(),\n\t);\nexport function serializeContentSecurityPolicy(policy: CspDirectives): string {\n\treturn Object.entries(policy)\n\t\t.map(\n\t\t\t([directive, values]) => `${toKebabCase(directive)} ${values.join(\" \")}`,\n\t\t)\n\t\t.join(\"; \");\n}"},{"path":"api/app/server.ts","excerpt":"import app, { getAppRuntime } from \"./hono\";\nimport { readAppEnv } from \"./env\";\nconst env = readAppEnv();\nconst server = Bun.serve({\n\tfetch: app.fetch,\n\thostname: env.host,\n\tport: env.port,\n});\nconsole.log(\n\t`Hono Standard server listening on http://${env.host}:${server.port}`,\n);\nconst shutdown = async (signal: string) => {\n\tconsole.log(`\\nReceived ${signal}. Shutting down gracefully...`);\n\tserver.stop(true);\n\ttry {\n\t\tconst runtime = await getAppRuntime();\n\t\tconsole.log(\"Closing database connection...\");\n\t\truntime.dbRuntime.close();\n\t\tconsole.log(\"Shutdown complete.\");\n\t\tprocess.exit(0);\n\t} catch (error) {\n\t\tconsole.error(\"Error during shutdown:\", error);\n\t\tprocess.exit(1);\n\t}\n};\nprocess.on(\"SIGINT\", () => shutdown(\"SIGINT\"));\nprocess.on(\"SIGTERM\", () => shutdown(\"SIGTERM\"));"},{"path":"api/routes/auth.route.test.ts","excerpt":"import { Hono } from \"hono\";\nimport { describe, expect, it, vi, beforeEach } from \"vitest\";\nimport { createAuthRoute } from \"./auth.route\";\nimport { requireAuth } from \"../middleware/auth\";\nimport type { AppEnv } from \"../app/env\";\nimport type { AuthService } from \"../modules/auth/auth.service\";\nimport { HttpError } from \"../modules/auth/errors\";\nimport {\n\tACCESS_TOKEN_COOKIE_NAME,\n\tREFRESH_TOKEN_COOKIE_NAME,\n} from \"../modules/auth/auth-cookies\";\ndescribe(\"auth route\", () => {\n\tlet app: Hono;\n\tlet mockAuthService: any;\n\tlet mockEnv: AppEnv;\n\tconst testUser = {\n\t\tid: \"a1a1a1a1-a1a1-41a1-a1a1-a1a1a1a1a1a1\",\n\t\temail: \"test@example.com\",\n\t\tdisplayName: \"Test User\",\n\t\trole: \"member\" as const,\n\t\tisActive: true,\n\t};\n\tbeforeEach(() => {\n\t\tmockEnv = {\n\t\t\tjwtSecret: \"x\".repeat(32),\n\t\t\tjwtAccessExpiresIn: \"15m\",\n\t\t\tjwtRefreshExpiresIn: \"7d\",\n\t\t\tsecureCookie: true,\n\t\t\tcookieSameSite: \"lax\",\n\t\t} as unknown as AppEnv;\n\t\tmockAuthService = {\n\t\t\tlogin: vi.fn(),\n\t\t\trefresh: vi.fn(),\n\t\t\tlogout: vi.fn(),\n\t\t\tfindUserById: vi.fn(),\n\t\t};\n\t\tapp = new Hono();\n\t\t// Set error handler to prevent throwing unhandled exceptions in tests\n\t\tapp.onError((err, c) => {\n\t\t\tconst status = (err as HttpError).status || 500;\n\t\t\treturn c.json({ message: err.message }, status as any);\n\t\t});\n\t\tapp.use(\n\t\t\t\"/auth/me\",\n\t\t\trequireAuth({\n\t\t\t\tenv: mockEnv,\n\t\t\t\tauthService: mockAuthService as unknown as AuthService,\n\t\t\t}),\n\t\t);\n\t\tapp.route(\n\t\t\t\"/auth\",\n\t\t\tcreateAuthRoute({\n\t\t\t\tauthService: mockAuthService as unknown as AuthService,\n\t\t\t\tenv: mockEnv,\n\t\t\t}),\n\t\t);\n\t});\n\tdescribe(\"POST /login\", () => {\n\t\tit(\"should login user with valid credentials and set cookies\", async () => {\n\t\t\tmockAuthService.login.mockResolvedValue({\n\t\t\t\taccessToken: \"access-token-123\",\n\t\t\t\trefreshToken: \"refresh-token-456\",\n\t\t\t\tuser: {\n\t\t\t\t\tid: te"},{"path":"api/routes/auth.route.ts","excerpt":"import { zValidator } from \"@hono/zod-validator\";\nimport { Hono } from \"hono\";\nimport { getCookie } from \"hono/cookie\";\nimport { loginSchema } from \"../../shared/schemas/auth.schema\";\nimport type { AppEnv } from \"../app/env\";\nimport type { AuthService } from \"../modules/auth/auth.service\";\nimport {\n\tREFRESH_TOKEN_COOKIE_NAME,\n\tclearAuthCookies,\n\tsetAuthCookies,\n} from \"../modules/auth/auth-cookies\";\nimport { getAuthContextUser } from \"../modules/auth/context\";\nimport { HttpError } from \"../modules/auth/errors\";\ntype AuthRouteDeps = {\n\tauthService: AuthService;\n\tenv: AppEnv;\n};\nexport function createAuthRoute(deps: AuthRouteDeps) {\n\treturn new Hono()\n\t\t.post(\"/login\", zValidator(\"json\", loginSchema), async (c) => {\n\t\t\tconst body = c.req.valid(\"json\");\n\t\t\tconst result = await deps.authService.login({\n\t\t\t\temail: body.email,\n\t\t\t\tpassword: body.password,\n\t\t\t});\n\t\t\tsetAuthCookies(c, deps.env, result);\n\t\t\treturn c.json({ user: result.user });\n\t\t})\n\t\t.post(\"/refresh\", async (c) => {\n\t\t\tconst refreshToken = getCookie(c, REFRESH_TOKEN_COOKIE_NAME);\n\t\t\tif (!refreshToken) {\n\t\t\t\tthrow new HttpError(401, \"Unauthorized\");\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\tconst result = await deps.authService.refresh(refreshToken);\n\t\t\tsetAuthCookies(c, deps.env, result);\n\t\t\treturn c.json({ user: result.user });\n\t\t})\n\t\t.post(\"/logout\", async (c) => {\n\t\t\tconst refreshToken = getCookie(c, REFRESH_TOKEN_COOKIE_NAME);\n\t\t\tawait deps.authService.logout(refreshToken);\n\t\t\tclearAuthCookies(c);\n\t\t\treturn c.json({ ok: true });\n\t\t})\n\t\t.get(\"/me\", async (c) => {\n\t\t\tconst authUser = getAuthContextUser(c);\n\t\t\tconst user = await deps.authService.findUserById(authUser.userId);\n\t\t\tif (!user?.isActive) {\n\t\t\t\tthrow new HttpError(401, \"Unauthorized\");\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\treturn c.json({\n\t\t\t\tuser: {\n\t\t\t\t\tid: user.id,\n\t\t\t\t\temail: user.email,\n\t\t\t\t\tdisplayName: us"},{"path":"api/routes/bbs.route.test.ts","excerpt":"import { Hono } from \"hono\";\nimport { HttpError } from \"../modules/auth/errors\";\nimport { afterEach, describe, expect, it, vi } from \"vitest\";\nimport { createBbsRoute } from \"./bbs.route\";\nimport { posts, threads } from \"../db/schema\";\ntype ThreadRow = {\n\tid: number;\n\ttitle: string;\n\tcreatedAt: Date;\n\tupdatedAt: Date;\n\tlastPostAt: Date;\n\treplyCount: number;\n};\ntype PostRow = {\n\tid: number;\n\tthreadId: number;\n\tparentPostId: number | null;\n\tauthorName: string;\n\tbody: string;\n\tcreatedAt: Date;\n\tupdatedAt: Date;\n};\nfunction createFakeDb(options?: {\n\tfailThreadInsert?: boolean;\n\tfailParentLookup?: boolean;\n}) {\n\tconst state = {\n\t\tthreadId: 0,\n\t\tpostId: 0,\n\t\tthreads: [] as ThreadRow[],\n\t\tposts: [] as PostRow[],\n\t};\n\tconst select = (selection?: Record<string, unknown>) => ({\n\t\tfrom(table: unknown) {\n\t\t\tif (table === threads) {\n\t\t\t\tconst build = (predicate?: unknown) => ({\n\t\t\t\t\tget: async () =>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tstate.threads.find((thread) =>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tmatchThreadPredicate(thread, predicate),\n\t\t\t\t\t\t) ?? null,\n\t\t\t\t\tall: async () =>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t[...state.threads]\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t.sort((a, b) => b.lastPostAt.getTime() - a.lastPostAt.getTime())\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t.map((thread) => ({\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tid: thread.id,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\ttitle: thread.title,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tcreatedAt: thread.createdAt,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tupdatedAt: thread.updatedAt,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tlastPostAt: thread.lastPostAt,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\treplyCount: thread.replyCount,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t})),\n\t\t\t\t});\n\t\t\t\treturn {\n\t\t\t\t\twhere: (predicate?: unknown) => build(predicate),\n\t\t\t\t\torderBy: () => build(),\n\t\t\t\t};\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\tconst build = (predicate?: unknown) => {\n\t\t\t\tconst rows = state.posts.filter((post) =>\n\t\t\t\t\tmatchPostPredicate(post, predicate, options?.failParentLookup),\n\t\t\t\t);\n\t\t\t\tconst query = {\n\t\t\t\t\tget: async () => rows[0] ?? null,\n\t\t\t\t\tall: async () =>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t[...rows].sort((a, b) => a.createdAt.getTime() - b.createdAt.getTi"},{"path":"api/routes/bbs.route.ts","excerpt":"import { zValidator } from \"@hono/zod-validator\";\nimport { and, asc, desc, eq } from \"drizzle-orm\";\nimport { Hono } from \"hono\";\nimport { z } from \"zod\";\nimport type { AppDatabase } from \"../db\";\nimport { posts, threads } from \"../db/schema\";\nimport { HttpError } from \"../modules/auth/errors\";\ntype BbsRouteDeps = {\n\tdb: AppDatabase;\n};\nconst threadCreateSchema = z.object({\n\ttitle: z.string().trim().min(1).max(120),\n\tbody: z.string().trim().min(1).max(4000),\n\tauthorName: z.string().trim().min(1).max(80).optional(),\n});\nconst replyCreateSchema = z.object({\n\tbody: z.string().trim().min(1).max(4000),\n\tauthorName: z.string().trim().min(1).max(80).optional(),\n\tparentPostId: z.number().int().positive().optional(),\n});\nasync function getThreadOrThrow(db: AppDatabase, id: number) {\n\tconst row = await db.select().from(threads).where(eq(threads.id, id)).get();\n\tif (!row) throw new HttpError(404, \"Thread not found\");\n\treturn row;\n}\nexport function createBbsRoute(deps: BbsRouteDeps) {\n\treturn new Hono()\n\t\t.get(\"/threads\", async (c) => {\n\t\t\tconst items = await deps.db\n\t\t\t\t.select({\n\t\t\t\t\tid: threads.id,\n\t\t\t\t\ttitle: threads.title,\n\t\t\t\t\tcreatedAt: threads.createdAt,\n\t\t\t\t\tupdatedAt: threads.updatedAt,\n\t\t\t\t\tlastPostAt: threads.lastPostAt,\n\t\t\t\t\treplyCount: threads.replyCount,\n\t\t\t\t})\n\t\t\t\t.from(threads)\n\t\t\t\t.orderBy(desc(threads.lastPostAt), desc(threads.createdAt))\n\t\t\t\t.all();\n\t\t\treturn c.json({ threads: items });\n\t\t})\n\t\t.get(\"/threads/:id\", async (c) => {\n\t\t\tconst id = Number(c.req.param(\"id\"));\n\t\t\tif (!Number.isInteger(id)) throw new HttpError(400, \"Invalid thread id\");\n\t\t\tconst thread = await getThreadOrThrow(deps.db, id);\n\t\t\tconst items = await deps.db\n\t\t\t\t.select({\n\t\t\t\t\tid: posts.id,\n\t\t\t\t\tthreadId: posts.threadId,\n\t\t\t\t\tparentPostId: posts.parentPostId,\n\t\t\t\t\tauthorName: posts.authorName"},{"path":"api/routes/health.route.test.ts","excerpt":"import { Hono } from \"hono\";\nimport { describe, expect, it } from \"vitest\";\nimport { createHealthRoute } from \"./health.route\";\ndescribe(\"health route\", () => {\n\tit(\"should return ok status\", async () => {\n\t\tconst app = new Hono().route(\"/health\", createHealthRoute());\n\t\tconst res = await app.request(\"/health\");\n\t\texpect(res.status).toBe(200);\n\t\tconst body = await res.json();\n\t\texpect(body).toEqual({\n\t\t\tstatus: \"ok\",\n\t\t\tservice: \"hono-standard\",\n\t\t});\n\t});\n});"},{"path":"api/routes/health.route.ts","excerpt":"import { Hono } from \"hono\";\nexport function createHealthRoute() {\n\treturn new Hono().get(\"/\", (c) => {\n\t\treturn c.json({ status: \"ok\", service: \"hono-standard\" });\n\t});\n}"},{"path":"api/routes/protected.route.test.ts","excerpt":"import { Hono } from \"hono\";\nimport { describe, expect, it } from \"vitest\";\nimport { createProtectedRoute } from \"./protected.route\";\ndescribe(\"protected route\", () => {\n\tit(\"returns the authenticated profile from context\", async () => {\n\t\tconst app = new Hono();\n\t\tapp.use(\"/protected/*\", async (c, next) => {\n\t\t\tc.set(\"authUser\", {\n\t\t\t\tuserId: \"a1a1a1a1-a1a1-41a1-a1a1-a1a1a1a1a1a1\",\n\t\t\t\temail: \"test@example.com\",\n\t\t\t\trole: \"member\",\n\t\t\t});\n\t\t\tawait next();\n\t\t});\n\t\tapp.route(\"/protected\", createProtectedRoute());\n\t\tconst res = await app.request(\"/protected/profile\");\n\t\tconst body = await res.json();\n\t\texpect(res.status).toBe(200);\n\t\texpect(body.profile).toEqual({\n\t\t\temail: \"test@example.com\",\n\t\t\trole: \"member\",\n\t\t});\n\t});\n});"},{"path":"api/routes/protected.route.ts","excerpt":"import { Hono } from \"hono\";\nimport type { ProtectedProfileResponse } from \"../../shared/schemas/protected.schema\";\nimport { getAuthContextUser } from \"../modules/auth/context\";\nexport function createProtectedRoute() {\n\treturn new Hono().get(\"/profile\", (c) => {\n\t\tconst authUser = getAuthContextUser(c);\n\t\tconst response = {\n\t\t\tprofile: {\n\t\t\t\temail: authUser.email,\n\t\t\t\trole: authUser.role,\n\t\t\t},\n\t\t} satisfies ProtectedProfileResponse;\n\t\treturn c.json(response);\n\t});\n}"},{"path":"web/src/App.tsx","excerpt":"import { QueryClient, QueryClientProvider } from \"@tanstack/react-query\";\nimport { RouterProvider } from \"@tanstack/react-router\";\nimport { router } from \"./router\";\nimport { ShowcaseSettingsProvider } from \"./showcase-settings-context\";\nconst queryClient = new QueryClient({\n\tdefaultOptions: {\n\t\tqueries: {\n\t\t\tretry: false,\n\t\t},\n\t},\n});\nexport function App() {\n\treturn (\n\t\t<QueryClientProvider client={queryClient}>\n\t\t\t<ShowcaseSettingsProvider>\n\t\t\t\t<RouterProvider router={router} />\n\t\t\t</ShowcaseSettingsProvider>\n\t\t</QueryClientProvider>\n\t);\n}"}],"llmContextFiles":[{"path":"LLM_CONTEXT.md","excerpt":"# LLM Context: Hono Standard\n\nこの文書は、`hono-standard` を clone した直後に作業入口を決めるための圧縮コンテキストです。現行 branch は local SQLite auth/showcase template です。RAG、pgvector、agentic search、wiki ingestion は含みません。\n\n## Repository Snapshot\n\n- Bun + Hono backend と React + Vite frontend を同一 origin で動かす template。\n- DB は local SQLite。Drizzle schema は `api/db/schema.ts`、migration は `drizzle/`。\n- Backend app composition は `api/app/hono.ts`、server bootstrap は `api/app/server.ts`。\n- DB runtime の public entry は `api/db/index.ts`。SQLite baseline は `api/db/sqlite.ts`、migration runner は `api/db/migrate.ts` から `api/db/migrate-sqlite.ts` を呼ぶ。\n- Frontend entry は `web/src/App.tsx`、router は `web/src/router.tsx`、API client は `web/src/api.ts`。\n- Auth 実装は `api/modules/auth/`、route は `api/routes/auth.route.ts`、login UI は `web/src/domains/auth/login-domain.tsx`。\n- Shared API schema/object は `shared/schemas/`。Backend は `zValidator`、frontend は `hono/client` + `AppType` で同じ契約を参照する。\n- Home と Showcase は未ログインでも表示する。ログイン状態がある場合だけ header に user chip と logout button を表示する。\n- Protected sample は `/protected` と `/api/protected/profile`。frontend guard と server-side `requireAuth` の両方を示す。\n- Package manager / runtime は Bun。dev server は `bunx --bun vite` で起動する。\n- Quality gates は `bun run verify` と `bun run verify:e2e`。CI も同じ入口を使う。\n- `main` は SQLite baseline。Turso / PostgreSQL / pgvector は `variant/*` branch で driver、schema、migration、docs、smoke setup を差し替える。\n\n## Top-Level Map\n\n| Path | Role |\n| --- | --- |\n| `api/app/hono.ts` | Hono middleware、API route、static fallback、`AppType` export |\n| `api/app/server.ts` | Bun server bootstrap |\n| `api/app/env.ts` | environment parsing and defaults |\n| `api/config/appDefaults.ts` | non-secret app defaults |\n| `api/db/index.ts` | DB runtime public entry and variant boundary |\n| `api/db/sqlite.ts` | SQLite baseline Drizzle runtime |\n| `api/db/migrate.ts` | migration runner public entry |\n| `api/db/migrate-sqlite.ts` | SQLite baseline migration runner |\n| `api/db/schema.ts` | SQLite baseline Drizzle schema |\n| `api/routes/auth.route.ts` | `/api/auth/*` route module |\n| `api/routes/health.route.ts` | health route |\n| `api/routes/protected.route.ts` | server-side protected API sample |\n| `api/modules/auth/` | Auth service、JWT、cookies、password hashing |\n| `api/middleware/auth.ts` | access-token auth middleware |\n| `shared/schemas/` | Zod schema and public API object types shared by api and web |\n| `web/src/App.tsx` | React Query and Router providers |\n| `web/src/router.tsx` | TanStack Router tree |\n| `web/src/api.ts` | browser API client and auth refresh handling |\n| `web/src/auth-context.tsx` | frontend auth state |\n| `web/src/routes/` | route definitions |\n| `web/src/views/` | Home/Login/Showcase views |\n| `web/src/showcase-*` | showcase state and URL search helpers |\n| `drizzle/` | SQL migrations |\n| `scripts/verify.ts` | verification pipeline |\n| `scripts/e2e-server.ts` | Playwright smoke server with isolated SQLite DB |\n| `tests/e2e/` | Playwright smoke tests |\n| `.github/workflows/verify.yml` | CI verification |\n| `Dockerfile`, `docker-compose.yml` | Optional SQLite baseline container runtime |\n\n## Task Routing\n\n| Task | Start here | Usually also read | Defer unless touched |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Change auth API | `api/routes/auth.route.ts`, `api/modules/auth/`, `api/middleware/auth.ts`, `shared/schemas/auth.schema.ts` | `web/src/api.ts`, `web/src/auth-context.tsx` | showcase UI |\n| Change protected sample | `api/routes/protected.route.ts`, `web/src/views/protected-view.tsx`, `web/src/routes/protected-route.tsx` | `api/middleware/auth.ts`, `shared/schemas/protected.schema.ts`, `web/src/api.ts` | showcase UI |\n| Change login UI | `web/src/views/login-view.tsx`, `web/src/domains/auth/login-domain.tsx` | `web/src/auth-context.tsx`, `web/src/api.ts` | DB schema |\n| Change app shell/routing | `web/src/routes/root-route.tsx`, `web/src/router.tsx` | `web/src/App.tsx`, affected view | auth service internals |\n| Change showcase UI | `web/src/views/showcase-view.tsx`, `web/src/showcase-settings-context.tsx`, `web/src/showcase-table-search.ts` | `web/src/styles.css` | backend auth |\n| Change env/config | `api/app/env.ts`, `api/config/appDefaults.ts`, `.env.example` | `drizzle.config.ts`, Docker/Compose if bind host or port changes | frontend views |\n| Change DB runtime/variant boundary | `api/db/index.ts`, `api/db/sqlite.ts`, `api/db/migrate.ts`, `api/db/migrate-sqlite.ts` | `api/cli/migrate.ts`, `api/cli/auth-create-admin.ts`, `docs/template-variant-management.md` | showcase UI |\n| Change DB schema/migration | `api/db/schema.ts`, `drizzle/`, `api/db/migrate*.ts` | `api/modules/auth/auth.service.ts`, `api/modules/auth/token.service.ts` | showcase UI |\n| Change build/dev tooling | `package.json`, `vite.config.ts`, `vitest.config.ts`, `playwright.config.ts`, `scripts/verify.ts` | `.github/workflows/verify.yml`, failing config-specific output | feature code |\n| Change docs | `README.md`, `LLM_CONTEXT.md`, `docs/` | `.gitignore` when generated output changes | feature code |\n\n## Styling / CSS Architecture\n\nUI 変更では、この節を styling 判断の入口にする。まず全 CSS を広く探索せず、以下の entrypoint と pattern source で説明できるか確認する。\n\n- Global style entrypoint: `web/src/styles.css`。Tailwind v4 の `@import \"tailwindcss\"`、`@theme` token、`@layer base`、`@layer components` をこの1ファイルに集約している。\n- CSS load path: `web/src/main.tsx` が `./styles.css` を import する。Tailwind plugin は `vite.config.ts` の `@tailwindcss/vite`。\n- Design tokens / theme values: `web/src/styles.css` の `@theme` が global token の source of truth。`--color-*` と `--radius-*` を Tailwind utility / `@apply` から使う。\n- Showcase theme values: `web/src/showcase-settings-context.tsx` が `--showcase-*` custom properties を生成し、`web/src/styles.css` の `.showcase-shell` と `:root[data-showcase-page-theme]` rules がそれを消費する。\n- Shared UI components and common patterns: `web/src/styles.css` の `.topbar`, `.menu-*`, `.auth-*`, `.home-*`, `.center-shell`, `.signed-in-panel`, `.showcase-*`, `.demo-*`, `.table-*` class families。\n- Page a"}],"recentCommitDiffs":[],"packageScripts":[{"name":"auth:create-admin","command":"bun run api/cli/auth-create-admin.ts"},{"name":"bootstrap","command":"bun scripts/bootstrap.ts"},{"name":"build","command":"bun run build:web"},{"name":"build:web","command":"vite build"},{"name":"db:generate","command":"drizzle-kit generate"},{"name":"db:migrate","command":"bun run api/cli/migrate.ts"},{"name":"db:migrate:drizzle","command":"drizzle-kit migrate"},{"name":"dev","command":"bunx --bun vite"},{"name":"dev:vite","command":"vite"},{"name":"format","command":"biome format --write api web shared scripts tests drizzle.config.ts playwright.config.ts vite.config.ts vitest.config.ts"},{"name":"format:check","command":"biome format api web shared scripts tests drizzle.config.ts playwright.config.ts vite.config.ts vitest.config.ts"},{"name":"lint","command":"biome lint api web shared scripts tests drizzle.config.ts playwright.config.ts vite.config.ts vitest.config.ts"},{"name":"seed:dev","command":"bun scripts/seed-dev.ts"},{"name":"start","command":"bun run api/app/server.ts"},{"name":"test","command":"vitest run"},{"name":"test:coverage","command":"vitest run --coverage"},{"name":"test:e2e","command":"playwright test"},{"name":"test:watch","command":"vitest"},{"name":"typecheck","command":"tsc --noEmit"},{"name":"verify","command":"bun scripts/verify.ts"},{"name":"verify:all","command":"bun run verify && bun run verify:e2e"},{"name":"verify:e2e","command":"bun run test:e2e"},{"name":"verify:strict","command":"bun run verify"}],"moduleOntology":null},"qualityCapabilities":{"projectType":"typescript","commands":[{"kind":"unit","source":"package_json","command":"bun run ''test''","runnable":true},{"kind":"coverage","source":"package_json","command":"bun run ''test:coverage''","runnable":true},{"kind":"e2e","source":"package_json","command":"bun run ''test:e2e''","runnable":true},{"kind":"verify","source":"package_json","command":"bun run ''verify''","runnable":true}],"missingCapabilities":[]},"recentTokenSpendTasks":[{"taskId":"3c40e22b-fbe5-48a1-ba92-64f990e589fd","title":"BBSを作りたいです。計画してください。","totalTokens":8468677,"callCount":8}],"recentRuns":{"completed":1,"failed":0,"running":0}}','{"role":"mission_task_generation","providerId":"codex","providerEndpointId":"ep_2a9c67769830da1e","routeSource":"primary","modelOrDeployment":"gpt-5.4-mini","thinkingDepth":null}','{"schemaVersion":"nightworkers.mission-task-candidates/v1","candidates":[{"title":"todo list 本体を実装する","summary":"未実装の todo list 機能を、一覧表示・追加・完了切り替えを含む本体として実装する入口候補。UI 詳細、状態管理、永続化、編集削除、検証方針は Plan Mode で確定する前提にする。","rationale":"repositorySnapshot は Hono + React + SQLite の template 寄りで、todo list 専用の実装は見当たらない。Mission Goal は機能本体の作成そのものなので、最初に本体実装の入口を置くのが直接的に Goal 達成へつながる。","goalId":"de3305e2-2269-4765-a117-5dd36de101e2","candidateKind":"feature_entrypoint","moduleRouting":{"primaryModule":null,"secondaryModules":["web/src","api/routes","api/db","shared/schemas"],"confidencePercent":24,"reason":"moduleOntology がなく、現状は template + BBS/認証サンプル中心に見えるため、todo list の正確なモジュール境界は未判定。UI と API/DB の両面が必要になる可能性が高い。"},"constraintGoalIds":[],"planModeOpenQuestions":["どの画面をホームにするか","todo の保存先を SQLite にするか","完了状態以外に編集・削除を含めるか","検証は unit / e2e のどこまでを必須にするか"],"evidence":[{"source":"mission_goal","label":"goalText","value":"考えられる最も使いやすいtodolistを作る"},{"source":"project_evaluation","label":"repositorySnapshot.description","value":"Minimal Hono + React template with optional login and showcase screens."},{"source":"project_evaluation","label":"llmContextFiles","value":"現行 branch は local SQLite auth/showcase template で、todo list 専用機能の記載はない"}],"evaluationContribution":42,"importancePercent":100,"confidencePercent":86,"tokenSize":"big","complexity":"complex","taskPrompt":"todo list 本体を実装してください。まず Plan Mode で、一覧/追加/完了切り替えのUI、データモデル、SQLite 永続化、編集削除の有無、完了状態の扱い、検証方針を短く決めてから実装に入ってください。","acceptanceCriteria":"todo list の本体機能がアプリ内で利用できること。少なくとも一覧表示と追加、完了状態の更新が動作し、既存の auth/showcase サンプルとは独立した機能として認識できること。UI / データモデル / 永続化 / 完了状態 / 編集削除 / 検証方針は Plan Mode で決定し、その決定に従って実装すること。","verificationPlan":"必要に応じて unit と e2e を追加し、既存の verify 体系で壊れていないことを確認する。todo list の作成、表示、完了切り替えが再現できることを最小確認として扱う。"},{"title":"todo list の永続化と API を整備する","summary":"todo list 本体を支える保存・取得・更新の API と SQLite スキーマを整備する候補。機能本体が作られる前提で、保存方式と状態遷移の土台を固める。","rationale":"Goal が未実装のため、本体実装の直下にあるデータ層を先に固める価値が高い。template は既に SQLite と Drizzle を持つので、todo list 用の schema と route を追加するのが直接的な補強になる。","goalId":"de3305e2-2269-4765-a117-5dd36de101e2","candidateKind":"feature_followup","moduleRouting":{"primaryModule":null,"secondaryModules":["api/db","api/routes","shared/schemas"],"confidencePercent":31,"reason":"todo list の本体モジュール名は未確定だが、保存と API は DB/runtime と route 層に集中すると見られる。moduleOntology がないため低信頼。"},"constraintGoalIds":[],"planModeOpenQuestions":["todo を単一テーブルで持つか","並び順を createdAt ベースにするか","更新可能なフィールドをどこまで許可するか"],"evidence":[{"source":"project_evaluation","label":"repositorySnapshot.migrationFiles","value":"drizzle/0001_auth.sql, drizzle/0002_bbs.sql があり、SQLite migration の土台は存在する"},{"source":"project_evaluation","label":"routeFiles","value":"api/routes/bbs.route.ts と api/db/schema.ts があり、同種の CRUD パターンを流用できる"},{"source":"project_evaluation","label":"qualityCapabilities","value":"unit / coverage / e2e / verify がすべて runnable"}],"evaluationContribution":26,"importancePercent":88,"confidencePercent":72,"tokenSize":"medium","complexity":"moderate","taskPrompt":"todo list の永続化と API 基盤を整備してください。SQLite スキーマ、shared schema、取得・作成・更新に必要な route を追加し、Plan Mode で決める保存方式と状態遷移に合わせて最小実装を作ってください。","acceptanceCriteria":"todo list の保存と取得、少なくとも作成と完了更新が API から扱えること。フロント本体が後から接続できる shared schema が用意され、既存の auth / bbs 機能を壊さないこと。","verificationPlan":"関連する route と schema の unit test を追加し、`bun run verify` で回ることを確認する。必要なら migration と DB runtime の接続も確認する。"},{"title":"todo list 画面をアプリに統合する","summary":"todo list 本体をユーザーが触れる画面としてルーティングとアプリシェルに統合する候補。実装済みの本体がある前提でも、入口導線がなければ Goal 達成にならないため優先度が高い。","rationale":"Goal 本体が API/DB 側でできても、UI 入口が無いと Mission Goal の可視成果にならない。template は React Router ベースなので、既存の home/showcase と競合しない導線を追加する価値がある。","goalId":"de3305e2-2269-4765-a117-5dd36de101e2","candidateKind":"feature_followup","moduleRouting":{"primaryModule":null,"secondaryModules":["web/src/routes","web/src/views","web/src/router.tsx"],"confidencePercent":29,"reason":"todo list の画面ルート構成は未判定だが、既存の React Router 構成に新規画面を統合する作業である可能性が高い。"},"constraintGoalIds":[],"planModeOpenQuestions":["ホームから遷移させるか直接表示するか","一覧と入力を同一画面に置くか","モバイル優先のレイアウトにするか"],"evidence":[{"source":"project_evaluation","label":"sourceFiles","value":"web/src/router.tsx, web/src/views/*, web/src/routes/* が存在する"},{"source":"project_evaluation","label":"repositorySnapshot.readmeExcerpt","value":"React Router ベースの画面を含む template と記載されている"},{"source":"project_evaluation","label":"latestEvaluation.summary","value":"BBS ルートや thread 系 UI も repo tree に見えるため、複数ドメインを載せる余地がある"}],"evaluationContribution":18,"importancePercent":74,"confidencePercent":68,"tokenSize":"medium","complexity":"moderate","taskPrompt":"todo list を触れる画面としてアプリに統合してください。既存 router / view 構成に合わせて導線を追加し、Plan Mode で決める画面配置とレイアウト方針に従って本体へ到達できるようにしてください。","acceptanceCriteria":"ユーザーが todo list 画面に到達でき、作成・表示・完了更新の主要操作が UI から実行できること。既存の home / showcase / auth 導線を壊さないこと。","verificationPlan":"ルーティング単位のテストと必要最小限の E2E で、画面到達と主要操作が通ることを確認する。"}]}',NULL,1783215958,1783216010);
INSERT INTO "mission_task_candidate_batches" ("id", "created_at", "updated_at", "repository_id", "status", "requested_goal_ids_json", "signal_snapshot_json", "selected_model_json", "raw_output_json", "error_message", "started_at", "completed_at") VALUES('d48a8e1e-7144-47db-96a1-e20d005ec19b',1783216872,1783216912,'984c8844-643e-4596-93a5-703a8d14a1e0','completed','["de3305e2-2269-4765-a117-5dd36de101e2"]','{"repository":{"id":"984c8844-643e-4596-93a5-703a8d14a1e0","name":"todolist","localPath":"/Users/y.noguchi/Code/todolist","branch":"main"},"activeGoals":[{"id":"de3305e2-2269-4765-a117-5dd36de101e2","title":"todo listを作る","goalText":"考えられる最も使いやすいtodolistを作る","interpretation":{"scope":"unknown","intent":"unknown","source":"unknown","confidencePercent":0,"reason":null}}],"latestEvaluation":{"id":"a9ff9b87-ada3-43cb-bc45-88b80d8b8644","overallScore":72,"dimensions":[{"key":"conceptValue","score":78,"label":"コンセプト価値"},{"key":"architectureQuality","score":80,"label":"アーキテクチャ"},{"key":"extensibility","score":74,"label":"拡張性"},{"key":"uiUx","score":69,"label":"UI / UX"},{"key":"operability","score":76,"label":"運用性"},{"key":"security","score":71,"label":"セキュリティ"},{"key":"maintainability","score":79,"label":"保守性"},{"key":"marketCompetitiveness","score":66,"label":"市場競争力"}],"summary":"Hono + React + SQLite を同一 origin でまとめたテンプレートとしては、認証、保護ルート、共有 schema、検証ゲートまで揃っており、実運用の土台として成立している。BBS ルートや thread 系 UI も repo tree に見えるため、単なる starter を越えて複数ドメインを載せる余地がある一方、評価根拠は repo structure と README/LLM_CONTEXT に限られるため、実装の細部と実行時品質は過大評価しない。"},"latestQuality":{"coverage":null,"e2e":{"status":"passed","total":2,"passed":2,"failed":0,"skipped":0,"durationMs":1170,"suites":[{"title":"smoke.spec.ts","status":"passed","tests":2,"durationMs":1170,"lastFailure":null}]}},"repositorySnapshot":{"packageName":"hono-standard","description":"Minimal Hono + React template with optional login and showcase screens.","readmeExcerpt":"# Hono Standard\n\n[![Bun](https://img.shields.io/badge/Bun-%23000000.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=bun&logoColor=white)](https://bun.sh/)\n[![Hono](https://img.shields.io/badge/Hono-%23E36022.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=hono&logoColor=white)](https://hono.dev/)\n[![React](https://img.shields.io/badge/React-%2320232a.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=react&logoColor=%2361DAFB)](https://react.dev/)\n[![SQLite](https://img.shields.io/badge/SQLite-003B57.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=sqlite&logoColor=white)](https://www.sqlite.org/)\n[![TypeScript](https://img.shields.io/badge/TypeScript-%23007ACC.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=typescript&logoColor=white)](https://www.typescriptlang.org/)\n[![MIT License](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-green.svg?style=for-the-badge)](LICENSE.md)\n\nHono backend と React + Vite frontend を同一 origin で動かす、local SQLite 対応の Web app template です。Drizzle のユーザー認証、httpOnly Cookie による access / refresh token、React Router ベースの画面、コンポーネント showcase を含みます。\n\n## 構成\n\n| Path | Role |\n| --- | --- |\n| `api/app/hono.ts` | Hono app composition。middleware、API route、静的配信、`AppType` を登録 |\n| `api/app/server.ts` | Bun server bootstrap |\n| `api/app/env.ts` | runtime env parser |\n| `api/config/appDefaults.ts` | 非シークレットの既定値 |\n| `api/db/index.ts` | DB runtime の public entry。variant はここから差し替える |\n| `api/db/sqlite.ts` | SQLite baseline の Drizzle runtime |\n| `api/db/schema.ts` | Drizzle SQLite schema |\n| `api/db/migrate.ts` | migration runner の public entry |\n| `api/db/migrate-sqlite.ts` | SQLite baseline の migration runner |\n| `api/routes/auth.route.ts` | `/api/auth/*` route |\n| `api/routes/health.route.ts` | `/api/health` route |\n| `api/routes/protected.route.ts` | `/api/protected/*` の server-side protected sample |\n| `api/modules/auth/` | password hash、JWT、cookie、auth service |\n| `api/middleware/auth.ts` | protected API middleware |\n| `web/src/` | React frontend |\n| `shared/schemas/` | frontend/backend で共有する Zod schema と API object type |\n| `drizzle/` | SQL migrations |\n| `scripts/verify.ts` | typecheck / lint / format / test / coverage / build の検証 pipeline |\n\n## 前提\n\n| Tool | 用途 |\n| --- | --- |\n| Bun | package manager、runtime、scripts |\n| SQLite | auth user / refresh token storage |\n\n## セットアップ\n\n```bash\nbun run bootstrap\nbun run auth:create-admin -- --email admin@example.com --name \"Admin User\"\nbun run dev\n```\n\n`bootstrap` は `.env` を用意し、dependency が未導入なら `bun install --frozen-lockfile` を実行し、SQLite database に migration を適用します。\n\n`auth:create-admin` は対話で password を読みます。自動化する場合は次のように標準入力から渡せます。\n\n```bash\nprintf ''%s\\n'' ''<password>'' | bun run auth:create-admin -- --email admin@example.com --name \"Admin User\" --password-stdin\n```\n\n開発サーバーは `http://localhost:5173` で起動します。Vite dev server が frontend を配信し、`/api/*` は Hono に渡されます。\n\n初回 clone 後に template の動作確認まで済ませる場合は、次を実行します。\n\n```bash\nbun run verify\nbun run verify:e2e\n```\n\n認証を使う app では `auth:create-admin` または `seed:dev` で admin を作成してから `/login` を確認します。認証を使わない app では、この README 後半の auth removal checklist に沿って auth route、DB table、login/protected screen、E2E scope をまとめて削ります。\n\n## 生成物と管理対象\n\nこの template では、source と docs は追跡し、local runtime や検証の生成物は追跡しません。\n\n| Path / Pattern | 扱い |\n| --- | --- |\n| `drizzle/*.sql` | Drizzle migration source。commit 対象 |\n| `.env.example` | local development の雛形。commit 対象 |\n| `.env*` | local secret / runtime env。`.env.example` 以外は commit しない |\n| `data/`, `*.db`, `*.sqlite`, `*.sqlite3` | local SQLite database。commit しない |\n| `coverage/`, `playwright-report/`, `test-results/` | verification output。commit しない |\n| `dist/`, `dist-web/`, `build/`, `*.tgz` | build / archive output。commit しない |\n\n## 環境変数\n\n非シークレットの既定値は `api/config/appDefaults.ts` にあります。`.env.example` は local development 向けの値です。\n\n| Variable | Required | Description | Default |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `NODE_ENV` | no | `development` / `test` / `production` | `development` |\n| `HOST` | no | HTTP bind host。container では `0.0.0.0` を指定 | `127.0.0.1` |\n| `PORT` | no | HTTP server port | `5173` |\n| `DATABASE_URL` | no | SQLite database ","sourceFiles":["LLM_CONTEXT.md","README.md","api/app/env.test.ts","api/app/env.ts","api/app/hono.test.ts","api/app/hono.ts","api/app/security-headers.ts","api/app/server.ts","api/cli/auth-create-admin.ts","api/cli/cli-contract.test.ts","api/cli/migrate.ts","api/config/appDefaults.ts","api/db/index.ts","api/db/migrate-sqlite.ts","api/db/migrate.ts","api/db/path.test.ts","api/db/path.ts","api/db/schema.ts","api/db/sqlite.ts","api/middleware/auth.test.ts","api/middleware/auth.ts","api/modules/auth/auth-cookies.test.ts","api/modules/auth/auth-cookies.ts","api/modules/auth/auth.service.test.ts","api/modules/auth/auth.service.ts","api/modules/auth/context.test.ts","api/modules/auth/context.ts","api/modules/auth/errors.test.ts","api/modules/auth/errors.ts","api/modules/auth/password.test.ts","api/modules/auth/password.ts","api/modules/auth/token.service.test.ts","api/modules/auth/token.service.ts","api/modules/auth/types.test.ts","api/modules/auth/types.ts","api/routes/auth.route.test.ts","api/routes/auth.route.ts","api/routes/bbs.route.test.ts","api/routes/bbs.route.ts","api/routes/health.route.test.ts","api/routes/health.route.ts","api/routes/protected.route.test.ts","api/routes/protected.route.ts","api/types/hono-context.d.ts","biome.json","docs/template-variant-management.md","drizzle.config.ts","drizzle/0001_auth.sql","drizzle/0002_bbs.sql","package.json","playwright.config.ts","scripts/bootstrap.test.ts","scripts/bootstrap.ts","scripts/e2e-server.ts","scripts/seed-dev.ts","scripts/verify.ts","shared/schemas/auth.schema.ts","shared/schemas/protected.schema.test.ts","shared/schemas/protected.schema.ts","tests/e2e/smoke.spec.ts","tsconfig.build.json","tsconfig.json","vite.config.ts","vitest.config.ts","web/src/App.tsx","web/src/api.test.ts","web/src/api.ts","web/src/auth-context.tsx","web/src/components/dev-error-panel.tsx","web/src/domains/auth/login-domain.tsx","web/src/main.tsx","web/src/router.tsx","web/src/routes/home-route.tsx","web/src/routes/login-route.tsx","web/src/routes/login-search.ts","web/src/routes/protected-route.tsx","web/src/routes/root-route.tsx","web/src/routes/route-access.test.ts","web/src/routes/route-access.ts","web/src/routes/showcase-route.tsx","web/src/routes/thread-detail-route.tsx","web/src/routes/thread-new-route.tsx","web/src/routes/threads-route.tsx","web/src/showcase-settings-context.tsx","web/src/showcase-table-search.ts","web/src/styles.css","web/src/views/home-view.tsx","web/src/views/login-view.tsx","web/src/views/protected-view.tsx","web/src/views/showcase-view.tsx","web/src/views/thread-detail-view.tsx","web/src/views/thread-new-view.tsx","web/src/views/threads-view.tsx"],"routeFiles":["api/routes/auth.route.test.ts","api/routes/auth.route.ts","api/routes/bbs.route.test.ts","api/routes/bbs.route.ts","api/routes/health.route.test.ts","api/routes/health.route.ts","api/routes/protected.route.test.ts","api/routes/protected.route.ts","web/src/routes/home-route.tsx","web/src/routes/login-route.tsx","web/src/routes/login-search.ts","web/src/routes/protected-route.tsx","web/src/routes/root-route.tsx","web/src/routes/route-access.test.ts","web/src/routes/route-access.ts","web/src/routes/showcase-route.tsx","web/src/routes/thread-detail-route.tsx","web/src/routes/thread-new-route.tsx","web/src/routes/threads-route.tsx","web/src/views/home-view.tsx","web/src/views/login-view.tsx","web/src/views/protected-view.tsx","web/src/views/showcase-view.tsx","web/src/views/thread-detail-view.tsx","web/src/views/thread-new-view.tsx","web/src/views/threads-view.tsx"],"migrationFiles":["drizzle/0001_auth.sql","drizzle/0002_bbs.sql"],"sourceExcerpts":[{"path":"README.md","excerpt":"# Hono Standard\n[![Bun](https://img.shields.io/badge/Bun-%23000000.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=bun&logoColor=white)](https://bun.sh/)\n[![Hono](https://img.shields.io/badge/Hono-%23E36022.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=hono&logoColor=white)](https://hono.dev/)\n[![React](https://img.shields.io/badge/React-%2320232a.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=react&logoColor=%2361DAFB)](https://react.dev/)\n[![SQLite](https://img.shields.io/badge/SQLite-003B57.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=sqlite&logoColor=white)](https://www.sqlite.org/)\n[![TypeScript](https://img.shields.io/badge/TypeScript-%23007ACC.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=typescript&logoColor=white)](https://www.typescriptlang.org/)\n[![MIT License](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-green.svg?style=for-the-badge)](LICENSE.md)\nHono backend と React + Vite frontend を同一 origin で動かす、local SQLite 対応の Web app template です。Drizzle のユーザー認証、httpOnly Cookie による access / refresh token、React Router ベースの画面、コンポーネント showcase を含みます。\n## 構成\n| Path | Role |\n| --- | --- |\n| `api/app/hono.ts` | Hono app composition。middleware、API route、静的配信、`AppType` を登録 |\n| `api/app/server.ts` | Bun server bootstrap |\n| `api/app/env.ts` | runtime env parser |\n| `api/config/appDefaults.ts` | 非シークレットの既定値 |\n| `api/db/index.ts` | DB runtime の public entry。variant はここから差し替える |\n| `api/db/sqlite.ts` | SQLite baseline の Drizzle runtime |\n| `api/db/schema.ts` | Drizzle SQLite schema |\n| `api/db/migrate.ts` | migration runner の public entry |\n| `api/db/migrate-sqlite.ts` | SQLite baseline の migration runner |\n| `api/routes/auth.route.ts` | `/api/auth/*` route |\n| `api/routes/health.route.ts` | `/api/health` route |\n| `api/routes/protected.route.ts` | `/api/protected/*` の server-side protected sample |\n| `api/modules/auth/` | password hash、JWT、cookie、auth service |\n| `api/mi"},{"path":"api/app/env.test.ts","excerpt":"import { describe, expect, it } from \"vitest\";\nimport { APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS } from \"../config/appDefaults\";\nimport { readAppEnv } from \"./env\";\ndescribe(\"readAppEnv\", () => {\n\tit(\"uses minimal app defaults\", () => {\n\t\tconst env = readAppEnv({});\n\t\texpect(env.nodeEnv).toBe(\"development\");\n\t\texpect(env.host).toBe(APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS.host);\n\t\texpect(env.port).toBe(APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS.port);\n\t\texpect(env.databaseUrl).toBe(APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS.databaseUrl);\n\t\texpect(env.appUrl).toBe(APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS.appUrl);\n\t\texpect(env.corsOrigins).toEqual(APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS.corsOrigins);\n\t\texpect(env.cookieSameSite).toBe(APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS.cookieSameSite);\n\t});\n\tit(\"accepts database and auth runtime overrides\", () => {\n\t\tconst env = readAppEnv({\n\t\t\tHOST: \"0.0.0.0\",\n\t\t\tPORT: \"5174\",\n\t\t\tDATABASE_URL: \"tmp/test.sqlite\",\n\t\t\tJWT_SECRET: \"x\".repeat(32),\n\t\t\tAPP_URL: \"https://showcase.example.com\",\n\t\t\tCORS_ORIGINS: \"https://showcase.example.com,http://localhost:5173\",\n\t\t\tAUTH_COOKIE_SECURE: \"true\",\n\t\t\tAUTH_COOKIE_SAME_SITE: \"none\",\n\t\t\tSECURITY_HEADERS_MODE: \"https\",\n\t\t});\n\t\texpect(env.host).toBe(\"0.0.0.0\");\n\t\texpect(env.port).toBe(5174);\n\t\texpect(env.databaseUrl).toBe(\"tmp/test.sqlite\");\n\t\texpect(env.jwtSecret).toBe(\"x\".repeat(32));\n\t\texpect(env.appUrl).toBe(\"https://showcase.example.com\");\n\t\texpect(env.corsOrigins).toEqual([\n\t\t\t\"https://showcase.example.com\",\n\t\t\t\"http://localhost:5173\",\n\t\t]);\n\t\texpect(env.secureCookie).toBe(true);\n\t\texpect(env.cookieSameSite).toBe(\"none\");\n\t\texpect(env.securityHeadersMode).toBe(\"https\");\n\t});\n\tit(\"falls back to the SQLite default when a dev shell provides a connection URL\", () => {\n\t\tconst env = readAppEnv({\n\t\t\tDATABASE_URL: \"postgres://postgres:postgres@127.0.0.1:5432/app\",\n\t\t});\n\t\texpect(env.databaseUrl).toBe(APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS.databaseUrl);\n\t});\n\tit(\"rej"},{"path":"api/app/env.ts","excerpt":"import { z } from \"zod\";\nimport { APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS } from \"../config/appDefaults\";\nimport { isDatabaseConnectionUrl } from \"../db/path\";\nconst optionalTrimmedString = z.preprocess((value) => {\n\tif (typeof value !== \"string\") return value;\n\tconst trimmed = value.trim();\n\treturn trimmed.length > 0 ? trimmed : undefined;\n}, z.string().trim().optional());\nconst optionalUrl = z.preprocess((value) => {\n\tif (typeof value !== \"string\") return value;\n\tconst trimmed = value.trim();\n\treturn trimmed.length > 0 ? trimmed : undefined;\n}, z.string().url().optional());\nconst optionalBoolean = z.preprocess((value) => {\n\tif (typeof value === \"boolean\") return value;\n\tif (typeof value !== \"string\") return value;\n\tconst normalized = value.trim().toLowerCase();\n\tif (!normalized) return undefined;\n\tif ([\"1\", \"true\", \"yes\", \"on\"].includes(normalized)) return true;\n\tif ([\"0\", \"false\", \"no\", \"off\"].includes(normalized)) return false;\n\treturn value;\n}, z.boolean().optional());\nconst optionalPort = z.preprocess((value) => {\n\tif (typeof value === \"number\") return value;\n\tif (typeof value !== \"string\") return value;\n\tconst trimmed = value.trim();\n\treturn trimmed.length > 0 ? Number(trimmed) : undefined;\n}, z.number().int().min(1).max(65535).optional());\nconst optionalCookieSameSite = z.preprocess((value) => {\n\tif (typeof value !== \"string\") return value;\n\tconst normalized = value.trim().toLowerCase();\n\treturn normalized.length > 0 ? normalized : undefined;\n}, z.enum([\"lax\", \"strict\", \"none\"]).optional());\nconst optionalSecurityHeadersMode = z.preprocess(\n\t(value) => {\n\t\tif (typeof value !== \"string\") return value;\n\t\tconst normalized = value.trim().toLowerCase();\n\t\treturn normalized.length > 0 ? normalized : undefined;\n\t},\n\tz.enum([\"auto\", \"http\", \"https\"]).default(\"auto\"),\n);\nconst EnvSchema = z"},{"path":"api/app/hono.test.ts","excerpt":"import { describe, expect, it, vi, beforeEach } from \"vitest\";\nimport fs from \"node:fs/promises\";\nimport { HttpError } from \"../modules/auth/errors\";\nimport { HTTPException } from \"hono/http-exception\";\n// Mock environment and DB connection before importing app\nvi.mock(\"../db\", () => ({\n\tcreateDbRuntime: vi.fn().mockReturnValue({\n\t\tdb: {\n\t\t\tquery: {\n\t\t\t\tusers: {\n\t\t\t\t\tfindFirst: vi.fn(),\n\t\t\t\t},\n\t\t\t},\n\t\t},\n\t\tclose: vi.fn(),\n\t\tconnection: {\n\t\t\tclient: {\n\t\t\t\tclose: vi.fn(),\n\t\t\t},\n\t\t\townsConnection: false,\n\t\t},\n\t}),\n}));\nvi.mock(\"./env\", () => ({\n\treadAppEnv: vi.fn().mockReturnValue({\n\t\tnodeEnv: \"test\",\n\t\thost: \"127.0.0.1\",\n\t\tport: 5173,\n\t\tdatabaseUrl: \"mock.db\",\n\t\tjwtSecret: \"x\".repeat(32),\n\t\tjwtAccessExpiresIn: \"15m\",\n\t\tjwtRefreshExpiresIn: \"7d\",\n\t\tappUrl: \"http://localhost:5173\",\n\t\tcorsOrigins: [\"http://localhost:5173\"],\n\t\ttrustProxy: true,\n\t\tsecureCookie: false,\n\t\tcookieSameSite: \"lax\",\n\t\tsecurityHeadersMode: \"auto\",\n\t}),\n}));\n// Mock Bun global variable before importing hono/bun dependent code\n(globalThis as any).Bun = {\n\tfile: (path: string) => ({\n\t\texists: () => Promise.resolve(true),\n\t}),\n};\n// Dynamically import app so globalThis.Bun is defined first\nconst { default: app } = await import(\"./hono\");\n// Add test routes before any request is processed (Hono routers lock after first request)\napp.post(\"/api/test-http-error\", () => {\n\tthrow new HttpError(400, \"Bad Parameters\");\n});\napp.post(\"/api/test-hono-http-exception\", () => {\n\tthrow new HTTPException(403, { message: \"Access Forbidden\" });\n});\napp.post(\"/api/test-generic-error\", () => {\n\tthrow new Error(\"Something blew up\");\n});\ndescribe(\"hono app entry\", () => {\n\tbeforeEach(() => {\n\t\tvi.restoreAllMocks();\n\t});\n\tit(\"should return 200 for /api/health\", async () => {\n\t\tconst res = await app.request(\"/api/health\");\n\t\texp"},{"path":"api/app/hono.ts","excerpt":"import fs from \"node:fs/promises\";\nimport path from \"node:path\";\nimport { serveStatic } from \"hono/bun\";\nimport { csrf } from \"hono/csrf\";\nimport { Hono } from \"hono\";\nimport { cors } from \"hono/cors\";\nimport { logger } from \"hono/logger\";\nimport { HTTPException } from \"hono/http-exception\";\nimport { secureHeaders } from \"hono/secure-headers\";\nimport type { DbRuntime } from \"../db\";\nimport { createDbRuntime } from \"../db\";\nimport { requireAuth } from \"../middleware/auth\";\nimport { AuthService } from \"../modules/auth/auth.service\";\nimport { HttpError } from \"../modules/auth/errors\";\nimport { createBbsRoute } from \"../routes/bbs.route\";\nimport { createAuthRoute } from \"../routes/auth.route\";\nimport { createHealthRoute } from \"../routes/health.route\";\nimport { createProtectedRoute } from \"../routes/protected.route\";\nimport { readAppEnv, type AppEnv } from \"./env\";\nimport { appContentSecurityPolicy } from \"./security-headers\";\nexport type AppDeps = {\n\tenv: AppEnv;\n\tdbRuntime: DbRuntime;\n\tauthService: AuthService;\n};\ndeclare global {\n\tvar __honoStandardRuntime__: Promise<AppDeps> | undefined;\n}\nexport async function createDefaultAppDeps(): Promise<AppDeps> {\n\tconst env = readAppEnv();\n\tconst dbRuntime = createDbRuntime(env);\n\tconst authService = new AuthService(dbRuntime.db, env);\n\treturn { env, dbRuntime, authService };\n}\nexport async function getAppRuntime(): Promise<AppDeps> {\n\tif (!globalThis.__honoStandardRuntime__) {\n\t\tglobalThis.__honoStandardRuntime__ = createDefaultAppDeps().catch(\n\t\t\t(error) => {\n\t\t\t\tglobalThis.__honoStandardRuntime__ = undefined;\n\t\t\t\tthrow error;\n\t\t\t},\n\t\t);\n\t}\n\treturn globalThis.__honoStandardRuntime__;\n}\nconst distWebRoot = path.resolve(process.cwd(), \"dist-web\");\nconst distWebIndex = path.resolve(distWebRoot, \"index.html\");\nexport function creat"},{"path":"api/app/security-headers.ts","excerpt":"type CspDirectives = Record<string, string[]>;\nexport const appContentSecurityPolicy: CspDirectives = {\n\tdefaultSrc: [\"''self''\"],\n\tbaseUri: [\"''self''\"],\n\tconnectSrc: [\"''self''\"],\n\tfontSrc: [\"''self''\", \"data:\"],\n\tformAction: [\"''self''\"],\n\tframeAncestors: [\"''self''\"],\n\timgSrc: [\"''self''\", \"data:\", \"blob:\"],\n\tmanifestSrc: [\"''self''\"],\n\tobjectSrc: [\"''none''\"],\n\tscriptSrc: [\"''self''\"],\n\tstyleSrc: [\"''self''\", \"''unsafe-inline''\"],\n\tworkerSrc: [\"''self''\", \"blob:\"],\n};\nexport const viteDevContentSecurityPolicy: CspDirectives = {\n\t...appContentSecurityPolicy,\n\tconnectSrc: [\n\t\t\"''self''\",\n\t\t\"ws:\",\n\t\t\"http://localhost:5173\",\n\t\t\"http://127.0.0.1:5173\",\n\t],\n\tscriptSrc: [\"''self''\", \"''unsafe-inline''\", \"''unsafe-eval''\"],\n};\nconst toKebabCase = (value: string): string =>\n\tvalue.replace(/[A-Z]+(?![a-z])|[A-Z]/g, (match, offset) =>\n\t\toffset ? `-${match.toLowerCase()}` : match.toLowerCase(),\n\t);\nexport function serializeContentSecurityPolicy(policy: CspDirectives): string {\n\treturn Object.entries(policy)\n\t\t.map(\n\t\t\t([directive, values]) => `${toKebabCase(directive)} ${values.join(\" \")}`,\n\t\t)\n\t\t.join(\"; \");\n}"},{"path":"api/app/server.ts","excerpt":"import app, { getAppRuntime } from \"./hono\";\nimport { readAppEnv } from \"./env\";\nconst env = readAppEnv();\nconst server = Bun.serve({\n\tfetch: app.fetch,\n\thostname: env.host,\n\tport: env.port,\n});\nconsole.log(\n\t`Hono Standard server listening on http://${env.host}:${server.port}`,\n);\nconst shutdown = async (signal: string) => {\n\tconsole.log(`\\nReceived ${signal}. Shutting down gracefully...`);\n\tserver.stop(true);\n\ttry {\n\t\tconst runtime = await getAppRuntime();\n\t\tconsole.log(\"Closing database connection...\");\n\t\truntime.dbRuntime.close();\n\t\tconsole.log(\"Shutdown complete.\");\n\t\tprocess.exit(0);\n\t} catch (error) {\n\t\tconsole.error(\"Error during shutdown:\", error);\n\t\tprocess.exit(1);\n\t}\n};\nprocess.on(\"SIGINT\", () => shutdown(\"SIGINT\"));\nprocess.on(\"SIGTERM\", () => shutdown(\"SIGTERM\"));"},{"path":"api/routes/auth.route.test.ts","excerpt":"import { Hono } from \"hono\";\nimport { describe, expect, it, vi, beforeEach } from \"vitest\";\nimport { createAuthRoute } from \"./auth.route\";\nimport { requireAuth } from \"../middleware/auth\";\nimport type { AppEnv } from \"../app/env\";\nimport type { AuthService } from \"../modules/auth/auth.service\";\nimport { HttpError } from \"../modules/auth/errors\";\nimport {\n\tACCESS_TOKEN_COOKIE_NAME,\n\tREFRESH_TOKEN_COOKIE_NAME,\n} from \"../modules/auth/auth-cookies\";\ndescribe(\"auth route\", () => {\n\tlet app: Hono;\n\tlet mockAuthService: any;\n\tlet mockEnv: AppEnv;\n\tconst testUser = {\n\t\tid: \"a1a1a1a1-a1a1-41a1-a1a1-a1a1a1a1a1a1\",\n\t\temail: \"test@example.com\",\n\t\tdisplayName: \"Test User\",\n\t\trole: \"member\" as const,\n\t\tisActive: true,\n\t};\n\tbeforeEach(() => {\n\t\tmockEnv = {\n\t\t\tjwtSecret: \"x\".repeat(32),\n\t\t\tjwtAccessExpiresIn: \"15m\",\n\t\t\tjwtRefreshExpiresIn: \"7d\",\n\t\t\tsecureCookie: true,\n\t\t\tcookieSameSite: \"lax\",\n\t\t} as unknown as AppEnv;\n\t\tmockAuthService = {\n\t\t\tlogin: vi.fn(),\n\t\t\trefresh: vi.fn(),\n\t\t\tlogout: vi.fn(),\n\t\t\tfindUserById: vi.fn(),\n\t\t};\n\t\tapp = new Hono();\n\t\t// Set error handler to prevent throwing unhandled exceptions in tests\n\t\tapp.onError((err, c) => {\n\t\t\tconst status = (err as HttpError).status || 500;\n\t\t\treturn c.json({ message: err.message }, status as any);\n\t\t});\n\t\tapp.use(\n\t\t\t\"/auth/me\",\n\t\t\trequireAuth({\n\t\t\t\tenv: mockEnv,\n\t\t\t\tauthService: mockAuthService as unknown as AuthService,\n\t\t\t}),\n\t\t);\n\t\tapp.route(\n\t\t\t\"/auth\",\n\t\t\tcreateAuthRoute({\n\t\t\t\tauthService: mockAuthService as unknown as AuthService,\n\t\t\t\tenv: mockEnv,\n\t\t\t}),\n\t\t);\n\t});\n\tdescribe(\"POST /login\", () => {\n\t\tit(\"should login user with valid credentials and set cookies\", async () => {\n\t\t\tmockAuthService.login.mockResolvedValue({\n\t\t\t\taccessToken: \"access-token-123\",\n\t\t\t\trefreshToken: \"refresh-token-456\",\n\t\t\t\tuser: {\n\t\t\t\t\tid: te"},{"path":"api/routes/auth.route.ts","excerpt":"import { zValidator } from \"@hono/zod-validator\";\nimport { Hono } from \"hono\";\nimport { getCookie } from \"hono/cookie\";\nimport { loginSchema } from \"../../shared/schemas/auth.schema\";\nimport type { AppEnv } from \"../app/env\";\nimport type { AuthService } from \"../modules/auth/auth.service\";\nimport {\n\tREFRESH_TOKEN_COOKIE_NAME,\n\tclearAuthCookies,\n\tsetAuthCookies,\n} from \"../modules/auth/auth-cookies\";\nimport { getAuthContextUser } from \"../modules/auth/context\";\nimport { HttpError } from \"../modules/auth/errors\";\ntype AuthRouteDeps = {\n\tauthService: AuthService;\n\tenv: AppEnv;\n};\nexport function createAuthRoute(deps: AuthRouteDeps) {\n\treturn new Hono()\n\t\t.post(\"/login\", zValidator(\"json\", loginSchema), async (c) => {\n\t\t\tconst body = c.req.valid(\"json\");\n\t\t\tconst result = await deps.authService.login({\n\t\t\t\temail: body.email,\n\t\t\t\tpassword: body.password,\n\t\t\t});\n\t\t\tsetAuthCookies(c, deps.env, result);\n\t\t\treturn c.json({ user: result.user });\n\t\t})\n\t\t.post(\"/refresh\", async (c) => {\n\t\t\tconst refreshToken = getCookie(c, REFRESH_TOKEN_COOKIE_NAME);\n\t\t\tif (!refreshToken) {\n\t\t\t\tthrow new HttpError(401, \"Unauthorized\");\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\tconst result = await deps.authService.refresh(refreshToken);\n\t\t\tsetAuthCookies(c, deps.env, result);\n\t\t\treturn c.json({ user: result.user });\n\t\t})\n\t\t.post(\"/logout\", async (c) => {\n\t\t\tconst refreshToken = getCookie(c, REFRESH_TOKEN_COOKIE_NAME);\n\t\t\tawait deps.authService.logout(refreshToken);\n\t\t\tclearAuthCookies(c);\n\t\t\treturn c.json({ ok: true });\n\t\t})\n\t\t.get(\"/me\", async (c) => {\n\t\t\tconst authUser = getAuthContextUser(c);\n\t\t\tconst user = await deps.authService.findUserById(authUser.userId);\n\t\t\tif (!user?.isActive) {\n\t\t\t\tthrow new HttpError(401, \"Unauthorized\");\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\treturn c.json({\n\t\t\t\tuser: {\n\t\t\t\t\tid: user.id,\n\t\t\t\t\temail: user.email,\n\t\t\t\t\tdisplayName: us"},{"path":"api/routes/bbs.route.test.ts","excerpt":"import { Hono } from \"hono\";\nimport { HttpError } from \"../modules/auth/errors\";\nimport { afterEach, describe, expect, it, vi } from \"vitest\";\nimport { createBbsRoute } from \"./bbs.route\";\nimport { posts, threads } from \"../db/schema\";\ntype ThreadRow = {\n\tid: number;\n\ttitle: string;\n\tcreatedAt: Date;\n\tupdatedAt: Date;\n\tlastPostAt: Date;\n\treplyCount: number;\n};\ntype PostRow = {\n\tid: number;\n\tthreadId: number;\n\tparentPostId: number | null;\n\tauthorName: string;\n\tbody: string;\n\tcreatedAt: Date;\n\tupdatedAt: Date;\n};\nfunction createFakeDb(options?: {\n\tfailThreadInsert?: boolean;\n\tfailParentLookup?: boolean;\n}) {\n\tconst state = {\n\t\tthreadId: 0,\n\t\tpostId: 0,\n\t\tthreads: [] as ThreadRow[],\n\t\tposts: [] as PostRow[],\n\t};\n\tconst select = (selection?: Record<string, unknown>) => ({\n\t\tfrom(table: unknown) {\n\t\t\tif (table === threads) {\n\t\t\t\tconst build = (predicate?: unknown) => ({\n\t\t\t\t\tget: async () =>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tstate.threads.find((thread) =>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tmatchThreadPredicate(thread, predicate),\n\t\t\t\t\t\t) ?? null,\n\t\t\t\t\tall: async () =>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t[...state.threads]\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t.sort((a, b) => b.lastPostAt.getTime() - a.lastPostAt.getTime())\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t.map((thread) => ({\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tid: thread.id,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\ttitle: thread.title,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tcreatedAt: thread.createdAt,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tupdatedAt: thread.updatedAt,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tlastPostAt: thread.lastPostAt,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\treplyCount: thread.replyCount,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t})),\n\t\t\t\t});\n\t\t\t\treturn {\n\t\t\t\t\twhere: (predicate?: unknown) => build(predicate),\n\t\t\t\t\torderBy: () => build(),\n\t\t\t\t};\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\tconst build = (predicate?: unknown) => {\n\t\t\t\tconst rows = state.posts.filter((post) =>\n\t\t\t\t\tmatchPostPredicate(post, predicate, options?.failParentLookup),\n\t\t\t\t);\n\t\t\t\tconst query = {\n\t\t\t\t\tget: async () => rows[0] ?? null,\n\t\t\t\t\tall: async () =>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t[...rows].sort((a, b) => a.createdAt.getTime() - b.createdAt.getTi"},{"path":"api/routes/bbs.route.ts","excerpt":"import { zValidator } from \"@hono/zod-validator\";\nimport { and, asc, desc, eq } from \"drizzle-orm\";\nimport { Hono } from \"hono\";\nimport { z } from \"zod\";\nimport type { AppDatabase } from \"../db\";\nimport { posts, threads } from \"../db/schema\";\nimport { HttpError } from \"../modules/auth/errors\";\ntype BbsRouteDeps = {\n\tdb: AppDatabase;\n};\nconst threadCreateSchema = z.object({\n\ttitle: z.string().trim().min(1).max(120),\n\tbody: z.string().trim().min(1).max(4000),\n\tauthorName: z.string().trim().min(1).max(80).optional(),\n});\nconst replyCreateSchema = z.object({\n\tbody: z.string().trim().min(1).max(4000),\n\tauthorName: z.string().trim().min(1).max(80).optional(),\n\tparentPostId: z.number().int().positive().optional(),\n});\nasync function getThreadOrThrow(db: AppDatabase, id: number) {\n\tconst row = await db.select().from(threads).where(eq(threads.id, id)).get();\n\tif (!row) throw new HttpError(404, \"Thread not found\");\n\treturn row;\n}\nexport function createBbsRoute(deps: BbsRouteDeps) {\n\treturn new Hono()\n\t\t.get(\"/threads\", async (c) => {\n\t\t\tconst items = await deps.db\n\t\t\t\t.select({\n\t\t\t\t\tid: threads.id,\n\t\t\t\t\ttitle: threads.title,\n\t\t\t\t\tcreatedAt: threads.createdAt,\n\t\t\t\t\tupdatedAt: threads.updatedAt,\n\t\t\t\t\tlastPostAt: threads.lastPostAt,\n\t\t\t\t\treplyCount: threads.replyCount,\n\t\t\t\t})\n\t\t\t\t.from(threads)\n\t\t\t\t.orderBy(desc(threads.lastPostAt), desc(threads.createdAt))\n\t\t\t\t.all();\n\t\t\treturn c.json({ threads: items });\n\t\t})\n\t\t.get(\"/threads/:id\", async (c) => {\n\t\t\tconst id = Number(c.req.param(\"id\"));\n\t\t\tif (!Number.isInteger(id)) throw new HttpError(400, \"Invalid thread id\");\n\t\t\tconst thread = await getThreadOrThrow(deps.db, id);\n\t\t\tconst items = await deps.db\n\t\t\t\t.select({\n\t\t\t\t\tid: posts.id,\n\t\t\t\t\tthreadId: posts.threadId,\n\t\t\t\t\tparentPostId: posts.parentPostId,\n\t\t\t\t\tauthorName: posts.authorName"},{"path":"api/routes/health.route.test.ts","excerpt":"import { Hono } from \"hono\";\nimport { describe, expect, it } from \"vitest\";\nimport { createHealthRoute } from \"./health.route\";\ndescribe(\"health route\", () => {\n\tit(\"should return ok status\", async () => {\n\t\tconst app = new Hono().route(\"/health\", createHealthRoute());\n\t\tconst res = await app.request(\"/health\");\n\t\texpect(res.status).toBe(200);\n\t\tconst body = await res.json();\n\t\texpect(body).toEqual({\n\t\t\tstatus: \"ok\",\n\t\t\tservice: \"hono-standard\",\n\t\t});\n\t});\n});"},{"path":"api/routes/health.route.ts","excerpt":"import { Hono } from \"hono\";\nexport function createHealthRoute() {\n\treturn new Hono().get(\"/\", (c) => {\n\t\treturn c.json({ status: \"ok\", service: \"hono-standard\" });\n\t});\n}"},{"path":"api/routes/protected.route.test.ts","excerpt":"import { Hono } from \"hono\";\nimport { describe, expect, it } from \"vitest\";\nimport { createProtectedRoute } from \"./protected.route\";\ndescribe(\"protected route\", () => {\n\tit(\"returns the authenticated profile from context\", async () => {\n\t\tconst app = new Hono();\n\t\tapp.use(\"/protected/*\", async (c, next) => {\n\t\t\tc.set(\"authUser\", {\n\t\t\t\tuserId: \"a1a1a1a1-a1a1-41a1-a1a1-a1a1a1a1a1a1\",\n\t\t\t\temail: \"test@example.com\",\n\t\t\t\trole: \"member\",\n\t\t\t});\n\t\t\tawait next();\n\t\t});\n\t\tapp.route(\"/protected\", createProtectedRoute());\n\t\tconst res = await app.request(\"/protected/profile\");\n\t\tconst body = await res.json();\n\t\texpect(res.status).toBe(200);\n\t\texpect(body.profile).toEqual({\n\t\t\temail: \"test@example.com\",\n\t\t\trole: \"member\",\n\t\t});\n\t});\n});"},{"path":"api/routes/protected.route.ts","excerpt":"import { Hono } from \"hono\";\nimport type { ProtectedProfileResponse } from \"../../shared/schemas/protected.schema\";\nimport { getAuthContextUser } from \"../modules/auth/context\";\nexport function createProtectedRoute() {\n\treturn new Hono().get(\"/profile\", (c) => {\n\t\tconst authUser = getAuthContextUser(c);\n\t\tconst response = {\n\t\t\tprofile: {\n\t\t\t\temail: authUser.email,\n\t\t\t\trole: authUser.role,\n\t\t\t},\n\t\t} satisfies ProtectedProfileResponse;\n\t\treturn c.json(response);\n\t});\n}"},{"path":"web/src/App.tsx","excerpt":"import { QueryClient, QueryClientProvider } from \"@tanstack/react-query\";\nimport { RouterProvider } from \"@tanstack/react-router\";\nimport { router } from \"./router\";\nimport { ShowcaseSettingsProvider } from \"./showcase-settings-context\";\nconst queryClient = new QueryClient({\n\tdefaultOptions: {\n\t\tqueries: {\n\t\t\tretry: false,\n\t\t},\n\t},\n});\nexport function App() {\n\treturn (\n\t\t<QueryClientProvider client={queryClient}>\n\t\t\t<ShowcaseSettingsProvider>\n\t\t\t\t<RouterProvider router={router} />\n\t\t\t</ShowcaseSettingsProvider>\n\t\t</QueryClientProvider>\n\t);\n}"}],"llmContextFiles":[{"path":"LLM_CONTEXT.md","excerpt":"# LLM Context: Hono Standard\n\nこの文書は、`hono-standard` を clone した直後に作業入口を決めるための圧縮コンテキストです。現行 branch は local SQLite auth/showcase template です。RAG、pgvector、agentic search、wiki ingestion は含みません。\n\n## Repository Snapshot\n\n- Bun + Hono backend と React + Vite frontend を同一 origin で動かす template。\n- DB は local SQLite。Drizzle schema は `api/db/schema.ts`、migration は `drizzle/`。\n- Backend app composition は `api/app/hono.ts`、server bootstrap は `api/app/server.ts`。\n- DB runtime の public entry は `api/db/index.ts`。SQLite baseline は `api/db/sqlite.ts`、migration runner は `api/db/migrate.ts` から `api/db/migrate-sqlite.ts` を呼ぶ。\n- Frontend entry は `web/src/App.tsx`、router は `web/src/router.tsx`、API client は `web/src/api.ts`。\n- Auth 実装は `api/modules/auth/`、route は `api/routes/auth.route.ts`、login UI は `web/src/domains/auth/login-domain.tsx`。\n- Shared API schema/object は `shared/schemas/`。Backend は `zValidator`、frontend は `hono/client` + `AppType` で同じ契約を参照する。\n- Home と Showcase は未ログインでも表示する。ログイン状態がある場合だけ header に user chip と logout button を表示する。\n- Protected sample は `/protected` と `/api/protected/profile`。frontend guard と server-side `requireAuth` の両方を示す。\n- Package manager / runtime は Bun。dev server は `bunx --bun vite` で起動する。\n- Quality gates は `bun run verify` と `bun run verify:e2e`。CI も同じ入口を使う。\n- `main` は SQLite baseline。Turso / PostgreSQL / pgvector は `variant/*` branch で driver、schema、migration、docs、smoke setup を差し替える。\n\n## Top-Level Map\n\n| Path | Role |\n| --- | --- |\n| `api/app/hono.ts` | Hono middleware、API route、static fallback、`AppType` export |\n| `api/app/server.ts` | Bun server bootstrap |\n| `api/app/env.ts` | environment parsing and defaults |\n| `api/config/appDefaults.ts` | non-secret app defaults |\n| `api/db/index.ts` | DB runtime public entry and variant boundary |\n| `api/db/sqlite.ts` | SQLite baseline Drizzle runtime |\n| `api/db/migrate.ts` | migration runner public entry |\n| `api/db/migrate-sqlite.ts` | SQLite baseline migration runner |\n| `api/db/schema.ts` | SQLite baseline Drizzle schema |\n| `api/routes/auth.route.ts` | `/api/auth/*` route module |\n| `api/routes/health.route.ts` | health route |\n| `api/routes/protected.route.ts` | server-side protected API sample |\n| `api/modules/auth/` | Auth service、JWT、cookies、password hashing |\n| `api/middleware/auth.ts` | access-token auth middleware |\n| `shared/schemas/` | Zod schema and public API object types shared by api and web |\n| `web/src/App.tsx` | React Query and Router providers |\n| `web/src/router.tsx` | TanStack Router tree |\n| `web/src/api.ts` | browser API client and auth refresh handling |\n| `web/src/auth-context.tsx` | frontend auth state |\n| `web/src/routes/` | route definitions |\n| `web/src/views/` | Home/Login/Showcase views |\n| `web/src/showcase-*` | showcase state and URL search helpers |\n| `drizzle/` | SQL migrations |\n| `scripts/verify.ts` | verification pipeline |\n| `scripts/e2e-server.ts` | Playwright smoke server with isolated SQLite DB |\n| `tests/e2e/` | Playwright smoke tests |\n| `.github/workflows/verify.yml` | CI verification |\n| `Dockerfile`, `docker-compose.yml` | Optional SQLite baseline container runtime |\n\n## Task Routing\n\n| Task | Start here | Usually also read | Defer unless touched |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Change auth API | `api/routes/auth.route.ts`, `api/modules/auth/`, `api/middleware/auth.ts`, `shared/schemas/auth.schema.ts` | `web/src/api.ts`, `web/src/auth-context.tsx` | showcase UI |\n| Change protected sample | `api/routes/protected.route.ts`, `web/src/views/protected-view.tsx`, `web/src/routes/protected-route.tsx` | `api/middleware/auth.ts`, `shared/schemas/protected.schema.ts`, `web/src/api.ts` | showcase UI |\n| Change login UI | `web/src/views/login-view.tsx`, `web/src/domains/auth/login-domain.tsx` | `web/src/auth-context.tsx`, `web/src/api.ts` | DB schema |\n| Change app shell/routing | `web/src/routes/root-route.tsx`, `web/src/router.tsx` | `web/src/App.tsx`, affected view | auth service internals |\n| Change showcase UI | `web/src/views/showcase-view.tsx`, `web/src/showcase-settings-context.tsx`, `web/src/showcase-table-search.ts` | `web/src/styles.css` | backend auth |\n| Change env/config | `api/app/env.ts`, `api/config/appDefaults.ts`, `.env.example` | `drizzle.config.ts`, Docker/Compose if bind host or port changes | frontend views |\n| Change DB runtime/variant boundary | `api/db/index.ts`, `api/db/sqlite.ts`, `api/db/migrate.ts`, `api/db/migrate-sqlite.ts` | `api/cli/migrate.ts`, `api/cli/auth-create-admin.ts`, `docs/template-variant-management.md` | showcase UI |\n| Change DB schema/migration | `api/db/schema.ts`, `drizzle/`, `api/db/migrate*.ts` | `api/modules/auth/auth.service.ts`, `api/modules/auth/token.service.ts` | showcase UI |\n| Change build/dev tooling | `package.json`, `vite.config.ts`, `vitest.config.ts`, `playwright.config.ts`, `scripts/verify.ts` | `.github/workflows/verify.yml`, failing config-specific output | feature code |\n| Change docs | `README.md`, `LLM_CONTEXT.md`, `docs/` | `.gitignore` when generated output changes | feature code |\n\n## Styling / CSS Architecture\n\nUI 変更では、この節を styling 判断の入口にする。まず全 CSS を広く探索せず、以下の entrypoint と pattern source で説明できるか確認する。\n\n- Global style entrypoint: `web/src/styles.css`。Tailwind v4 の `@import \"tailwindcss\"`、`@theme` token、`@layer base`、`@layer components` をこの1ファイルに集約している。\n- CSS load path: `web/src/main.tsx` が `./styles.css` を import する。Tailwind plugin は `vite.config.ts` の `@tailwindcss/vite`。\n- Design tokens / theme values: `web/src/styles.css` の `@theme` が global token の source of truth。`--color-*` と `--radius-*` を Tailwind utility / `@apply` から使う。\n- Showcase theme values: `web/src/showcase-settings-context.tsx` が `--showcase-*` custom properties を生成し、`web/src/styles.css` の `.showcase-shell` と `:root[data-showcase-page-theme]` rules がそれを消費する。\n- Shared UI components and common patterns: `web/src/styles.css` の `.topbar`, `.menu-*`, `.auth-*`, `.home-*`, `.center-shell`, `.signed-in-panel`, `.showcase-*`, `.demo-*`, `.table-*` class families。\n- Page a"}],"recentCommitDiffs":[],"packageScripts":[{"name":"auth:create-admin","command":"bun run api/cli/auth-create-admin.ts"},{"name":"bootstrap","command":"bun scripts/bootstrap.ts"},{"name":"build","command":"bun run build:web"},{"name":"build:web","command":"vite build"},{"name":"db:generate","command":"drizzle-kit generate"},{"name":"db:migrate","command":"bun run api/cli/migrate.ts"},{"name":"db:migrate:drizzle","command":"drizzle-kit migrate"},{"name":"dev","command":"bunx --bun vite"},{"name":"dev:vite","command":"vite"},{"name":"format","command":"biome format --write api web shared scripts tests drizzle.config.ts playwright.config.ts vite.config.ts vitest.config.ts"},{"name":"format:check","command":"biome format api web shared scripts tests drizzle.config.ts playwright.config.ts vite.config.ts vitest.config.ts"},{"name":"lint","command":"biome lint api web shared scripts tests drizzle.config.ts playwright.config.ts vite.config.ts vitest.config.ts"},{"name":"seed:dev","command":"bun scripts/seed-dev.ts"},{"name":"start","command":"bun run api/app/server.ts"},{"name":"test","command":"vitest run"},{"name":"test:coverage","command":"vitest run --coverage"},{"name":"test:e2e","command":"playwright test"},{"name":"test:watch","command":"vitest"},{"name":"typecheck","command":"tsc --noEmit"},{"name":"verify","command":"bun scripts/verify.ts"},{"name":"verify:all","command":"bun run verify && bun run verify:e2e"},{"name":"verify:e2e","command":"bun run test:e2e"},{"name":"verify:strict","command":"bun run verify"}],"moduleOntology":null},"qualityCapabilities":{"projectType":"typescript","commands":[{"kind":"unit","source":"package_json","command":"bun run ''test''","runnable":true},{"kind":"coverage","source":"package_json","command":"bun run ''test:coverage''","runnable":true},{"kind":"e2e","source":"package_json","command":"bun run ''test:e2e''","runnable":true},{"kind":"verify","source":"package_json","command":"bun run ''verify''","runnable":true}],"missingCapabilities":[]},"recentTokenSpendTasks":[{"taskId":"3c40e22b-fbe5-48a1-ba92-64f990e589fd","title":"BBSを作りたいです。計画してください。","totalTokens":8468677,"callCount":8}],"recentRuns":{"completed":1,"failed":0,"running":0}}','{"role":"mission_task_generation","providerId":"codex","providerEndpointId":"ep_2a9c67769830da1e","routeSource":"primary","modelOrDeployment":"gpt-5.4-mini","thinkingDepth":null}','{"schemaVersion":"nightworkers.mission-task-candidates/v1","candidates":[{"title":"todo list 本体を実装する","summary":"未実装の todo list 機能を、既存の Hono + React + SQLite 構成に直接載せて作る起点候補です。まず一覧・追加・完了切替・削除を含む本体を実装し、UI と保存方式の詳細は Plan Mode で確定します。","rationale":"repositorySnapshot は minimal Hono + React template として見え、todo list の本体実装はまだ確認できません。Mission Goal は『考えられる最も使いやすい todolist を作る』なので、最優先は機能本体を作る入口です。既存の auth/showcase/bbs は目標の直接実装ではないため、まず todo domain を立ち上げる必要があります。","goalId":"de3305e2-2269-4765-a117-5dd36de101e2","candidateKind":"feature_entrypoint","moduleRouting":{"primaryModule":null,"secondaryModules":["web/src","api/routes","api/db","shared/schemas"],"confidencePercent":20,"reason":"moduleOntology が無く、todo list 専用モジュールも未確認のため未判定です。現状は template 構成上、frontend / backend / shared schema / DB にまたがる可能性があります。"},"constraintGoalIds":[],"planModeOpenQuestions":["UI は単一画面か分割画面か","データモデルは task の最小属性だけにするか","保存先は SQLite の永続化でよいか","完了状態をどう表現するか","編集・削除を最初から入れるか","検証は unit / e2e のどこまで必要か"],"evidence":[{"source":"mission_goal","label":"goal_title","value":"todo listを作る"},{"source":"project_evaluation","label":"overallScore","value":"72"},{"source":"quality","label":"e2e","value":"passed 2/2"},{"source":"llm_usage","label":"repositorySnapshot","value":"Minimal Hono + React template with optional login and showcase screens."}],"evaluationContribution":34,"importancePercent":100,"confidencePercent":84,"tokenSize":"big","complexity":"complex","taskPrompt":"todo list の本体を実装してください。既存の Hono + React + SQLite 構成に合わせて、まずは Plan Mode で UI 方針、データモデル、保存方式、完了状態、編集削除、検証方針を短く決めてから実装に入ってください。","acceptanceCriteria":"todo list の本体が repo 上で実装され、ユーザーがタスクを追加・確認・完了切替できること。UI / 保存 / 完了表現 / 編集削除 / 検証の前提が Plan Mode で明確化され、Goal に直接関係する範囲に収まっていること。","verificationPlan":"実装後に関連 unit と e2e を実行し、追加した todo list の主要操作が通ることを確認する。既存の auth/showcase/bbs の挙動を壊していないことも合わせて確認する。"}]}',NULL,1783216872,1783216912);
INSERT INTO "mission_task_candidate_batches" ("id", "created_at", "updated_at", "repository_id", "status", "requested_goal_ids_json", "signal_snapshot_json", "selected_model_json", "raw_output_json", "error_message", "started_at", "completed_at") VALUES('d0accc3c-5b8b-4217-b4f3-3c7efb847ad9',1783223822,1783223855,'984c8844-643e-4596-93a5-703a8d14a1e0','completed','["de3305e2-2269-4765-a117-5dd36de101e2"]','{"repository":{"id":"984c8844-643e-4596-93a5-703a8d14a1e0","name":"todolist","localPath":"/Users/y.noguchi/Code/todolist","branch":"main"},"activeGoals":[{"id":"de3305e2-2269-4765-a117-5dd36de101e2","title":"todo listを作る","goalText":"考えられる最も使いやすいtodolistを作る","interpretation":{"scope":"unknown","intent":"unknown","source":"unknown","confidencePercent":0,"reason":null}}],"latestEvaluation":{"id":"a9ff9b87-ada3-43cb-bc45-88b80d8b8644","overallScore":72,"dimensions":[{"key":"conceptValue","score":78,"label":"コンセプト価値"},{"key":"architectureQuality","score":80,"label":"アーキテクチャ"},{"key":"extensibility","score":74,"label":"拡張性"},{"key":"uiUx","score":69,"label":"UI / UX"},{"key":"operability","score":76,"label":"運用性"},{"key":"security","score":71,"label":"セキュリティ"},{"key":"maintainability","score":79,"label":"保守性"},{"key":"marketCompetitiveness","score":66,"label":"市場競争力"}],"summary":"Hono + React + SQLite を同一 origin でまとめたテンプレートとしては、認証、保護ルート、共有 schema、検証ゲートまで揃っており、実運用の土台として成立している。BBS ルートや thread 系 UI も repo tree に見えるため、単なる starter を越えて複数ドメインを載せる余地がある一方、評価根拠は repo structure と README/LLM_CONTEXT に限られるため、実装の細部と実行時品質は過大評価しない。"},"latestQuality":{"coverage":null,"e2e":{"status":"passed","total":2,"passed":2,"failed":0,"skipped":0,"durationMs":1170,"suites":[{"title":"smoke.spec.ts","status":"passed","tests":2,"durationMs":1170,"lastFailure":null}]}},"repositorySnapshot":{"packageName":"hono-standard","description":"Minimal Hono + React template with optional login and showcase screens.","readmeExcerpt":"# Hono Standard\n\n[![Bun](https://img.shields.io/badge/Bun-%23000000.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=bun&logoColor=white)](https://bun.sh/)\n[![Hono](https://img.shields.io/badge/Hono-%23E36022.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=hono&logoColor=white)](https://hono.dev/)\n[![React](https://img.shields.io/badge/React-%2320232a.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=react&logoColor=%2361DAFB)](https://react.dev/)\n[![SQLite](https://img.shields.io/badge/SQLite-003B57.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=sqlite&logoColor=white)](https://www.sqlite.org/)\n[![TypeScript](https://img.shields.io/badge/TypeScript-%23007ACC.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=typescript&logoColor=white)](https://www.typescriptlang.org/)\n[![MIT License](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-green.svg?style=for-the-badge)](LICENSE.md)\n\nHono backend と React + Vite frontend を同一 origin で動かす、local SQLite 対応の Web app template です。Drizzle のユーザー認証、httpOnly Cookie による access / refresh token、React Router ベースの画面、コンポーネント showcase を含みます。\n\n## 構成\n\n| Path | Role |\n| --- | --- |\n| `api/app/hono.ts` | Hono app composition。middleware、API route、静的配信、`AppType` を登録 |\n| `api/app/server.ts` | Bun server bootstrap |\n| `api/app/env.ts` | runtime env parser |\n| `api/config/appDefaults.ts` | 非シークレットの既定値 |\n| `api/db/index.ts` | DB runtime の public entry。variant はここから差し替える |\n| `api/db/sqlite.ts` | SQLite baseline の Drizzle runtime |\n| `api/db/schema.ts` | Drizzle SQLite schema |\n| `api/db/migrate.ts` | migration runner の public entry |\n| `api/db/migrate-sqlite.ts` | SQLite baseline の migration runner |\n| `api/routes/auth.route.ts` | `/api/auth/*` route |\n| `api/routes/health.route.ts` | `/api/health` route |\n| `api/routes/protected.route.ts` | `/api/protected/*` の server-side protected sample |\n| `api/modules/auth/` | password hash、JWT、cookie、auth service |\n| `api/middleware/auth.ts` | protected API middleware |\n| `web/src/` | React frontend |\n| `shared/schemas/` | frontend/backend で共有する Zod schema と API object type |\n| `drizzle/` | SQL migrations |\n| `scripts/verify.ts` | typecheck / lint / format / test / coverage / build の検証 pipeline |\n\n## 前提\n\n| Tool | 用途 |\n| --- | --- |\n| Bun | package manager、runtime、scripts |\n| SQLite | auth user / refresh token storage |\n\n## セットアップ\n\n```bash\nbun run bootstrap\nbun run auth:create-admin -- --email admin@example.com --name \"Admin User\"\nbun run dev\n```\n\n`bootstrap` は `.env` を用意し、dependency が未導入なら `bun install --frozen-lockfile` を実行し、SQLite database に migration を適用します。\n\n`auth:create-admin` は対話で password を読みます。自動化する場合は次のように標準入力から渡せます。\n\n```bash\nprintf ''%s\\n'' ''<password>'' | bun run auth:create-admin -- --email admin@example.com --name \"Admin User\" --password-stdin\n```\n\n開発サーバーは `http://localhost:5173` で起動します。Vite dev server が frontend を配信し、`/api/*` は Hono に渡されます。\n\n初回 clone 後に template の動作確認まで済ませる場合は、次を実行します。\n\n```bash\nbun run verify\nbun run verify:e2e\n```\n\n認証を使う app では `auth:create-admin` または `seed:dev` で admin を作成してから `/login` を確認します。認証を使わない app では、この README 後半の auth removal checklist に沿って auth route、DB table、login/protected screen、E2E scope をまとめて削ります。\n\n## 生成物と管理対象\n\nこの template では、source と docs は追跡し、local runtime や検証の生成物は追跡しません。\n\n| Path / Pattern | 扱い |\n| --- | --- |\n| `drizzle/*.sql` | Drizzle migration source。commit 対象 |\n| `.env.example` | local development の雛形。commit 対象 |\n| `.env*` | local secret / runtime env。`.env.example` 以外は commit しない |\n| `data/`, `*.db`, `*.sqlite`, `*.sqlite3` | local SQLite database。commit しない |\n| `coverage/`, `playwright-report/`, `test-results/` | verification output。commit しない |\n| `dist/`, `dist-web/`, `build/`, `*.tgz` | build / archive output。commit しない |\n\n## 環境変数\n\n非シークレットの既定値は `api/config/appDefaults.ts` にあります。`.env.example` は local development 向けの値です。\n\n| Variable | Required | Description | Default |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `NODE_ENV` | no | `development` / `test` / `production` | `development` |\n| `HOST` | no | HTTP bind host。container では `0.0.0.0` を指定 | `127.0.0.1` |\n| `PORT` | no | HTTP server port | `5173` |\n| `DATABASE_URL` | no | SQLite database ","sourceFiles":["LLM_CONTEXT.md","README.md","api/app/env.test.ts","api/app/env.ts","api/app/hono.test.ts","api/app/hono.ts","api/app/security-headers.ts","api/app/server.ts","api/cli/auth-create-admin.ts","api/cli/cli-contract.test.ts","api/cli/migrate.ts","api/config/appDefaults.ts","api/db/index.ts","api/db/migrate-sqlite.ts","api/db/migrate.ts","api/db/path.test.ts","api/db/path.ts","api/db/schema.ts","api/db/sqlite.ts","api/middleware/auth.test.ts","api/middleware/auth.ts","api/modules/auth/auth-cookies.test.ts","api/modules/auth/auth-cookies.ts","api/modules/auth/auth.service.test.ts","api/modules/auth/auth.service.ts","api/modules/auth/context.test.ts","api/modules/auth/context.ts","api/modules/auth/errors.test.ts","api/modules/auth/errors.ts","api/modules/auth/password.test.ts","api/modules/auth/password.ts","api/modules/auth/token.service.test.ts","api/modules/auth/token.service.ts","api/modules/auth/types.test.ts","api/modules/auth/types.ts","api/routes/auth.route.test.ts","api/routes/auth.route.ts","api/routes/bbs.route.test.ts","api/routes/bbs.route.ts","api/routes/health.route.test.ts","api/routes/health.route.ts","api/routes/protected.route.test.ts","api/routes/protected.route.ts","api/types/hono-context.d.ts","biome.json","docs/template-variant-management.md","drizzle.config.ts","drizzle/0001_auth.sql","drizzle/0002_bbs.sql","package.json","playwright.config.ts","scripts/bootstrap.test.ts","scripts/bootstrap.ts","scripts/e2e-server.ts","scripts/seed-dev.ts","scripts/verify.ts","shared/schemas/auth.schema.ts","shared/schemas/protected.schema.test.ts","shared/schemas/protected.schema.ts","tests/e2e/smoke.spec.ts","tsconfig.build.json","tsconfig.json","vite.config.ts","vitest.config.ts","web/src/App.tsx","web/src/api.test.ts","web/src/api.ts","web/src/auth-context.tsx","web/src/components/dev-error-panel.tsx","web/src/domains/auth/login-domain.tsx","web/src/main.tsx","web/src/router.tsx","web/src/routes/home-route.tsx","web/src/routes/login-route.tsx","web/src/routes/login-search.ts","web/src/routes/protected-route.tsx","web/src/routes/root-route.tsx","web/src/routes/route-access.test.ts","web/src/routes/route-access.ts","web/src/routes/showcase-route.tsx","web/src/routes/thread-detail-route.tsx","web/src/routes/thread-new-route.tsx","web/src/routes/threads-route.tsx","web/src/showcase-settings-context.tsx","web/src/showcase-table-search.ts","web/src/styles.css","web/src/views/home-view.tsx","web/src/views/login-view.tsx","web/src/views/protected-view.tsx","web/src/views/showcase-view.tsx","web/src/views/thread-detail-view.tsx","web/src/views/thread-new-view.tsx","web/src/views/threads-view.tsx"],"routeFiles":["api/routes/auth.route.test.ts","api/routes/auth.route.ts","api/routes/bbs.route.test.ts","api/routes/bbs.route.ts","api/routes/health.route.test.ts","api/routes/health.route.ts","api/routes/protected.route.test.ts","api/routes/protected.route.ts","web/src/routes/home-route.tsx","web/src/routes/login-route.tsx","web/src/routes/login-search.ts","web/src/routes/protected-route.tsx","web/src/routes/root-route.tsx","web/src/routes/route-access.test.ts","web/src/routes/route-access.ts","web/src/routes/showcase-route.tsx","web/src/routes/thread-detail-route.tsx","web/src/routes/thread-new-route.tsx","web/src/routes/threads-route.tsx","web/src/views/home-view.tsx","web/src/views/login-view.tsx","web/src/views/protected-view.tsx","web/src/views/showcase-view.tsx","web/src/views/thread-detail-view.tsx","web/src/views/thread-new-view.tsx","web/src/views/threads-view.tsx"],"migrationFiles":["drizzle/0001_auth.sql","drizzle/0002_bbs.sql"],"sourceExcerpts":[{"path":"README.md","excerpt":"# Hono Standard\n[![Bun](https://img.shields.io/badge/Bun-%23000000.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=bun&logoColor=white)](https://bun.sh/)\n[![Hono](https://img.shields.io/badge/Hono-%23E36022.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=hono&logoColor=white)](https://hono.dev/)\n[![React](https://img.shields.io/badge/React-%2320232a.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=react&logoColor=%2361DAFB)](https://react.dev/)\n[![SQLite](https://img.shields.io/badge/SQLite-003B57.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=sqlite&logoColor=white)](https://www.sqlite.org/)\n[![TypeScript](https://img.shields.io/badge/TypeScript-%23007ACC.svg?style=for-the-badge&logo=typescript&logoColor=white)](https://www.typescriptlang.org/)\n[![MIT License](https://img.shields.io/badge/License-MIT-green.svg?style=for-the-badge)](LICENSE.md)\nHono backend と React + Vite frontend を同一 origin で動かす、local SQLite 対応の Web app template です。Drizzle のユーザー認証、httpOnly Cookie による access / refresh token、React Router ベースの画面、コンポーネント showcase を含みます。\n## 構成\n| Path | Role |\n| --- | --- |\n| `api/app/hono.ts` | Hono app composition。middleware、API route、静的配信、`AppType` を登録 |\n| `api/app/server.ts` | Bun server bootstrap |\n| `api/app/env.ts` | runtime env parser |\n| `api/config/appDefaults.ts` | 非シークレットの既定値 |\n| `api/db/index.ts` | DB runtime の public entry。variant はここから差し替える |\n| `api/db/sqlite.ts` | SQLite baseline の Drizzle runtime |\n| `api/db/schema.ts` | Drizzle SQLite schema |\n| `api/db/migrate.ts` | migration runner の public entry |\n| `api/db/migrate-sqlite.ts` | SQLite baseline の migration runner |\n| `api/routes/auth.route.ts` | `/api/auth/*` route |\n| `api/routes/health.route.ts` | `/api/health` route |\n| `api/routes/protected.route.ts` | `/api/protected/*` の server-side protected sample |\n| `api/modules/auth/` | password hash、JWT、cookie、auth service |\n| `api/mi"},{"path":"api/app/env.test.ts","excerpt":"import { describe, expect, it } from \"vitest\";\nimport { APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS } from \"../config/appDefaults\";\nimport { readAppEnv } from \"./env\";\ndescribe(\"readAppEnv\", () => {\n\tit(\"uses minimal app defaults\", () => {\n\t\tconst env = readAppEnv({});\n\t\texpect(env.nodeEnv).toBe(\"development\");\n\t\texpect(env.host).toBe(APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS.host);\n\t\texpect(env.port).toBe(APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS.port);\n\t\texpect(env.databaseUrl).toBe(APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS.databaseUrl);\n\t\texpect(env.appUrl).toBe(APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS.appUrl);\n\t\texpect(env.corsOrigins).toEqual(APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS.corsOrigins);\n\t\texpect(env.cookieSameSite).toBe(APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS.cookieSameSite);\n\t});\n\tit(\"accepts database and auth runtime overrides\", () => {\n\t\tconst env = readAppEnv({\n\t\t\tHOST: \"0.0.0.0\",\n\t\t\tPORT: \"5174\",\n\t\t\tDATABASE_URL: \"tmp/test.sqlite\",\n\t\t\tJWT_SECRET: \"x\".repeat(32),\n\t\t\tAPP_URL: \"https://showcase.example.com\",\n\t\t\tCORS_ORIGINS: \"https://showcase.example.com,http://localhost:5173\",\n\t\t\tAUTH_COOKIE_SECURE: \"true\",\n\t\t\tAUTH_COOKIE_SAME_SITE: \"none\",\n\t\t\tSECURITY_HEADERS_MODE: \"https\",\n\t\t});\n\t\texpect(env.host).toBe(\"0.0.0.0\");\n\t\texpect(env.port).toBe(5174);\n\t\texpect(env.databaseUrl).toBe(\"tmp/test.sqlite\");\n\t\texpect(env.jwtSecret).toBe(\"x\".repeat(32));\n\t\texpect(env.appUrl).toBe(\"https://showcase.example.com\");\n\t\texpect(env.corsOrigins).toEqual([\n\t\t\t\"https://showcase.example.com\",\n\t\t\t\"http://localhost:5173\",\n\t\t]);\n\t\texpect(env.secureCookie).toBe(true);\n\t\texpect(env.cookieSameSite).toBe(\"none\");\n\t\texpect(env.securityHeadersMode).toBe(\"https\");\n\t});\n\tit(\"falls back to the SQLite default when a dev shell provides a connection URL\", () => {\n\t\tconst env = readAppEnv({\n\t\t\tDATABASE_URL: \"postgres://postgres:postgres@127.0.0.1:5432/app\",\n\t\t});\n\t\texpect(env.databaseUrl).toBe(APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS.databaseUrl);\n\t});\n\tit(\"rej"},{"path":"api/app/env.ts","excerpt":"import { z } from \"zod\";\nimport { APP_CONFIG_DEFAULTS } from \"../config/appDefaults\";\nimport { isDatabaseConnectionUrl } from \"../db/path\";\nconst optionalTrimmedString = z.preprocess((value) => {\n\tif (typeof value !== \"string\") return value;\n\tconst trimmed = value.trim();\n\treturn trimmed.length > 0 ? trimmed : undefined;\n}, z.string().trim().optional());\nconst optionalUrl = z.preprocess((value) => {\n\tif (typeof value !== \"string\") return value;\n\tconst trimmed = value.trim();\n\treturn trimmed.length > 0 ? trimmed : undefined;\n}, z.string().url().optional());\nconst optionalBoolean = z.preprocess((value) => {\n\tif (typeof value === \"boolean\") return value;\n\tif (typeof value !== \"string\") return value;\n\tconst normalized = value.trim().toLowerCase();\n\tif (!normalized) return undefined;\n\tif ([\"1\", \"true\", \"yes\", \"on\"].includes(normalized)) return true;\n\tif ([\"0\", \"false\", \"no\", \"off\"].includes(normalized)) return false;\n\treturn value;\n}, z.boolean().optional());\nconst optionalPort = z.preprocess((value) => {\n\tif (typeof value === \"number\") return value;\n\tif (typeof value !== \"string\") return value;\n\tconst trimmed = value.trim();\n\treturn trimmed.length > 0 ? Number(trimmed) : undefined;\n}, z.number().int().min(1).max(65535).optional());\nconst optionalCookieSameSite = z.preprocess((value) => {\n\tif (typeof value !== \"string\") return value;\n\tconst normalized = value.trim().toLowerCase();\n\treturn normalized.length > 0 ? normalized : undefined;\n}, z.enum([\"lax\", \"strict\", \"none\"]).optional());\nconst optionalSecurityHeadersMode = z.preprocess(\n\t(value) => {\n\t\tif (typeof value !== \"string\") return value;\n\t\tconst normalized = value.trim().toLowerCase();\n\t\treturn normalized.length > 0 ? normalized : undefined;\n\t},\n\tz.enum([\"auto\", \"http\", \"https\"]).default(\"auto\"),\n);\nconst EnvSchema = z"},{"path":"api/app/hono.test.ts","excerpt":"import { describe, expect, it, vi, beforeEach } from \"vitest\";\nimport fs from \"node:fs/promises\";\nimport { HttpError } from \"../modules/auth/errors\";\nimport { HTTPException } from \"hono/http-exception\";\n// Mock environment and DB connection before importing app\nvi.mock(\"../db\", () => ({\n\tcreateDbRuntime: vi.fn().mockReturnValue({\n\t\tdb: {\n\t\t\tquery: {\n\t\t\t\tusers: {\n\t\t\t\t\tfindFirst: vi.fn(),\n\t\t\t\t},\n\t\t\t},\n\t\t},\n\t\tclose: vi.fn(),\n\t\tconnection: {\n\t\t\tclient: {\n\t\t\t\tclose: vi.fn(),\n\t\t\t},\n\t\t\townsConnection: false,\n\t\t},\n\t}),\n}));\nvi.mock(\"./env\", () => ({\n\treadAppEnv: vi.fn().mockReturnValue({\n\t\tnodeEnv: \"test\",\n\t\thost: \"127.0.0.1\",\n\t\tport: 5173,\n\t\tdatabaseUrl: \"mock.db\",\n\t\tjwtSecret: \"x\".repeat(32),\n\t\tjwtAccessExpiresIn: \"15m\",\n\t\tjwtRefreshExpiresIn: \"7d\",\n\t\tappUrl: \"http://localhost:5173\",\n\t\tcorsOrigins: [\"http://localhost:5173\"],\n\t\ttrustProxy: true,\n\t\tsecureCookie: false,\n\t\tcookieSameSite: \"lax\",\n\t\tsecurityHeadersMode: \"auto\",\n\t}),\n}));\n// Mock Bun global variable before importing hono/bun dependent code\n(globalThis as any).Bun = {\n\tfile: (path: string) => ({\n\t\texists: () => Promise.resolve(true),\n\t}),\n};\n// Dynamically import app so globalThis.Bun is defined first\nconst { default: app } = await import(\"./hono\");\n// Add test routes before any request is processed (Hono routers lock after first request)\napp.post(\"/api/test-http-error\", () => {\n\tthrow new HttpError(400, \"Bad Parameters\");\n});\napp.post(\"/api/test-hono-http-exception\", () => {\n\tthrow new HTTPException(403, { message: \"Access Forbidden\" });\n});\napp.post(\"/api/test-generic-error\", () => {\n\tthrow new Error(\"Something blew up\");\n});\ndescribe(\"hono app entry\", () => {\n\tbeforeEach(() => {\n\t\tvi.restoreAllMocks();\n\t});\n\tit(\"should return 200 for /api/health\", async () => {\n\t\tconst res = await app.request(\"/api/health\");\n\t\texp"},{"path":"api/app/hono.ts","excerpt":"import fs from \"node:fs/promises\";\nimport path from \"node:path\";\nimport { serveStatic } from \"hono/bun\";\nimport { csrf } from \"hono/csrf\";\nimport { Hono } from \"hono\";\nimport { cors } from \"hono/cors\";\nimport { logger } from \"hono/logger\";\nimport { HTTPException } from \"hono/http-exception\";\nimport { secureHeaders } from \"hono/secure-headers\";\nimport type { DbRuntime } from \"../db\";\nimport { createDbRuntime } from \"../db\";\nimport { requireAuth } from \"../middleware/auth\";\nimport { AuthService } from \"../modules/auth/auth.service\";\nimport { HttpError } from \"../modules/auth/errors\";\nimport { createBbsRoute } from \"../routes/bbs.route\";\nimport { createAuthRoute } from \"../routes/auth.route\";\nimport { createHealthRoute } from \"../routes/health.route\";\nimport { createProtectedRoute } from \"../routes/protected.route\";\nimport { readAppEnv, type AppEnv } from \"./env\";\nimport { appContentSecurityPolicy } from \"./security-headers\";\nexport type AppDeps = {\n\tenv: AppEnv;\n\tdbRuntime: DbRuntime;\n\tauthService: AuthService;\n};\ndeclare global {\n\tvar __honoStandardRuntime__: Promise<AppDeps> | undefined;\n}\nexport async function createDefaultAppDeps(): Promise<AppDeps> {\n\tconst env = readAppEnv();\n\tconst dbRuntime = createDbRuntime(env);\n\tconst authService = new AuthService(dbRuntime.db, env);\n\treturn { env, dbRuntime, authService };\n}\nexport async function getAppRuntime(): Promise<AppDeps> {\n\tif (!globalThis.__honoStandardRuntime__) {\n\t\tglobalThis.__honoStandardRuntime__ = createDefaultAppDeps().catch(\n\t\t\t(error) => {\n\t\t\t\tglobalThis.__honoStandardRuntime__ = undefined;\n\t\t\t\tthrow error;\n\t\t\t},\n\t\t);\n\t}\n\treturn globalThis.__honoStandardRuntime__;\n}\nconst distWebRoot = path.resolve(process.cwd(), \"dist-web\");\nconst distWebIndex = path.resolve(distWebRoot, \"index.html\");\nexport function creat"},{"path":"api/app/security-headers.ts","excerpt":"type CspDirectives = Record<string, string[]>;\nexport const appContentSecurityPolicy: CspDirectives = {\n\tdefaultSrc: [\"''self''\"],\n\tbaseUri: [\"''self''\"],\n\tconnectSrc: [\"''self''\"],\n\tfontSrc: [\"''self''\", \"data:\"],\n\tformAction: [\"''self''\"],\n\tframeAncestors: [\"''self''\"],\n\timgSrc: [\"''self''\", \"data:\", \"blob:\"],\n\tmanifestSrc: [\"''self''\"],\n\tobjectSrc: [\"''none''\"],\n\tscriptSrc: [\"''self''\"],\n\tstyleSrc: [\"''self''\", \"''unsafe-inline''\"],\n\tworkerSrc: [\"''self''\", \"blob:\"],\n};\nexport const viteDevContentSecurityPolicy: CspDirectives = {\n\t...appContentSecurityPolicy,\n\tconnectSrc: [\n\t\t\"''self''\",\n\t\t\"ws:\",\n\t\t\"http://localhost:5173\",\n\t\t\"http://127.0.0.1:5173\",\n\t],\n\tscriptSrc: [\"''self''\", \"''unsafe-inline''\", \"''unsafe-eval''\"],\n};\nconst toKebabCase = (value: string): string =>\n\tvalue.replace(/[A-Z]+(?![a-z])|[A-Z]/g, (match, offset) =>\n\t\toffset ? `-${match.toLowerCase()}` : match.toLowerCase(),\n\t);\nexport function serializeContentSecurityPolicy(policy: CspDirectives): string {\n\treturn Object.entries(policy)\n\t\t.map(\n\t\t\t([directive, values]) => `${toKebabCase(directive)} ${values.join(\" \")}`,\n\t\t)\n\t\t.join(\"; \");\n}"},{"path":"api/app/server.ts","excerpt":"import app, { getAppRuntime } from \"./hono\";\nimport { readAppEnv } from \"./env\";\nconst env = readAppEnv();\nconst server = Bun.serve({\n\tfetch: app.fetch,\n\thostname: env.host,\n\tport: env.port,\n});\nconsole.log(\n\t`Hono Standard server listening on http://${env.host}:${server.port}`,\n);\nconst shutdown = async (signal: string) => {\n\tconsole.log(`\\nReceived ${signal}. Shutting down gracefully...`);\n\tserver.stop(true);\n\ttry {\n\t\tconst runtime = await getAppRuntime();\n\t\tconsole.log(\"Closing database connection...\");\n\t\truntime.dbRuntime.close();\n\t\tconsole.log(\"Shutdown complete.\");\n\t\tprocess.exit(0);\n\t} catch (error) {\n\t\tconsole.error(\"Error during shutdown:\", error);\n\t\tprocess.exit(1);\n\t}\n};\nprocess.on(\"SIGINT\", () => shutdown(\"SIGINT\"));\nprocess.on(\"SIGTERM\", () => shutdown(\"SIGTERM\"));"},{"path":"api/routes/auth.route.test.ts","excerpt":"import { Hono } from \"hono\";\nimport { describe, expect, it, vi, beforeEach } from \"vitest\";\nimport { createAuthRoute } from \"./auth.route\";\nimport { requireAuth } from \"../middleware/auth\";\nimport type { AppEnv } from \"../app/env\";\nimport type { AuthService } from \"../modules/auth/auth.service\";\nimport { HttpError } from \"../modules/auth/errors\";\nimport {\n\tACCESS_TOKEN_COOKIE_NAME,\n\tREFRESH_TOKEN_COOKIE_NAME,\n} from \"../modules/auth/auth-cookies\";\ndescribe(\"auth route\", () => {\n\tlet app: Hono;\n\tlet mockAuthService: any;\n\tlet mockEnv: AppEnv;\n\tconst testUser = {\n\t\tid: \"a1a1a1a1-a1a1-41a1-a1a1-a1a1a1a1a1a1\",\n\t\temail: \"test@example.com\",\n\t\tdisplayName: \"Test User\",\n\t\trole: \"member\" as const,\n\t\tisActive: true,\n\t};\n\tbeforeEach(() => {\n\t\tmockEnv = {\n\t\t\tjwtSecret: \"x\".repeat(32),\n\t\t\tjwtAccessExpiresIn: \"15m\",\n\t\t\tjwtRefreshExpiresIn: \"7d\",\n\t\t\tsecureCookie: true,\n\t\t\tcookieSameSite: \"lax\",\n\t\t} as unknown as AppEnv;\n\t\tmockAuthService = {\n\t\t\tlogin: vi.fn(),\n\t\t\trefresh: vi.fn(),\n\t\t\tlogout: vi.fn(),\n\t\t\tfindUserById: vi.fn(),\n\t\t};\n\t\tapp = new Hono();\n\t\t// Set error handler to prevent throwing unhandled exceptions in tests\n\t\tapp.onError((err, c) => {\n\t\t\tconst status = (err as HttpError).status || 500;\n\t\t\treturn c.json({ message: err.message }, status as any);\n\t\t});\n\t\tapp.use(\n\t\t\t\"/auth/me\",\n\t\t\trequireAuth({\n\t\t\t\tenv: mockEnv,\n\t\t\t\tauthService: mockAuthService as unknown as AuthService,\n\t\t\t}),\n\t\t);\n\t\tapp.route(\n\t\t\t\"/auth\",\n\t\t\tcreateAuthRoute({\n\t\t\t\tauthService: mockAuthService as unknown as AuthService,\n\t\t\t\tenv: mockEnv,\n\t\t\t}),\n\t\t);\n\t});\n\tdescribe(\"POST /login\", () => {\n\t\tit(\"should login user with valid credentials and set cookies\", async () => {\n\t\t\tmockAuthService.login.mockResolvedValue({\n\t\t\t\taccessToken: \"access-token-123\",\n\t\t\t\trefreshToken: \"refresh-token-456\",\n\t\t\t\tuser: {\n\t\t\t\t\tid: te"},{"path":"api/routes/auth.route.ts","excerpt":"import { zValidator } from \"@hono/zod-validator\";\nimport { Hono } from \"hono\";\nimport { getCookie } from \"hono/cookie\";\nimport { loginSchema } from \"../../shared/schemas/auth.schema\";\nimport type { AppEnv } from \"../app/env\";\nimport type { AuthService } from \"../modules/auth/auth.service\";\nimport {\n\tREFRESH_TOKEN_COOKIE_NAME,\n\tclearAuthCookies,\n\tsetAuthCookies,\n} from \"../modules/auth/auth-cookies\";\nimport { getAuthContextUser } from \"../modules/auth/context\";\nimport { HttpError } from \"../modules/auth/errors\";\ntype AuthRouteDeps = {\n\tauthService: AuthService;\n\tenv: AppEnv;\n};\nexport function createAuthRoute(deps: AuthRouteDeps) {\n\treturn new Hono()\n\t\t.post(\"/login\", zValidator(\"json\", loginSchema), async (c) => {\n\t\t\tconst body = c.req.valid(\"json\");\n\t\t\tconst result = await deps.authService.login({\n\t\t\t\temail: body.email,\n\t\t\t\tpassword: body.password,\n\t\t\t});\n\t\t\tsetAuthCookies(c, deps.env, result);\n\t\t\treturn c.json({ user: result.user });\n\t\t})\n\t\t.post(\"/refresh\", async (c) => {\n\t\t\tconst refreshToken = getCookie(c, REFRESH_TOKEN_COOKIE_NAME);\n\t\t\tif (!refreshToken) {\n\t\t\t\tthrow new HttpError(401, \"Unauthorized\");\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\tconst result = await deps.authService.refresh(refreshToken);\n\t\t\tsetAuthCookies(c, deps.env, result);\n\t\t\treturn c.json({ user: result.user });\n\t\t})\n\t\t.post(\"/logout\", async (c) => {\n\t\t\tconst refreshToken = getCookie(c, REFRESH_TOKEN_COOKIE_NAME);\n\t\t\tawait deps.authService.logout(refreshToken);\n\t\t\tclearAuthCookies(c);\n\t\t\treturn c.json({ ok: true });\n\t\t})\n\t\t.get(\"/me\", async (c) => {\n\t\t\tconst authUser = getAuthContextUser(c);\n\t\t\tconst user = await deps.authService.findUserById(authUser.userId);\n\t\t\tif (!user?.isActive) {\n\t\t\t\tthrow new HttpError(401, \"Unauthorized\");\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\treturn c.json({\n\t\t\t\tuser: {\n\t\t\t\t\tid: user.id,\n\t\t\t\t\temail: user.email,\n\t\t\t\t\tdisplayName: us"},{"path":"api/routes/bbs.route.test.ts","excerpt":"import { Hono } from \"hono\";\nimport { HttpError } from \"../modules/auth/errors\";\nimport { afterEach, describe, expect, it, vi } from \"vitest\";\nimport { createBbsRoute } from \"./bbs.route\";\nimport { posts, threads } from \"../db/schema\";\ntype ThreadRow = {\n\tid: number;\n\ttitle: string;\n\tcreatedAt: Date;\n\tupdatedAt: Date;\n\tlastPostAt: Date;\n\treplyCount: number;\n};\ntype PostRow = {\n\tid: number;\n\tthreadId: number;\n\tparentPostId: number | null;\n\tauthorName: string;\n\tbody: string;\n\tcreatedAt: Date;\n\tupdatedAt: Date;\n};\nfunction createFakeDb(options?: {\n\tfailThreadInsert?: boolean;\n\tfailParentLookup?: boolean;\n}) {\n\tconst state = {\n\t\tthreadId: 0,\n\t\tpostId: 0,\n\t\tthreads: [] as ThreadRow[],\n\t\tposts: [] as PostRow[],\n\t};\n\tconst select = (selection?: Record<string, unknown>) => ({\n\t\tfrom(table: unknown) {\n\t\t\tif (table === threads) {\n\t\t\t\tconst build = (predicate?: unknown) => ({\n\t\t\t\t\tget: async () =>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tstate.threads.find((thread) =>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tmatchThreadPredicate(thread, predicate),\n\t\t\t\t\t\t) ?? null,\n\t\t\t\t\tall: async () =>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t[...state.threads]\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t.sort((a, b) => b.lastPostAt.getTime() - a.lastPostAt.getTime())\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t.map((thread) => ({\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tid: thread.id,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\ttitle: thread.title,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tcreatedAt: thread.createdAt,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tupdatedAt: thread.updatedAt,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tlastPostAt: thread.lastPostAt,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\treplyCount: thread.replyCount,\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t})),\n\t\t\t\t});\n\t\t\t\treturn {\n\t\t\t\t\twhere: (predicate?: unknown) => build(predicate),\n\t\t\t\t\torderBy: () => build(),\n\t\t\t\t};\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\tconst build = (predicate?: unknown) => {\n\t\t\t\tconst rows = state.posts.filter((post) =>\n\t\t\t\t\tmatchPostPredicate(post, predicate, options?.failParentLookup),\n\t\t\t\t);\n\t\t\t\tconst query = {\n\t\t\t\t\tget: async () => rows[0] ?? null,\n\t\t\t\t\tall: async () =>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t[...rows].sort((a, b) => a.createdAt.getTime() - b.createdAt.getTi"},{"path":"api/routes/bbs.route.ts","excerpt":"import { zValidator } from \"@hono/zod-validator\";\nimport { and, asc, desc, eq } from \"drizzle-orm\";\nimport { Hono } from \"hono\";\nimport { z } from \"zod\";\nimport type { AppDatabase } from \"../db\";\nimport { posts, threads } from \"../db/schema\";\nimport { HttpError } from \"../modules/auth/errors\";\ntype BbsRouteDeps = {\n\tdb: AppDatabase;\n};\nconst threadCreateSchema = z.object({\n\ttitle: z.string().trim().min(1).max(120),\n\tbody: z.string().trim().min(1).max(4000),\n\tauthorName: z.string().trim().min(1).max(80).optional(),\n});\nconst replyCreateSchema = z.object({\n\tbody: z.string().trim().min(1).max(4000),\n\tauthorName: z.string().trim().min(1).max(80).optional(),\n\tparentPostId: z.number().int().positive().optional(),\n});\nasync function getThreadOrThrow(db: AppDatabase, id: number) {\n\tconst row = await db.select().from(threads).where(eq(threads.id, id)).get();\n\tif (!row) throw new HttpError(404, \"Thread not found\");\n\treturn row;\n}\nexport function createBbsRoute(deps: BbsRouteDeps) {\n\treturn new Hono()\n\t\t.get(\"/threads\", async (c) => {\n\t\t\tconst items = await deps.db\n\t\t\t\t.select({\n\t\t\t\t\tid: threads.id,\n\t\t\t\t\ttitle: threads.title,\n\t\t\t\t\tcreatedAt: threads.createdAt,\n\t\t\t\t\tupdatedAt: threads.updatedAt,\n\t\t\t\t\tlastPostAt: threads.lastPostAt,\n\t\t\t\t\treplyCount: threads.replyCount,\n\t\t\t\t})\n\t\t\t\t.from(threads)\n\t\t\t\t.orderBy(desc(threads.lastPostAt), desc(threads.createdAt))\n\t\t\t\t.all();\n\t\t\treturn c.json({ threads: items });\n\t\t})\n\t\t.get(\"/threads/:id\", async (c) => {\n\t\t\tconst id = Number(c.req.param(\"id\"));\n\t\t\tif (!Number.isInteger(id)) throw new HttpError(400, \"Invalid thread id\");\n\t\t\tconst thread = await getThreadOrThrow(deps.db, id);\n\t\t\tconst items = await deps.db\n\t\t\t\t.select({\n\t\t\t\t\tid: posts.id,\n\t\t\t\t\tthreadId: posts.threadId,\n\t\t\t\t\tparentPostId: posts.parentPostId,\n\t\t\t\t\tauthorName: posts.authorName"},{"path":"api/routes/health.route.test.ts","excerpt":"import { Hono } from \"hono\";\nimport { describe, expect, it } from \"vitest\";\nimport { createHealthRoute } from \"./health.route\";\ndescribe(\"health route\", () => {\n\tit(\"should return ok status\", async () => {\n\t\tconst app = new Hono().route(\"/health\", createHealthRoute());\n\t\tconst res = await app.request(\"/health\");\n\t\texpect(res.status).toBe(200);\n\t\tconst body = await res.json();\n\t\texpect(body).toEqual({\n\t\t\tstatus: \"ok\",\n\t\t\tservice: \"hono-standard\",\n\t\t});\n\t});\n});"},{"path":"api/routes/health.route.ts","excerpt":"import { Hono } from \"hono\";\nexport function createHealthRoute() {\n\treturn new Hono().get(\"/\", (c) => {\n\t\treturn c.json({ status: \"ok\", service: \"hono-standard\" });\n\t});\n}"},{"path":"api/routes/protected.route.test.ts","excerpt":"import { Hono } from \"hono\";\nimport { describe, expect, it } from \"vitest\";\nimport { createProtectedRoute } from \"./protected.route\";\ndescribe(\"protected route\", () => {\n\tit(\"returns the authenticated profile from context\", async () => {\n\t\tconst app = new Hono();\n\t\tapp.use(\"/protected/*\", async (c, next) => {\n\t\t\tc.set(\"authUser\", {\n\t\t\t\tuserId: \"a1a1a1a1-a1a1-41a1-a1a1-a1a1a1a1a1a1\",\n\t\t\t\temail: \"test@example.com\",\n\t\t\t\trole: \"member\",\n\t\t\t});\n\t\t\tawait next();\n\t\t});\n\t\tapp.route(\"/protected\", createProtectedRoute());\n\t\tconst res = await app.request(\"/protected/profile\");\n\t\tconst body = await res.json();\n\t\texpect(res.status).toBe(200);\n\t\texpect(body.profile).toEqual({\n\t\t\temail: \"test@example.com\",\n\t\t\trole: \"member\",\n\t\t});\n\t});\n});"},{"path":"api/routes/protected.route.ts","excerpt":"import { Hono } from \"hono\";\nimport type { ProtectedProfileResponse } from \"../../shared/schemas/protected.schema\";\nimport { getAuthContextUser } from \"../modules/auth/context\";\nexport function createProtectedRoute() {\n\treturn new Hono().get(\"/profile\", (c) => {\n\t\tconst authUser = getAuthContextUser(c);\n\t\tconst response = {\n\t\t\tprofile: {\n\t\t\t\temail: authUser.email,\n\t\t\t\trole: authUser.role,\n\t\t\t},\n\t\t} satisfies ProtectedProfileResponse;\n\t\treturn c.json(response);\n\t});\n}"},{"path":"web/src/App.tsx","excerpt":"import { QueryClient, QueryClientProvider } from \"@tanstack/react-query\";\nimport { RouterProvider } from \"@tanstack/react-router\";\nimport { router } from \"./router\";\nimport { ShowcaseSettingsProvider } from \"./showcase-settings-context\";\nconst queryClient = new QueryClient({\n\tdefaultOptions: {\n\t\tqueries: {\n\t\t\tretry: false,\n\t\t},\n\t},\n});\nexport function App() {\n\treturn (\n\t\t<QueryClientProvider client={queryClient}>\n\t\t\t<ShowcaseSettingsProvider>\n\t\t\t\t<RouterProvider router={router} />\n\t\t\t</ShowcaseSettingsProvider>\n\t\t</QueryClientProvider>\n\t);\n}"}],"llmContextFiles":[{"path":"LLM_CONTEXT.md","excerpt":"# LLM Context: Hono Standard\n\nこの文書は、`hono-standard` を clone した直後に作業入口を決めるための圧縮コンテキストです。現行 branch は local SQLite auth/showcase template です。RAG、pgvector、agentic search、wiki ingestion は含みません。\n\n## Repository Snapshot\n\n- Bun + Hono backend と React + Vite frontend を同一 origin で動かす template。\n- DB は local SQLite。Drizzle schema は `api/db/schema.ts`、migration は `drizzle/`。\n- Backend app composition は `api/app/hono.ts`、server bootstrap は `api/app/server.ts`。\n- DB runtime の public entry は `api/db/index.ts`。SQLite baseline は `api/db/sqlite.ts`、migration runner は `api/db/migrate.ts` から `api/db/migrate-sqlite.ts` を呼ぶ。\n- Frontend entry は `web/src/App.tsx`、router は `web/src/router.tsx`、API client は `web/src/api.ts`。\n- Auth 実装は `api/modules/auth/`、route は `api/routes/auth.route.ts`、login UI は `web/src/domains/auth/login-domain.tsx`。\n- Shared API schema/object は `shared/schemas/`。Backend は `zValidator`、frontend は `hono/client` + `AppType` で同じ契約を参照する。\n- Home と Showcase は未ログインでも表示する。ログイン状態がある場合だけ header に user chip と logout button を表示する。\n- Protected sample は `/protected` と `/api/protected/profile`。frontend guard と server-side `requireAuth` の両方を示す。\n- Package manager / runtime は Bun。dev server は `bunx --bun vite` で起動する。\n- Quality gates は `bun run verify` と `bun run verify:e2e`。CI も同じ入口を使う。\n- `main` は SQLite baseline。Turso / PostgreSQL / pgvector は `variant/*` branch で driver、schema、migration、docs、smoke setup を差し替える。\n\n## Top-Level Map\n\n| Path | Role |\n| --- | --- |\n| `api/app/hono.ts` | Hono middleware、API route、static fallback、`AppType` export |\n| `api/app/server.ts` | Bun server bootstrap |\n| `api/app/env.ts` | environment parsing and defaults |\n| `api/config/appDefaults.ts` | non-secret app defaults |\n| `api/db/index.ts` | DB runtime public entry and variant boundary |\n| `api/db/sqlite.ts` | SQLite baseline Drizzle runtime |\n| `api/db/migrate.ts` | migration runner public entry |\n| `api/db/migrate-sqlite.ts` | SQLite baseline migration runner |\n| `api/db/schema.ts` | SQLite baseline Drizzle schema |\n| `api/routes/auth.route.ts` | `/api/auth/*` route module |\n| `api/routes/health.route.ts` | health route |\n| `api/routes/protected.route.ts` | server-side protected API sample |\n| `api/modules/auth/` | Auth service、JWT、cookies、password hashing |\n| `api/middleware/auth.ts` | access-token auth middleware |\n| `shared/schemas/` | Zod schema and public API object types shared by api and web |\n| `web/src/App.tsx` | React Query and Router providers |\n| `web/src/router.tsx` | TanStack Router tree |\n| `web/src/api.ts` | browser API client and auth refresh handling |\n| `web/src/auth-context.tsx` | frontend auth state |\n| `web/src/routes/` | route definitions |\n| `web/src/views/` | Home/Login/Showcase views |\n| `web/src/showcase-*` | showcase state and URL search helpers |\n| `drizzle/` | SQL migrations |\n| `scripts/verify.ts` | verification pipeline |\n| `scripts/e2e-server.ts` | Playwright smoke server with isolated SQLite DB |\n| `tests/e2e/` | Playwright smoke tests |\n| `.github/workflows/verify.yml` | CI verification |\n| `Dockerfile`, `docker-compose.yml` | Optional SQLite baseline container runtime |\n\n## Task Routing\n\n| Task | Start here | Usually also read | Defer unless touched |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Change auth API | `api/routes/auth.route.ts`, `api/modules/auth/`, `api/middleware/auth.ts`, `shared/schemas/auth.schema.ts` | `web/src/api.ts`, `web/src/auth-context.tsx` | showcase UI |\n| Change protected sample | `api/routes/protected.route.ts`, `web/src/views/protected-view.tsx`, `web/src/routes/protected-route.tsx` | `api/middleware/auth.ts`, `shared/schemas/protected.schema.ts`, `web/src/api.ts` | showcase UI |\n| Change login UI | `web/src/views/login-view.tsx`, `web/src/domains/auth/login-domain.tsx` | `web/src/auth-context.tsx`, `web/src/api.ts` | DB schema |\n| Change app shell/routing | `web/src/routes/root-route.tsx`, `web/src/router.tsx` | `web/src/App.tsx`, affected view | auth service internals |\n| Change showcase UI | `web/src/views/showcase-view.tsx`, `web/src/showcase-settings-context.tsx`, `web/src/showcase-table-search.ts` | `web/src/styles.css` | backend auth |\n| Change env/config | `api/app/env.ts`, `api/config/appDefaults.ts`, `.env.example` | `drizzle.config.ts`, Docker/Compose if bind host or port changes | frontend views |\n| Change DB runtime/variant boundary | `api/db/index.ts`, `api/db/sqlite.ts`, `api/db/migrate.ts`, `api/db/migrate-sqlite.ts` | `api/cli/migrate.ts`, `api/cli/auth-create-admin.ts`, `docs/template-variant-management.md` | showcase UI |\n| Change DB schema/migration | `api/db/schema.ts`, `drizzle/`, `api/db/migrate*.ts` | `api/modules/auth/auth.service.ts`, `api/modules/auth/token.service.ts` | showcase UI |\n| Change build/dev tooling | `package.json`, `vite.config.ts`, `vitest.config.ts`, `playwright.config.ts`, `scripts/verify.ts` | `.github/workflows/verify.yml`, failing config-specific output | feature code |\n| Change docs | `README.md`, `LLM_CONTEXT.md`, `docs/` | `.gitignore` when generated output changes | feature code |\n\n## Styling / CSS Architecture\n\nUI 変更では、この節を styling 判断の入口にする。まず全 CSS を広く探索せず、以下の entrypoint と pattern source で説明できるか確認する。\n\n- Global style entrypoint: `web/src/styles.css`。Tailwind v4 の `@import \"tailwindcss\"`、`@theme` token、`@layer base`、`@layer components` をこの1ファイルに集約している。\n- CSS load path: `web/src/main.tsx` が `./styles.css` を import する。Tailwind plugin は `vite.config.ts` の `@tailwindcss/vite`。\n- Design tokens / theme values: `web/src/styles.css` の `@theme` が global token の source of truth。`--color-*` と `--radius-*` を Tailwind utility / `@apply` から使う。\n- Showcase theme values: `web/src/showcase-settings-context.tsx` が `--showcase-*` custom properties を生成し、`web/src/styles.css` の `.showcase-shell` と `:root[data-showcase-page-theme]` rules がそれを消費する。\n- Shared UI components and common patterns: `web/src/styles.css` の `.topbar`, `.menu-*`, `.auth-*`, `.home-*`, `.center-shell`, `.signed-in-panel`, `.showcase-*`, `.demo-*`, `.table-*` class families。\n- Page a"}],"recentCommitDiffs":[],"packageScripts":[{"name":"auth:create-admin","command":"bun run api/cli/auth-create-admin.ts"},{"name":"bootstrap","command":"bun scripts/bootstrap.ts"},{"name":"build","command":"bun run build:web"},{"name":"build:web","command":"vite build"},{"name":"db:generate","command":"drizzle-kit generate"},{"name":"db:migrate","command":"bun run api/cli/migrate.ts"},{"name":"db:migrate:drizzle","command":"drizzle-kit migrate"},{"name":"dev","command":"bunx --bun vite"},{"name":"dev:vite","command":"vite"},{"name":"format","command":"biome format --write api web shared scripts tests drizzle.config.ts playwright.config.ts vite.config.ts vitest.config.ts"},{"name":"format:check","command":"biome format api web shared scripts tests drizzle.config.ts playwright.config.ts vite.config.ts vitest.config.ts"},{"name":"lint","command":"biome lint api web shared scripts tests drizzle.config.ts playwright.config.ts vite.